�脢id�c8f15a067b6d�body��_这叫“心理演练”（表象训练）：在脑中生动地想象动作过程，会激活与真实执行高度重叠的大脑运动区，帮助强化动作计划。研究显示它不能替代身体训练，但配合练习能提升准确性和信心。普通人也适用：演讲前在脑中把流程过一遍，上台会更流畅、更少卡壳。��That's mental rehearsal (motor imagery): vividly imagining a movement activates brain motor regions that overlap with actual execution, strengthening the action plan. Research shows it can't replace physical training, but combined with practice it improves accuracy and confidence. It works for everyday life too — mentally running through a presentation beforehand makes delivery smoother.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�ca1523c3a2fa�body��#这来自“内群体偏好”：人天生会把人分成“自己人”和“外人”。对内部成员宽容能增强群体凝聚力、维持合作关系；对外人更严则是一种防范风险和资源竞争的心理。这种倾向在进化中有助于保护自己的族群和联盟。�MThis comes from in-group favoritism: people naturally sort others into 'us' and 'them.' Being lenient with insiders strengthens group cohesion and cooperation, while judging outsiders more harshly is a defensive response to risk and competition over resources. Evolutionarily, this tendency helped protect one's own kin and alliance.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ca878aaa700f�body�ٟ艾宾浩斯发现遗忘先快后慢，刚学完几小时内大量遗忘。及时且间隔的复习能在痕迹消失前加固，比临考突击高效得多。٭Ebbinghaus showed forgetting is fast then slows—much is lost within hours. Timely, spaced review strengthens traces before they fade, far better than last-minute cramming.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ca95be9babb8�body���Selye 将应激反应分为三阶段：警觉期（快速动员）、抵抗期（身体适应并维持高警备）、耗竭期（资源耗尽、机能崩溃）。它说明压力若持续超过承受，最终会损害健康。��Selye's GAS has three stages: alarm (rapid mobilization), resistance (adapting and staying on high alert), and exhaustion (resources depleted, breakdown). It shows that unrelenting stress beyond capacity eventually harms health.�ans��src��7Selye, H. (1956).《The Stress of Life》, McGraw-Hill.�2Selye, H. (1956). The Stress of Life. McGraw-Hill.��id�cab97c894421�body���习惯叠加是把新行为绑在已有稳定习惯之后，例如刷完牙后立刻冥想 1 分钟。借助既有提示降低启动成本，让新例行更容易被触发，是行为设计中的实用技巧。��Habit stacking attaches a new behavior to an existing stable habit—e.g., after brushing teeth, meditate 1 minute. Leveraging the old cue lowers startup cost and makes the new routine easier to trigger—a practical behavior-design trick.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�caf65465cc40�body��b这叫“舌尖现象”：语义信息已经准备好了，但语音那一环暂时“卡住”，所以你知道是谁，却拼不出名字。名字、老歌和低频词最容易出现，年龄增长时会更频繁。通常过一会儿或换个线索（比如想起第一个字）就能想起来，说明记忆没有丢，只是暂时提取不顺利。��That's the tip-of-the-tongue state: the meaning is ready, but the phonological link is temporarily stuck, so you know who it is yet can't say the name. It's most common with proper names, old songs, and low-frequency words, and becomes more frequent with age. It usually resolves in moments or with a cue like the first letter — the memory isn't gone, just briefly hard to retrieve.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�cb565e26ae07�body��<关键期假说认为儿童在某个年龄窗口（约青春期前）内习得母语最为容易，大脑可塑性高，能自然掌握语音和语法。错过该窗口后，第二语言学习通常更费力，口音也更难消除。极端案例“野孩” Genie 的研究支持语言存在敏感的发育窗口。��The critical period hypothesis holds that children acquire a native language most easily within an age window before roughly puberty, when brain plasticity is high and phonology and grammar come naturally. After that window, second-language learning is typically harder and accents are harder to lose. The case of the isolated child Genie supports a sensitive developmental window for language.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�ccb28670d250�body�ٷ随机分配把参与者分入处理组与对照组，平衡已知未知差异，使两组除处理外可比。这是实验能推论因果的核心，比“自然分组”更可靠。��Random assignment splits participants into treatment and control, balancing known and unknown differences so groups differ only by the manipulation. It is the core that lets experiments infer causation, more than natural grouping.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�cd61a521c5a1�body���频率比强度更影响长期感受：日常里可期待的小好事不断刷新积极体验，而罕见的盛大时刻很快被适应掉。幸福多是“常常有点好”，不是“偶尔极好”。��Frequency shapes long-term feeling more than intensity: daily small joys keep refreshing positive experience, while rare grand moments are quickly adapted away. Well-being is often a little good often, not extreme good rarely.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�cdf02da37bc4�body���核心批评是“事后讲故事”：用现代现象反推远古适应，难以证伪且易忽略文化与生态变量。谨慎的做法是提出可检验预测并结合多物种、多文化比较，而非把一切行为都归因于基因。�"The main critique is 'just-so storytelling': inferring ancient adaptations from modern traits, hard to falsify and overlooking culture and ecology. The careful approach poses testable predictions and uses cross-species, cross-cultural comparison rather than attributing everything to genes.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ce92dad36477�body���人们对极低概率的事件往往要么过度恐惧、要么过度乐观，取决于呈现方式，这被称为概率忽视。彩票和保险都利用了这种心理。理性评估概率能减少误判。��People often either over-fear or over-hope about very low probabilities depending on framing, called probability neglect. Lotteries and insurance both exploit this. Assessing real probabilities rationally reduces error.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�ceb607fde4dd�body���斯奈德的希望理论把希望分为“路径思维”（找到办法）与“动力思维”（有意愿走）。高希望者面对阻碍会想替代路线而非放弃，可被目标分解与路径练习提升。��Snyder's hope theory splits hope into pathways (finding routes) and agency (will to go). High-hope people brainstorm alternatives when blocked, not quit; it rises via goal breakdown and path practice.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�cf622d37ebae�body��多巴胺更像是想要或预期奖励的信号，而非快乐本身（快乐更多与内啡肽、阿片系统相关）。它的预测误差机制让我们追逐目标，也解释了赌博、刷手机为何停不下来——是渴望在循环，不是满足。�Dopamine is more a wanting or reward-prediction signal than pleasure itself, which links more to endorphins and opioids. Its prediction-error mechanism drives goal pursuit and explains why gambling or scrolling is hard to stop—craving loops, not satisfaction.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d0534eaf15ef�body���情绪调节是指人们影响自己何时、如何体验与表达情绪的过程，比如深呼吸平复愤怒、转移注意力缓解焦虑。健康的调节不是压抑情绪，而是以合适的方式应对。它是心理韧性的重要部分。�-Emotion regulation is the process by which people influence when and how they experience and express emotions, such as deep breathing to calm anger or distraction to ease anxiety. Healthy regulation is not suppression but responding in an appropriate way. It is a key part of psychological resilience.�ans��src��eGross,《Emotion regulation: Taking stock and moving forward.》,Emotion,2013 (DOI: 10.1037/a0032135)�cGross, 'Emotion regulation: Taking stock and moving forward.', Emotion, 2013, DOI: 10.1037/a0032135��id�d07ff681f2c6�body���我们解释他人行为时常过度归因为性格、低估情境（如迟到=不靠谱，而非堵车）。对自己则相反（自我服务偏差）。它源于注意焦点在“人”而非“环境”。��We over-attribute others' acts to character and under-weight context (late = unreliable, not traffic). For ourselves the reverse holds (self-serving bias). Attention fixes on the person, not the situation.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d0a13e0d0b3d�body���社会认同理论认为，人们通过所属群体来定义自我，并倾向于对内群体偏好、对外群体贬低以提升自尊。这解释了群体间的偏见与竞争。它也是理解球迷、国籍认同的框架。��Social identity theory holds that people define themselves through group membership and favor the in-group while downgrading out-groups to boost self-esteem. This explains intergroup bias and competition. It also frames fan and national identities.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d0e4b788c387�body�٨间隔重复把学习分散在多个时段，能增强记忆的巩固并减少遗忘曲线下滑；临时集中突击虽短期记住，却很快遗忘且理解较浅。��Spaced repetition spreads study across sessions, strengthening memory consolidation and slowing the forgetting curve; last-minute cramming may stick short-term but fades fast and yields shallower understanding.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d29d503d970e�body���自我关怀是在痛苦时以善意对待自己、承认人人都会失败、保持觉察而不淹没。它不同于沉溺的自怜，也不同于自我膨胀，研究关联更低焦虑与更强改变动力。��Self-compassion is treating yourself kindly in pain, seeing failure as shared, and staying mindful without drowning. Unlike self-pity or ego-inflation, it links to lower anxiety and stronger motivation to change.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d36aa70dec9c�body���西方观察者更倾向性格归因（他性子急），东亚观察者更倾向情境归因（当时太挤）。这种差异来自独立 versus 互依自我，也会影响对责任、教育与管理的理解。��Western observers lean toward dispositional attribution (he is impatient); East Asian observers lean toward situational (it was crowded). This follows independent versus interdependent selves and affects views of responsibility, education and management.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d5d59dec7e80�body��关键期假说认为在童年某个窗口内，人类大脑对母语语音与语法的吸收最为高效，错过之后第二语言习得难度显著上升。Genie 等极端个案与移民年龄研究为其提供了证据，但成人仍可达到较高水平。�%The critical period hypothesis holds that a childhood window allows especially efficient native-like acquisition of phonology and grammar, after which second-language learning grows harder. Cases like Genie and age-of-arrival studies support it, though adults can still reach high proficiency.�ans��src��5《心理学与生活》;《神经科学》(Bear 等)�9Psychology: The Adaptive Mind; Neuroscience (Bear et al.)��id�d6fac8f70ff6�body�� 陈述性记忆是“知道事实与事件”（能说出口，如首都名字），依赖海马；程序性记忆是“知道怎么做”（骑车、打字），靠基底节与小脑，常常说不清却做得准。二者可分离：健忘症患者忘了曾学过，身体却仍会做。�'Declarative memory is knowing that (facts/events, verbalizable, hippocampus-dependent); procedural memory is knowing how (riding a bike, typing), supported by striatum and cerebellum, often unverbalizable yet accurate. They dissociate: amnesics forget having learned yet the body still performs.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d7a1f7d4d9c6�body���自尊是对自我价值的稳定肯定，自恋则是脆弱且需要外部赞美的自我膨胀。高自尊者能接受批评，自恋者常对批评激烈反应。两者易被混淆但本质不同。��Self-esteem is stable assurance of self-worth; narcissism is fragile, praise-dependent self-inflation. High-self-esteem people accept criticism; narcissists often react harshly to it. They are easily confused but essentially different.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d8367d9394c4�body��)并非所有认知都必然衰退：加工速度和复杂记忆检索常变慢，但语义知识与专业判断可保持甚至增长。生活方式如运动、社交、学习新技能有助于维持认知储备。个体差异很大，疾病（如痴呆）导致的衰退与正常老化应区分。�NNot all cognition inevitably declines: processing speed and complex recall often slow, yet semantic knowledge and expertise can hold or grow. Lifestyle factors like exercise, social contact, and learning new skills build cognitive reserve. Individual differences are large, and disease decline like dementia differs from normal aging.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�d852ca8db265�body���斯金纳提出，行为的结果会影响它再次出现的概率：奖励增加行为（正强化），惩罚或减少后果则降低行为。训练宠物、课堂管理都用这一原理。关键是“后果”要及时且一致。�Skinner proposed that the consequence of a behavior affects its future probability: rewards increase it (positive reinforcement), while punishment or removing a reward decreases it. Training pets and classroom management use this principle. The consequence must be timely and consistent.�ans��src��Skinner 操作性条件作用�Skinner operant conditioning��id�d8ee349f9b69�body���孤独是“渴望的连接”和“实际连接”之间的落差，所以热闹的人群里也可能孤独。决定连接感的是质量而非数量，一个被真正理解的关系胜过许多浅层往来。��Loneliness is the gap between the connection you want and the connection you have, so you can feel lonely in a crowd. What matters is quality not quantity; one relationship where you feel understood beats many shallow ones.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d9d4ff964118�body���韧性不是不受伤，而是在逆境中恢复并适应的能力，受基因、支持系统与应对方式共同影响。它可通过建立社会连接、认知重评、规律睡眠运动等被训练提升，并非固定天赋。��Resilience is not never hurt but recovering and adapting after adversity, shaped by genes, support, and coping. It is trainable via social connection, reappraisal, and regular sleep/exercise—not a fixed gift.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�da1e4a12bb24�body��阿希让被试在明显简单的线段判断任务中面对群体一致的错误答案，约三分之一的被试会跟随群体犯错。这表明即使在客观清晰的任务上，群体压力也能显著改变公开行为，尽管私下判断未必改变。��Asch had participants give line-judgment answers while confederates unanimously erred; about one third conformed to the group. It shows that even on unambiguous tasks, group pressure can shift public behavior even when private judgment is intact.�ans��src��M阿希 (1956). 独立与从众研究. Psychological Monographs, 70(9), 1–70�cAsch, S. E. (1956). Studies of independence and conformity. Psychological Monographs, 70(9), 1–70��id�da9af3b28975�body�ٺ流畅性错觉指材料因排版、重复而显得好懂时，人会误判自己已掌握。真正掌握要看提取难度，而非阅读顺滑；用自测打破这种错觉最有效。��The fluency illusion is mistaking easy reading (due to layout or repetition) for understanding. Real mastery tracks retrieval difficulty, not reading smoothness; self-testing is the best cure.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dc067230a8c1�body���冒充者综合征指能力很强的人仍觉得自己是“骗子”、害怕被揭穿，把成功归因于运气。它常见于高成就群体并带来持续焦虑。承认它并关注客观证据可缓解。��Imposter syndrome is when capable people feel like frauds and fear being exposed, attributing success to luck. It is common among high achievers and brings chronic anxiety. Naming it and focusing on objective evidence helps.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dcad3d4efa8c�body���目标是做什么，价值是为什么重要；当行动连回我想成为怎样的人，意志耗尽时仍有内在锚点。写下这对我意味着什么能把外在任务变内在动力。��Goals are what to do, values why it matters; when action ties to who I want to be, an inner anchor remains after willpower fades. Writing what this means to me turns external tasks into internal drive.�ans��src��jDeci 与 Ryan《自我决定论》（1985）；Ryan 与 Deci 2000 年综述（载 American Psychologist）�ZDeci & Ryan, Self-Determination Theory (1985); Ryan & Deci (2000) in American Psychologist��id�dcf40e5baa9e�body��5科学家在猴子大脑里发现了一类“镜像神经元”：自己动作时和看别人做同样动作时都会放电。这类细胞让大脑能自动“模拟”所见的行为，帮我们理解他人意图、学会新技能。看别人吃、看比赛时身体紧张，都与这种自动模仿有关。�XScientists found “mirror neurons” in monkeys that fire both when the animal acts and when it watches another do the same. These cells let the brain automatically “simulate” what it sees, helping us read others' intentions and learn skills. Craving food at a food show or tensing up watching a match is this automatic simulation at work.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�dd25b2939f88�body���组块化是把零散信息组合成有意义的单元，从而突破工作记忆的容量限制。例如把一串数字分成几组来记。通过寻找规律，人们能短时记住更多内容。��Chunking groups scattered items into meaningful units, overcoming the capacity limits of working memory. For example, breaking a long number into a few groups makes it easier to hold. By finding patterns, people can keep far more in mind at once.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�de232a826385�body���认知重评是指改变对事件的看法从而改变情绪反应，比如把失败看作学习机会。它比压抑情绪更健康和持久。大量研究把它列为最有效的情绪调节策略之一。�Cognitive reappraisal means changing how you interpret an event to change your emotional response, such as seeing failure as a learning opportunity. It is healthier and more lasting than suppressing emotion. Research ranks it among the most effective regulation strategies.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e05a8e230129�body���内脏感觉（interoception）把心跳、呼吸等信号送进大脑，形成“说不出的预感”。研究表明人常在意识理由出现前，身体已对风险或信任对象作出反应，即身体先于言语直觉。��Interoception feeds heart-rate, breathing and other signals to the brain, forming 'wordless hunches'. Studies show the body often reacts to risk or trust before conscious reasons appear—the body intuiting ahead of words.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�e06e67cc9615�body��D非注意盲视指当人全神贯注于某项任务时，会看不见视野中突然出现但无关的刺激，即使它非常显眼。著名的“看不见的大猩猩”实验中，数传球次数的人往往漏看穿猩猩服走过的人。它说明注意的稀缺会让我们对未被预期的事物“视而不见”。�QInattentional blindness is failing to see an unexpected but conspicuous stimulus because attention is fully engaged in another task. In the famous invisible gorilla study, people counting passes often miss a person in a gorilla suit walking across the screen. It shows that scarce attention can make us literally blind to the unexpected.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e10bac6d47ca�body���西方被试的记忆更突出个人独特事件与自我，东亚被试更常回忆与他人的关系情境并更谦抑。记忆并非纯个人存档，而受文化叙事脚本塑造，被称为“集体记忆”的延伸。��Western respondents recall more unique, self-centered events; East Asians more often recall relational contexts and self-efface. Memory is not a purely personal archive but shaped by cultural narrative scripts—an extension of 'collective memory'.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e12c2e308c9a�body���在场人越多，每个人感到的别人会管的负责越稀释，且大家互看彼此反应来定义紧急程度（多元无知）。破解之道：明确指向某人求助，穿蓝衣的您快打120。��The more bystanders, the more each person's sense that someone else will help is diluted, and people read each other's calm to define the situation as non-urgent (pluralistic ignorance). The fix: single out one person, you in blue, call 120 now.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e2d0cf57135b�body�ٽ复制危机指许多已发表结果在重新实验时消失，原因含小样本、p-hacking、发表偏倚（只发显著）。它推动了预注册、大样本与开放数据的改革。��The replication crisis: many published results vanish on re-test, from small samples, p-hacking and publication bias (only significant gets printed). It spurred preregistration, big samples and open data.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�e4288febc283�body��/能。游戏的反馈即时、目标清晰、难度会随能力调整，正好构成学习的最佳条件，还常激发主动探索和试错。研究者发现，适度的游戏能锻炼规则理解、策略和团队合作。关键不在于“玩不玩”，而在于是否主动思考和平衡时间。�eYes. Games give immediate feedback, clear goals, and difficulty that adjusts to your skill — ideal learning conditions — and they spark active exploration and trial-and-error. Research shows reasonable gaming can exercise rule comprehension, strategy, and teamwork. The point isn't whether you play, but whether you think actively and balance your time.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（学习与发展章）�8Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), learning and development��id�e4f416062835�body���完美主义常把“做错”等同于“我很差”，于是用拖延来回避可能出丑的风险。把目标从“一次做到完美”换成“先完成再改进”，能打破这个自我阻碍的循环。��Perfectionism often equates making a mistake with being inadequate, so people delay to avoid the risk of looking bad. Shifting the goal from do it perfectly the first time to finish first then improve breaks this self-defeating loop.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e5221d7e8e26�body���偶尔噩梦正常，多由压力、创伤或药物引起；若频繁到影响睡眠和白天状态，可能是噩梦障碍。记录梦境和减压有帮助，严重时需专业干预。儿童做噩梦也较常见。�Occasional nightmares are normal, often from stress, trauma, or medication; if frequent enough to impair sleep and daytime function, it may be nightmare disorder. Logging dreams and reducing stress help, and severe cases need professional care. Nightmares are also common in children.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e5e6b685c206�body���扎荣茨的优势反应模型认为，他人在场增强驱力，使熟练任务（优势反应）更易表现，而使困难任务更易出错。即简单任务被促进、复杂任务被抑制。��Zajonc's drive theory holds that the presence of others increases arousal, facilitating dominant responses on well-learned tasks but hindering them on difficult ones. Thus simple tasks are improved and complex tasks impaired.�ans��src��=Zajonc, R. B. (1965). 《社会促进》. 《科学》149卷.�8Zajonc, R. B. (1965). Social facilitation. Science, 149.��id�e6baed442e98�body���短时记忆容量有限、保持时间短（约几秒到一分钟），比如刚记的电话号码。长时记忆容量几乎无限、可保持很久，比如你童年的往事。通过重复和理解，短时记忆才能转入长时记忆。�.Short-term memory has limited capacity and lasts only seconds to about a minute, like a phone number you just heard. Long-term memory has nearly unlimited capacity and can last a long time, such as childhood memories. Through repetition and understanding, short-term memory can become long-term memory.�ans��src��Atkinson-Shiffrin 记忆模型�Atkinson-Shiffrin memory model��id�e6cb471b307f�body���罗特提出控制点指人把事件结果归因于自身（内控）还是外部运气与环境（外控）的倾向。内控者更觉自己能影响结果，外控者更易感无力。它是解释动机与应对风格的有用人格维度。��Rotter's locus of control is the tendency to attribute outcomes to oneself (internal) or to luck and environment (external). Internals feel they can influence results; externals feel powerless. It is a useful trait explaining motivation and coping.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e7edbffa1760�body��海马体像记忆的“索引与装订机”：它把分散在各皮层的信息绑定成新的情景记忆，并在睡眠中把记忆逐步转移到新皮层长期存储。海马受损的人难以形成新的陈述性记忆，但旧记忆和技能仍可保留。�The hippocampus acts like an index and binder: it binds distributed cortical information into new episodic memories and, during sleep, gradually transfers them to neocortex for long-term storage. Damage blocks new declarative memory formation while old memories and skills can remain.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e7fb62987129�body���基本归因错误指人们在解释他人行为时，过度强调性格特质而低估情境因素。它源于我们以人为中心加工信息的习惯，以及对情境约束的注意不足，在个体主义文化中尤为明显。�The fundamental attribution error is the tendency to over-explain others' behavior by disposition and under-weight situational constraints. It stems from person-centered processing and limited attention to context, and is especially pronounced in individualistic cultures.�ans��src��C《心理学与生活》;《心理学年度评论》社会认知卷�MPsychology: The Adaptive Mind; Annual Review of Psychology (social cognition)��id�e969582bf657�body��5写感恩清单会把注意力从“缺什么”转向“已经有什么”，研究反复发现，定期练习的人幸福感更高、睡眠更好、抑郁更少。感恩不是无视困难，而是训练大脑去留意原本被忽略的好事。坚持几周，效果通常比一次性的大满足更持久。�ZA gratitude list shifts attention from what's missing to what's already there, and studies repeatedly find regular practitioners report more happiness, better sleep, and less depression. Gratitude doesn't ignore problems; it trains the brain to notice good things that were overlooked. A few consistent weeks often outlast one big splurge of joy.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（积极心理章）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), positive psychology��id�eab4f527173e�body���无尽的信息流制造一种“我在掌控”的错觉，但超出认知容量的信息反而加重不确定感。固定信息时段、关闭推送，能让大脑从持续警觉中恢复平静。��Endless feeds create an illusion of being in control, but information beyond our cognitive capacity raises uncertainty. Setting fixed news times and turning off alerts lets the brain step down from constant alertness.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�eb142684c53b�body���咖啡因主要通过阻断脑中的腺苷受体起作用；腺苷在清醒时不断累积、让人产生困意，阻断它等于掩盖了疲劳，而非凭空制造能量。这在某种程度上是“还债”——疲惫并未消失，只是被推迟，等咖啡因代谢、腺苷重新占据受体时，困意会连本带利回来。它也会轻度兴奋中枢神经，但并不能替代真正的休息。��Caffeine works mainly by blocking adenosine receptors in the brain; adenosine normally builds up during waking hours and makes you feel sleepy, so blocking it masks fatigue rather than creating new energy. It's partly 'borrowing'—the tiredness isn't gone, just delayed, and it returns with interest as caffeine wears off and adenosine resumes. It also mildly stimulates the central nervous system, but doesn't replace real rest.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ebf025101862�body��/焦虑是对未来威胁的过度、持续担忧，常伴心跳加快、坐立不安等身体反应；正常担心通常针对具体事情且会随解决而消失。当焦虑严重影响生活时，可能发展为焦虑障碍，应寻求专业帮助。适度焦虑其实也能提醒我们做好准备。�@Anxiety is excessive, persistent worry about future threats, often with a racing heart and restlessness; normal worry is usually about a specific thing and fades when resolved. When anxiety severely disrupts life, it may be an anxiety disorder needing professional help. Moderate anxiety can actually prompt preparation.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�ed5d3701984a�body��"根据 DSM-5，PTSD 的核心症状包括侵入性再体验（闪回、噩梦）、对创伤线索的回避、认知与情绪的负面改变，以及过度警觉与易激惹。该病须由经历或目睹实际死亡、重伤或性暴力等创伤事件引发，症状持续超过一个月。�;Per DSM-5, PTSD core symptoms include intrusive re-experiencing (flashbacks, nightmares), avoidance of trauma cues, negative alterations in cognition and mood, and hyperarousal/irritability. It requires exposure to a traumatic event (e.g., death, serious injury, sexual violence) with symptoms lasting over a month.�ans��src��6美国精神医学学会（APA）《DSM-5》（2013）�.American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5 (2013)��id�ed86b837dc1b�body���艾宾浩斯发现，遗忘在学习后最初几小时内最快，约一天后遗留约三分之一，之后趋于平缓。遗忘遵循先快后慢的指数式衰减规律，因此及时复习能有效对抗遗忘。�␀Ebbinghaus found that forgetting is fastest in the first hours after learning, leaving about one third after a day and then flattening. Forgetting follows an exponential decay that is rapid at first and slow later, so timely review effectively counters it.�ans��src��;Ebbinghaus, H. (1885). 《记忆: 实验心理学研究》.�IEbbinghaus, H. (1885). Memory: A Contribution to Experimental Psychology.��id�ee114412e363�body���情绪会临时改变我们对风险的权衡：恐惧放大威胁、愤怒增高自信与冒险。等情绪平复，前额叶重新评估，才发现当时夸大了利害。给决定降温几小时能减少这类后悔。��Emotion temporarily shifts risk weighting: fear amplifies threat, anger raises confidence and risk-taking. Once calm, the prefrontal cortex re-evaluates and sees the stakes were exaggerated. Cooling a decision for hours cuts this regret.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�eeabdcecc7b8�body���经典精神分析的可证伪性与疗效证据较弱，主流循证医学评价不高；但其对潜意识、移情与早期经验的洞见影响了现代动力治疗。今天多被视为文化思潮而非首选项实证疗法。�*Classic psychoanalysis scores poorly on falsifiability and efficacy evidence and is little favored by evidence-based medicine; yet its insights on the unconscious, transference and early experience shaped modern dynamic therapy. Today it is more cultural legacy than first-line empirical treatment.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�f001922d0681�body��G埃里克森把青少年期看作“同一性对角色混乱”的阶段，青少年要回答“我是谁、要成为怎样的人”。积极探索价值观与职业并形成稳定同一性是健康结果；回避探索则可能导致迷茫或被动接受他人定义。同一性并非一次定型，而会在一生中重塑。�>Erikson saw adolescence as identity versus role confusion, where teens ask who am I and what to become. Actively exploring values and careers to form a stable identity is the healthy outcome; avoiding exploration leads to confusion or accepting others' definitions. Identity is not fixed once but reshaped across life.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�f1c3c9c4bc93�body���心理理论是理解他人有不同于自己的信念、欲望和知识的能力，经典标志是通过错误信念任务（如 Sally-Anne）。多数儿童约 4 岁掌握，是社交、欺骗与共情发展的关键里程碑。��Theory of mind is understanding that others have beliefs, desires, and knowledge different from one's own; the classic marker is passing false-belief tasks (Sally-Anne). Most children master it around age 4—key for socializing, deception, and empathy.�ans��src��Wimmer 与 Perner (1983)�Wimmer & Perner (1983)��id�f45a0791f5e4�body���短期压力是适应性动员；长期压力使皮质醇持续偏高，抑制免疫、损害海马记忆与心血管，并扰乱代谢。身体本为偶尔应激设计，持续高水平会进入耗损状态。�Short-term stress is adaptive mobilization; chronic stress keeps cortisol high, suppressing immunity, harming hippocampal memory and the cardiovascular system, and disrupting metabolism. Bodies evolved for occasional stress; sustained high levels lead to wear.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f59a0cf5dc8e�body��~这叫“记忆回涨”（reminiscence bump）：人们在回忆自传体往事时，对青少年晚期到青年早期的记忆数量远多于其他年龄段（Rubin, Rahhal & Poon, 1998）。一种解释认为这一时期身份确立、第一次恋爱与离家等“第一次”体验密集，加之当时大脑对新颖事件编码更强，于是留下了格外鲜明的痕迹。�sThis is the reminiscence bump: when recalling autobiographical events, people report far more from late adolescence to early adulthood than from other periods (Rubin, Rahhal & Poon, 1998). A leading explanation is that identity formation, first loves and leaving home create a dense pile of novel firsts, and the young brain encodes such novel events especially strongly.�ans��src��xRubin, Rahhal & Poon (1998)《童年失忆、记忆回涨与老龄化中的提取》, Psychology and Aging 13(2):230-250ًRubin, D.C., Rahhal, T.A. & Poon, L.W. (1998). Things learned in early adulthood are remembered best. Psychology and Aging, 13(2), 230-250.��id�f5edd18187c2�body�٥书提供知识与视角，却无法针对你的具体情况反馈、陪你度过情绪难关。中重度困扰或危机时，仍需有训练的人和系统方案。��Books give knowledge and perspective but cannot tailor feedback to your case or sit with you through distress. For moderate to severe struggles or crisis, trained people and structured plans are still needed.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�f65d599dc139�body���情商指识别、理解、管理自己与他人情绪的能力，由梅耶和萨洛维提出概念、戈尔曼推广。它有助于沟通与合作，但是否算作“智力”在学界仍有争议。�Emotional intelligence is the ability to recognize, understand, and manage one's own and others' emotions, conceptualized by Mayer and Salovey and popularized by Goleman. It aids communication and cooperation, though whether it counts as 'intelligence' is debated.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f7c2335fb786�body�ٺ这是焦虑型解释偏差：把模糊信号往最坏方向填。对方可能只是在忙，而我们的不安会自动补全成“关系有危险”，提醒我们别急着下结论。��This is an anxious interpretation bias that fills ambiguous signals with the worst meaning. The other person may just be busy, while our unease auto-completes it as the relationship is in danger, a reminder not to jump to conclusions.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f9f16ba70683�body���后续研究显示服从随“受害者距离近”“权威远程/不具名”而变化：当能看见受害者或自己亲手执行，服从下降；当责任被分摊给上级，服从上升。说明恶行常是情境产物。��Later work shows obedience drops when the victim is near or one acts directly, and rises when authority is remote or responsibility is diffused upward. It suggests harmful obedience is often a product of situation, not just character.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fa12a6fe0a08�body���受益发现指在困境中找出积极意义或收获（如更珍惜关系、更清楚优先级）。适度进行关联更好的适应，但强迫“正向”可能否定真实痛苦，需顺势而非硬扭。��Benefit finding is spotting meaning or gain in hardship (valuing ties, clearer priorities). In moderation it links to better adjustment, but forced positivity can deny real pain—let it emerge, don't twist.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�faf50edd84c4�body��>基本情绪的面部表情跨文化大体相同，但“什么时候可以表现、表现多少”却由文化规则（显示规则）塑造。比如有的文化鼓励直接表达，有的文化要求对长辈和外人保持收敛。情绪本身是共通的，表达方式则是被家庭和文化“教”出来的。�=Basic facial expressions of emotion are largely universal, but “when and how much to show” is shaped by cultural display rules. Some cultures encourage open expression; others expect restraint around elders and strangers. The emotions themselves are shared — how we show them is learned from family and culture.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（情绪章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), emotion chapter��id�fbd8f722eeae�body���内在动机来自活动本身的乐趣，外在动机来自奖赏或压力。德西发现，对本来有趣的任务提供外部金钱奖励，反而会降低内在动机，即过度正当化效应。�Intrinsic motivation comes from the enjoyment of the activity itself, while extrinsic motivation comes from rewards or pressure. Deci found that offering external monetary rewards for already enjoyable tasks can lower intrinsic motivation, an effect called overjustification.�ans��src��dDeci, E. L. (1971). 《奖励对内在动机的削弱》. 《人格与社会心理学杂志》18卷.�]Deci, E. L. (1971). Effects of externally mediated rewards on intrinsic motivation. JPSP, 18.��id�fd53f9fa16af�body�ٱ正念调节强调不加评判地觉察当下情绪，与情绪保持距离而不被卷入。它降低反应性，让人更从容地回应。冥想练习是常见培养方式。��Mindfulness regulation emphasizes noticing present emotions without judgment and keeping distance from them rather than being swept along. It reduces reactivity and lets people respond more calmly. Meditation is a common way to build it.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fd669c84d95a�body���昼夜节律是约 24 小时的内源生物钟（下丘脑视交叉上核主导），受光照调节，驱动褪黑素夜间升高、皮质醇晨间升高。它与睡眠压力（腺苷累积）共同决定你何时困、何时清醒。�␀The circadian rhythm is a ~24-hour internal clock (hypothalamic suprachiasmatic nucleus), light-entrained, driving melatonin up at night and cortisol in the morning. Together with sleep pressure (adenosine buildup), it decides when you are sleepy or alert.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fd8db13ad636�body���适度压力助记忆（应激增强编码），但过高皮质醇会损害海马体检索与前额叶执行功能，导致关键时刻一片空白。考试焦虑就是这个区间的表现。��Mild stress aids memory via enhanced encoding, but high cortisol impairs hippocampal retrieval and prefrontal executive function, causing blank-out at key moments. Test anxiety sits in this zone.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fe44abdbde0f�body��h社会支持的好处远不止心理安慰：研究反复发现，支持关系稳定的人压力激素反应更低、心血管更健康、手术后恢复更快，死亡率也更低。被倾听会让人感到被理解，减少“独自扛着”的负担。这不是矫情，而是人类作为社会动物的基本需求，也是健康心理学的重要发现。��Social support's benefits go far beyond comfort: studies consistently find people with steady supportive ties show lower stress-hormone responses, better cardiovascular health, faster recovery after surgery, and lower mortality. Being heard means feeling understood and less alone with a problem. It's not emotional fuss — connection is a basic need of a social species and a major finding in health psychology.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（健康心理章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), health psychology chapter��id�fec81c6d4ddf�body���“选择过载”指选项过多会增加决策疲劳、提高预期并放大后悔，反而降低满意度与行动力。适度限制选项、提供推荐往往比海量选择更让人满意。��Choice overload means too many options raise decision fatigue, inflate expectations and amplify regret, lowering satisfaction and action. Limiting options or offering guidance often pleases more than sheer abundance.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�ff21cf1824bc�body���视错觉是大脑对视觉信息的错误解读，让我们“看到”并不存在的东西或错误的形状。例如缪勒-莱尔错觉中两条等长线段看起来不一样长。它说明感知不是相机式的复制，而是主动建构。�A visual illusion is the brain's misinterpretation of visual information, making us 'see' things that are not there or wrong shapes. In the Müller-Lyer illusion, two equal lines look unequal. It shows perception is not camera-like copying but active construction.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ff81f5a20562�body���倦怠含情绪耗竭（累）、去人格化（对人对事冷漠）、个人成就感降低。它来自长期资源（控制、支持）被过度索取，非单纯“懒”，需调结构而非只劝坚强。��Burnout has three parts: emotional exhaustion, cynicism/depersonalization, and reduced personal accomplishment. It stems from chronically drained resources (control, support), not mere laziness—fix structure, not just willpower.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ff9b7726f24f�body���匿名削弱了对评价和后果的顾虑，也降低了自我监控，使人更易释放攻击性或失礼言行。这与去个体化密切相关。网络环境尤其需要规范来弥补。��Anonymity lowers concern about evaluation and consequences and reduces self-monitoring, making people more likely to release aggression or rudeness. It is closely tied to deindividuation. Online spaces especially need norms to compensate.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ffed784ab916�body���卡巴金创立的 MBSR 已有大量随机对照研究，元分析显示它能中轻度降低焦虑、压力与慢性疼痛，效果接近放松训练但更持久。它并非治愈一切的魔法，而是可训练的情绪调节技能。��Kabat-Zinn's MBSR has many RCTs; meta-analyses show moderate reductions in anxiety, stress and chronic pain, lasting longer than plain relaxation. It is not a cure-all but a trainable emotion-regulation skill.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�psy_19_002�body��&这一不对称被称为行动者—观察者偏差。观察者的视线聚焦于行为者本人,知觉显著性让人格信息比背景更醒目;而行动者拥有当时情境的大量细节,于是把原因推向外部条件。语言习惯与文化规范会进一步放大这条归因鸿沟。�_The asymmetry is known as the actor–observer bias. An observer’s gaze settles on the actor, and perceptual salience makes personal qualities stand out against the background; actors, who hold rich detail about the situation at hand, push causes outward onto circumstances. Linguistic habits and cultural norms widen this attributional gap further.�ans��src�ٛJones 与 Nisbett 1972 年的归因专著,及 Malle 2006 年发表于《心理学公报》的行动者—观察者不对称元分析(132卷6期,895-919页)ٶJones & Nisbett (1972) attribution monograph; Malle, B. F. (2006). The actor-observer asymmetry in attribution: A (surprising) meta-analysis. Psychological Bulletin, 132(6), 895-919.��id�psy_19_005�body��2此时分数极其稳定,却始终稳定地偏离了测量目标:就像一台体重秤每次给出相同读数,读数却一直错。例如以鞋码预测数学能力,重测一致性可以做得很高,与真实数学成绩的相关却接近零。可见信度只是效度的必要条件,绝非充分条件。��Scores would be extremely stable while steadily missing the intended target, like a bathroom scale that returns identical readings every time yet never lands on the true weight. Predicting mathematical ability from shoe size, for instance, could yield excellent test–retest consistency while correlating with actual performance at nearly zero. Reliability is thus a necessary condition for validity, never a sufficient one.�ans��src��TCronbach 与 Meehl 1955 年发表于《心理学公报》的构念效度经典论文�OCronbach & Meehl (1955), the construct-validity paper in Psychological Bulletin��id�psy_19_008�body���该理论指出,北美文化把自我塑造为边界清晰、由内在特质界定的独立实体,自尊维护与自我拔高因此更常见;东亚文化将自我安放于关系网络之中,推崇谦逊与情境调适,自我批评式表达反而有助于维系和谐。后续研究提示,这些分歧集中体现在外显自评层面,而内隐积极偏见在各文化间相对普遍。��The theory argues that North American culture casts the self as a bounded entity defined by inner attributes, making self-esteem maintenance and self-enhancement routine, whereas East Asian cultures seat the self within relational networks that prize modesty and contextual adjustment, so self-critical expression can even serve harmony. Follow-up work indicates the divergence concentrates in explicit self-reports, while an implicit positivity bias appears fairly widespread across cultures.�ans��src��UMarkus 与 Kitayama 1991 年发表于《心理学评论》的自我建构理论论文�JMarkus & Kitayama (1991), the self-construal paper in Psychological Review��id�psy_19_012�body��罗杰斯在1957年提出六项条件,其中属于咨询师态度的有三项:真诚一致(表里如一)、无条件积极关注(不因来访者的言行而撤回接纳)以及共情性理解(准确进入来访者的内在参照框架);其余三项涉及双方处于心理接触、来访者处于不一致状态,以及来访者能知觉到这些态度。他认为这些关系条件本身就是治疗性改变的引擎,而不是技术操作的附属品。这一主张把疗效重心从“用什么方法”移到了“关系的品质”上。��In 1957 Rogers proposed six conditions, three of which concern the therapist's attitudes: congruence (being genuine and transparent), unconditional positive regard (acceptance not withdrawn because of what the client says or does), and empathic understanding (accurately entering the client's internal frame of reference); the remaining three involve two persons in psychological contact, the client's state of incongruence, and the client's perception of these attitudes. He held that these relational conditions are themselves the engine of therapeutic change rather than accessories to technique. The claim shifted the locus of efficacy away from method and onto the quality of the relationship.�ans��src��kRogers(1957),《治疗性人格改变的必要与充分条件》,《咨询心理学杂志》第21卷第2期ىRogers, C. R. (1957). The necessary and sufficient conditions of therapeutic personality change. Journal of Consulting Psychology, 21(2).��id�psy_19_015�body���该理论指出,消极情绪收窄即时的思维行动库(例如恐惧触发逃跑),积极情绪则反向将其拓宽,使注意力容纳更多可能性并整合更宽泛的信息。被拓宽的那些瞬间并不能直接解决生存问题,却借助游戏与探索等行为积累起持久的身体、心理与社会资源。实验显示,诱发积极情绪能提升认知灵活性并加快心血管应激后的恢复,构成“拓展当下、建构未来”的适应逻辑。�FThe theory notes that negative emotions narrow the momentary thought-action repertoire (fear triggers flight, say), whereas positive emotions broaden it, letting attention hold more possibilities and integrate wider information. Those broadened moments solve no survival problem directly; instead they accrue durable physical, psychological, and social resources through play and exploration. Experiments show that induced positive emotions raise cognitive flexibility and hasten cardiovascular recovery after stress, an adaptive logic of broadening the present to build the future.�ans��src��~Fredrickson(2001),《积极情绪在积极心理学中的角色:拓展-建构理论》,《美国心理学家》第56卷第3期١Fredrickson, B. L. (2001). The role of positive emotions in positive psychology: The broaden-and-build theory of positive emotions. American Psychologist, 56(3).��id�psy_19_018�body���罗斯认为这个偏差之所以“基本”,是因为它扎根于知觉层面的显著度差异:行动者占据观察者的注意中心,背景自动退居为框架,于是观察者系统性地把行为记在特质头上。琼斯与哈里斯早在1967年就用实验表明,即便明确告知文章立场系被指派,读者仍然高估作者的真实态度。这一不对称还顺带解释了行动者-观察者效应,以及它在不同文化中表现出的强弱差别。��Ross deemed the error fundamental because it grows out of perceptual salience: the actor occupies the center of the observer's attention while the background recedes into framing, so observers systematically charge behavior to dispositions. Jones and Harris had shown experimentally back in 1967 that readers overestimated writers' true attitudes even after being told the essay stance was assigned. The same asymmetry also accounts for the actor-observer effect and for its varying strength across cultures.�ans��src��rRoss(1977),《直觉心理学家及其短处:归因过程中的歪曲》,《实验社会心理学进展》第10卷ٞRoss, L. (1977). The intuitive psychologist and his shortcomings: Distortions in the attribution process. Advances in Experimental Social Psychology, Vol. 10.��id�psy_19_020�body���沃尔普观察到,焦虑反应与放松状态在生理上无法同时完全维持,若每一次呈现只引起轻微焦虑的刺激都伴随放松反应,焦虑便会与这个抑制性反应建立新联结而被逐级削弱。脱敏流程据此搭建由弱到强的恐惧等级表,保证暴露强度始终落在可被抑制的范围之内。对照研究显示,该方法对特定恐怖症的疗效胜过领悟取向的谈话治疗,成为日后循证暴露疗法的先声。�3Wolpe observed that anxiety and relaxation cannot be fully sustained physiologically at the same time; whenever a stimulus evoking only mild anxiety co-occurs with a relaxation response, anxiety forms new links to that inhibitory state and is whittled down level by level. Desensitization accordingly builds a fear hierarchy running from weak to strong, keeping exposure within intensities that inhibition can cover. Comparative trials found it outperformed insight-oriented talk therapy for specific phobias, presaging today's evidence-based exposure treatments.�ans��src��LWolpe(1958),《借相互抑制实施心理治疗》,斯坦福大学出版社�^Wolpe, J. (1958). Psychotherapy by Reciprocal Inhibition. Stanford: Stanford University Press.��id�psy_20_002�body���在1950年美国心理学会主席就职演讲中,吉尔福特指出传统智力测验几乎不触及创造潜能,由此开启了系统化的创造力实证研究。他将发散思维定义为沿多个方向生成多样答案的加工,并以流畅性、变通性、独创性与精致性作为核心指标。这一框架直接催生了托兰斯创造性思维测验等标准化工具,至今仍是领域测量的主干。��In his 1950 APA presidential address, J. P. Guilford observed that conventional intelligence tests barely touched creative potential, launching systematic empirical study of creativity. He defined divergent thinking as generating varied answers along many directions, indexed by fluency, flexibility, originality, and elaboration. The framework directly inspired standardized tools such as the Torrance Tests of Creative Thinking, still central to measurement in the field.�ans��src�ٷGuilford, J. P. (1950). Creativity.《American Psychologist》第5卷第9期, 444-454; Torrance, E. P. (1974). Torrance Tests of Creative Thinking: Manual. Scholastic Testing Service.٪Guilford, J. P. (1950). Creativity. American Psychologist, 5(9), 444-454. Torrance, E. P. (1974). Torrance Tests of Creative Thinking: Manual. Scholastic Testing Service.��id�psy_20_005�body���安斯沃斯让12至18个月大的婴儿经历与母亲的短暂分离和重聚,再依分离焦虑、自主探索及重聚反应进行分类。安全型婴儿在母亲在场时积极探索,重聚时寻求接触并能很快平复;回避型看似漠然,生理应激却升高;抗拒型既索求又抗拒安抚,难以平静。梅因等人其后识别出紊乱型——行为缺乏一致策略,常与照料者的创伤或未解决的丧失史相关联。�[Mary Ainsworth had 12-to-18-month-old infants undergo brief separations from and reunions with their mother, then classified them by separation distress, autonomous exploration, and reunion behavior. Secure infants explore actively while the mother is present, seek contact at reunion, and settle quickly; avoidant infants look indifferent while showing elevated physiological stress; resistant infants both seek and rebuff comfort and are hard to soothe. Main and colleagues later identified disorganized attachment, marked by strategy-less behavior often tied to caregivers' trauma or unresolved loss.�ans��src�فAinsworth 等《Patterns of Attachment》(1978); Main & Solomon 载 Greenberg 等编《Attachment in the Preschool Years》(1990)كAinsworth et al., Patterns of Attachment (1978); Main & Solomon, in Greenberg et al. eds., Attachment in the Preschool Years (1990)��id�psy_20_008�body���Ulrich 于 1984 年发表在 Science 的配对对照研究发现,胆囊手术患者若病房窗外是树木,所需的强效镇痛剂更少、住院天数更短、护士负面记录也更少。减压理论认为自然景观凭借进化习得的偏好能迅速降低交感唤醒与负性情绪,注意力恢复理论则强调软魅力使定向注意得以休整。这表明环境的视觉属性可以直接影响生理康复指标,而不只是提供心理安慰。�=Ulrich's matched-pair study published in Science in 1984 found that gallbladder surgery patients whose windows faced trees needed fewer strong analgesics, had shorter hospital stays, and received fewer negative nurses' notes. Stress reduction theory holds that evolutionarily favored natural scenes quickly lower sympathetic arousal and negative affect, while attention restoration theory stresses soft fascination giving directed attention a rest. Visual properties of settings thus feed straight into physiological recovery markers rather than merely comforting patients.�ans��src��mUlrich, R. S. (1984). View through a window may influence recovery from surgery. Science, 224(4647), 420-421.�mUlrich, R. S. (1984). View through a window may influence recovery from surgery. Science, 224(4647), 420-421.��id�psy_20_018�body���这类测验(如列举砖头的多种用途)只捕捉想法生成的流畅性、灵活性与独创性,却无法评估想法的可行性与社会价值,而后者才是创造性成就的关键。贝尔等人的综述指出,测验分数与真实创作成果的相关通常较弱,且高度依赖领域知识,因此它更适合作为能力侧写的一个成分,而不是创造力的单一指标。��Such tasks (like listing alternative uses for a brick) capture only the fluency, flexibility, and originality of idea generation, not the feasibility and social value of ideas, which is what creative achievement actually turns on. Reviews by Baer and colleagues show these scores correlate weakly with real creative products and depend heavily on domain knowledge, so they are better treated as one component of an ability profile than as a single measure of creativity.�ans��src�پGuilford, J. P. (1967). The Nature of Human Intelligence. New York: McGraw-Hill; Baer, J. (1993). Creativity and Divergent Thinking: A Task-Specific Approach. Hillsdale, NJ: Lawrence ErlbaumًGuilford, J. P. (1967), The Nature of Human Intelligence, McGraw-Hill; Baer, J. (1993), Creativity and Divergent Thinking, Lawrence Erlbaum��id�psy_20_020�body���音乐战栗多出现在期待被延迟或突然兑现的时刻,例如和声的意外转折或漫长渐强后的爆发;休伦的期待理论认为,大脑持续对声音事件做概率预测,预测落空触发唤醒反应,延迟兑现则放大随后的奖赏体验。萨林普尔等人的成像研究发现,多巴胺在“期待阶段”与“高潮体验阶段”分别于背侧与腹侧纹状体释放,把这种快感锚定到了具体神经回路。�,Musical chills tend to strike when expectation is delayed or suddenly fulfilled — an unexpected harmonic turn, or the burst after a long crescendo. Huron's expectation theory holds that the brain continuously issues probabilistic predictions about sound events; violated predictions trigger arousal, while delayed fulfillment amplifies the reward that follows. Imaging work by Salimpoor and colleagues found dopamine released in dorsal striatum during anticipation and ventral striatum during peak experience, anchoring the pleasure to specific circuits.�ans��src��Huron, D. (2006). Sweet Anticipation: Music and the Psychology of Expectation. Cambridge, MA: MIT Press; Salimpoor, V. N. et al. (2011). Anatomically distinct dopamine release during anticipation and experience of peak emotion to music. Nature Neuroscience, 14(2), 257-262�tHuron, D. (2006), Sweet Anticipation, MIT Press; Salimpoor, V. N. et al. (2011), Nature Neuroscience, 14(2): 257-262��id�psy_21_002�body��动作技能依赖以基底节和小脑为核心的程序性记忆系统,其运转并不需要内侧颞叶参与。经典病例H.M.完全记不住每天的练习经历,却在镜画任务上一天天画得更好,证明陈述性记忆与技能学习由不同的脑系统分别支持。�uMotor skills rely on the procedural memory system centered on the basal ganglia and cerebellum, which operates without the medial temporal lobes. The classic patient H.M. retained no memory of his daily practice sessions yet drew better and better on the mirror-drawing task, demonstrating that declarative memory and skill learning are supported by distinct brain systems.�ans��src�٬Milner, Corkin, Teuber,《Further analysis of the hippocampal amnesic syndrome: 14-year follow-up study of H.M.》,Neuropsychologia,1968 (DOI: 10.1016/0028-3932(68)90021-3)٪Milner, Corkin, Teuber, 'Further analysis of the hippocampal amnesic syndrome: 14-year follow-up study of H.M.', Neuropsychologia, 1968, DOI: 10.1016/0028-3932(68)90021-3��id�psy_21_005�body��`整合二十余年数十项测量的综述显示,死亡焦虑、感知到的系统不稳定与威胁觉察,同右翼权威主义及社会支配取向之间存在稳定的正相关。死亡凸显实验同样观察到,被试在思考死亡之后会短暂更偏好转统价值和严厉惩罚,提示动机性社会认知是其可能的心理机制之一。��Integrative reviews covering dozens of measures over two decades show stable positive correlations among death anxiety, perceived system instability and threat detection on the one hand, and right-wing authoritarianism and social dominance orientation on the other. Mortality-salience experiments likewise find that participants temporarily favor traditional values and harsher punishment after contemplating death, pointing to motivated social cognition as one plausible mechanism.�ans��src�ٲJost、Glaser、Kruglanski 与 Sulloway,《Political conservatism as motivated social cognition.》,Psychological Bulletin 129(3): 339-375,2003 (DOI: 10.1037/0033-2909.129.3.339)٬Jost, Glaser, Kruglanski & Sulloway, 'Political conservatism as motivated social cognition.', Psychological Bulletin 129(3): 339-375, 2003, DOI: 10.1037/0033-2909.129.3.339��id�psy_21_008�body���在嘈杂聚会中人们能专注追踪一段对话,却会在远处有人喊到自己名字时立即转向——这就是鸡尾酒会效应。Cherry 的双耳分听实验显示,未被注意耳的信息大多在语义分析前就被过滤,但姓名等高显著刺激仍能突破瓶颈进入意识。这说明注意选择以早期感觉过滤为主,同时保留晚期语义加工的通道。��Amid party noise people can follow a single conversation yet turn immediately when someone across the room says their name — the cocktail party effect. Cherry's dichotic listening experiments showed that input to the unattended ear is largely filtered out before semantic analysis, yet highly salient items like one's own name still break through into awareness. Selective attention therefore relies chiefly on early sensory filtering while keeping a late semantic route open.�ans��src�مCherry (1953), Some Experiments on the Recognition of Speech with One and with Two Ears, Journal of the Acoustical Society of AmericaوCherry (1953), "Some Experiments on the Recognition of Speech, with One and with Two Ears," Journal of the Acoustical Society of America��id�psy_21_015�body��t社区心理学常用“社区感”来解释：当居民觉得自己属于这个社区、彼此重要并且能一起影响公共事务时，日常压力就被缓冲了。紧密的邻里网络还提供实际帮助和非正式照看，削弱孤独感与失范感。干预研究显示，改善公共空间、组织邻里活动能够切实提升居民的心理健康指标。��Community psychology explains it through “sense of community”: when residents feel they belong, matter to one another, and can jointly influence local affairs, everyday stressors get buffered. Dense neighborhood networks also provide practical help and informal looking-after, weakening isolation and anomie. Intervention research shows that improving public spaces and organizing neighborhood activities measurably raises residents' mental-health indicators.�ans��src��`Kawachi & Berkman (2001), Social Ties and Mental Health, Journal of Urban Health, 78(3): 460-467�_Kawachi & Berkman (2001), Social Ties and Mental Health, Journal of Urban Health 78(3): 460-467��id�psy_21_018�body���为控制难治性癫痫,H.M.于1953年接受双侧内侧颞叶切除手术,术后出现严重的顺行性遗忘,无法形成新的陈述性记忆,但短时记忆与手术前的远期记忆基本保留。Scoville与Milner在1957年的病例报告中指出,海马结构受损使新记忆难以巩固,而镜像描画等程序性学习任务仍可正常进步。这种双重分离促使研究者把记忆拆分为可分离的系统,并确立了海马在陈述性记忆形成中的核心地位。��To control intractable epilepsy, H.M. underwent bilateral medial temporal lobe resection in 1953, which left him with profound anterograde amnesia: he could form no new declarative memories, while short-term memory and remote memories from before the surgery remained largely intact. Scoville and Milner's 1957 case report showed that damage to the hippocampal region impaired consolidation of new memories even as procedural learning on tasks like mirror-drawing continued to improve normally. This double dissociation led researchers to split memory into separable systems and fixed the hippocampus at the center of declarative memory formation.�ans��src�ٌScoville & Milner (1957), Loss of recent memory after bilateral hippocampal lesions,《Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery, and Psychiatry》هScoville & Milner (1957), Loss of Recent Memory after Bilateral Hippocampal Lesions, Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery, and Psychiatry��id�psy_21_020�body��8Batson提出,当目睹他人受苦而唤起共情关怀时,助人的最终目标是切实改善对方的处境;而在共情水平较低时,帮助往往服务于减轻自身不安或回避内疚等利己目的。在他1981年的关键实验中,被试目睹一名同伴接受电击后可以选择代替其承受剩余电击,实验同时操纵了共情的唤起程度以及被试能否轻易离开现场。结果显示,高共情组即便可以轻松逃离也依然选择代为承受,这支持了共情能够引发纯粹的利他动机,尽管该结论至今仍有争论。��Batson argued that when witnessing another person suffer arouses empathic concern, the ultimate goal of helping is genuinely to improve that person's situation, whereas under low empathy helping tends to serve egoistic ends such as easing one's own discomfort or dodging guilt. In his pivotal 1981 experiment, participants watched a confederate receive shocks and could volunteer to take the remaining shocks for her, while empathic arousal and the ease of escaping the scene were manipulated. Highly empathic participants still volunteered even when they could easily leave, supporting the claim that empathy evokes pure altruistic motivation, though the conclusion remains contested.�ans��src�ٛBatson, Duncan, Ackerman, Buckley & Birch (1981), Is empathic emotion a source of altruistic motivation?,《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》ٖBatson, Duncan, Ackerman, Buckley & Birch (1981), Is Empathic Emotion a Source of Altruistic Motivation?, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology��id�psy_22_002�body���过度规则化指儿童把不规则词形套进一般规则，例如英语里把 went 说成 goed、把 feet 说成 foots。耐人寻味的是，不少孩子先记住正确形式，之后才出现这类“退步”，呈U形轨迹：先逐个记忆，继而归纳出加 -ed 的规则并推广过头，最后才掌握例外。这些错误恰恰证明儿童在主动构建语法规则，而不是机械模仿大人的话。��Overregularization means fitting irregular forms into a general rule—saying goed for went and foots for feet in English. Intriguingly, many children first memorize the correct forms and only later commit such “errors,” a U-shaped course: item-by-item storage, then induction of the add -ed rule pushed too far, and finally mastery of exceptions. These very errors prove that children actively construct grammar instead of parroting adult speech.�ans��src�ِMarcus, G. F. 等（1992），《儿童发展研究学会专著丛刊》第57卷第4期（总第228号）：儿童过度规则化的语料分析��Marcus, G. F., Pinker, S., Ullman, M., Hollander, M., Rosen, T. J., & Xu, F. (1992). Overregularization in language acquisition. Monographs of the Society for Research in Child Development, 57(4, Serial No. 228)��id�psy_22_005�body���框架效应指对同一决策问题的不同表述会引发系统性不同的偏好。经典“亚洲疾病问题”中，600人生命受威胁：方案被描述为“确定救活200人”时，多数人选它；改成“400人将死亡”后，多数人转而冒险。机制在于参照点依赖与损失规避：以存活数为参照时人们回避风险，损失被凸显时人们宁可一搏。偏好取决于呈现方式，而非仅由结果决定。�The framing effect is the systematic divergence of preferences caused by different descriptions of one decision problem. In the classic “Asian disease problem,” an epidemic threatens 600 lives: described as certainly saving 200, the program wins majority support; recast as letting 400 die, most switch to the risky alternative. Reference dependence joined with loss aversion explains this—anchored on survivors, people shun risk; with losses made salient, they prefer to gamble. Preference hinges on presentation, not on outcomes alone.�ans��src�هTversky, A. & Kahneman, D.（1981），Science 第211卷第4481期，453–458；“亚洲疾病问题”；doi:10.1126/science.7455683ٓTversky, A., & Kahneman, D. (1981). The framing of decisions and the psychology of choice. Science, 211(4481), 453-458. doi:10.1126/science.7455683��id�psy_22_008�body���Hackman 与 Oldham 提出，技能多样性、任务完整性、任务重要性、自主性与反馈五项核心特征共同决定工作的激励潜能：前三项让员工体验到工作的意义，自主性带来责任感，反馈帮助了解绩效结果。对成长需求较强的员工，这些特征经由关键心理状态提升内在动机、工作满意度与绩效表现；将五项特征加权合成即得到激励潜能分数。�<Hackman and Oldham proposed five core dimensions—skill variety, task identity, task significance, autonomy, and feedback—that jointly determine a job's motivational potential. The first three let workers experience the work as meaningful, autonomy creates a sense of responsibility, and feedback tells them how well they are doing. For employees with strong growth needs, these dimensions raise intrinsic motivation, job satisfaction, and performance through critical psychological states; weighting and combining the five features yields a motivating potential score.�ans��src�ـHackman, J. R. & Oldham, G. R.（1976），《组织行为与人类绩效》16(2)，250–279；doi:10.1016/0030-5073(76)90016-7��Hackman, J. R., & Oldham, G. R. (1976). Motivation through the design of work: Test of a theory. Organizational Behavior and Human Performance, 16(2), 250-279. doi:10.1016/0030-5073(76)90016-7��id�psy_22_015�body���洛夫特斯与帕尔默1974年让被试观看同一段车祸影片，仅将提问中的动词由“碰上”换成“撞毁”，后者组估计的车速显著更快，一周后更多人“记得”看到了并不存在的碎玻璃。可见记忆并非录像回放而是重构：事后信息会并入原始记忆痕迹，系统性歪曲对速度、细节乃至人物的回忆。该效应直接推动了警方询问规范与双盲辨认程序的建立。�*In 1974, Loftus and Palmer had participants watch identical footage of a car crash, changing only the verb in the question from hit to smashed. The smashed group estimated faster speeds and, a week later, more often remembered broken glass that never existed. Memory thus works by reconstruction rather than playback: post-event information merges into the original trace and systematically distorts recall of speed, detail, even who was involved. The effect directly spurred the adoption of police interview standards and double-blind lineup procedures.�ans��src�٫Loftus & Palmer（1974），《言语学习与言语行为杂志》13(5)，585–589：语言与记忆交互的车祸影片重构实验；doi:10.1016/S0022-5371(74)80011-3��Loftus, E. F., & Palmer, J. C. (1974). Reconstruction of automobile destruction: An example of the interaction between language and memory. Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior, 13(5), 585-589. doi:10.1016/S0022-5371(74)80011-3��id�psy_23_002�body���该理论由Allport提出：当双方地位平等、拥有共同目标、开展群际合作并得到制度支持时，群体间的直接接触能瓦解刻板印象、减少偏见。Pettigrew与Tropp对五百多项研究的元分析证实接触与偏见呈稳定负相关，其机制包括增进对外群体的了解、降低群际焦虑和提升共情。这为学校融合、社区混居等政策提供了实证依据。�Proposed by Allport, the theory states that direct contact between groups reduces prejudice when optimal conditions hold: equal status, common goals, intergroup cooperation, and institutional support. Pettigrew and Tropp's meta-analysis of over five hundred studies confirmed a robust negative association between contact and prejudice, mediated by greater knowledge of the outgroup, lower intergroup anxiety, and increased empathy. These findings supply the empirical basis for policies such as school integration and mixed-housing programs.�ans��src�ٮPettigrew, T. F., & Tropp, L. R. (2006). 群际接触理论的元分析检验. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 90(5), 751–783. DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.90.5.751ٻPettigrew, T. F., & Tropp, L. R. (2006). A meta-analytic test of intergroup contact theory. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 90(5), 751–783. DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.90.5.751��id�psy_23_005�body���该模型认为应激不是事件固有的属性，而是源于个体对环境要求与自身资源匹配关系的动态评估。初级评价判断某事件是否构成伤害、威胁或挑战；次级评价则盘点自己可用于应对的资源与行动选项。当要求被判定超出可用资源时，人才体验到应激，因此同一事件会在不同个体身上引发不同反应。这一框架也奠定了问题焦点应对与情绪焦点应对的经典区分。�_In this model, stress is not an inherent property of events; it emerges from a person's dynamic evaluation of the fit between environmental demands and personal resources. Primary appraisal judges whether an event threatens harm or instead presents a challenge; secondary appraisal takes stock of the resources and options available for coping. Stress is experienced when demands are judged to exceed available resources, which is why the same event can provoke different reactions in different people. This framework also grounded the classic distinction between problem-focused and emotion-focused coping.�ans��src��ILazarus, R. S., & Folkman, S. (1984). 应激、评价与应对. Springer.�NLazarus, R. S., & Folkman, S. (1984). Stress, Appraisal, and Coping. Springer.��id�psy_23_018�body���刻板印象威胁指人因担心印证所属群体的负面刻板印象而产生的压力。Steele 与 Aronson 发现：测验被说成“诊断智力”时黑人学生成绩下滑，同样题目被描述为无关练习时差距基本消失，因为这种忧虑占用工作记忆并诱发回避。它说明部分群体差异源于情境压力而非能力，改进测验措辞即可缓解。��Stereotype threat is the pressure people feel when they fear confirming a negative stereotype about their own group. Steele and Aronson showed that when a test was billed as diagnostic of intelligence, Black students' scores dropped markedly, yet the gap largely vanished when the same items were described as unrelated practice, because the worry consumes working memory and breeds avoidance. Group differences partly reflect situational strain rather than ability, and fairer test framing eases them.�ans��src���Steele, J. W., & Aronson, S. (1995). Stereotype threat and the intellectual test performance of African Americans. 《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》第69卷第5期, 797-811. DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.69.5.797��Steele, J. W., & Aronson, S. (1995). Stereotype threat and the intellectual test performance of African Americans. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 69(5), 797-811. DOI: 10.1037/0022-3514.69.5.797��id�psy_23_020�body���治疗联盟指来访者与治疗师之间的情感信任，以及对目标和任务的一致认同。跨流派元分析显示，联盟质量与结局的相关约 0.28，早期联盟尤其关键，控制早期症状改善后关联仍然存在。但相关不等于因果，联盟好坏也可能部分源于症状变化本身。总体看，技术之外，联盟的建立与修复是可训练、可评估的核心成分。�The therapeutic alliance denotes the bond of trust between client and therapist plus shared agreement on goals and tasks. Cross-school meta-analyses find alliance quality correlates with outcome around .28, the early alliance being especially pivotal, and the association persists after controlling for early symptom change. Correlation is not causation, however, since alliance quality may partly stem from symptom change itself. Beyond technique, building and repairing alliance is a trainable, assessable core ingredient.�ans��src��WFlückiger、Del Re、Wampold 与 Horvath 的元分析，《Psychotherapy》，2018 年�HFlückiger, Del Re, Wampold & Horvath meta-analysis, Psychotherapy, 2018��id�psy_26_003�body���因为睡眠本身就是巩固过程的活跃阶段。慢波睡眠中海马把白天的新痕迹反复回放给新皮层,尖波涟漪与皮层慢振荡耦合驱动这场重演,使记忆逐步从依赖海马的短期存储转入皮层长期网络;同时睡眠隔绝了新的干扰输入,突触还经历稳态性缩减以提高信噪比。通宵者跳过了这套离线加工,脆弱的新痕迹更容易被后续信息冲刷掉。��Sleep itself is an active stage of consolidation. During slow-wave sleep the hippocampus replays the day's fresh traces into neocortex - sharp-wave ripples locked to cortical slow oscillations drive the replay - so memories gradually move from hippocampus-dependent short-term storage into long-term cortical networks. Sleep also blocks new interfering input while synaptic downscaling improves signal-to-noise. All-nighters skip that offline processing, leaving fragile new traces far easier to wash out.�ans��src��kRasch, Born,《About Sleep's Role in Memory》,Physiological Reviews,2013 (DOI: 10.1152/physrev.00032.2012)�iRasch, Born, 'About Sleep's Role in Memory', Physiological Reviews, 2013, DOI: 10.1152/physrev.00032.2012��id�psy_26_006�body���直答:榜样受罚并没有抹掉习得,只是压制了表现。机理:Bandura在1965年让不同组儿童看到攻击榜样的三种结局,受罚组当场模仿确实骤减,但改用奖品激励后,他们对动作的再现与其他组不相上下,可见观察早已完成学习,替代惩罚改变的是行为被表达的概率。是否表现出学到的行为取决于预期后果,这正是社会学习理论区分习得与表现的核心依据。�Punishment never erased what the children had learned - it only suppressed performance. In Bandura's 1965 experiment different groups watched an aggressive model come to three fates; the punished group imitated far less on the spot, yet once rewards were promised for reproducing the acts they matched the others almost move for move, showing observation had already done the teaching. Vicarious consequences shift how likely an acquired act is expressed, which is why social learning theory keeps acquisition and performance apart.�ans��src�ٰBandura论文《Influence of Models' Reinforcement Contingencies on the Acquisition of Imitative Responses》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 1965(斯坦福大学)ٯBandura A, Influence of Models' Reinforcement Contingencies on the Acquisition of Imitative Responses, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 1965 (Stanford University)��id�psy_26_010�body���直答:做选择本身就会消耗自控所依赖的资源。机理:Vohs等2008年的系列实验发现,先连续在多个商品间取舍的被试,随后把手浸入冰水的坚持时间更短、更容易向甜食屈服;对真实商场顾客的追踪也呈现同样模式。原因在于每一次取舍都要压住落选方案的吸引力并承担选错的风险,几轮下来资源见底,再遇诱惑时能用来踩刹车的储备已所剩无几。��Choosing itself drains the resource that self-control runs on. Across a 2008 series of experiments, Vohs and colleagues found that people first made to trade off among many products kept their hands in ice water for less time and caved to sweets more easily, and shoppers tracked in a real mall fitted the same pattern. Every trade-off means suppressing the pull of rejected options while shouldering the risk of a bad pick, so after a few rounds little reserve remains for braking against the next temptation.�ans��src���Vohs等论文《Making Choices Impairs Subsequent Self-Control: A Limited-Resource Account of Decision Making, Self-Regulation, and Active Initiative》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 2008(明尼苏达大学)��Vohs KD et al., 'Making choices impairs subsequent self-control: a limited-resource account of decision making, self-regulation, and active initiative', Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 2008 (University of Minnesota)��id�psy_26_013�body���直答:先前的连续选择消耗了自控资源,抑制购买冲动的力量随之下降。机理:Vohs与Faber让部分被试先完成耗资源的自控任务,随后他们在模拟购买情境中报告更强的购买欲、愿出更高的价、买得更多;决策疲劳削弱了对占有冲动的抑制,也让注意更容易被诱人商品捕获,价格权衡让位于即时欲望,冲动消费因此上升。��Self-control resources drained by earlier choices weaken the brake on buying impulses. Vohs and Faber had some participants first perform effortful self-control tasks; afterward, in simulated purchasing situations they reported stronger urges to buy, offered higher prices, and bought more items. Decision fatigue erodes inhibition of acquisition impulses and lets attention latch onto tempting products, so price evaluation gives way to immediate desire and impulsive spending climbs.�ans��src�ٛVohs与Faber论文《Spent Resources: Self-Regulatory Resource Availability Affects Impulse Buying》,Journal of Consumer Research 2007(明尼苏达大学)١Vohs KD & Faber RJ, 'Spent Resources: Self-Regulatory Resource Availability Affects Impulse Buying', Journal of Consumer Research, 2007 (University of Minnesota)��id�0686d6e8a055�body�ٵ该定律指出唤醒水平与表现呈“倒U型”关系：适度唤醒表现最好，过低令人懈怠、过高引发焦虑。任务越复杂，最佳唤醒水平通常越低。��The law states an inverted-U relation between arousal and performance: moderate arousal yields the best result, while too little brings lethargy and too much brings anxiety. The more complex the task, the lower the optimal arousal tends to be.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0d6266ee587a�body���该理论提出我们因哭泣而悲伤、因逃跑而害怕，即身体反应先于情绪体验，情绪是对生理变化的知觉。它把外周生理反馈置于情绪起因的核心，区别于后来的认知理论。�The theory proposes that we feel sad because we cry and afraid because we flee, meaning bodily responses precede emotional experience and emotion is the perception of physiological change. It places peripheral feedback at the core of emotion causation, unlike later cognitive theories.�ans��src��AJames, W. (1884). 《什么是情绪?》. 《心智》杂志9卷.�.James, W. (1884). What is an emotion? Mind, 9.��id�237cc4b4954b�body��/压力对记忆呈“倒 U”双相作用：适量皮质醇提升警觉与提取，但长期高水平皮质醇会损伤海马体新生与突触可塑，损害记忆（Lupien 等, 2009）。这就是“急性增益、慢性损伤”——短期压力是助推器，长期压力则是侵蚀记忆的酸。�'Stress affects memory in an inverted-U: moderate cortisol boosts alertness and retrieval, but prolonged high cortisol damages hippocampal neurogenesis and synaptic plasticity (Lupien et al., 2009). Hence acute gain, chronic drain - short-term stress is a booster, long-term stress erodes memory.�ans��src��sLupien 等 (2009)《终身压力对脑与记忆的影响》, Current Directions in Psychological Science 18(1):6-11٠Lupien, S.J., McEwen, B.S., Gunnar, M.R. & Heim, C. (2009). Effects of stress throughout the lifespan. Current Directions in Psychological Science, 18(1), 6-11.��id�247444275a23�body���常见风险因素包括既往自杀企图、重度抑郁等精神疾病、物质滥用、慢性疼痛和强烈孤独感。保护性因素如社会支持和求助意愿可降低风险，有危机时应及时寻求专业帮助。�Common risk factors include prior attempts, mental illness such as major depression, substance abuse, chronic pain, and acute loneliness. Protective factors like social support and willingness to seek help reduce risk; professional help should be sought in crisis.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�4c61f00fe934�body���埃里克森认为人一生要经历八个危机阶段，从婴儿期的“信任对不信任”到老年的“自我整合对绝望”。每个阶段都要平衡一对矛盾，顺利解决才能形成健康人格。��Erikson held that people pass through eight crisis stages, from 'trust vs. mistrust' in infancy to 'integrity vs. despair' in old age. Each stage balances a pair of opposites, and resolving it well fosters a healthy personality.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�538b42053a70�body��<希金斯的“自我不一致理论”（Higgins, 1987）区分理想我、应该我与现实我：理想我落差引发抑郁型情绪（失望、沮丧），应该我落差引发焦虑型情绪（紧张、内疚）。它不是普通的“不满意”，而是特定自我表征错位导致的特定情绪配方。�NHiggins's self-discrepancy theory (1987) contrasts ideal, ought and actual selves: a gap from the ideal self breeds dejection-related emotions (disappointment), while a gap from the ought self breeds agitation-related ones (anxiety, guilt). It is not vague dissatisfaction but a specific mismatch yielding a specific emotional recipe.�ans��src��nHiggins, E.T. (1987)《自我不一致：联结自我与情绪的理论》, Psychological Review 94(3):319-340�pHiggins, E.T. (1987). Self-discrepancy: a theory relating self and affect. Psychological Review, 94(3), 319-340.��id�5bb078e6352f�body��)贝姆的“自我知觉理论”（Bem, 1972）认为，当内在态度模糊时，人会像旁观者一样，从自己的外显行为反推态度。这解释了为什么小承诺会悄悄改变偏好、为什么“假装喜欢”久了可能真喜欢——行为先于并塑造了自我认知。�$Bem's self-perception theory (1972) says when internal attitudes are unclear, we infer them from our own behavior as an outside observer would. It explains why small commitments quietly shift preference and why pretending to like can become real - behavior precedes and shapes self-knowledge.�ans��src��hBem, D.J. (1972)《自我知觉理论》, in Berkowitz(编) Experimental Social Psychology 进展 6:1-62�^Bem, D.J. (1972). Self-perception theory. Advances in Experimental Social Psychology, 6, 1-62.��id�5fb8fd8d7b14�body�ٺ拉扎勒斯区分问题聚焦应对（直接解决压力源）与情绪聚焦应对（调节情绪反应），此外还有回避、求助等策略。不同情境下有效方式不同。��Lazarus distinguished problem-focused coping (directly tackling the stressor) from emotion-focused coping (managing emotional reactions), plus strategies like avoidance and seeking support. Different situations call for different approaches.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�62efb2489078�body���左右半球确有功能偏侧化：左半球通常更擅长语言与逻辑，右半球更擅长空间与面孔加工。但大多数任务由两个半球协同完成，“左脑理性、右脑感性”的说法过于简化。��The hemispheres do show lateralization: the left is typically stronger in language and logic, the right in spatial and face processing. But most tasks engage both cooperatively, so 'left brain rational, right brain creative' is an oversimplification.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�64defac4fac4�body���内隐偏见是人们无意识中持有的、未经反思的态度或刻板印象，会影响不带恶意的决策。它可通过内隐联想测验测量，且不同于公开表达的外显偏见。��Implicit bias is an unconscious, unreflective attitude or stereotype that can affect decisions even without malicious intent. It is measured by the Implicit Association Test and differs from openly expressed explicit bias.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�69b3ff777c1b�body���埃里克森认为青少年处于“同一性对角色混乱”阶段，需要回答“我是谁、我要成为什么样的人”。成功建立同一性有助于形成稳定的自我与人生方向。��Erikson placed adolescents in the 'identity vs. role confusion' stage, where they must answer 'who am I and what do I want to become.' Successfully forming an identity helps build a stable self and life direction.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�84875425faa2�body�٢这叫REM睡眠行为障碍，本应让身体麻痹的肌肉抑制机制失效，使人把梦里的动作真实做出来，常见于中老年，需医学评估。ٱCalled REM sleep behavior disorder, the muscle paralysis that should occur fails, so people physically act out dreams—more common in older adults and needs medical evaluation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�91b4c798e110�body���布洛卡区（左额下回）损伤导致表达性失语：说话费力、语法缺失但理解相对保留；韦尼克区（左颞上回）损伤导致感受性失语：言语流利却语义混乱、理解受损。�.Damage to Broca's area (left inferior frontal gyrus) causes expressive aphasia: effortful speech and agrammatism with relatively preserved comprehension. Damage to Wernicke's area (left superior temporal gyrus) causes receptive aphasia: fluent but semantically empty speech with impaired comprehension.�ans��src��WBear, M. F., Connors, B. W., Paradiso, M. A. 《神经科学》(第6版), 语言章节.�XBear, M. F., Connors, B. W., & Paradiso, M. A. Neuroscience (6th ed.), language chapter.��id�98fe96bf96be�body�ي多数儿童在 18–24 个月通过“镜子测试”（鼻尖点红后照镜会去摸自己鼻子），标志自我再认能力出现。ْMost children pass the 'mirror test' (touching a marked nose when seeing themselves) at 18–24 months, marking the emergence of self-recognition.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�d45f800eef99�body���流体智力（快速推理、新信息处理）约 20 岁后缓降；晶体智力（知识、词汇、判断）可维持甚至上升。这解释了为何长者反应慢但更有智慧，经验是真实资产。��Fluid intelligence (fast reasoning, new processing) dips after about 20; crystallized intelligence (knowledge, vocabulary, judgment) holds or rises. This explains why elders react slower yet wiser; experience is a real asset.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�d9ebfe052039�body��N希金斯的“调节焦点”理论（Higgins, 1997）把动机分成促进焦点（追求理想、收益、成长）与预防焦点（守规矩、避损失、责任）。同一目标下，前者偏好冒险策略、被收益激励，后者偏好稳妥策略、被失误警醒，解释了为何同样努力的人风格截然不同。�hHiggins's regulatory focus theory (1997) splits motivation into promotion focus (pursuing ideals, gains, growth) and prevention focus (upholding duties, avoiding losses, responsibilities). Under the same goal, the former favors eager strategies and gain framing, the latter cautious ones and loss framing - explaining why equally driven people differ in style.�ans��src��WHiggins, E.T. (1997)《超越快乐与痛苦》, American Psychologist 52(12):1280-1300�YHiggins, E.T. (1997). Beyond pleasure and pain. American Psychologist, 52(12), 1280-1300.��id�eea5782756a5�body�ٽ罗杰斯强调“自我概念”与“无条件积极关注”，认为人天生有向善和自我实现的倾向。心理困扰常源于真实自我与理想自我之间的差距过大。��Rogers emphasized the 'self-concept' and 'unconditional positive regard,' believing people are naturally inclined toward growth and self-actualization. Distress often stems from too large a gap between the real and ideal self.�ans��src��BRogers, C. R. (1961).《On Becoming a Person》, Houghton Mifflin.�aRogers, C. R. (1961). On Becoming a Person: A Therapist's View of His Approach. Houghton Mifflin.��id�eff86dd16801�body��T詹姆斯-兰格理论（James, 1884；Lange, 1885）认为身体反应先于并构成情绪体验：先有心跳加速，大脑才把它解读为“害怕”。坎农-巴德理论（Cannon & Bard, 1927）则主张丘脑同时把信号送往身体和大脑皮层，所以生理唤起与主观感受是同时发生的，而非先后因果。�JThe James-Lange theory (James, 1884; Lange, 1885) holds that bodily responses come first and create the feeling - we run, therefore we are afraid. The Cannon-Bard theory (Cannon & Bard, 1927) argues the thalamus sends signals to both body and cortex at once, so arousal and conscious feeling arise together rather than in a chain.�ans��src�فCannon, W.B. & Bard, P. (1927)《与情绪表达相关的丘脑部位》, in Cannon Bodily Changes in Pain, Hunger, Fear and RageًCannon, W.B. & Bard, P. (1927). On the neural basis of emotional expression. In W.B. Cannon, Bodily Changes in Pain, Hunger, Fear and Rage.��id�fe29f8ec89c6�body�ٱ婴儿海马体和前额叶尚未成熟，难以形成稳定长时记忆；且语言和自我意识尚未发展，称为“婴儿期失忆”。一般最早记忆约在3-4岁。��The infant hippocampus and prefrontal cortex are not yet mature enough for stable long-term memory, and language and self-awareness are undeveloped—called childhood (infantile) amnesia. Earliest memories usually appear around age 3–4.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�psy_24_020�body���洛夫特斯与帕尔默1974年让被试看同一段车祸影片后回答:车辆碰撞时开多快,平均估约40.8英里/小时(约66公里/小时);换成“撞毁”时,估计升到约45.2英里/小时(约73公里/小时),且一周后被问是否看到碎玻璃时,撞毁组的虚报率翻倍——根本没有玻璃。记忆不是回放而是重构:每次回忆都会把当下信息(提问措辞、他人叙述、想象)编织进痕迹,越频繁回忆越可能偏离原始事件。这解释了为何无辜者会被指认、为何连续访谈可能污染儿童证词;司法程序中的盲指认与双盲讯问正是这些实验的直接产物。��Loftus and Palmer showed subjects one crash film, then asked how fast the cars were going when they hit each other: estimates averaged about 40.8 miles per hour (about 66 km/h); swapping smashed for hit pushed averages to about 45.2 miles per hour (about 73 km/h), and a week later the smashed group doubled false claims of seeing broken glass — there was none. Memory reconstructs rather than replays: every recall weaves current information (question wording, others' accounts, imagination) into the trace, so frequent retelling drifts further from events. This explains wrongful identifications and contaminated child testimony — blind lineups and double-blind interviewing are direct offspring of these experiments.�ans��src���Loftus 与 Palmer,《Reconstruction of automobile destruction: An example of the interaction between language and memory》,Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior,1974 (DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(74)80011-3)��Loftus & Palmer, 'Reconstruction of automobile destruction: An example of the interaction between language and memory', Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior, 1974, DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(74)80011-3��id�009791d592a3�body���标签效应指被贴上某类标签后，本人与他人按标签期待行事（自证预言），并损害身份与自尊。去标签化、先看能力再看诊断，是更尊重也更准确的方式。��Labeling effect: once tagged (patient, failure), the person and others act to match the label (self-fulfilling prophecy), harming identity and self-worth. De-labeling—seeing ability before diagnosis—is more respectful and accurate.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�00d13b336f49�body���阅读时需暂存前文并整合句法，工作记忆容量低者更易在长句末尾丢失开头信息。达尼曼等人的研究表明，工作记忆容量是阅读理解与词汇学习的有力预测指标。�Reading requires holding earlier text and integrating syntax, so low-capacity readers more easily lose the beginning of a long sentence by its end. Daneman and Carpenter showed working-memory capacity is a strong predictor of reading comprehension and vocabulary learning.�ans��src��tDaneman, M. & Carpenter, P. A. (1980). 《工作记忆与阅读理解中的个体差异》. 《言语学习》19卷.لDaneman, M. & Carpenter, P. A. (1980). Individual differences in working memory. Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior, 19.��id�00e9460aeac1�body��心理学家卡尼曼提出，大脑有两套思维系统：系统1快速、自动、凭直觉，比如看到可怕画面立刻害怕；系统2缓慢、费力、需要逻辑，比如解数学题。两者配合，但系统1常常抢先影响我们的判断。�"Psychologist Kahneman described two thinking systems: System 1 is fast, automatic, and intuitive, such as feeling fear instantly at a scary image; System 2 is slow, effortful, and logical, such as solving a math problem. They work together, but System 1 often influences our judgment first.�ans��src��Kahneman 双系统理论�Kahneman dual-system theory��id�016e2cc4476d�body��z青春期大脑发展并不均衡：负责情绪与奖赏的深层结构（如杏仁核、纹状体）先成熟，而负责计划、抑制冲动的前额叶皮层要到二十多岁才完全成熟。所以青少年情绪反应快而刹车系统慢，这是神经发育的正常现象，不是“不懂事”。充足的睡眠、支持和安全的环境能帮大脑平稳成长。�oThe adolescent brain matures unevenly: deep structures for emotion and reward (amygdala, striatum) mature first, while the prefrontal cortex for planning and impulse control finishes in the mid-20s. So teens react fast with a slow brake — a normal part of brain development, not “immaturity.” Good sleep, support, and safe environments help it develop smoothly.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�021398924392�body��治疗联盟指来访者与咨询师之间就目标、任务达成的一致以及情感联结。大量元分析表明，联盟质量是跨流派预测疗效最稳定的因素之一，甚至超过具体技术手段，因为它影响来访者的投入与依从。�$The therapeutic alliance is the agreement on goals and tasks plus the emotional bond between client and therapist. Meta-analyses rank alliance quality among the most consistent predictors of outcome across schools of therapy, often outweighing specific techniques by strengthening engagement.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 心理治疗卷�4Annual Review of Psychology (psychotherapy research)��id�027edef65074�body�پ该训练教人们识别永久性、普遍性与个人化的悲观解释风格，并用证据反驳灾难化想法（ABC 模型）。改变归因方式可提升韧性与抑郁预防效果。�The training teaches people to recognize a pessimistic explanatory style that is permanent, pervasive, and personal, and to dispute catastrophic thoughts with evidence (the ABC model). Changing attributional style boosts resilience and helps prevent depression.�ans��src��.Seligman, M. E. P. (1991). 《学习乐观》.�,Seligman, M. E. P. (1991). Learned Optimism.��id�02c151b4b11b�body��1过度理由效应的经典演示是，让本来喜欢画画的幼儿在获得奖状奖励后，自由活动时主动画画的时间反而减少，因为孩子把行为归因于外部奖赏而非兴趣本身。自我决定理论用自主感、胜任感与归属感三种基本需要加以解释：可预期的、以控制为目的的物质奖励削弱自主感，因而降低内在动机；而信息性的正面反馈提升胜任感，通常不产生这种损害。因此实践含义并非取消奖励，而是避免把奖励设计成对行为的控制条件。��The classic demonstration of the overjustification effect had preschoolers who already enjoyed drawing receive certificates for it, after which they spent less free-choice time drawing, because they attributed the activity to the reward rather than to their own interest. Self-determination theory explains this through three basic needs — autonomy, competence, and relatedness: expected tangible rewards used to control behaviour undercut autonomy and thus intrinsic motivation, whereas informational positive feedback enhances competence and generally does no such damage. The practical implication is not to abolish rewards but to avoid designing them as controlling contingencies on behaviour.�ans��src�ٴLepper、Greene 与 Nisbett（1973）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》；Deci 与 Ryan《Intrinsic Motivation and Self-Determination in Human Behavior》（1985）٤Lepper, Greene and Nisbett (1973), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Deci and Ryan, Intrinsic Motivation and Self-Determination in Human Behavior (1985)��id�032e7724c2a1�body��5格式塔学派发现，大脑会自动把零散的元素组织成有意义的整体，比如把靠近的点看成一组、把断开的线条补成完整图形（接近、闭合、相似等原则）。这些组织规则不靠学习，而是大脑感知系统的默认设置，帮助我们快速理解世界。�8Gestalt psychologists found the brain automatically organizes scattered elements into meaningful wholes — grouping nearby dots, completing broken lines (proximity, closure, similarity, etc.). These rules are not learned; they are the default wiring of the perceptual system, helping us grasp the world quickly.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（感觉与知觉章）�@Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), sensation and perception chapter��id�0367106f38a6�body���刻板印象常源于对社会环境的高效分类与启发式加工，一旦形成便通过注意偏向与记忆重构维持。它们会在不知不觉中影响我们对个体特质的解释，即便当事人并不认同这些刻板内容。��Stereotypes often arise from efficient social categorization and heuristic processing, then persist through attentional biases and memory reconstruction. They can shape how we interpret an individual's traits outside conscious endorsement.�ans��src���Hamilton, Gifford,《Illusory correlation in interpersonal perception: A cognitive basis of stereotypic judgments》,Journal of Experimental Social Psychology,1976 (DOI: 10.1016/s0022-1031(76)80006-6)��Hamilton, Gifford, 'Illusory correlation in interpersonal perception: A cognitive basis of stereotypic judgments', Journal of Experimental Social Psychology, 1976, DOI: 10.1016/s0022-1031(76)80006-6��id�04c4bd325793�body�ي人们倾向于寻找、记住支持自己已有观点的信息，而忽视相反证据，这会强化偏见并让人更难改变想法。هPeople favor information that supports their existing beliefs and ignore contradictory evidence, reinforcing bias and resisting change.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�0554181f8f24�body��\是的，这就是“自我实现预言”。罗森塔尔实验中，被随机告知“智力高”的孩子，一年后成绩反而真的更好，因为期望改变了老师的关注、鼓励和孩子的自信。期待本身不是魔法，而是它改变了互动的质量。反过来，善用积极的期望，能帮身边的人发挥得更好。�bYes — the self-fulfilling prophecy. In the Rosenthal experiment, children randomly labeled “high potential” later showed real gains, because expectations changed teacher attention, encouragement, and the children's confidence. Expectation isn't magic; it changes the quality of interaction. Used kindly, positive expectations help people do better.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会影响章）�8Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social influence chapter��id�0729e223e369�body���自我决定论由 Deci 与 Ryan 提出，认为自主性、胜任感与关系感是人类三种普遍的基本心理需求，满足它们能促进内在动机与心理健康。该理论自 1985 年提出后广泛应用于教育、运动与组织领域。�"Self-Determination Theory, proposed by Deci and Ryan, holds that autonomy, competence, and relatedness are three universal basic psychological needs whose satisfaction fosters intrinsic motivation and well-being. Since 1985 it has been widely applied in education, sport, and organizations.�ans��src��jDeci 与 Ryan《自我决定论》（1985）；Ryan 与 Deci 2000 年综述（载 American Psychologist）�ZDeci & Ryan, Self-Determination Theory (1985); Ryan & Deci (2000) in American Psychologist��id�07b0bf8e1b39�body��闪光灯记忆指人们对重大、情绪强烈事件（如亲历地震或得知重要新闻）发生时的情境细节拥有异常清晰、持久的记忆。Brown 与 Kulik 于 1977 年提出该概念，但后续研究表明其清晰度常高于准确性，并非完全可靠。�&A flashbulb memory is an unusually vivid and long-lasting memory of the circumstances in which one learned about a surprising, emotionally arousing event. Brown and Kulik proposed the concept in 1977, though later research shows such memories are often confident rather than perfectly accurate.�ans��src��NBrown 与 Kulik 1977 年论文（载 Cognition）；Myers《社会心理学》�;Brown & Kulik (1977) in Cognition; Myers, Social Psychology��id�09270139e31f�body�٨社会助长指他人在场能提升简单任务表现，社会懈怠指群体中个人努力程度下降。两者都说明他人存在会改变个体的行为投入。��Social facilitation is that the presence of others improves performance on simple tasks, while social loafing is the drop in individual effort within a group. Both show that others' presence changes how much we invest.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�0ba0f7d7df74�body��6大五人格模型用五个广泛维度描述人格：开放性、尽责性、外向性、宜人性与神经质（OCEAN）。Costa 与 McCrae 在 1980 年代通过 NEO-PI 系列量表系统确立该模型，其修订版 NEO-PI-R 于 1992 年发布，该模型在跨文化研究中表现出良好的稳定性。�QThe Big Five model describes personality along five broad dimensions: Openness, Conscientiousness, Extraversion, Agreeableness, and Neuroticism (OCEAN). Costa and McCrae established the model through the NEO-PI series of inventories in the 1980s, with the revised NEO-PI-R published in 1992, and it shows robust cross-cultural stability.�ans��src��MCosta 与 McCrae《NEO-PI-R 手册》（1992）；Funder《人格心理学》�SCosta & McCrae, NEO PI-R Professional Manual (1992); Funder, The Personality Puzzle��id�0c457ce106b1�body���前额叶支撑抑制控制、工作记忆与认知灵活性三大核心执行功能，使个体能计划、抗干扰并切换策略。其损伤会导致目标导向行为瓦解，是多动症等疾病的关注焦点。�The prefrontal cortex supports three core executive functions—inhibitory control, working memory, and cognitive flexibility—enabling planning, distraction resistance, and strategy switching. Its damage disrupts goal-directed behavior and is central to ADHD.�ans��src��4《神经科学》(Bear 等);美国心理学会(APA)�DNeuroscience (Bear et al.); American Psychological Association (APA)��id�0c4d2996d804�body��戴维森的“第三人称效应”（Davison, 1983）指人们普遍觉得自己比他人更不受媒体影响，于是支持限制“别人会中招”的内容。这种偏差来自自我提升与乐观偏见，却可能导致低估自己真正被操控的风险。�
Davison's third-person effect (1983) is the widespread belief that media influence others more than ourselves, leading people to back restrictions for those who would be fooled. Rooted in self-enhancement and optimism bias, it can blind us to our own susceptibility.�ans��src��ZDavison, W.P. (1983)《第三人称效应的假设》, Public Opinion Quarterly 47(1):1-15�fDavison, W.P. (1983). The third-person effect in communication. Public Opinion Quarterly, 47(1), 1-15.��id�0cd5d897833e�body��计划谬误指人们在估算项目工期与成本时系统性偏乐观，因为习惯采用内部视角：设想理想的执行路径，逐步累加时间，却忽略了历史上同类项目普遍出现的意外与返工。参照类别预测法要求转向外部视角，先找出足够多的可比项目，用其实际工期与超支的分布作为基准，再根据本项目的特殊之处做有限调整。这一方法已被写入部分国家的基础设施评估规范，用于对大型工程的乐观偏差进行强制上调。��The planning fallacy is the systematic optimism in estimating project duration and cost that arises from taking an inside view: imagining an ideal execution path and adding up steps while ignoring the surprises and rework that historically afflict comparable projects. Reference class forecasting insists on the outside view, assembling a large enough set of similar past projects, using the observed distribution of their durations and overruns as the baseline, and only then making limited adjustments for what is genuinely unusual here. The technique has been written into some national infrastructure appraisal guidance as a mandatory optimism-bias uplift for large works.�ans��src�هKahneman 与 Tversky（1979）直觉预测与纠偏程序论文；Flyvbjerg（2006）《Project Management Journal》参照类别预测ٞKahneman and Tversky (1979), Intuitive prediction: biases and corrective procedures; Flyvbjerg (2006), Project Management Journal, reference class forecasting��id�0d4a53aa4904�body���信度指测验结果的一致性与稳定性，效度指测验是否真正测到了它声称要测的东西。效度比信度更根本：不可靠的测验一定无效，可靠却不一定有效。��Reliability is the consistency and stability of test results; validity is whether the test truly measures what it claims. Validity is more fundamental: an unreliable test cannot be valid, but a reliable one is not automatically valid.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�0dbc78ab557d�body���单纯曝光效应指人们仅仅因为反复接触某刺激，就会对其产生更高的喜好，无需任何奖励或熟悉信息的加工。Zajonc 于 1968 年提出并验证，说明喜好可在无意识层面由重复接触塑造。�The mere exposure effect is that repeated exposure to a stimulus increases liking of it, without any reward or conscious familiarity processing. Zajonc proposed and demonstrated it in 1968, showing preference can be shaped by mere repetition outside awareness.�ans��src��hZajonc 1968 年论文（载 Journal of Personality and Social Psychology）；Myers《社会心理学》�WZajonc (1968) in Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Myers, Social Psychology��id�0de367abeb62�body��当颜色词的字义与墨色不一致时，说出墨色的反应时明显变长、错误增多，因为熟练成人的阅读高度自动化，字义在无意图的情况下被激活，与需要努力控制的颜色命名任务竞争同一反应通道。这说明自动化加工难以随意关闭，冲突解决依赖前扣带皮层与前额叶的控制机制。若让被试反复练习颜色命名，或反过来削弱阅读的自动化程度，干扰量就会减小，这也是自动化程度可训练的证据。�rWhen a colour word's meaning conflicts with its ink colour, naming the ink takes longer and produces more errors, because reading is highly automatic in skilled adults so word meaning is activated unintentionally and competes for the same response channel as the effortful colour-naming task. This shows automatic processing cannot simply be switched off, and that conflict resolution recruits control mechanisms in the anterior cingulate and prefrontal cortex. Extensive practice at colour naming — or conditions that reduce reading automaticity — shrinks the interference, evidence that automaticity itself is trainable.�ans��src�ىStroop（1935）《Journal of Experimental Psychology》；MacLeod（1991）《Psychological Bulletin》斯特鲁普效应半世纪回顾يStroop (1935), Journal of Experimental Psychology; MacLeod (1991), Psychological Bulletin, half a century of research on the Stroop effect��id�0e81b7929bbd�body��w不一定。认知能力随年龄的变化不同步：反应速度、工作记忆等“流体能力”通常会下降，但词汇、经验、判断力等“晶体能力”常能继续增长到老年。大脑还有“认知储备”——丰富的学习经历就像备用线路，能缓冲老化的影响。保持学习、社交和身体活动，对大脑健康非常有益。��Not necessarily. Abilities age at different rates: “fluid” capacities like reaction speed and working memory typically decline, while “crystallized” ones like vocabulary, experience, and judgment often keep growing into old age. The brain also builds cognitive reserve — rich learning experiences act as backup wiring that buffers decline. Continuing to learn, socialize, and stay physically active strongly benefits brain health.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�0ed01438473c�body�ٷ苛勒在黑猩猩实验中发现，学习有时不是逐步试误，而是突然“灵光一现”地看清新关系、找到解法。它强调对问题整体结构的重组理解。��Köhler, studying chimpanzees, found that learning is sometimes not gradual trial-and-error but a sudden 'aha' grasp of new relations that yields a solution. It emphasizes reorganizing one's understanding of the problem's whole structure.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0f201d1ec9a0�body�ٺ共情是理解并感受他人情绪的能力，分为认知共情（理解对方想法）和情感共情（共享对方感受）。它是亲社会行为与道德关怀的重要基础。��Empathy is the ability to understand and feel another's emotions, split into cognitive empathy (grasping their thoughts) and affective empathy (sharing their feelings). It underpins prosocial behavior and moral care.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�10399d6289c2�body�٢可以。通过暗示、误导信息或想象练习，人们可能“回忆”出从未发生的事，这叫错误记忆。记忆是可重构的而非录像式。��Yes. Through suggestion, misleading information, or imagination exercises, people may 'recall' events that never happened—called false memories. Memory is reconstructive, not like a video recording.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�12055add5825�body���面对面互动带来触觉、眼神与同步生理信号（如心率趋同），促进催产素与安全感；浅层线上连接若替代真实接触，可能反而加剧孤独。质量重于数量。��Face-to-face contact brings touch, eye contact and synchronized signals like heart-rate convergence, boosting oxytocin and safety; shallow online ties that replace real contact can worsen loneliness. Quality beats quantity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�168c1865ff9e�body���交错练习指混合不同题型/技能轮换训练，而非长时间只练一种（集中练习）。它增加提取难度与辨别训练，提升长期保留和迁移，虽当下更费劲、成绩看起来更差。��Interleaving mixes different problem types/skills in rotation rather than massing one (blocking). It adds retrieval difficulty and discrimination training, boosting long-term retention and transfer—though it feels harder and looks worse immediately.�ans��src��Rohrer 与 Taylor (2007)�Rohrer & Taylor (2007)��id�171080a90135�body���神经性厌食是一种进食障碍，表现为对体重和体形的强烈恐惧、刻意限制进食，并伴扭曲的身体意象。它可造成严重生理后果，需要医学与心理联合干预。��Anorexia nervosa is an eating disorder marked by intense fear of weight gain, deliberate food restriction, and distorted body image. It can cause severe physical harm and needs combined medical and psychological care.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�171f5e03cf01�body�ٮ脸红由交感神经系统引发，血管扩张使面部血流增加，常在尴尬、羞耻时被触发，可能是一种向他人传递“我知错了”的社会信号。٪Blushing is triggered by the sympathetic nervous system dilating facial blood vessels, often during embarrassment or shame—possibly a social signal of 'I know I erred.'�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�1960049e0053�body��0“30 岁焦虑”很常见，因为社会和文化常把 30 岁当成一个“该有成就”的节点，比如成家、立业、稳定。到了这个年纪，人们会不自觉和同龄人比较，又正经历职业和关系的多重转变，担心“落后”或“来不及”，于是产生焦虑。�JThirty-something anxiety is common because society often treats 30 as a milestone for having it all figured out—a partner, a career, stability. Around this age people compare themselves with peers and face multiple transitions in work and relationships, worrying they are 'behind' or 'running out of time,' which breeds anxiety.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�1ab50d6f36d8�body��&抑郁症是一种常见心境障碍，表现为持续低落、兴趣减退、精力下降，并影响睡眠、食欲和注意力，持续两周以上需重视。它不是“想不开”，而是与脑内化学物质、基因和处境都有关。及时寻求医生或心理咨询非常重要。�BDepression is a common mood disorder with persistent low mood, loss of interest, and reduced energy, affecting sleep, appetite, and concentration; lasting over two weeks warrants attention. It is not 'weak will', but linked to brain chemistry, genes, and circumstances. Seeking a doctor or counselor promptly is important.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�1b558e4daccf�body���双盲设计使受试者与施测者均不知分组，可同时排除受试者的期望效应与研究者的无意偏倚。它在药物与行为干预中最大程度隔离处理变量的净效应，是建立因果的强有力工具。��Double-blind designs withhold group assignment from both participants and experimenters, ruling out expectation effects and unconscious bias. In drug and behavioral trials they isolate the net treatment effect, a strong tool for causality.�ans��src��l沙迪什、库克、坎贝尔 (2002). 《广义因果推断的实验与准实验设计》. Houghton MifflinٕShadish, W. R., Cook, T. D., & Campbell, D. T. (2002). Experimental and Quasi-Experimental Designs for Generalized Causal Inference. Houghton Mifflin��id�1ce19b0cf7cc�body���这叫“窒息”（choking under pressure）：压力越大表现反而越差。一个主要原因是“过度分析”——本应自动化的动作被意识反复监控，变得僵硬；同时焦虑占据工作记忆，干扰临场判断。应对方法包括在训练中模拟高压情境、把注意力放在“过程线索”（呼吸、动作节奏）而不是比分和结果上。�~That's choking under pressure: performance gets worse as stakes rise. A key cause is over-analysis — automatic skills get hijacked by conscious monitoring and turn rigid — while anxiety consumes working memory and disrupts judgment. Remedies include simulating high-pressure situations in practice and focusing on process cues (breathing, movement rhythm) rather than the score.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1d74443a98dc�body���效应量量化关系的强度，置信区间给出估计的精度与不确定性范围，二者弥补了 p 值只回答「是否有差异」的不足。报告效应量有助于跨研究比较与元分析，是结果可解释性的核心。�Effect sizes quantify relationship strength and confidence intervals convey precision and uncertainty, complementing p-values that only ask whether a difference exists. Reporting them aids cross-study comparison and meta-analysis, central to interpretable results.�ans��src��Z《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 方法卷;美国心理学会(APA)�OAnnual Review of Psychology (methods); American Psychological Association (APA)��id�1fb6d9511b2b�body�ي可以。复杂情境（如毕业）会同时唤起喜悦与失落，心理学称为“矛盾情绪”，说明情绪并非非此即彼。ٔYes. Complex situations (e.g., graduation) can evoke both joy and loss at once—called 'ambivalence'—showing emotions are not strictly either-or.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（情绪章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), emotion chapter��id�1fbee536a140�body���关键期是某种能力或行为最容易习得、且错过便难以补偿的特定发育窗口，例如视觉和语言发展的早期阶段。但许多能力也存在可塑性较强的“敏感期”。�A critical period is a specific developmental window when a capacity or behavior is most easily acquired and missed opportunities are hard to compensate, such as early vision and language development. Many abilities instead have a more plastic 'sensitive period.'�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�203baf49ccee�body�ٖ当任务需要创造性或合作时，竞争带来的焦虑和评价压力会占用认知资源，反而抑制发挥，尤其对害怕失败的人。ٶWhen tasks need creativity or cooperation, competition's anxiety and evaluation pressure consume cognitive resources and hurt performance, especially for fear-of-failure individuals.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�21131b561416�body���津巴多让大学生随机扮演狱警或囚犯，原本正常的人很快表现出虐待或顺从角色行为，实验仅6天就被迫中止。它说明情境力量会强烈塑造人的行为。��Zimbardo randomly assigned students to play guards or prisoners; ordinary people quickly adopted abusive or submissive roles, and the study was halted after just six days. It showed how powerfully situations can shape behavior.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�22add6bf762b�body�ي除共情与道德规范外，助人能带来“温暖光辉”式的愉悦（助人快感），并受互惠期待与社会赞许影响。ٗBeyond empathy and moral norms, helping yields a 'warm glow' of pleasure (helper's high) and is shaped by reciprocity expectations and social approval.�ans��src�ٛBatson, Duncan, Ackerman, Buckley & Birch (1981), Is empathic emotion a source of altruistic motivation?,《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》ٖBatson, Duncan, Ackerman, Buckley & Birch (1981), Is Empathic Emotion a Source of Altruistic Motivation?, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology��id�24ef9e2eab64�body��_精细加工可能性模型（ELM）认为说服走两条路：中心路径——认真评估论据质量，常用于高卷入的购买（如买房）；外周路径——靠形象、名人、语气等外围线索，常用于低卷入场景（如买零食）。两条路都能改变态度，但中心路径形成的态度更持久、更难被反转。�[The elaboration likelihood model (ELM) says persuasion runs two routes: the central route carefully weighs arguments (high-involvement choices like a house), and the peripheral route leans on image, celebrities, and tone (low-involvement choices like snacks). Both can change attitudes, but central-route attitudes last longer and resist reversal.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（态度与说服章）�@Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), attitudes and persuasion chapter��id�2565bace7faf�body��/这叫“锚定效应”：大脑在做估算时，会以最先接触到的数字作为起点，再围绕它上下调整，而调整往往不够。比如先看到高价，会觉得后面“打折”很划算。锚定是自动发生的，认识它可以在谈判和购物时多提醒自己重新评估。�+Called anchoring: when estimating, the brain starts from the first number it sees and adjusts around it — usually not enough. See a high price first, and a later “discount” feels like a bargain. Anchoring runs automatically; knowing about it helps you re-evaluate in negotiations and shopping.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�256e66ed2662�body�ٜ我们的大脑已习惯文字从左向右、正立呈现，镜像反转打破了字形与运动经验，需要额外加工，因此感到不适或困难。ٮOur brains are tuned to text presented upright and left-to-right; mirror reversal breaks learned shape and motor expectations, requiring extra processing and feeling awkward.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�27aefb72a26a�body�ٍ梦游发生在深睡（非REM）阶段，大脑部分觉醒而运动系统被异常激活，可能与遗传、睡眠剥夺或压力有关。٫Sleepwalking occurs in deep (non-REM) sleep when parts of the brain partially awaken and the motor system activates abnormally, linked to genetics, deprivation, or stress.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�28212e37bc2e�body���确认偏误指人们偏好搜寻、解读与记住支持自己既有信念的信息，而忽视或贬低反例。它既体现在主动的信息选择上，也体现在对模糊证据的主观解读中，是导致观点极化的重要认知基础。�Confirmation bias is the tendency to seek, interpret, and recall information that supports existing beliefs while dismissing counterevidence. It operates in both information selection and biased interpretation of ambiguous evidence, underpinning attitude polarization.�ans��src��K《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 推理与决策卷�;Annual Review of Psychology (reasoning and decision making)��id�2839fb6d821b�body���创伤后成长指经历困境后个体在关系、个人力量与人生意义上获得积极转变。泰德斯基强调它是与痛苦共存的积极变化，而非否认创伤，也不等于没有创伤后应激症状。��Post-traumatic growth is positive change in relationships, personal strength, and meaning of life after adversity. Tedeschi stresses it coexists with suffering rather than denying trauma, and does not imply the absence of PTSD symptoms.�ans��src��cTedeschi, R. G. & Calhoun, L. G. (1996). 《创伤后成长量表》. 《创伤压力杂志》9卷.�lTedeschi, R. G. & Calhoun, L. G. (1996). The Posttraumatic Growth Inventory. Journal of Traumatic Stress, 9.��id�2a077c19021c�body��6睡眠时海马体把短期记忆转入长期储存。�:Sleep lets the hippocampus move memory to long-term store.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�2b4ac8a78482�body�ٳ血清素是调节情绪、睡眠和食欲的重要神经递质，水平偏低常与抑郁和焦虑相关。许多抗抑郁药（如SSRIs）正是通过提升其可用性起效。��Serotonin is a key neurotransmitter regulating mood, sleep, and appetite; low levels are linked to depression and anxiety. Many antidepressants, such as SSRIs, work by increasing its availability.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�2b5e8109811b�body�ٺ斯金纳提出，行为后果会影响其再次发生的概率：奖励增加行为（强化），惩罚减少行为。它强调通过后果塑造行为，而非由刺激自动引发。��Skinner proposed that the consequences of a behavior affect its future probability: rewards increase it (reinforcement), punishments decrease it. It emphasizes shaping behavior through consequences rather than automatic stimulus responses.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2b78b3cd507c�body��,强迫症表现为反复出现的侵入性想法（强迫思维）和为了缓解焦虑而不得不做的重复行为（强迫动作），如反复检查或清洗。患者通常知道这些想法不合理却难以停止。它属于焦虑相关障碍谱系，暴露与反应预防疗法效果较好。�8OCD involves recurring intrusive thoughts (obsessions) and repetitive acts (compulsions) done to relieve anxiety, such as repeated checking or washing. Sufferers usually know the thoughts are unreasonable yet cannot stop. It sits in the anxiety-related spectrum, and exposure with response prevention works well.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�2dfb43b8f664�body���在西蒙斯与莱文的实地实验中，实验者向路人问路，途中两人抬着门板穿过，趁遮挡把对话者换成另一个人，约半数路人没有察觉。类似地，在图片渐变或闪烁遮挡范式中，画面里相当大的物体消失也常被忽略。这说明视觉系统并不维护一份完整的场景副本，而是按需把注意投向局部并即时提取信息，所谓丰富连续的视觉体验很大程度上是主观建构，而不是逐点存储的结果。�cIn Simons and Levin's field study an experimenter asked pedestrians for directions and, while two people carried a door between them, was swapped for a different person mid-conversation; roughly half the pedestrians never noticed. Similar failures occur in gradual-change and flicker paradigms, where sizeable objects vanish from a scene unremarked. The lesson is that vision does not maintain a complete internal copy of the world but directs attention locally and extracts information on demand, so our sense of a rich continuous visual experience is largely a construction rather than point-by-point storage.�ans��src�ىSimons 与 Levin（1998）《Psychonomic Bulletin & Review》门实验；Rensink、O'Regan 与 Clark（1997）《Psychological Science》قSimons and Levin (1998), Psychonomic Bulletin and Review, the door study; Rensink, O'Regan and Clark (1997), Psychological Science��id�2eb067b2ef13�body�ٿ昼夜节律是约24小时的内在生物钟，调节睡眠、体温和激素等；松果体在黑暗中分泌褪黑素，向身体发出“该睡了”的信号。光线会抑制其分泌。��The circadian rhythm is an internal roughly 24-hour clock regulating sleep, body temperature, and hormones; the pineal gland secretes melatonin in darkness, signaling the body to sleep. Light suppresses its release.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�3111c0a4cf96�body���白天积累的压力与焦虑会在睡眠中被激活，尤其在快速眼动（REM）睡眠期，形成恐惧梦境；创伤经历（如PTSD）、某些药物与饮酒也可能诱发噩梦。ٻDaytime stress and anxiety can resurface during sleep, especially in REM sleep, as frightening dreams; trauma (such as PTSD), certain medications, and alcohol can also trigger nightmares.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�32d35fdec347�body��艾米茨与麦卡洛的随机对照实验显示，连续数周定期写下值得感恩之事的被试（如研究一中每周列五件、持续十周），其幸福感与乐观水平高于仅记录日常困扰的对照组。效应部分来自对积极信息的注意偏向被强化。�pEmmons and McCullough's randomized controlled experiments showed that participants who regularly wrote down things they were grateful for over several weeks (e.g., listing five items weekly for ten weeks in Study 1) reported higher well-being and optimism than controls who recorded daily hassles. Part of the effect comes from reinforcing a positive attentional bias.�ans��src��qEmmons, R. A. & McCullough, M. E. (2003). 《数算恩惠与负担》. 《人格与社会心理学杂志》84卷.�VEmmons, R. A. & McCullough, M. E. (2003). Counting blessings versus burdens. JPSP, 84.��id�331a58c32e6e�body��n这叫自我效能感——对自己完成某项任务的能力的信心。班杜拉的研究表明，高自我效能让人更愿意尝试、更努力坚持、在困难时更快恢复。它的来源包括亲历成功、看到相似的人成功、他人的鼓励和稳定的情绪状态。效能感不是盲目自信，而是建立在真实经验上的踏实底气。�rThat's self-efficacy — confidence in your ability to complete a specific task. Bandura showed high self-efficacy makes people try harder, persist longer, and recover faster from setbacks. It grows from personal success, seeing similar others succeed, encouragement, and stable emotional states. It's not blind optimism but grounded confidence built on real experience.�ans��src��A《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会认知与动机章）�GPsychology and Life (Zimbardo), social cognition and motivation chapter��id�343ad615a24b�body��#诺伦-霍克西玛的“反刍”研究（Nolen-Hoeksema, 1991）指，被动反复聚焦自身痛苦而不采取行动，会延长并加深抑郁。反刍像在情绪伤口上打转，夺走解决问题的精力；相比之下，分散注意或意义重评更能打断这趟下行电梯。�Nolen-Hoeksema's rumination research (1991) shows passively brooding on one's distress without action prolongs and deepens depression. Rumination circles the emotional wound, stealing energy from problem-solving; distraction or meaning reappraisal better breaks the downward elevator.�ans��src��yNolen-Hoeksema, S. (1991)《对抑郁的反应及其功能》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 59(3):504-511كNolen-Hoeksema, S. (1991). Responses to depression and their effects. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 59(3), 504-511.��id�3587e641e932�body�ٜ地位关联资源、伴侣选择与生存安全，进化使大脑把社会地位当作奖赏来追求；现代社会它更多体现为尊重与影响力。ٔStatus links to resources, mating, and safety; evolution wired the brain to treat status as a reward, now expressed mainly as respect and influence.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会心理学章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social psychology chapter��id�3873a5ed5b60�body���复述是用自己的话把对方的意思说回去，确认是核对“我理解得对不对”。它们让对方感到被准确接住，也避免各说各的，把沟通拉到同一频道。ٺReflecting puts the other person's meaning back in your own words, and checking asks did I get this right. They make the speaker feel accurately held and prevent talking past each other.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�38841b7a3109�body�ٮ心理意象是在没有外界刺激时，在脑中“看到”“听到”或“感受”事物的能力，依赖与真实感知重叠的脑区，可用于计划与记忆。ٱMental imagery is rehearsing sights, sounds, or feelings in the mind without external input, using brain areas overlapping with real perception—useful for planning and memory.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�38a7a02127ab�body���绝对阈限是刚能察觉到刺激的最小强度，比如最微弱能听到的声音。差别阈限则是刚能分辨两种刺激不同的最小差异，韦伯定律说明它与原有刺激强度成比例。阈限帮助我们理解感官的灵敏度。�The absolute threshold is the minimum intensity we can just detect, like the faintest audible sound. The difference threshold is the smallest change we can distinguish, and Weber's law says it is proportional to the original stimulus. Thresholds help us understand sensory sensitivity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�399ed8c61b7d�body��G“努力合理化”指人越高代价地加入某群体，越会提升对它的评价，以消解“付出这么多却无用”的失调（Aronson & Mills, 1959）。实验中经历严苛入会仪式的人，比轻易加入的人更觉得小组活动有趣，说明痛苦本身被重新解释成了“它一定很值得”。�_Effort justification means the more costly the entry into a group, the more we raise its value, to reduce the dissonance of I suffered for nothing (Aronson & Mills, 1959). In the classic study, people who endured a harsh initiation rated the group more interesting than those admitted easily - the pain itself got reinterpreted as it must be worth it.�ans��src�ٛAronson, Mills,《The effect of severity of initiation on liking for a group.》,The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology,1959 (DOI: 10.1037/h0047195)ٙAronson, Mills, 'The effect of severity of initiation on liking for a group.', The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 1959, DOI: 10.1037/h0047195��id�39e0e1fb9c7d�body��>这叫“情绪传染”：人会无意识地同步他人的表情、动作和情绪状态。打哈欠传染、笑声传染、谈话时彼此模仿姿势都是例子，背后与自动模仿、行为同步等社会性机制有关。它像社交黏合剂，让群体情绪同步，也是为什么笑声能带动全场。�;That's emotional contagion: people unconsciously synchronize others' expressions, movements, and moods. Yawn and laughter contagion and mirroring postures in conversation reflect automatic imitation and behavioral synchrony. It acts as social glue that synchronizes group emotion — and why laughter sweeps a room.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（情绪章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), emotion chapter��id�3aadaa5804f8�body��\跨文化研究发现，东亚人倾向整体思维，更注意场景背景和事物间的关系；西方人倾向分析思维，更注意突出的单个物体。看同一幅水底图时，日本被试提到背景鱼更多，美国被试更关注主角鱼。文化经验塑造了注意习惯，两类思维各有优劣，混着用反而最灵活。��Cross-cultural research shows East Asians tend toward holistic thinking, noticing backgrounds and relationships; Westerners toward analytic thinking, focusing on salient single objects. Viewing the same underwater scene, Japanese participants mentioned background fish more, Americans the big foreground fish. Cultural experience shapes attention habits; each style has strengths and combining them is most flexible.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3b1d2cc79621�body��M这叫“可得性启发”：判断概率时，我们依赖“相关例子多容易想出来”。坠机新闻罕见但画面感强、容易回忆，所以被高估；开车的风险天天见，却被“习惯化”了。大脑用“容易想到”代替了“真实频率”——多数时候高效，却会让风险判断失真。�SThat's the availability heuristic: we judge likelihood by how easily examples come to mind. Plane crashes are rare but vivid and memorable, so we overestimate them; driving risk is constant yet normalized. The brain substitutes “easy to recall” for “actual frequency” — efficient most of the time, but it distorts risk judgments.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�3b650e10616e�body��巴甫洛夫发现，本来无关的刺激（如铃声）如果反复伴随会带来反应的事物（如食物），之后单独出现也会引发反应（流口水），这叫条件反射。它解释了恐惧、偏好等许多情绪性学习。广告也常利用这种联想。�Pavlov found that a neutral stimulus (a bell) paired repeatedly with a meaningful one (food) later triggers the response (salivation) alone—a conditioned reflex. It explains many emotional learnings like fears and preferences. Advertising also exploits such associations.�ans��src��Pavlov 条件反射实验�Pavlov conditioning experiments��id�3bcc0d9e3848�body���后见之明偏差指事件发生后，人们错误地觉得我早就知道会这样。记忆被事后信息重构，使过去的不确定性被低估，这会削弱从失败中真正学习的能力。ٹHindsight bias is the illusion, after an event, that one knew it all along. Memory is rewritten by outcome info, underrating past uncertainty and undermining real learning from failure.�ans��src��Fischhoff (1975)�Fischhoff (1975)��id�3c791df72bb0�body���错误信息效应指个体在事件发生后接触到不准确信息，导致原记忆被污染甚至替换。例如目击证人在误导性提问后“记得”了从未发生的细节，这在司法目击记忆研究中影响重大。��The misinformation effect occurs when people encounter inaccurate information after an event, distorting or replacing the original memory. Eyewitnesses may later recall details they never saw after leading questions—a major issue in forensic psychology.�ans��src���Loftus 与 Palmer,《Reconstruction of automobile destruction: An example of the interaction between language and memory》,Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior,1974 (DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(74)80011-3)��Loftus & Palmer, 'Reconstruction of automobile destruction: An example of the interaction between language and memory', Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior, 1974, DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(74)80011-3��id�3d9a72495367�body���社会承诺与归属感提供外在锚点与乐趣，降低今天不想动的弃权率；同伴的同步动作还能促进内啡肽与联结感。把运动变成见面理由是提高依从性的巧招。��Social commitment and belonging give external anchors and fun, lowering skip rates on low-motivation days; synchronized movement with peers also boosts endorphins and bonding. Making exercise a reason to meet people lifts adherence.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�40f86443cd60�body��&特沃斯基与卡尼曼的“框架效应”（Tversky & Kahneman, 1981）表明，决策随信息是“收益框架”还是“损失框架”而反转，哪怕客观结果相同。面对收益人们偏保守、面对损失偏冒险，这揭示偏好并不稳定，而被表述方式左右。�Tversky and Kahneman's framing effect (1981) shows choices flip depending on whether information is cast as gains or losses, even with identical outcomes. People turn risk-averse for gains and risk-seeking for losses, revealing that preferences are unstable and shaped by wording.�ans��src��QTversky, A. & Kahneman, D. (1981)《选择的框架》, Science 211(4481):453-458�vTversky, A. & Kahneman, D. (1981). The framing of decisions and the psychology of choice. Science, 211(4481), 453-458.��id�4280f5c27fc8�body��t这叫共情：我们能部分地“模拟”他人的情绪状态。看到别人疼痛或悲伤，大脑里与自身感受相关的区域会被激活，所以会觉得“感同身受”。共情常常推动利他行为——伸出援手不只是为了回报。当然，共情可以被锻炼，过度投入也可能让人“共情疲劳”，需要平衡和关怀自己。�pThat's empathy: we partly simulate another person's emotional state. Seeing pain or grief activates brain regions tied to our own experience, which is why it feels contagious. Empathy often motivates altruistic behavior — helping isn't only about reward. It can be trained, though over-investing can lead to “compassion fatigue,” so balance and self-care matter.�ans��src��$APA（共情与利他行为研究）�#APA (empathy and altruism research)��id�42e19fcbb9ff�body���该疗法通过刺激控制、睡眠限制与认知重构打破焦虑失眠循环，疗效可媲美药物且无依赖。美国睡眠医学会推荐其作为慢性失眠首选，随访中效果更持久。�0The therapy breaks the anxiety-insomnia loop through stimulus control, sleep restriction, and cognitive restructuring, matching drug efficacy without dependence. The American Academy of Sleep Medicine recommends it as the first-line treatment for chronic insomnia, with more durable effects at follow-up.�ans��src��t美国睡眠医学会 (AASM) (2011). 《成人慢性失眠治疗临床指南》. 《临床睡眠医学杂志》7卷.كAmerican Academy of Sleep Medicine (2011). Clinical Guideline for the Treatment of Insomnia. Journal of Clinical Sleep Medicine, 7.��id�43b2e8a91fee�body��-Harlow 于 1958 年让幼猴在“铁丝母亲”（带奶瓶）与“绒布母亲”（无奶瓶）间选择，发现幼猴更依恋柔软的绒布母亲，说明依恋的基础是“接触安慰”而非单纯的食物满足。这一结果反驳了当时以喂养解释依恋的行为主义观点。�?In 1958 Harlow offered infant monkeys a wire “mother” with a bottle versus a soft cloth “mother” without one, and found they clung to the cloth mother, showing that attachment rests on “contact comfort” rather than mere feeding. This refuted the behaviorist view that attachment derives from food provision.�ans��src��VHarlow 1958 年论文（载 American Psychologist）；Berk《毕生发展心理学》�NHarlow (1958) in American Psychologist; Berk, Development Through the Lifespan��id�445d276c2caf�body��Y依恋理论把人对亲密关系的内部模式大致分为安全型、焦虑型（或矛盾型）和回避型：安全型容易信任与被信任，焦虑型常担心被抛弃，回避型倾向于保持距离。这些模式与早年照料经验有关，但并非一成不变——自我觉察和新的关系体验都可以逐渐改变它们。�:Attachment theory describes internal working models of close relationships: secure types trust and feel trusted easily, anxious types fear abandonment, avoidant types keep distance. These patterns relate to early caregiving, but they're not fixed — self-awareness and new relational experiences can reshape them.�ans��src��5《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（依恋研究）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), attachment research��id�450350425812�body���CBT 是一种结构化、短程的心理治疗，帮助患者识别并改变导致痛苦的歪曲思维和行为模式，由贝克和埃利斯奠基。它对抑郁、焦虑等许多问题都有实证支持。��CBT is a structured, time-limited psychotherapy that helps clients identify and change distorted thinking and behavior patterns that cause distress, founded by Beck and Ellis. It has strong evidence for depression, anxiety, and many other problems.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�4507cef16aff�body��#阿希于 1951 年让被试在明显的长度判断任务中面对多数人一致的错误答案，结果发现约三分之一的被试在大多数关键试次中跟随群体错误，约四分之三的人至少从众一次。实验显示群体规范能在感知判断上产生强大影响。�In 1951 Asch had participants judge line lengths while confederates gave unanimously wrong answers; about one-third conformed on most critical trials, and roughly three-quarters conformed at least once. The study shows group norms can strongly sway even perceptual judgments.�ans��src��RAsch 1951 年论文（载 Psychological Monographs）；Myers《社会心理学》�AAsch (1951) in Psychological Monographs; Myers, Social Psychology��id�451cde0465c2�body���舌尖现象是能确定知道某词却暂时提取失败的状态。通常是词义/概念线索已激活，但语音线索未接通。它随年龄略增，且与语言检索的竞争有关，多数情况下稍后或借助线索即可恢复。��The tip-of-the-tongue state is knowing a word yet failing to retrieve it. Usually the conceptual representation is activated but the phonological form is not. It rises slightly with age and reflects competition in lexical access; cues often resolve it.�ans��src�ٔBrown, McNeill,《The “tip of the tongue” phenomenon》,Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior,1966 (DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(66)80040-3)ْBrown, McNeill, 'The “tip of the tongue” phenomenon', Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior, 1966, DOI: 10.1016/s0022-5371(66)80040-3��id�4609e65e3c96�body���间隔重复在逐渐拉长的间隔中复习，利用提取难度适中这一最优挑战巩固记忆（可提取但需努力）。它契合遗忘曲线，比集中练习产生更稳固、更可迁移的学习。��Spaced repetition reviews at lengthening intervals, using optimally challenging retrieval (accessible but effortful). It fits the forgetting curve and yields more durable, transferable learning than massed practice.�ans��src��Cepeda 等 (2006)�Cepeda et al. (2006)��id�471b7f9f6302�body���PTSD 在经历或目睹严重创伤事件后出现，核心症状为反复闪回、回避创伤线索以及持续的高度警觉。它并非意志薄弱，而是大脑对极端威胁的正常反应失调。��PTSD arises after experiencing or witnessing a severe trauma, with core symptoms of intrusive re-experiencing, avoidance of triggers, and persistent hyperarousal. It is not weakness but a dysregulation of the brain's normal response to extreme threat.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�473bc3a4e463�body��Y成长型思维（德韦克提出）是说能力可以通过练习提升，但它常被误读成“只要拼命努力就一定能成功”。真正做法是：相信能力可发展，同时讲究方法和策略，从失败和反馈中学习，并把努力用在更聪明的地方。努力重要，但方向、资源和现实限制同样关键。�hGrowth mindset (Dweck) means abilities can be developed through practice, but it is often misread as 'try hard and you'll surely succeed.' The real practice is to believe skills can grow while also using good strategies, learning from failure and feedback, and directing effort wisely. Effort matters, but direction, resources, and real constraints matter too.�ans��src��GCarol S. Dweck,Mindset: The New Psychology of Success,Random House,2006�KCarol S. Dweck, Mindset: The New Psychology of Success, Random House, 2006.��id�47a124541fe6�body��?波贝利的两过程模型（Borbély, 1982）把睡眠驱动拆成“睡眠稳态压力”和“昼夜节律”两条线。清醒时脑细胞消耗 ATP 释放腺苷，腺苷在脑中累积就像“睡眠压力”的时钟，咖啡因正是堵住腺苷受体让人暂时不困；小睡则部分清掉了这股压力。�6Borbély's two-process model (1982) splits sleep drive into a sleep homeostatic pressure and the circadian rhythm. While awake, brain cells burn ATP and release adenosine, which accumulates as a rising sleep-pressure clock; caffeine blocks adenosine receptors to mask it, and a nap partly clears that pressure.�ans��src��ZBorbély, A.A. (1982)《睡眠调节的双过程模型》, Human Neurobiology 1(3):195-204�bBorbély, A.A. (1982). A two process model of sleep regulation. Human Neurobiology, 1(3), 195-204.��id�4889daeeefff�body���锚定效应指人在估计时过度依赖最先获得的信息（锚），即使锚与问题无关。例如先看到高价再砍价，会觉得低价很划算。锚通过启动参照点影响后续调整，且调整往往不足。�Anchoring is over-reliance on the first piece of info (the anchor) when estimating, even if irrelevant. Seeing a high price before bargaining makes a lower one feel like a deal. Anchors set reference points; adjustments from them are typically insufficient.�ans��src��Tversky 与 Kahneman (1974)�Tversky & Kahneman (1974)��id�4acd8df398f8�body���杏仁核快速检测威胁性刺激并触发恐惧反应与注意偏向，是情绪学习与记忆强化的关键枢纽。其过度活跃与焦虑障碍相关，而损伤会导致恐惧识别与条件化学习受损。��The amygdala rapidly detects threat and triggers fear responses and attentional bias, serving as a hub for emotional learning and memory enhancement. Its overactivity links to anxiety, while damage impairs fear recognition and conditioning.�ans��src�٭Bear, M. F., Connors, B. W., & Paradiso, J. A. (2016).《神经科学:探索大脑》第4版, Sinauer Associates; LeDoux, J. E. (1998).《The Emotional Brain》, Touchstone.ٮBear, M. F., Connors, B. W., & Paradiso, J. A. (2016). Neuroscience: Exploring the Brain (4th ed.). Sinauer Associates. LeDoux, J. E. (1998). The Emotional Brain. Touchstone.��id�4b3f190d71dc�body��t婴儿出生时能分辨世界上几乎所有语言的语音，但长期只听母语后，大脑的语音分类会“专精化”：对母语的区别越来越敏感，对没听过的音越来越钝。这就是为什么成年人学外语时，某些音“耳朵听到了但大脑不分类”。不是听力出了问题，而是大脑的语音筛选器按母语定型了。��Newborns can discriminate nearly all speech sounds in the world's languages, but with prolonged exposure to the home language the brain's phonetic categories specialize: it grows sharper at native contrasts and blunter at unfamiliar ones. That's why adult language learners hear certain sounds yet fail to categorize them. The ears are fine — the brain's filter is tuned to the native language.�ans��src��NKuhl, P. K., Williams, K. A., Lacerda, F., Stevens, K. N., & Trevino, P. (1992). The linguistic experience alters the development of the auditory system.《Science》255(5047), 835-841; Werker, J. F., & Tees, R. C. (1984). A cross-language study of vowel length contrasts in infants.《Infant Behavior and Development》7(3), 447-456.�HKuhl, P. K., Williams, K. A., Lacerda, F., Stevens, K. N., & Trevino, P. (1992). The linguistic experience alters the development of the auditory system. Science, 255(5047), 835-841. Werker, J. F., & Tees, R. C. (1984). A cross-language study of vowel length contrasts in infants. Infant Behavior and Development, 7(3), 447-456.��id�4cdca8d5cc9c�body���压力下发挥骤降（choking）常因过度自我关注打乱自动化：新手想“每一步”反而干扰已熟练动作。对策含流程化注意（盯球）、模拟高压训练与信任肌肉记忆。��Choking is sudden performance drop under pressure, often from over self-focus breaking automation: thinking 'each step' disrupts skilled action. Fixes include routine attention (watch the ball), pressure simulation and trusting muscle memory.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�4da1bc86beb2�body�٨跨时区飞行打乱了体内生物钟（昼夜节律）与目的地光暗周期的同步，导致失眠、疲惫和注意力下降，通常需要数天重新校准。ٞCrossing time zones desynchronizes the body clock (circadian rhythm) from local light-dark cycles, causing insomnia and fatigue that take days to recalibrate.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4eb6841dbfcf�body���控制点指人们认为事情结果由谁掌控：内控者觉得靠自己努力，外控者觉得靠运气或他人。内控倾向通常与更高的主动性和学业成就相关。它可以通过经历和引导慢慢调整。�0Locus of control is whether people believe outcomes are controlled by themselves or by external forces: internals credit their effort, externals credit luck or others. An internal orientation often links to more initiative and academic achievement. It can shift gradually through experience and guidance.�ans��src��Rotter 控制点理论�Rotter locus of control theory��id�4f69320c6877�body�ٷ沉默可以打断升级的循环，给双方降温，也表达“我在认真掂量，而不是急着赢”。但沉默用于冷处理、惩罚对方时，会变成另一种伤害。ٵSilence can break the escalation loop, cool both sides and signal I am weighing this, not rushing to win. But used as cold withdrawal to punish, it becomes a different kind of harm.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�52ca17de50a3�body�ٴ折中效应：在不确定时人们倾向选中间档以求“安全不亏”，看似理性实为回避极端。商家用高低两档夹出中间“主推”款即是利用它。ٺCompromise effect: when unsure, people pick the middle to seem 'safe, no loss'—rational-looking but avoiding extremes. Sellers flank a target with high/low to make the middle the hero.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�532294c8667c�body���情绪粒度指个体区分和标记精细情绪（如沮丧、懊恼而非笼统的不好）的能力。高情绪粒度者能更精准地选配调节策略，巴瑞特研究发现其与更少的冲动行为和更高的调节效能相关。�(Emotional granularity is the ability to discriminate and label fine-grained emotions (such as dejected versus annoyed, rather than a vague bad) . High granularity lets people pick more precise regulation strategies, and Barrett found it correlates with fewer impulsive acts and better regulation.�ans��src�ٺBarrett, L. F., Gross, J., Christensen, T. C., Benvenuto, M. (2001). 《知道自己感受并知道如何应对：情绪分化与情绪调节的关系》. 《认知与情绪》15卷6期.��Barrett, L. F., Gross, J., Christensen, T. C., & Benvenuto, M. (2001). Knowing what you're feeling and knowing what to do about it: Mapping the relation between emotion differentiation and emotion regulation. Cognition and Emotion, 15(6).��id�5677af9bb7b4�body��!神经可塑性指神经系统在经验、学习或损伤后改变结构与功能连接的能力，包括突触强化、皮层重组与神经发生。这一机制贯穿一生，是康复、学习与记忆的生理基础，由 Ramón y Cajal 等早期提出并由当代影像研究证实。�lNeuroplasticity is the nervous system's capacity to change its structure and functional connections after experience, learning, or injury, including synaptic strengthening, cortical reorganization, and neurogenesis. It operates across the lifespan and underlies recovery, learning, and memory, proposed early by Ramón y Cajal and confirmed by modern neuroimaging.�ans��src��jRamón y Cajal《神经系统的衰退与再生》（1928）；Kolb 与 Whishaw《神经心理学基础》فRamón y Cajal, Degeneration and Regeneration of the Nervous System (1928); Kolb & Whishaw, Fundamentals of Human Neuropsychology��id�5883fae5c5dc�body��Hull 于 1943 年提出，生理需求产生内部紧张（驱力），而行为的目的在于降低这种驱力、恢复体内平衡，因此满足需求的行为会被强化。该理论能解释饥渴等基础动机，但难以涵盖好奇、成就等无明确驱力的行为。�-Hull proposed in 1943 that physiological needs create internal tension (drive), and behavior aims to reduce that drive and restore homeostasis, so need-satisfying behavior is reinforced. It explains basic motives like hunger and thirst but struggles with curiosity or achievement lacking clear drives.�ans��src��iHull《行为的组织》（Principles of Behavior, 1943）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�KHull, Principles of Behavior (1943); Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�58f37e17eff5�body���情绪粒度指用精确、具体的词汇区分不同情绪状态的能力（如区分沮丧与倦怠）。粒度越高，越能针对性调节情绪、减少冲动，并与更好的心理健康相关。��Emotional granularity is the ability to distinguish feelings with precise, specific labels (e.g., dejected vs fatigued). Higher granularity enables targeted regulation and links to better mental health.�ans��src��Lisa Feldman Barrett 研究�Lisa Feldman Barrett's research��id�59a68bc6dc15�body��O克莱因研究消防指挥官等实务专家，发现他们能在数秒内识别情境模式并选出可行方案，依靠的是长期积累的模式库。卡尼曼则指出许多领域的专家预测并不优于简单统计规则。两人后来达成共识：直觉可靠需要两个条件，一是环境具有足够的规律性与可预测结构，二是从业者能通过长期实践获得及时且明确的反馈。棋类、消防与麻醉满足这些条件，而长期政治预测和股票选择则不满足，因此在低效度环境中应更多依赖形式化模型与检查清单。��Klein studied practitioners such as fireground commanders and found they recognise situational patterns within seconds and select a workable option, drawing on a large repertoire built over years. Kahneman countered that in many fields expert forecasts do not beat simple statistical rules. The two later converged on two conditions for trustworthy intuition: an environment with sufficient regularity and predictable structure, and an opportunity to learn it through prolonged practice with prompt, unambiguous feedback. Chess, firefighting, and anaesthesia meet these criteria while long-range political forecasting and stock picking do not, so in low-validity environments formal models and checklists should carry more weight.�ans��src��tKahneman 与 Klein（2009）《American Psychologist》直觉专长的条件；Klein《Sources of Power》（1998）�tKahneman and Klein (2009), American Psychologist, Conditions for intuitive expertise; Klein, Sources of Power (1998)��id�5a46f0400e77�body��C经典研究认为工作记忆容量大约在“7±2”个项目（现代估计更接近4个），超过这个范围就容易出错。这就是为什么临时记电话号码或地址要赶紧写下来。容量不是智商高低，而是大脑短时存储的通用限制，可以通过组块、练习等策略变相扩大。�hClassic research put working-memory capacity at about “7 ± 2” items (modern estimates are closer to 4), and beyond that range errors multiply. That is why a phone number or address must be written down quickly. The limit is a general constraint of short-term storage, not a measure of intelligence, and strategies like chunking can stretch it in practice.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（记忆与思维章）�>Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), chapter on memory and thinking��id�5a52fffe90e5�body���纵向研究显示，较强的社会联结与更低的全因死亡率、更好的心血管恢复及更低的炎症水平相关。社会隔离则被比作与吸烟相当的死亡风险因素，提示关系本身就是健康资源。��Longitudinal studies link stronger social ties to lower all-cause mortality, better cardiovascular recovery, and reduced inflammation. Social isolation rivals smoking as a mortality risk factor, suggesting relationships are themselves health resources.�ans��src��_《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 健康心理卷;Nature Human Behaviour�GAnnual Review of Psychology (health psychology); Nature Human Behaviour��id�5adcfaa21dfd�body��5特沃斯基与卡尼曼的启发式研究（Tversky & Kahneman, 1974）指出，我们用“易得性”判断概率：近期鲜活的事更容易被想起，于是显得更常见。同时“代表性”让人凭相似度误判，比如把罕见病当感冒——这两种快捷思考常偏离真实统计。�7Tversky and Kahneman's heuristics work (1974) shows we judge probability by availability: recent vivid events come to mind easily and seem more common. The representativeness heuristic likewise misleads by similarity - e.g., mistaking a rare disease for a cold. Both mental shortcuts drift from true statistics.�ans��src��nTversky, A. & Kahneman, D. (1974)《不确定性下的判断：启发与偏差》, Science 185(4157):1124-1131�tTversky, A. & Kahneman, D. (1974). Judgment under uncertainty: heuristics and biases. Science, 185(4157), 1124-1131.��id�5c98c57311e0�body�ىFOMO 是担心别人在经历更有趣的事而自己缺席的焦虑，多由社交媒体对比触发，会驱动频繁刷屏与不满。٤FOMO is anxiety that others are having better experiences without you, often triggered by social-media comparison, driving compulsive scrolling and dissatisfaction.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�605f367bf77d�body���Dweck 提出，相信能力可通过努力增长（成长型）的人，更把失败看作学习机会，倾向挑战困难任务；相比固定型思维，他们长期表现更好、韧性更强。但思维干预需配合具体策略才有效。��Dweck found that believing ability grows with effort (growth mindset) leads people to treat failure as learning and embrace challenge; vs fixed mindset, they achieve more and persist. Yet mindset interventions work best paired with concrete strategies.�ans��src��Dweck (2006)�Dweck (2006)��id�60cb48ff0a69�body��M皮亚杰发现，这一阶段（前运算期）的孩子还没有“守恒”概念：他们只盯着高度一个维度，还没学会在脑中同时补偿宽度。所以同样多的水倒进细高杯，他们会觉得变多了。这是正常的发展阶段，随着大脑成熟和具体经验积累，孩子会逐渐掌握守恒。�FPiaget found children at this stage (preoperational) haven't acquired conservation: they fix on one dimension, height, without mentally compensating for width. So the same water in a taller, thinner glass looks like more. It's a normal developmental step that resolves as the brain matures and concrete experience accumulates.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（人的发展章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), human development chapter��id�61ddff0522c6�body��?记忆若不复习会随时间减弱，或被新信息干扰。�9Unrehearsed memories fade or get overwritten by new ones.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�62422612d56f�body�ٮ把情绪和触发事件写下来，能把模糊的感受变成可观察的信息，让人发现“原来是这件事总戳到我”。看见模式，是改变的第一步。ٶWriting down emotions and triggers turns vague feelings into observable information, revealing the same thing always pushes my button. Seeing the pattern is the first step to change.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�62697544b8bf�body���文化适应是个体接触新文化后在行为、价值与身份上的调整，可有同化、分离、融合等不同策略。健康适应常在保持原文化与接纳新文化间取得平衡（融合），而非简单替换。�Acculturation is the adjustment of behavior, values and identity upon contact with a new culture, with strategies like assimilation, separation or integration. Healthy adaptation often balances keeping the heritage culture and embracing the new, rather than replacing one.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�63ee825c11b8�body���内在动机来自活动本身的兴趣与满足感，外在动机来自奖励或避免惩罚等外部结果。过度用外部奖励有时反而会降低原有的内在兴趣（过度辩护效应）。�Intrinsic motivation comes from interest and satisfaction in the activity itself; extrinsic motivation comes from external outcomes like rewards or avoiding punishment. Overusing external rewards can sometimes lower original intrinsic interest (overjustification effect).�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�650f61516cab�body���多巴胺参与奖赏、动机、运动和快乐体验，被称为“快乐递质”但更准确说是“想要”的递质。其系统异常与帕金森病、成瘾和精神分裂症有关。��Dopamine is involved in reward, motivation, movement, and pleasure; it is better described as the 'wanting' neurotransmitter than simply a happiness one. Its system is implicated in Parkinson's disease, addiction, and schizophrenia.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�658a05b4e612�body��6皮亚杰提出儿童认知发展经历四个阶段：感知运动期（0–2 岁，获客体恒常性）、前运算期（2–7 岁，自我中心）、具体运算期（7–11 岁，掌握守恒）和形式运算期（11 岁以上，抽象推理）。该理论奠定了发展心理学的建构主义基础。�+Piaget proposed four stages of cognitive development: sensorimotor (0–2, object permanence), preoperational (2–7, egocentrism), concrete operational (7–11, conservation), and formal operational (11+, abstract reasoning). The theory founded the constructivist basis of developmental psychology.�ans��src��jPiaget《儿童智力的起源》（The Origins of Intelligence, 1952）；Berk《毕生发展心理学》�RPiaget, The Origins of Intelligence (1952); Berk, Development Through the Lifespan��id�6706537e960e�body���拉扎勒斯将应对分为问题聚焦（直接改变压力源，如制定计划）与情绪聚焦（调节情绪反应，如倾诉或回避）。可控压力更适合问题聚焦，不可控时情绪聚焦更有效。�%Lazarus divided coping into problem-focused (directly changing the stressor, e.g., planning) and emotion-focused (regulating emotional response, e.g., venting or avoiding). Problem-focused coping fits controllable stress, while emotion-focused works better when the stressor is uncontrollable.�ans��src��DLazarus, R. S. & Folkman, S. (1984). 《压力、评价与应对》.�CLazarus, R. S. & Folkman, S. (1984). Stress, Appraisal, and Coping.��id�69f67df0c2f8�body��8熟练阅读是“整体识别”：大脑同时绑定字形、语音和意义，看到熟悉的词会整体匹配，不必逐笔画加工。所以我们会瞬间读对常用词，也会被形近字干扰、漏看错别字——这些都说明阅读靠的是自动化的词形识别，而不是慢慢“拼”。�NFluent reading relies on holistic recognition: the brain binds form, sound, and meaning together, matching familiar words as wholes without stroke-by-stroke processing. That's why we read common words instantly, get tripped up by look-alike characters, and miss typos — reading is automatic word-form recognition, not slow decoding.�ans��src��0《认知心理学》（阅读的认知加工）�6Cognitive Psychology (cognitive processing of reading)��id�6b1b9775944b�body��A拖延更常与情绪有关：任务让人焦虑、厌烦或自我怀疑时，大脑会逃向即时回报的事来缓解不适。研究提示拖延与情绪调节能力、冲动控制有关，而非简单的懒。把任务拆小、减少启动阻力、先做五分钟，都是绕过“情绪拦路虎”的实用方法。�xProcrastination is more often about emotion: when a task feels anxious, boring, or threatening, the brain flees to immediately rewarding activities to soothe discomfort. Research links it to emotion regulation and impulse control rather than laziness. Breaking tasks down, lowering the start barrier, and doing just five minutes are practical ways around the emotional hurdle.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6b5d45a8ebc3�body��7研究者从语言中大量描述人的形容词出发，对自评与他评数据反复做因素分析，发现描述稳定地聚成五个维度：开放性、尽责性、外向性、宜人性与神经质。这一结构在不同语言、文化与评定来源中大体可重复，且各维度与学业成绩、职业表现、健康行为等结果有可验证的相关。相比把人分成若干互斥类型的做法，大五采用连续维度，避免了在分界点附近的人为归类不稳定问题，也更符合人格特质呈近似正态分布的实证观察。��Researchers began with the large stock of trait adjectives in natural language and repeatedly factor-analysed self- and observer ratings, finding that descriptions converge on five dimensions: openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness, and neuroticism. The structure replicates broadly across languages, cultures, and rating sources, and each dimension shows verifiable associations with academic achievement, job performance, and health behaviour. Compared with sorting people into mutually exclusive types, the Big Five uses continuous dimensions, which avoids the unstable classification of people near a cut-off and better matches the observation that traits are distributed approximately normally.�ans��src�َCosta 与 McCrae《NEO Personality Inventory 专业手册》；John 与 Srivastava（1999）《Handbook of Personality》大五特质分类学ٔCosta and McCrae, NEO Personality Inventory professional manual; John and Srivastava (1999), The Big Five trait taxonomy, in Handbook of Personality��id�6c174c1021f4�body���享乐性食欲随重复快速习惯化（多巴胺预期递减），所以第一口满足感最强；饥饿时胃与激素信号放大奖赏。这解释了为什么零食打开就停不下，但吃到后面快乐递减。��Hedonic appetite habituates fast with repetition as dopamine prediction drops, so the first bite feels best; hunger amplifies reward via stomach and hormonal signals. It explains why a snack is hard to stop once opened yet enjoyment fades later.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6e8294fe4068�body�ٷ塞利格曼发现，当动物或人反复经历无法控制的负面事件后，会学会“做什么都没用”而放弃尝试。它被认为是抑郁的重要心理机制之一。��Seligman found that after repeated uncontrollable bad events, animals and people learn that 'nothing works' and stop trying. It is considered one important psychological mechanism of depression.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7006aa10642a�body���CBT认为，想法、情绪和行为相互影响：长期不变的负性想法（如“我什么都做不好”）会加重低落和回避行为，而回避又维持了问题。治疗师陪来访者一起识别并检验这些想法、逐步练习新行为，改变便自然发生。CBT对抑郁、焦虑等多种问题有效，是经过大量对照研究验证的一线心理治疗。��CBT holds that thoughts, emotions, and behaviors feed each other: persistent negative thoughts (“I can't do anything right”) deepen low mood and avoidance, and avoidance keeps the problem alive. The therapist helps clients spot and test those thoughts and practice new behaviors step by step, so change follows. CBT is a first-line, well-evidenced treatment for depression, anxiety, and more.�ans��src��!APA（认知行为疗法入门）�+APA (intro to cognitive behavioral therapy)��id�713697a22a74�body��+可得性启发式让判断依赖于事例回想的容易程度，空难报道密集且画面震撼，因而在记忆中格外突出，而每天发生的交通死亡分散且不被报道。斯洛维克的心理测量研究进一步发现，公众的风险感知主要沿两个维度组织：可怕程度，包括是否灾难性、是否无法控制、是否危及后代；以及未知程度，包括是否不可观察、后果是否延迟。这解释了为什么核能与转基因引发的担忧远高于统计死亡率相近甚至更高的日常风险。�zThe availability heuristic makes judgement depend on how easily instances come to mind, and air crashes are densely reported with striking imagery, so they loom large in memory while daily road deaths are dispersed and unreported. Slovic's psychometric research further showed public risk perception organises along two dimensions: dread, covering catastrophic potential, uncontrollability, and threat to future generations, and the unknown, covering unobservability and delayed effects. That is why nuclear power and genetic modification provoke far more concern than everyday hazards with comparable or higher statistical mortality.�ans��src��vSlovic（1987）《Science》风险感知；Tversky 与 Kahneman（1973）《Cognitive Psychology》可得性启发式�kSlovic (1987), Science, Perception of risk; Tversky and Kahneman (1973), Cognitive Psychology, Availability��id�717d0f19a6e2�body�ٜ杏仁核是情绪（尤其是恐惧）加工的核心，能快速检测威胁并触发“战斗或逃跑”反应。它还参与情绪性记忆的强化。١The amygdala is central to emotion, especially fear, quickly detecting threats and triggering the fight-or-flight response. It also strengthens emotional memory.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�7208d1bf3355�body��控制点指个体对自己生活事件成败原因的归因倾向：内控者认为结果取决于自身努力与能力，外控者则归因于运气、命运或他人。Rotter 于 1966 年提出该概念，并编制量表加以测量，是人格与动机研究的重要变量。�/Locus of control is the extent to which people attribute life outcomes to themselves versus external forces: internals credit their own effort and ability, externals credit luck, fate, or others. Rotter introduced it in 1966 with a measuring scale, a key variable in personality and motivation research.�ans��src��URotter 1966 年论文（载 Psychological Monographs）；Funder《人格心理学》�IRotter (1966) in Psychological Monographs; Funder, The Personality Puzzle��id�7259249d3e5e�body���自评受记忆偏差、社会赞许、当下情绪与对题目的理解差异影响，同一人不同天可能给出不同答案。因此重要结论常以行为任务或多方法交叉验证，而非单靠自我报告。�Self-reports suffer from memory bias, social desirability, current mood and differing interpretations, so the same person may answer differently on another day. Important conclusions often combine behavioral tasks or multiple methods rather than relying on one survey.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�74841fa7efce�body��+贝克提出的认知模型认为，情绪困扰并非直接由事件引起，而是经由自动化的负性想法与更深层的信念图式中介，例如把一次失败解读为我一无是处。治疗因此聚焦识别自动想法、检验其证据、发展更符合事实的替代解释，并配合行为激活、暴露与技能训练。强调家庭作业与行为实验的原因是，仅在会谈中的言语说服难以撼动长期形成的图式，只有让来访者在真实情境中收集反证，新的认知才会获得体验层面的支持。�Beck's cognitive model holds that distress is not produced directly by events but mediated by automatic negative thoughts and deeper belief schemas, as when one failure is read as proof of being worthless. Therapy therefore focuses on identifying automatic thoughts, examining the evidence for them, and developing more accurate alternatives, combined with behavioural activation, exposure, and skills training. Homework and behavioural experiments are central because verbal persuasion within sessions rarely shifts long-standing schemas; only gathering disconfirming evidence in real situations gives new appraisals experiential support.�ans��src��xBeck《Cognitive Therapy of Depression》（1979）；美国心理学会（APA）抑郁症心理治疗临床实践指南ٓBeck et al., Cognitive Therapy of Depression (1979); American Psychological Association clinical practice guideline for the treatment of depression��id�74d74685c3dc�body���概念隐喻理论认为抽象概念借由具体经验域（如空间、物质）来组织。莱考夫指出争论是战争等隐喻并非修辞装饰，而是塑造思维的认知结构；神经影像显示隐喻加工同时激活感觉运动区。�5Conceptual metaphor theory holds that abstract concepts are organized via concrete domains such as space and substance. Lakoff argued that metaphors like argument is war are not mere rhetoric but cognitive structures shaping thought; neuroimaging shows metaphor processing also activates sensorimotor regions.�ans��src��CLakoff, G. & Johnson, M. (1980). 《我们赖以生存的隐喻》.�6Lakoff, G. & Johnson, M. (1980). Metaphors We Live By.��id�74ecfcb2c8e9�body���流体智力指快速推理与加工新信息的能力，成年后逐渐下滑；晶体智力指通过经验积累的知识与词汇，通常随年龄保持稳定甚至上升。这一区分解释了为何老年人往往在专业知识上优于年轻人。��Fluid intelligence, the ability to reason and process novel information, declines from adulthood, while crystallized intelligence, accumulated knowledge and vocabulary, stays stable or rises. This distinction explains older adults' edge in expertise.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 认知老化卷�-Annual Review of Psychology (cognitive aging)��id�7690931fa705�body��2这是“沉没成本谬误”：已经花掉的钱和时间不该影响下一步决定，但大脑很难放下“已经投入的”。继续看完并不会让票钱回来，反而搭上更多时间。识别沉没成本，只问“从现在开始怎么选最好”，能避免很多将错就错的决定。�.That's the sunk cost fallacy: money and time already spent shouldn't drive future choices, but the brain clings to prior investment. Watching to the end won't refund the ticket — it only costs more time. Spotting sunk costs and asking “what's best from here?” avoids throwing good time after bad.�ans��src��$APA（沉没成本与决策研究）�#APA (sunk cost and decision-making)��id�76fe8daa2b93�body��#韦格纳的“讽刺过程理论”（Wegner, 1987）指出，压抑一个念头需要两套系统：有意识去压，和无意识去监视。监视系统老在扫描“它来了没”，反而把被禁念头频频推到前台，于是越不想越想——硬压情绪往往适得其反。�5Wegner's ironic process theory (1987) says suppressing a thought needs two systems: a conscious pusher and an unconscious monitor. The monitor keeps scanning has it come back, which keeps shoving the forbidden thought forward - so the more we forbid, the more it appears. Forcing down emotion often backfires.�ans��src��mWegner, D.M. (1987)《思维压抑的悖论效应》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 53(1):5-13�{Wegner, D.M. (1987). Paradoxical effects of thought suppression. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 53(1), 5-13.��id�777eb98df272�body���安斯沃思通过陌生情境实验将婴儿依恋分为安全型、回避型与焦虑矛盾型。安全型儿童在照料者离开时不安但返回后能被安抚，不安全型则表现为过度黏人或冷漠回避，影响后续人际关系模式。�Ainsworth's Strange Situation classified infant attachment into secure, avoidant, and anxious-resistant patterns. Secure children are distressed by separation but soothed on return, whereas insecure ones show clinging or detached avoidance, shaping later relationship patterns.�ans��src��G安斯沃思等 (1978). 《依恋类型》. Lawrence Erlbaum Associates�vAinsworth, M. D. S., Blehar, M. C., Waters, E., & Wall, S. (1978). Patterns of Attachment. Lawrence Erlbaum Associates��id�783476d11d8b�body���我们习惯用有限的线索（表情、语气）快速推断他人想法，并过度自信。其实他人内心常与我们猜测不同，所谓读心多是投射而非精确解码，尤其在情绪高强度时更易误判。��We quickly infer others' thoughts from sparse cues (faces, tone) and are overconfident. Others' inner states often differ from our guesses; 'mind reading' is usually projection, not precise decoding, and worsens under high emotion.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�785fc7367009�body�� 精神分裂症典型症状分阳性与阴性：阳性如幻觉、妄想、思维紊乱，阴性如情感淡漠、意志减退、社交退缩。它常起病于青年期，是严重的精神障碍而非“多重人格”。抗精神病药可缓解阳性症状，康复还需综合支持。�YSchizophrenia symptoms split into positive and negative: positive ones like hallucinations, delusions, and disorganized thinking; negative ones like flat affect, reduced drive, and withdrawal. It often begins in youth and is a serious disorder, not multiple personality. Antipsychotics ease positive symptoms, with rehabilitation support needed.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�795003985151�body��S这叫“规划谬误”：人们习惯按“最顺利的情形”预估，忽略过去的真实经验和意外因素，导致系统性乐观。研究甚至发现，提醒人们“你以前也超时过”也几乎不改变预估。更可靠的办法是参考“同类任务过去平均花了多久”，而不是想象一条完美路径。�ZThat's the planning fallacy: people estimate from the smoothest possible scenario, ignoring past experience and surprises, producing systematic optimism. Studies show even reminding people they overran before barely changes estimates. A more reliable approach is anchoring on how long similar tasks actually took, not on an imagined perfect path.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�7bad81518464�body�ٽ自我效能感是个体对自己能否完成某任务的信念。高自我效能的人更愿挑战困难、坚持更久，它受成败经验、榜样、言语劝说和情绪状态影响。��Self-efficacy is a person's belief in their ability to accomplish a task. Those with high self-efficacy take on harder challenges and persist longer; it is shaped by mastery experiences, models, persuasion, and emotional states.�ans��src��!《人格心理学》（伯格）�Personality (Burger)��id�7bcba5df46ea�body���常用的韦氏量表等分测验测言语、推理、记忆等能力，再把个人得分与同龄常模比较换算成离差智商，平均值设为100。IQ测的是特定认知能力，并非人格或全部潜能。��Common tools like the Wechsler scales test verbal, reasoning, and memory abilities, then compare a person's score to age-based norms to yield a deviation IQ with a mean of 100. IQ measures specific cognitive capacities, not personality or full potential.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�7d0c2894e1d3�body�ٓ惊恐发作是突然的强烈恐惧伴心悸、窒息感，常由身体感觉被误读为“危险”引发，形成“恐惧恐惧”的循环。٩A panic attack is sudden intense fear with racing heart and breathlessness, often triggered when bodily sensations are misread as danger, creating a 'fear of fear' loop.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�7fddb79f225a�body��心理理论是个体理解他人拥有与自己不同的信念、愿望和意图的能力。Wimmer 与 Perner 于 1983 年用“错误信念任务”发现，儿童约在 4 岁左右才具备此能力，这被认为是社会认知发展的关键里程碑。�␀Theory of mind is the ability to attribute to others beliefs, desires, and intentions different from one's own. Wimmer and Perner's 1983 false-belief task showed children typically acquire this around age 4, a key milestone in social-cognitive development.�ans��src��UWimmer 与 Perner 1983 年论文（载 Cognition）；Berk《毕生发展心理学》�KWimmer & Perner (1983) in Cognition; Berk, Development Through the Lifespan��id�80467230dbfe�body��{标签帮助快速理解自己和归属群体，但也可能变成自我实现的预言，限制行为与改变的可能。�|Labels help quickly understand oneself and belong, but can become self-fulfilling prophecies that limit behavior and change.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�80dea8884783�body��u这是操作性条件反射的原理：行为的结果会塑造行为，被强化的行为更可能重复。斯金纳发现，正向强化（给想要的后果）通常比惩罚更有效地塑造行为，因为惩罚只告诉“别做什么”，且常伴随恐惧。教学、养育和训练中，“明确目标+及时正向反馈”往往带来更稳定持久的改变。��This is operant conditioning: consequences shape behavior, and reinforced behavior repeats. Skinner found positive reinforcement (delivering a wanted consequence) usually shapes behavior more effectively than punishment, which only says “don't do that” and often brings fear. Clear goals plus timely positive feedback bring steadier, lasting change in teaching, parenting, and training.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（学习章）�0Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), learning chapter��id�8328a10fe0ef�body���外向者从社交和外界刺激中获得能量，内向者则在安静独处中“充电”。这并非害羞与否，而是能量来源不同。大多数人都处在两者之间，叫中间性格。��Extraverts gain energy from socializing and external stimulation, while introverts 'recharge' in quiet solitude. This is not about shyness but about where energy comes from. Most people fall in between, called ambiversion.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�860dd02d1963�body�ٴ面对压力时，肾上腺释放皮质醇以提升血糖、调动能量应对威胁。短期有益，但长期过高会损害免疫、睡眠和记忆，并增加慢性病风险。��Under stress, the adrenal glands release cortisol to raise blood sugar and mobilize energy against threat. Short-term it helps, but chronically high levels harm immunity, sleep, and memory and raise chronic-disease risk.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�862712b8c839�body���REM睡眠时眼球快速转动、脑电接近清醒状态，绝大多数生动梦境发生在此阶段，对身体恢复和记忆巩固十分重要。每晚REM会多次出现并逐次变长。��During REM sleep the eyes dart rapidly and brain activity resembles wakefulness; most vivid dreams occur here, and it is important for physical restoration and memory consolidation. REM recurs several times nightly, lengthening each time.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�86e73d918f2e�body���Sperry 等人对因治疗癫痫而切断胼胝体的“裂脑”病人研究发现，左右半球功能有所分工：左半球擅长语言与逻辑，右半球擅长空间与面孔加工。Sperry 因此获 1981 年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖。�(Sperry and colleagues studied “split-brain” patients whose corpus callosum was cut to treat epilepsy, finding functional specialization: the left hemisphere excels at language and logic, the right at spatial and face processing. Sperry received the 1981 Nobel Prize in Physiology or Medicine.�ans��src��?Sperry 1982 年诺贝尔奖演讲；Gazzaniga《裂脑研究》�:Sperry (1982) Nobel lecture; Gazzaniga, The Bisected Brain��id�877460d596d5�body��w心流是全身投入、忘记时间的精神状态，前提是挑战难度和自身技能相匹配。想把它变成日常，可以：把任务拆成清晰的小目标、设定即时反馈、主动调节难度、减少干扰，并建立固定的进入状态的小仪式（如固定时间地点）。关键在于让挑战略高于当前能力，又不太高而让人挫败。��Flow is a state of total absorption where you lose track of time, occurring when challenge and skill are matched. To make it a daily habit, break tasks into clear small goals, seek immediate feedback, tune the difficulty, cut distractions, and build a ritual that signals 'start' (same time, same place). The key is keeping challenge just above your current ability—without tipping into frustration.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�88189176e86c�body���罗夏测验呈现十张对称墨迹图，让被试自由描述看到什么，借以探查人格与思维特征。它属于投射测验，但信效度与解释标准在学界一直存在争议。��The Rorschach presents ten symmetrical inkblots for the person to describe freely, probing personality and thought patterns. It is a projective test whose reliability, validity, and scoring standards remain debated.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�88eac0304102�body���当人全神贯注于某项任务时，会完全忽略视野中明显但并不相关的刺激，西蒙斯和查布里斯用“看不见的大猩猩”实验证明了这一点。它说明注意是有选择性的，而非被动接收所有信息。��When people focus intently on one task, they can completely miss obvious but unrelated stimuli in view, as shown by Simons and Chabris in the 'invisible gorilla' experiment. It shows that attention is selective rather than passively receiving everything.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8a9f7a739bbf�body��1848 年，铁路工人盖奇被一根铁棍贯通前额叶，虽幸存但性格从温和变为冲动、缺乏计划，表明前额叶对人格、决策与社会行为至关重要。这一经典病例是脑功能定位与额叶执行功能研究的重要起点。�MIn 1848 railroad worker Phineas Gage survived a tamping iron piercing his prefrontal cortex, after which his personality shifted from temperate to impulsive and disinhibited, showing the prefrontal lobe's role in personality, decision-making, and social behavior. The case is a landmark for brain localization and executive function.�ans��src�ـHarlow 1868 年病例报告（载 Bulletin of the Massachusetts Medical Society）；Kolb 与 Whishaw《神经心理学基础》�PHarlow (1868) case report; Kolb & Whishaw, Fundamentals of Human Neuropsychology��id�8bfa6306dc4a�body���可得性启发式指用容易想到的例子来判断事件发生频率。飞机事故、鲨鱼袭击因媒体醒目而易回想，于是我们高估其概率，却低估日常高发风险（如车祸）。��The availability heuristic judges frequency by how easily examples come to mind. Plane crashes or shark attacks are vivid and memorable, so we overestimate their probability while underestimating everyday risks like car accidents.�ans��src��Tversky 与 Kahneman (1973)�Tversky & Kahneman (1973)��id�8c080cbdbda5�body�ك青春期大脑和身体快速发育、生物钟自然延后，且学业社交压力大，推荐 8–10 小时，但多数不足。وRapid brain and body development, a naturally delayed circadian clock, and high demands mean teens need 8–10 hours, yet most get less.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�8c177b684faa�body�ٷ每次会议都打断深度工作的节奏，并留下注意力残留，恢复需要时间。把会议集中、留出整块“无会时段”，能保护真正产出所需的专注。��Each meeting breaks the rhythm of deep work and leaves attention residue that takes time to recover. Batching meetings and protecting blocked no-meeting time guards the focus real output needs.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�8dbcfc845f55�body��\这叫暴露疗法。恐惧常靠逃避维持：逃开一次，就少了一次“原来也没事”的学习机会。在安全的、循序渐进的暴露中，大脑慢慢把原本的恐惧记忆与新经验联系起来，恐惧反应随之降低。这个过程叫“消退”，是恐惧症、创伤后应激障碍等治疗的核心成分之一。�DThat's exposure therapy. Fear is maintained by avoidance: every escape skips a chance to learn “nothing bad happened.” Through safe, graded exposure, the brain links the old fear memory with new experience, and the fear response weakens. This process, called extinction, is a core component in treating phobias and PTSD.�ans��src��$APA（暴露疗法与焦虑障碍）�,APA (exposure therapy for anxiety disorders)��id�8ddfa670a764�body��“空巢”指子女长大离家后，父母独自留在家里的阶段。失落来自日常角色和陪伴的消失，担心被需要感降低；轻松则来自终于卸下养育重担、重新拥有属于自己的时间和空间。两种感受同时存在，是很正常的。�<The 'empty nest' refers to the phase when grown children leave home and parents are left alone. The loss comes from the disappearance of a daily role and constant companionship; the relief comes from easing the caregiving burden and reclaiming time and space of their own. Both feelings are normal and often coexist.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�8e08c813c4f0�body���桑代克提出，带来满意结果的行为更可能被重复，带来不适结果的行为则被削弱。它是行为主义学习理论的早期基石，也预示了后来的强化概念。��Thorndike proposed that behaviors followed by satisfying results are more likely to recur, while those followed by discomfort are weakened. It was an early cornerstone of learning theory and prefigured later ideas of reinforcement.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8f7950d13b18�body���图式是头脑中组织知识、帮助理解和预测世界的心理框架，由皮亚杰提出并在认知心理学中发展。它让我们快速处理信息，但也可能造成刻板印象与错觉。��A schema is a mental framework that organizes knowledge and helps us understand and predict the world, introduced by Piaget and developed in cognitive psychology. It lets us process information quickly but can also produce stereotypes and illusions.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�9082e504ae87�body��1麦圭尔团队发现，通过极其严苛的伦敦路线知识考试的出租车司机，其海马后部灰质体积大于对照组，且体积与从业年限相关。为排除天生差异的解释，研究者又对受训者进行纵向追踪，发现只有最终通过考试的人出现海马后部体积增长，未通过者与对照组则没有变化。这为成年人复杂空间学习可以引起结构性可塑性提供了较强证据，同时也提示这种适应可能伴随代价，例如某些新的空间信息学习任务上的表现相对较弱。��Maguire's group found that taxi drivers who had passed London's demanding street-knowledge examination had larger posterior hippocampal grey matter volume than controls, with volume related to years on the job. To rule out pre-existing differences, the researchers followed trainees longitudinally and found posterior hippocampal growth only in those who eventually qualified, with no change in those who failed or in controls. This provides strong evidence that complex spatial learning can drive structural plasticity in adults, while also suggesting the adaptation carries trade-offs, since qualified drivers performed relatively worse on some tasks requiring new spatial learning.�ans��src�ٙMaguire 等（2000）《美国科学院院刊》伦敦出租车司机海马研究；Woollett 与 Maguire（2011）《Current Biology》纵向追踪研究٥Maguire et al. (2000), PNAS, navigation-related structural change in the hippocampi of taxi drivers; Woollett and Maguire (2011), Current Biology, longitudinal study��id�90c7666bcf44�body��b这叫“旁观者效应”：人多时，每个人都觉得“别人会出手”，责任被摊薄（责任扩散），还容易观察别人先不动而误判“可能没什么要紧”。达利与拉塔内的经典实验发现，单独遇到求助时人们反而更常出手。知道自己容易这样想，能帮我们在关键时刻多迈出一步。�iThis is the bystander effect: with more people, everyone assumes “someone else will act,” responsibility spreads thin (diffusion of responsibility), and people look to others who also stay still, misjudging the situation as not serious. Classic studies by Darley and Latané found lone witnesses help more. Simply knowing this helps you step up in a crisis.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会心理章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social psychology chapter��id�91c463cb1e66�body��V文化心理学区分“独立型自我”和“互依型自我”：前者强调独特性、内在品质和自我表达，在欧美文化中更常见；后者强调关系角色、归属与群体和谐，在东亚文化中更常见。其实大多数人都同时具备两种自我构念，只是侧重不同，并会随环境和场合切换。�ICultural psychology distinguishes an independent self-construal — uniqueness, inner traits, self-expression, more common in Western cultures — from an interdependent one — roles, belonging, group harmony, more common in East Asian cultures. Most people actually hold both, just weighted differently and switched by context.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9374b364562a�body��e波格斯的多重迷走神经理论（Porges, 2007）把威胁反应看成自主神经的三层系统：最外层是社交联结（腹侧迷走），受威胁时退到“战斗或逃跑”（交感），再升级则启用古老的对立神经（背侧迷走）让人“僵立”。所以“吓呆”不是胆小，而是神经系统的一种保命档位。�APorges's polyvagal theory (2007) models threat response as a three-tier autonomic system: the top layer is social engagement (ventral vagal), giving way under threat to fight-or-flight (sympathetic), and at the extreme to an ancient dorsal-vagal freeze. So being petrified is not cowardice but a hard-wired survival gear.�ans��src��VPorges, S.W. (2007)《多重迷走神经理论》, Biological Psychiatry 62(4):431-434�VPorges, S.W. (2007). The polyvagal perspective. Biological Psychiatry, 62(4), 431-434.��id�95d2669fae55�body��_不会。双语儿童一般能分清两种语言，并在不同场合自动切换，偶尔混淆只是正常的小插曲。研究还发现，双语者的大脑要不断“选一种、压一种”，这相当于持续的训练，与更好的注意力控制和任务切换能力相关。双语不是负担，而是一种让大脑保持灵活的经验。��No. Bilingual children generally keep two languages apart and switch automatically by context; occasional mixing is a normal blip. Because their brains constantly select one language while suppressing the other, bilingual experience works as ongoing training linked to better attentional control and task switching. Bilingualism isn't a burden — it's experience that keeps the mind flexible.�ans��src��APA（双语儿童研究）�!APA (bilingual children research)��id�9928ecaa1873�body��闪光灯记忆指人们对重大事件（如灾难）形成的高置信度生动记忆。研究发现，尽管主观上非常清晰，其客观准确率会随时间下降，因为记忆在每次提取时都被重新建构，情绪增强了自信而非准确性。�Flashbulb memories are vivid, high-confidence recollections of momentous events. Research shows that while subjectively clear, their objective accuracy decays over time because memory is reconstructed on each retrieval—emotion boosts confidence, not accuracy.�ans��src�ِTalarico 与 Rubin,《Confidence, Not Consistency, Characterizes Flashbulb Memories》,Psychological Science,2003 (DOI: 10.1111/1467-9280.02453)َTalarico and Rubin, 'Confidence, Not Consistency, Characterizes Flashbulb Memories', Psychological Science, 2003, DOI: 10.1111/1467-9280.02453��id�99b97831e653�body��失眠的认知行为疗法包含睡眠限制、刺激控制、认知重构与睡眠卫生教育，核心是打破在床上清醒焦虑的条件化联结，并重建稳定的睡眠驱动。随机对照试验显示其疗效与镇静催眠药短期相当，但停止治疗后收益能维持数月以上，而药物停用后常出现反弹性失眠与耐受问题。基于此，美国内科医师学会等机构的指南把它列为成年慢性失眠的首选治疗，数字化交付形式也使可及性显著提高。��Cognitive behavioural therapy for insomnia combines sleep restriction, stimulus control, cognitive restructuring, and sleep hygiene education, aiming to break the conditioned association between bed and anxious wakefulness while rebuilding a strong sleep drive. Randomised trials show short-term efficacy comparable to sedative hypnotics, but its benefits persist for months after treatment ends, whereas stopping medication often brings rebound insomnia and tolerance. On that basis guidelines from bodies such as the American College of Physicians name it the first-line treatment for chronic insomnia in adults, and digital delivery has substantially improved access.�ans��src�٘美国内科医师学会成人慢性失眠管理临床实践指南（2016，《Annals of Internal Medicine》）；Espie 等数字化 CBT-I 随机试验ٮAmerican College of Physicians clinical practice guideline on chronic insomnia in adults (2016, Annals of Internal Medicine); Espie et al., randomised trials of digital CBT-I��id�99c530576a42�body���测试效应指主动提取信息（如自测、做测验）比被动重读更能促进长期记忆的巩固。Roediger 与 Karpicke 于 2006 年在实验中证实，反复提取练习能显著提高日后回忆，被称为“提取练习效应”。�/The testing effect is the finding that actively retrieving information (e.g., self-quizzing) strengthens long-term retention more than passive rereading. Roediger and Karpicke demonstrated in 2006 that repeated retrieval practice greatly improves later recall, also called the retrieval practice effect.�ans��src��2Roediger 与 Karpicke,《Test-Enhanced Learning》,Psychological Science,2006 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x)；Dunlosky, Rawson, Marsh & Nathan,《Improving Students’ Learning With Effective Learning Techniques》,Psychological Science in the Public Interest,2013 (DOI: 10.1177/1529100612453266)�+Roediger & Karpicke, 'Test-Enhanced Learning', Psychological Science, 2006, DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x; Dunlosky, Rawson, Marsh & Nathan, 'Improving Students’ Learning With Effective Learning Techniques', Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 2013, DOI: 10.1177/1529100612453266��id�9b16cbdf5682�body���急性压力激活交感肾上腺髓质轴，释放肾上腺素与去甲肾上腺素，使心率加快、血压升高、血糖上升以应战或逃离。坎农最早系统描述了这一应急反应。��Acute stress activates the sympathetic-adrenomedullary axis, releasing epinephrine and norepinephrine to raise heart rate, blood pressure, and blood glucose for fighting or fleeing. Cannon was the first to systematically describe this emergency response.�ans��src��,Cannon, W. B. (1932). 《身体的智慧》.�-Cannon, W. B. (1932). The Wisdom of the Body.��id�9b1e59c9832b�body��K认知失调指当个体同时持有相互冲突的认知（如“吸烟有害”却“我在吸烟”）时会产生心理紧张，从而倾向于改变态度或行为以消除不适。Festinger 于 1957 年提出，并用著名的“1 美元/20 美元”实验证明，报酬越小、理由越不足，态度改变反而越大。�HCognitive dissonance is the discomfort from holding conflicting cognitions (e.g., “smoking harms” yet “I smoke”), driving people to change attitudes or behavior to reduce tension. Festinger proposed it in 1957 and, in the famous $1/$20 experiment, showed that insufficient justification produces greater attitude change.�ans��src��HFestinger《认知失调理论》（1957）；Myers《社会心理学》�LFestinger, A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance (1957); Myers, Social Psychology��id�9bca8702d71a�body��程序性记忆是关于“怎么做”的记忆，比如骑车、打字或游泳，学会后往往不需要有意识回想就能自动完成。它属于非陈述性记忆，主要由小脑和基底节参与。即使说不清步骤，身体也能熟练做到。�*Procedural memory is memory for 'how to do things', such as riding a bike, typing, or swimming, which becomes automatic without conscious recall. It is a type of non-declarative memory involving mainly the cerebellum and basal ganglia. You can do it skillfully even if you cannot explain the steps.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9cc2b81e21a5�body��这叫“鸡尾酒会效应”，指大脑在多重声音中自动筛选并优先处理对自己重要的信息，比如自己的名字。它依赖注意的选择性，也说明听觉感知并非被动接收。熟悉的声音和情绪词更容易被捕捉。�This is the 'cocktail party effect', where the brain automatically filters and prioritizes important information like one's own name amid many sounds. It relies on selective attention and shows hearing is not passive. Familiar voices and emotional words are caught more easily.�ans��src��auditory 选择性注意研究�%Auditory selective attention research��id�9d0e9719c6fa�body��教科书长期以纽约一起凶杀案中三十八名目击者无人报警的叙事引入责任分散概念，但后来的档案核查表明，能清楚看到全过程的证人远少于此，确有人报警和呼喊，媒体报道存在夸大。达利与拉塔内的实验室研究依然稳健：旁观人数越多，个体的干预概率与速度下降，机制包括责任分散、评价顾虑与多元无知。更晚近的公共监控录像分析进一步发现，在真实暴力冲突中至少有一人介入的比例超过九成，说明旁观者人数增加会降低个体概率，却提高了至少有人出手的总体可能性。��Textbooks long introduced diffusion of responsibility with the story of a New York murder witnessed by thirty-eight people who did nothing, but archival checks showed far fewer witnesses had a clear view, some did shout or call the police, and the press account was exaggerated. Darley and Latané's laboratory findings nonetheless hold up: as the number of bystanders grows, an individual's likelihood and speed of intervening fall, through diffusion of responsibility, evaluation apprehension, and pluralistic ignorance. More recent analyses of public surveillance footage add that in real violent conflicts someone intervenes in over ninety percent of cases, so larger crowds lower individual probability while raising the overall chance that help arrives.�ans��src���Darley 与 Latané（1968）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》；Manning、Levine 与 Collins（2007）《American Psychologist》；Philpot 等（2020）《American Psychologist》ٰDarley and Latané (1968), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Manning, Levine and Collins (2007), American Psychologist; Philpot et al. (2020), American Psychologist��id�9f510da17b07�body��X弗林通过比较各国智力测验的常模发现，二十世纪中大多数工业化国家的原始得分每十年上升约三点，增幅在瑞文推理等流体智力测验上最明显，因此需要不断重新标定常模。通常的解释包括营养与健康改善、受教育年限延长、家庭规模缩小以及日常环境中抽象符号任务增多。挪威等国基于全体征兵样本的研究显示，出生于二十世纪七十年代中期以后的世代得分转为缓慢下降，且家庭内部也出现同样趋势，这更支持环境变化而非人口构成变化的解释。��By comparing test norms across countries, Flynn found raw scores in most industrialised nations rose about three points per decade during the twentieth century, most steeply on fluid reasoning measures such as Raven's matrices, which is why norms must be restandardised repeatedly. Common explanations include better nutrition and health, longer schooling, smaller families, and a daily environment richer in abstract symbolic tasks. Studies using complete Norwegian conscription records show scores turning slowly downward for cohorts born after the mid-1970s, with the same trend appearing within families, which favours environmental change over shifts in population composition.�ans��src�ٖFlynn（1987）《Psychological Bulletin》十四国智商增长；Bratsberg 与 Rogeberg（2018）《美国科学院院刊》弗林效应逆转研究وFlynn (1987), Psychological Bulletin, Massive IQ gains in 14 nations; Bratsberg and Rogeberg (2018), PNAS, Flynn effect and its reversal��id�9f75e9987c2b�body���当人被提醒所属群体某方面不行（如女性数学、少数族裔智力），焦虑会占用工作记忆，反而拉低表现，形成自我实现的预言。仅是“被评估”的暗示就足以触发，与真实能力无关。��When reminded their group is supposedly weak at something (women at math, minorities at IQ), anxiety eats working memory and lowers performance, a self-fulfilling prophecy. Mere hints of being evaluated trigger it, unrelated to real ability.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a0b7aa5be4cc�body��G这叫“基本归因错误”：解释别人行为时，我们倾向于归因于性格（“他懒”），而解释自己行为时更看重处境（“我堵车了”）。因为观察别人时处境是背景，观察自己时内心处境更清晰。意识到这个偏差，能让我们对他人更宽容、判断更准确。�7That's the fundamental attribution error: for others we lean on traits (“he's lazy”), for ourselves we weigh circumstances (“I hit traffic”). When judging others the situation is background; when judging ourselves our circumstances are vivid. Noticing this bias makes us more tolerant and more accurate.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会认知章）�8Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social cognition chapter��id�a0dd4f9b9d17�body���双语者需持续抑制非目标语言，这种练习增强了执行控制。比亚韦斯托克研究发现双语儿童在任务转换、冲突抑制上更优，且可能延迟痴呆发病约 4 到 5 年（关联而非因果）。�!Bilinguals must continuously inhibit the non-target language, which exercises executive control. Bialystok found bilingual children outperform on task switching and conflict inhibition, and that bilingualism may delay dementia onset by about four to five years (correlational, not causal).�ans��src��[Bialystok, E. 等 (2004). 《双语、衰老与认知控制》. 《心理与衰老》19卷.�bBialystok, E. et al. (2004). Bilingualism, aging, and cognitive control. Psychology and Aging, 19.��id�a11cafedd629�body��
回顾性评价主要由体验中的峰值强度与结束时的水平决定，而对持续时间相对不敏感，这被称为峰终定律和持续时间忽视。卡尼曼的冷水实验让被试分别把手浸入冰水六十秒，或六十秒后再延长三十秒并让水温略微回升，多数人更愿意重复第二种更长但结尾更舒适的体验。这一规律影响临床操作设计、服务体验管理与医疗程序的收尾方式，同时也提醒记忆效用与实时体验效用可能系统性背离。��Retrospective evaluations are dominated by the peak intensity during an episode and by how it ends, while being relatively insensitive to how long it lasted — the peak-end rule together with duration neglect. In Kahneman's cold-water study participants immersed a hand in ice water for sixty seconds, or for sixty seconds followed by thirty more during which the water warmed slightly, and most preferred to repeat the longer trial with the gentler ending. The pattern shapes clinical procedure design, service experience management, and how medical procedures are concluded, and it warns that remembered utility can diverge systematically from moment-by-moment experience.�ans��src�كKahneman 等（1993）《Psychological Science》更多痛苦被偏好；Redelmeier 与 Kahneman（1996）《Pain》结肠镜研究ًKahneman et al. (1993), Psychological Science, When more pain is preferred to less; Redelmeier and Kahneman (1996), Pain, colonoscopy study��id�a127c463f009�body�ٸA型人格由弗里德曼和罗森曼提出，特征是竞争性强、急迫、敌意和时间紧迫感。早期研究将其与冠心病风险相联系，但后来的证据更谨慎。��Type A personality, described by Friedman and Rosenman, features competitiveness, urgency, hostility, and time pressure. Early research linked it to coronary heart disease risk, though later evidence is more cautious.�ans��src��!《人格心理学》（伯格）�Personality (Burger)��id�a33b78bf7521�body��n“学习风格”的说法很流行，但严格的实验没有发现“按风格匹配教学”能提高成绩的证据。相反，有效学习取决于内容性质和策略：空间信息用图、词汇用意义联想、程序技能靠练习。与其问“我是什么型”，不如直接用被验证的方法——间隔复习、自我测试、给他人讲解。��Learning styles are popular, but rigorous experiments find no benefit to matching instruction to a supposed “type.” Effective learning instead depends on content and strategy: maps for spatial material, meaning links for vocabulary, practice for skills. Rather than asking “what type am I,” use evidence-based methods — spaced review, self-testing, and explaining to others.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�a7bc5607d853�body�ٱ双相情感障碍以情绪在抑郁期与躁狂（或轻躁狂）期之间大幅波动为特征。躁狂期表现为异常高涨、精力过剩、冲动和睡眠需求减少。��Bipolar disorder is marked by large mood swings between depressive episodes and manic (or hypomanic) episodes. Mania involves unusually elevated mood, excess energy, impulsivity, and reduced need for sleep.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�a998df701523�body���关键期是指个体在某段时间里特别容易习得某种能力（如语言），一旦错过就难以达到最佳水平。例如幼年缺乏语言刺激可能影响终身语言发展。但许多能力也有“敏感期”，只是没那么绝对。�CA critical period is a window when an individual is especially ready to acquire a skill, such as language, and missing it makes reaching the best level difficult. For example, lack of language exposure in early childhood can affect lifelong language development. Many skills have 'sensitive periods' that are less absolute.�ans��src��!发展神经科学与语言研究�0Developmental neuroscience and language research��id�aa131258b2d2�body���工作记忆容量有限，多信道若都争同一资源反而互相干扰（如边听讲座边逐字抄写）。更好的做法是让看、听、做指向互补信息，而非重复同一内容。��Working-memory capacity is limited; multiple channels competing for the same resource interfere (e.g., transcribing a lecture verbatim while listening). Better is letting seeing, hearing and doing point to complementary—not duplicated—information.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�aadb6f9fa861�body���高尽责者更规律地作息、就医、规避风险行为。弗里德曼等人的长期追踪显示，尽责性可预测更低的全因死亡率，部分通过健康行为与慢性病管理中介。�Highly conscientious people keep more regular routines, seek medical care, and avoid risky behaviors. Friedman and colleagues' long-term follow-up showed conscientiousness predicts lower all-cause mortality, partly mediated by health behaviors and chronic-disease management.�ans��src��oFriedman, H. S. 等 (1993). 《童年期人格能否预测长寿》. 《人格与社会心理学杂志》65卷.�~Friedman, H. S. et al. (1993). Does childhood personality predict longevity? Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 65.��id�ab47d44c529a�body�٫刻板印象是对某一群体成员过度简化、固定化的看法，常以偏概全。它可能源于认知上的分类节约，却会导致偏见与不公的对待。��A stereotype is an oversimplified, fixed belief about members of a group that generalizes from the few to the many. It may arise from the mind's category shortcuts yet leads to prejudice and unfair treatment.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�ac6cb622405a�body��n这叫“测试效应”（提取练习）：主动回忆——自测、默写、做题——比重复阅读更能巩固记忆，因为每次提取都会重新强化记忆痕迹，还能暴露薄弱点。即使自测出错，修正之后也比单纯重读记得牢。把“读完就背一遍”换成“读完合上书回忆一遍”，学习效率会明显提升。��That's the testing effect: active retrieval — quizzing, reciting from memory, doing problems — strengthens memory more than rereading, because each retrieval re-solidifies the trace and reveals gaps. Even getting answers wrong and then correcting them beats passive rereading. Switching from “read then repeat” to “read then recall without looking” boosts learning noticeably.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�acc8c2a97bc1�body��Ekman 在 1971 年的跨文化研究中发现，快乐、悲伤、愤怒、恐惧、厌恶与惊讶六种情绪的面孔表情在不同文化中可被一致识别，支持基本情绪具普遍性的观点。这一发现挑战了情绪表达纯属文化习得的假说。�1In cross-cultural studies from 1971, Ekman found that facial expressions of happiness, sadness, anger, fear, disgust, and surprise are recognized consistently across cultures, supporting the universality of basic emotions. This challenged the view that emotional expressions are purely culturally learned.�ans��src�لEkman 与 Friesen 1971 年论文（载 Journal of Personality and Social Psychology）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�nEkman & Friesen (1971) in Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�ae1a9370a3b0�body��认知行为疗法由 Aaron Beck 在 1960 年代发展，认为情绪困扰源于扭曲的认知（如灾难化、非黑即白），通过识别和重构这些自动思维来改变情绪与行为。大量随机对照试验支持其对抑郁、焦虑等障碍的疗效。�?Cognitive behavioral therapy, developed by Aaron Beck in the 1960s, holds that emotional distress stems from distorted thinking (e.g., catastrophizing, all-or-nothing), and that identifying and restructuring automatic thoughts changes emotion and behavior. Numerous RCTs support its efficacy for depression and anxiety.�ans��src��LBeck《认知疗法与情绪障碍》（1976）；Comer《异常心理学》�VBeck, Cognitive Therapy and the Emotional Disorders (1976); Comer, Abnormal Psychology��id�ae6fa5e9b580�body��^格罗斯的过程模型按时间顺序区分调节策略，认知重评发生在情绪反应完全展开之前，通过改变对情境意义的解释来调整情绪；表达抑制发生在反应之后，只压住外显行为。实验与日常记录显示，重评能同时降低主观负性体验与生理唤醒，且不损害记忆和社交互动质量；抑制虽然减少了外部表现，但主观感受未减轻，交感激活反而升高，还会削弱对话中的融洽感与事后记忆。长期使用抑制与较差的心理健康指标相关，因此临床训练通常优先培养重评能力。�Gross's process model orders regulation strategies in time: cognitive reappraisal occurs before an emotional response has fully unfolded and works by changing how the situation is construed, whereas expressive suppression comes afterwards and only restrains outward behaviour. Experiments and daily diary studies show reappraisal lowers both subjective negative experience and physiological arousal without impairing memory or the quality of social interaction, while suppression reduces visible expression yet leaves felt emotion intact, raises sympathetic activation, and degrades rapport and later recall of the conversation. Habitual suppression is associated with poorer mental health indicators, so clinical training generally prioritises building reappraisal skills.�ans��src�٫Gross（1998）《Review of General Psychology》情绪调节的萌生领域；Gross 与 John（2003）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》个体差异研究ٷGross (1998), Review of General Psychology, The emerging field of emotion regulation; Gross and John (2003), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, individual differences study��id�aea0303b71e2�body���群体讨论常会强化原有倾向，使保守的更保守、冒险的更冒险，这叫“风险转移”或群体极化。责任被分散也是原因之一。理解它能帮助团队更谨慎地做决定。�Group discussion often intensifies the original tendency, making cautious groups more cautious and risky ones riskier—called 'risky shift' or group polarization. Diffusion of responsibility also plays a role. Understanding it helps teams decide more carefully.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�aed8c18f3d37�body��A这叫“社会懈怠”：当个人贡献难以被区分时，个体在群体中会不自觉地减少付出。好消息是，当任务重要、成员关系紧密、彼此能看到贡献时，懈怠会明显减少。把大目标拆成可辨认的个人任务、及时反馈进度，是提升团队效率的实用办法。�BThat's social loafing: when individual contributions are hard to distinguish, people unconsciously reduce effort in a group. The good news: loafing drops when the task matters, members are close, and contributions are visible. Breaking big goals into identifiable individual tasks with regular feedback is a practical fix.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（社会心理学章）�9Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), social psychology chapter��id�afb8cebfb718�body��心流指人全神贯注于一项挑战与技能相匹配的活动时，进入忘我、时间感扭曲且伴随高度愉悦的最优体验。Csikszentmihalyi 于 1975 年提出并系统研究，指出清晰目标与即时反馈是触发心流的关键条件。�Flow is a state of total absorption in an activity whose challenge matches one's skill, bringing a loss of self-consciousness, distorted time sense, and deep enjoyment. Csikszentmihalyi proposed and studied it from 1975, noting clear goals and immediate feedback as key triggers.�ans��src�ـCsikszentmihalyi《心流》（Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience, 1990）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�kCsikszentmihalyi, Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience (1990); Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�b05c8efef314�body���情绪表达规则规定在何种情境下应展现或压抑何种情绪。东亚文化更鼓励抑制负面外露以维持和谐，欧美文化更容忍甚至鼓励情绪的外显表达，这塑造了跨文化的情绪行为差异。�	Display rules dictate which emotions may be shown or suppressed in given contexts. East Asian cultures encourage dampening negative expression for harmony, while many Western cultures tolerate or encourage open expression, shaping cross-cultural emotional behavior.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 文化心理卷�1Annual Review of Psychology (cultural psychology)��id�b0eecc042f9e�body���大五人格用开放性、尽责性、外倾性、宜人性、神经质五个维度描述人格，取首字母组成OCEAN。它被广泛用于研究与人才评估，具有较好的跨文化稳定性。��The Big Five describes personality along openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness, and neuroticism—spelled OCEAN. It is widely used in research and personnel assessment and shows cross-cultural stability.�ans��src��!《人格心理学》（伯格）�Personality (Burger)��id�b11549592963�body���情绪劫持由 Goleman 提出：当威胁感强烈时，杏仁核绕过缓慢的理性脑（前额叶）抢先反应，导致冲动爆发或僵住。事后冷静下来才反应过来。规律放松与觉察训练可缩短劫持时长。��Coined by Goleman: when threat is intense, the amygdala bypasses the slower rational prefrontal cortex, triggering impulsive outbursts or freezing—you realize only after calming. Relaxation and awareness training shorten hijacks.�ans��src��Goleman 情绪智力� Goleman's emotional intelligence��id�b2004172df9b�body��这叫“鸡尾酒会效应”：耳朵接收所有声音，但大脑会选择性地把注意力投向某个声音来源，同时压低其他噪音。如果别人突然喊你的名字，注意力会立刻被拉过去，说明过滤并非绝对，重要的信息仍能突破。�Known as the cocktail party effect: the ears receive every sound, but the brain selectively tunes attention to one source while suppressing the rest. If someone calls your name, attention snaps to it — the filter isn't absolute, and important signals still break through.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（注意章）�1Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), attention chapter��id�b235d65f298e�body��依恋理论由 Bowlby 提出、Ainsworth 用“陌生情境”实验发展，认为婴儿与主要照料者形成的安全或不安全的情感联结影响其后社会关系。Ainsworth 区分了安全型、回避型与矛盾/抗拒型，后来 Main 又补充了紊乱型。�GAttachment theory, proposed by Bowlby and extended by Ainsworth's “Strange Situation” experiments, holds that the emotional bond infants form with a primary caregiver shapes later social relationships. Ainsworth identified secure, avoidant, and ambivalent/resistant patterns, later supplemented by Main's disorganized type.�ans��src��`Ainsworth 等《依恋模式》（Patterns of Attachment, 1978）；Bowlby《依恋》（1969）�JAinsworth et al., Patterns of Attachment (1978); Bowlby, Attachment (1969)��id�b24951f35c3c�body��>斯特鲁普效应指当颜色词本身的字面含义（如用红墨水写的“蓝”字）与印刷颜色不一致时，人们念出颜色的反应会变慢、错误增多。它揭示了自动化阅读过程会干扰需要有意控制的颜色命名任务，说明自动化加工与受控加工之间存在冲突。�=The Stroop effect occurs when the ink color of a color word (e.g., the word “blue” printed in red) mismatches its meaning, slowing and error-prone color naming. It shows that automatic reading interferes with the controlled task of naming colors, illustrating conflict between automatic and controlled processing.�ans��src�٩Stroop, J.R.,《Studies of interference in serial verbal reactions.》, Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1935 (DOI: 10.1037/h0054651)；Sternberg《认知心理学》٥Stroop, J.R., 'Studies of interference in serial verbal reactions.', Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1935, DOI: 10.1037/h0054651; Sternberg, Cognitive Psychology��id�b25d8c44584f�body�ٽ大规模研究显示，强社会关系与更低死亡率相关，影响堪比戒烟；孤独则像慢性压力，升高炎症与心血管风险。连接是健康行为，不是奢侈品。��Large studies link strong social ties to lower mortality, on par with quitting smoking; loneliness acts like chronic stress, raising inflammation and cardiovascular risk. Connection is a health behavior, not a luxury.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b29e289cf113�body��>这叫“间隔效应”：把学习分散到不同时间，比一次集中学更有利于长期记忆。间隔期间，大脑会在后台继续加工材料；遗忘后再一次回忆，会强化记忆的连接。考前突击只能应付短期考试，间隔复习才能在考试后还记得，也减少临考焦虑。�SThat's the spacing effect: learning spread across time beats massed cramming for long-term retention. Between sessions the brain keeps processing material; recalling after some forgetting strengthens the memory trace. Cramming only covers the short term, while spaced review still works after the exam — and it eases last-minute anxiety.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�b3de488539ad�body���阿内特提出 18–29 岁是介于依赖与担责间的探索期：试工作、试关系、试价值观。现代社会中它被拉长，所以而立延迟并非脆弱，而是结构变化。��Arnett proposes 18–29 as a exploration phase between dependence and responsibility: trying jobs, relationships and values. As society stretches it, a delayed adulthood (而立) is structural change, not fragility.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�b5908c92fcf3�body���恐惧靠回避维持；渐进、安全地接触害怕情境且不发生可怕后果，会让大脑消退旧的条件反应。关键在不逃以让学习发生，需在安全节奏下进行。��Fear is maintained by avoidance; gradual safe contact with the feared situation, without the dreaded outcome, lets the brain extinguish the old conditioned response. The key is not fleeing so learning occurs, at a safe pace.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�b858609de27f�body���共情是设身处地感受他人情绪（认知共情理解立场、情绪共情共享感受）；同情是对他人困境感到关切但不必共享其情绪。适度共情有助连接，但过度共情可能导致耗竭，而同情更具行动导向。��Empathy is sharing or understanding another's feeling (cognitive: perspective; affective: shared feeling); sympathy is concern for their plight without necessarily feeling it. Empathy builds bonds but can exhaust; sympathy is more action-oriented.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b8aebad90e66�body�ٙ味觉受体基因、唾液成分、嗅觉灵敏度乃至情绪和经验的差异，都会改变对味道的感知，所以口味偏好高度个性化。ٮDifferences in taste-receptor genes, saliva composition, smell sensitivity, and even mood and experience change taste perception, making flavor preferences highly individual.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�bbbec907f223�body���守恒指儿童认识到物体某些属性（如数量、体积）在外观改变后仍然不变。前运算期儿童常因注意力被表面变化吸引而判断错误，到具体运算期才掌握。�Conservation is the understanding that certain properties of objects, such as amount or volume, stay the same despite changes in appearance. Preoperational children often err by focusing on surface changes, and master it only in the concrete operational stage.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�bcb66155f43a�body��#双相情感障碍以情绪在抑郁低谷与躁狂或轻躁狂高峰之间摆动为特征，躁狂期表现为情绪高涨、精力过旺、睡眠需求减少与冲动决策。它不同于普通的情绪波动，发作会明显损害功能。治疗常以情绪稳定剂配合心理治疗。�8Bipolar disorder is marked by mood swinging between depressive lows and manic or hypomanic highs, with mania showing elevated mood, excess energy, reduced sleep need, and impulsive decisions. It differs from normal mood swings in impairing function. Treatment usually combines mood stabilizers and psychotherapy.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�bde9ed2a101f�body���布罗卡失语表现为说话费力但理解相对完好，对应左额下回损伤；韦尼克失语则言语流畅却语义混乱、理解受损，对应左颞上回损伤。二者揭示了语言产出与理解在脑中的分离。�#Broca's aphasia brings effortful speech with preserved comprehension from left inferior frontal damage; Wernicke's aphasia yields fluent but meaningless speech with impaired comprehension from left superior temporal damage. They reveal the brain's separation of production and comprehension.�ans��src��YBear、Connors 与 Paradis,《神经科学:探索大脑》第4版,Sinauer Associates,2016�]Bear, Connors & Paradis, Neuroscience: Exploring the Brain, 4th ed., Sinauer Associates, 2016��id�beb27a85d834�body���德韦克提出，成长型思维相信能力可以通过努力提升，而固定型思维认为能力天生不变。拥有成长型思维的学生更不怕困难、更愿意挑战。表扬“努力”比表扬“聪明”更能培养它。�␀Dweck proposed that a growth mindset believes ability can improve through effort, while a fixed mindset sees ability as inborn. Students with a growth mindset fear difficulty less and embrace challenge. Praising 'effort' rather than 'smartness' fosters it.�ans��src��GCarol S. Dweck,Mindset: The New Psychology of Success,Random House,2006�KCarol S. Dweck, Mindset: The New Psychology of Success, Random House, 2006.��id�bf7f80f05bcd�body�ي恐惧是对明确、即时威胁的急性反应；焦虑则是对模糊、未来可能危险的预期性担忧，常没有明确对象。ُFear is an acute response to a clear, immediate threat; anxiety is anticipatory worry about vague, future danger, often without a clear object.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�c028a0ebeb06�body���ADHD 以与年龄不符的注意分散、冲动和/或过度活动为核心，常在儿童期显现并可持续到成人。它属于神经发育差异，并非教养失败或单纯“调皮”。行为干预与药物可显著改善功能。�ADHD centers on age-inappropriate inattention, impulsivity, and/or hyperactivity, often appearing in childhood and continuing into adulthood. It is a neurodevelopmental difference, not bad parenting or mere naughtiness. Behavioral care and medication can markedly improve function.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�c13f228044be�body��:布罗卡区（左额下回）损伤导致表达性失语，患者理解尚可但说话费力、语法缺失；韦尼克区（左颞上回）损伤导致感受性失语，患者流利却语无伦次、理解困难。二者由 Broca（1861）与 Wernicke（1874）先后发现，奠定了语言脑定位的基础。�cDamage to Broca's area (left inferior frontal gyrus) causes expressive aphasia—impaired, nonfluent speech with preserved comprehension; damage to Wernicke's area (left superior temporal gyrus) causes receptive aphasia—fluent but meaningless speech and poor comprehension. Broca (1861) and Wernicke (1874) founded the cortical localization of language.�ans��src��\Broca 1861 年论文；Wernicke 1874 年论文；Kolb 与 Whishaw《神经心理学基础》�TBroca (1861); Wernicke (1874); Kolb & Whishaw, Fundamentals of Human Neuropsychology��id�c2cd4d9cae31�body�ي研究显示出生顺序的影响很小且常被家庭规模等因素混淆；长子女可能更尽责，但差异远小于流行说法。ٹResearch finds birth-order effects on personality are small and often confounded by family size; firstborns may be slightly more conscientious, but far less than popular claims suggest.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c3e3606120f9�body��p这利用了两种顺从技巧：先提小请求再提大请求的“脚在门槛”（foot-in-the-door, Freedman & Fraser, 1966），以及先提大请求被拒再退而求其次的“留面子”（door-in-the-face, Cialdini 等, 1975）。前者靠承诺一致，后者靠对比与互惠——先拒绝大的，再面对小的会觉得“占了便宜”而答应。�nTwo compliance techniques are at work: foot-in-the-door (a small request first, then a bigger one; Freedman & Fraser, 1966) leverages consistency, while door-in-the-face (a big rejected request followed by a smaller one; Cialdini et al., 1975) leverages contrast and reciprocity. After refusing the large ask, the smaller one feels like a bargain we ought to accept.�ans��src��|Cialdini 等 (1975)《留面子技术：相互让步的顺从》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 31(2):206-215��Cialdini, R.B., Vincent, J.E., Lewis, S.K., Catalan, J., Wheeler, D. & Darby, B.L. (1975). Reciprocal concessions procedure for inducing compliance. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 31(2), 206-215.��id�c43ca95444a5�body�ٖ“控制错觉”让我们相信主动选择能降低危险（如自选彩票号码），实际上概率并未改变，只是主观安全感上升。١An 'illusion of control' makes us believe active choice reduces danger (e.g., picking lottery numbers), though odds are unchanged—only subjective safety rises.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�c68adb048dca�body�ٷ德西和瑞安提出，人的内在动机源于三种基本心理需求的满足：自主性、胜任感和关系感。当环境支持这些需求，人的投入与幸福感更高。��Deci and Ryan proposed that intrinsic motivation grows from satisfying three basic psychological needs: autonomy, competence, and relatedness. When environments support these, engagement and well-being rise.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c6bb1b230aee�body��操作性条件反射由 Skinner 提出，行为后果（奖励或惩罚）决定其再发生的概率。Ferster 与 Skinner 于 1957 年系统比较了连续强化与间歇强化，发现可变比率强化（如赌博）最能维持稳定而持久的行为。�4Operant conditioning, developed by Skinner, holds that behavior is shaped by its consequences (reinforcement or punishment). Ferster and Skinner systematically compared continuous and intermittent schedules in 1957, finding that variable-ratio schedules (as in gambling) produce the most persistent behavior.�ans��src��|Ferster 与 Skinner《强化的程序》（Schedules of Reinforcement, 1957）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�\Ferster & Skinner, Schedules of Reinforcement (1957); Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�c6c5042164e7�body�ٴ认知焦虑（担心）通常伤表现，躯体焦虑（心跳快）在中等水平反可提唤醒。把紧张重评为“准备好”、配合呼吸，能把激动转为助力。ٱCognitive anxiety (worry) usually hurts; somatic anxiety (racing heart) at moderate level can aid arousal. Reframing nerves as 'ready' with breathing turns excitement into fuel.�ans��src�٥FINKENBERG,《COGNITIVE AND SOMATIC STATE ANXIETY AND SELF-CONFIDENCE IN CHEERLEADING COMPETITION》,Perceptual and Motor Skills,1992 (DOI: 10.2466/pms.75.7.835-839)٣FINKENBERG, 'COGNITIVE AND SOMATIC STATE ANXIETY AND SELF-CONFIDENCE IN CHEERLEADING COMPETITION', Perceptual and Motor Skills, 1992, DOI: 10.2466/pms.75.7.835-839��id�c7315faf2ed7�body���经验丰富者在典型病例上凭模式直觉又快又准，但罕见与不典型情况直觉易错，需系统性核对清单与数据。最佳实践是直觉触发假设、证据再做确认，而非单凭感觉下结论。��Experienced clinicians are fast and accurate via pattern intuition in typical cases, but rare or atypical ones trip intuition, needing checklists and data. Best practice: intuition generates hypotheses, evidence confirms—not gut alone.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�c7558fba81cc�body��"彭凯平等发现东亚思维偏“辩证”：习惯在矛盾中找平衡、接受变化与中庸（Peng & Nisbett, 1999）。这塑造了归因与说服风格——东亚人更少非黑即白，更愿意保留对立观点的张力，而欧美文化更强调逻辑一致与范畴清晰。�8Peng and Nisbett (1999) found East Asian thought leans dialectical: comfortable balancing contradictions and expecting change toward the middle. This shapes attribution and persuasion - East Asians tolerate both-sides tension more, while European-American culture prizes logical consistency and clear categories.�ans��src��ePeng, K. & Nisbett, R.E. (1999)《文化、辩证法与推理》, American Psychologist 54(9):741-754�kPeng, K. & Nisbett, R.E. (1999). Culture, dialectics, and reasoning. American Psychologist, 54(9), 741-754.��id�ca8754da5b65�body���可得性启发式指人们依据能多容易想起某类事例来评估其发生频率。因为媒体对空难、犯罪的突出报道，人们常高估罕见风险而低估常见风险，造成风险感知扭曲。��The availability heuristic judges event frequency by how easily examples come to mind. Vivid media coverage of plane crashes or crimes leads people to overestimate rare risks and underestimate common ones, distorting risk perception.�ans��src�ٕTversky, Kahneman,《Availability: A heuristic for judging frequency and probability》,Cognitive Psychology,1973 (DOI: 10.1016/0010-0285(73)90033-9)ٓTversky, Kahneman, 'Availability: A heuristic for judging frequency and probability', Cognitive Psychology, 1973, DOI: 10.1016/0010-0285(73)90033-9��id�caec8f0d8389�body��/克罗斯的“自我距离”研究发现，用旁观者视角、以第三人称重述情绪事件，能降低心率与负性反刍（Kross 等, 2009; 2011）。拉开心理距离让大脑从沉浸的“热”状态切换到可分析的“冷”状态，于是情绪更快降温而不被反复咀嚼。�;Kross's self-distancing work shows that recounting an emotional event from a third-person, observer view lowers heart rate and negative rumination (Kross et al., 2009, 2011). Creating psychological distance flips the brain from immersed hot to analytical cool processing, so feelings cool without being chewed over.�ans��src�فKross 等 (2011)《为何追问“为什么”有时适得其反》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 100(6):991-1006فKross, E., Ayduk, O. et al. (2011). When asking why doesn't work. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 100(6), 991-1006.��id�cbe61a5d601d�body�ٙ青春期生物钟自然延后（睡眠相位后移），加上手机蓝光与社交诱惑，使入睡变晚，但早起上学造成长期睡眠不足。٤The teen circadian clock naturally shifts later (delayed phase), plus phone light and social pulls delay sleep, while early school start causes chronic short sleep.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cc144740bda1�body�ٮ观察学习指通过观察他人（榜样）的行为及其后果来学习，而不必亲自试错。波波娃娃实验显示儿童会模仿成人对玩偶的攻击行为。��Observational learning is acquiring behavior by watching others (models) and the consequences they face, without direct trial and error. The Bobo doll experiment showed children imitating adults' aggression toward the doll.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ccd7b1830fab�body���情商指识别、理解、管理和运用自己与他人情绪的能力。它包含自我觉察、情绪调节、同理心和人际交往等成分。较高的情商有助于更好地处理冲突和建立关系，但不等于不会难过。�Emotional intelligence is the ability to recognize, understand, manage, and use your own and others' emotions. It includes self-awareness, emotion regulation, empathy, and social skills. Higher EQ helps handle conflict and build relationships, but it does not mean never feeling sad.�ans��src��Salovey & Mayer / Goleman�Salovey & Mayer / Goleman��id�ce6959a9939f�body���群体思维指高凝聚、封闭群体为维持一致而压制异议，导致忽视替代方案与风险。贾尼斯以猪湾事件等为例，指出幻觉式一致与自我审查是典型症状。��Groupthink occurs when a highly cohesive, insulated group suppresses dissent to preserve harmony, leading it to ignore alternatives and risks. Janis cited cases like the Bay of Pigs, noting illusory unanimity and self-censorship as hallmark symptoms.�ans��src��4Janis, I. L. (1972). 《群体思维的受害者》.�+Janis, I. L. (1972). Victims of Groupthink.��id�ce70c51ebb58�body���元认知是个体对自己认知过程的觉察与调控，包括“知道我知道什么”的知识以及计划、监控和调节学习的能力。Flavell 于 1979 年系统提出该概念，它是自主学习与有效问题解决的重要基础。�*Metacognition is awareness and regulation of one's own cognitive processes, including knowledge about what one knows and the ability to plan, monitor, and adjust learning. Flavell systematically introduced the concept in 1979, and it underlies self-regulated learning and effective problem solving.�ans��src��cFlavell 1979 年论文（载 American Psychologist）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�OFlavell (1979) in American Psychologist; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�ce95edf139bb�body���最近发展区是儿童“独立解决问题的实际发展水平”与“在成人或能力更强同伴指导下能达到的潜在水平”之间的差距。维果茨基强调教学应落在这一区域，并通过“支架”式引导促进发展。��The zone of proximal development is the gap between what a child can do alone and what they can achieve with guidance from a more capable person. Vygotsky argued that instruction should target this zone and use “scaffolding” to foster development.�ans��src��_Vygotsky《思维与语言》（Thought and Language, 1962）；Berk《毕生发展心理学》�MVygotsky, Thought and Language (1962); Berk, Development Through the Lifespan��id�d0482ab1d307�body���数据共享提升研究透明度、可重复性与二次分析效率，并减少选择性报告。其顾虑包括参与者隐私保护、数据误用与弱势群体风险，因此需在伦理审查与去标识化框架下有序推进。��Data sharing boosts transparency, reproducibility, and reuse while reducing selective reporting. Concerns include participant privacy, misuse, and risks to vulnerable groups, so it must proceed under ethics review and de-identification.�ans��src��NNature Human Behaviour 开放科学政策;《心理学年度评论》方法卷�SNature Human Behaviour (open science policy); Annual Review of Psychology (methods)��id�d091db6e2bbe�body���健康信念模型认为人们采取预防行为取决于对疾病严重性与易感性的感知、对行动收益与障碍的权衡，以及提示行动线索与自我效能。它常用于设计疫苗接种与筛查的促进行为。��The health belief model explains preventive action through perceived severity and susceptibility, benefits versus barriers, cues to action, and self-efficacy. It is widely used to design vaccination and screening campaigns.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 健康心理卷�/Annual Review of Psychology (health psychology)��id�d0afa39365e7�body���实验让被试在明显的线段长度判断中面对一致给出错误答案的同伴，约三分之一的关键试次出现从众。事后访谈显示动机各异：多数人明知答案不对，只是不愿在群体中显得突兀，属于规范性影响；少数人真的开始怀疑自己的知觉，属于信息性影响。决定性的操纵是引入一名持异议的同伴，从众率立刻大幅下降，这说明关键不是多数人的数量，而是一致性是否被打破。�[Participants judged obvious line lengths while confederates unanimously gave wrong answers, and conformity appeared on roughly a third of critical trials. Post-experiment interviews revealed mixed motives: most knew the answer was wrong but did not want to stand out, which is normative influence, while a minority genuinely began to doubt their own perception, which is informational influence. The decisive manipulation was adding a single dissenting confederate, after which conformity dropped sharply — showing that what matters is not the size of the majority but whether its unanimity is broken.�ans��src��kAsch（1955）《Scientific American》从众研究；Asch（1951）群体压力与判断修正实验报告٘Asch (1955), Scientific American, Opinions and social pressure; Asch (1951), Effects of group pressure upon the modification and distortion of judgments��id�d17e60a0a82f�body���我们解释他人行为时常夸大性格、忽视情境（如迟到等于懒，而不是堵车）。东方文化因更重情境，此偏差比西方弱。意识到我也可能在同样情境下这样做能减少苛责。��We explain others' acts by overstating traits and ignoring context (late equals lazy, not traffic). Because East cultures weigh context more, this bias is weaker there. Realizing you might do the same in that situation reduces harshness.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d3bbf9375ee4�body���儿童大约在4岁能理解“别人可能有和我不同的想法”，这标志心理理论的出现。经典的“错误信念任务”会测孩子是否知道别人可能持有错误看法。心理理论是社交和沟通发展的关键一步。�#Around age 4, children understand that 'others can have thoughts different from mine', marking the emergence of theory of mind. The classic 'false-belief task' tests whether a child knows someone can hold a mistaken view. Theory of mind is a key step in social and communicative development.�ans��src��"Wimmer & Perner 错误信念实验�'Wimmer & Perner false-belief experiment��id�d5cb6217cfb3�body���生成效应指相比被动阅读，自己生成内容（填空、造句、推导）能形成更深、更独特的记忆痕迹。主动构建迫使大脑建立更多检索路径，因此回忆率更高。��The generation effect: producing content yourself (fill-ins, sentences, derivations) creates deeper, more distinctive memory traces than reading. Active construction forces more retrieval routes, raising recall.�ans��src��nSlamecka, Graf,《The generation effect: Delineation of a phenomenon.》,1978 (DOI: 10.1037/0278-7393.4.6.592)�kSlamecka, Graf, 'The generation effect: Delineation of a phenomenon.', 1978, DOI: 10.1037/0278-7393.4.6.592��id�d684508d5b3e�body���元分析通过系统整合多项独立研究、用统计方法估计整体效应，能发现单个小样本研究难以检出的稳定模式，并量化异质性来源。它是证据分级的顶层方法，但依赖纳入研究的质量。��Meta-analysis systematically combines independent studies to estimate an overall effect, revealing stable patterns small samples miss and quantifying heterogeneity. It tops evidence hierarchies but depends on the quality of included studies.�ans��src��B《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 方法卷�%Annual Review of Psychology (methods)��id�d6db4709836c�body��情景记忆是关于自己经历过的事件（何时何地），带有主观时间感；语义记忆是关于事实与概念（如首都名字），不绑定具体经历。两者都属陈述性记忆，但神经基础部分分离（海马与新皮层）。�Episodic memory is about personally experienced events (when/where), with a sense of subjective time; semantic memory is about facts and concepts (e.g., capitals), unbound to experience. Both are declarative but partly dissociated neurally (hippocampus vs neocortex).�ans��src��Tulving 记忆分类�Tulving's memory taxonomy��id�d7da050ef90e�body��t自我决定理论区分内在动机（为乐趣本身而做）与外在动机（为奖励或压力而做）。内在动机满足自主、胜任、归属三种基本心理需要，让人更投入、更持久、更少耗竭；而过分强调外在奖励有时反而会削弱内在兴趣。找到“我真正在乎什么”，是把外在目标变成内在动力的关键。��Self-determination theory distinguishes intrinsic motivation (doing for its own joy) from extrinsic motivation (doing for rewards or pressure). Intrinsic motivation satisfies the needs for autonomy, competence, and relatedness, fueling deeper engagement, persistence, and less burnout; heavy external rewards can even crowd out interest. Finding what you truly value turns outer goals into inner drive.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（动机章）�2Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), motivation chapter��id�d8bd879c97af�body��~人们高估自己在他人眼中的显眼程度，以为自己的失误被众人关注，其实别人大多没那么在意。يPeople overestimate how much others notice them, believing their blunders are in the spotlight, when others are mostly far less attentive.�ans��src�ټGilovich、Medvec 与 Savitsky（2000）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》聚光灯效应；Gilovich 与 Savitsky（1999）《Current Directions in Psychological Science》ٳGilovich, Medvec and Savitsky (2000), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, The spotlight effect; Gilovich and Savitsky (1999), Current Directions in Psychological Science��id�d8c334334e72�body���损失厌恶指人们对失去同样东西的痛苦，大于得到它的快乐，损失带来的负效用约是收益的两倍。这会让人在投资或选择时过于保守、不愿止损。它是行为经济学的重要发现。�Loss aversion means the pain of losing the same thing is greater than the pleasure of gaining it, with losses feeling about twice as strong as gains. It makes people overly cautious in investing and reluctant to cut losses. It is a key finding in behavioral economics.�ans��src��Kahneman & Tversky 前景理论�"Kahneman & Tversky prospect theory��id�d9421551cd24�body��&常见焦虑障碍包括广泛性焦虑（长期过度担忧）、惊恐障碍（突发强烈恐惧伴心悸）、社交焦虑（害怕被评价）以及特定恐惧症。它们共享对威胁的过度警觉，但触发情境与表现不同。认知行为疗法与药物对多数类型有效。�'Common anxiety disorders include generalized anxiety (chronic worry), panic disorder (sudden intense fear with racing heart), social anxiety (fear of evaluation), and specific phobias. They share over-alertness to threat but differ in triggers and expression. CBT and medication help most types.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�da6e5d08c2e5�body���自我关怀由自我友善（替代自我批评）、共通人性（承认苦难的普遍性）与正念（平衡看待痛苦）构成。内夫研究显示高自我关怀者焦虑更低、复原力更强，且不伴随自满。� Self-compassion consists of self-kindness (replacing self-criticism), common humanity (recognizing that suffering is universal), and mindfulness (holding pain in balanced awareness). Neff found that higher self-compassion links to lower anxiety and greater resilience without complacency.�ans��src��ZNeff, K. D. (2003). 《自我关怀量表的开发与验证》. 《自我与身份》2卷.�kNeff, K. D. (2003). Development and validation of a scale to measure self-compassion. Self and Identity, 2.��id�da79fbaabf22�body�٨它把抽象的感激变成具体、真实的连接时刻，双方都被触动，记忆还会反复回放带来余温。一次真诚的致谢，效益常持续数周。ٰIt turns vague gratitude into a concrete, real moment of connection that moves both people, and the memory replays as afterglow. One sincere thank-you often pays off for weeks.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�daa5b620314e�body���这类行为会刺激多巴胺系统，但关键不是“快乐”而是“期待”——大脑在“可能得到奖励”时释放更多多巴胺，让人不断想“再看一个”“再来一局”。内容不可预测（下一条是什么不知道）时最抓人。这是正常的大脑机制，意识到“期待陷阱”，用定时提醒、物理隔离手机等边界方法，就能重新掌握主动。��These behaviors stimulate the dopamine system, but the driver isn't pleasure — it's anticipation. The brain releases more dopamine when reward might be coming, pushing “one more video,” “one more round.” Unpredictable content (you don't know what's next) is the most gripping. This is a normal brain mechanism; seeing the “anticipation trap” and setting boundaries — timers, physically separate the phone — restores your agency.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�dadbb1d67974�body���ADHD 是一种常见于儿童（也可延续到成人）的神经发育障碍，表现为持续的注意力不集中、多动和冲动，超出同龄正常水平并影响功能。它可通过行为干预和药物进行管理。�ADHD is a neurodevelopmental disorder common in children (and sometimes persisting into adulthood), showing sustained inattention, hyperactivity, and impulsivity beyond typical age levels and impairing function. It is managed with behavioral intervention and medication.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�db7b1d4a395f�body�١在入睡或醒来时，意识已清醒但身体仍处于 REM 的麻痹状态，短暂无法动弹并常伴压迫感或幻觉，通常几分钟内自行解除。ٰAt sleep onset or waking, consciousness is alert but the body remains REM-paralyzed, causing brief immobility with pressure or hallucinations, usually resolving within minutes.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dd4f633dc369�body���情景记忆是亲历某件事的回忆（何时何地），语义记忆是脱离语境的常识与事实（如首都的名字）。图尔文提出前者带有自我时间感，后者可被单独提取而不附带个人经历。�!Episodic memory is recall of personally experienced events (when and where), whereas semantic memory is context-free knowledge and facts (such as capital cities). Tulving argued that the former carries a sense of self in time, while the latter can be retrieved without personal experience.�ans��src��JTulving, E. (1972). 《情景与语义记忆》. 见《记忆的组织》.�LTulving, E. (1972). Episodic and semantic memory. In Organization of Memory.��id�de5ce70c91d2�body��@早期研究结果看似矛盾：他人在场时，骑行速度、简单反应等任务表现提升，而学习生词、解复杂问题等任务表现下降。扎伊翁茨提出驱力理论加以整合：他人在场提高生理唤醒，而唤醒会强化优势反应；对已经熟练的任务，优势反应就是正确反应，因此表现改善；对尚未掌握的任务，优势反应往往是错误反应，因此表现变差。后续解释补充了评价顾虑与注意冲突等社会认知因素，说明单纯的他人存在与被评价的预期作用并不相同。��Early findings looked contradictory: with others present, cycling speed and simple reaction tasks improved while learning new vocabulary or solving complex problems got worse. Zajonc integrated them with a drive account: the presence of others raises physiological arousal, and arousal strengthens the dominant response; on well-practised tasks the dominant response is the correct one so performance improves, while on unmastered tasks it is often an error so performance declines. Later accounts added social-cognitive factors such as evaluation apprehension and attentional conflict, showing that mere presence and the expectation of being judged do not work identically.�ans��src��uZajonc（1965）《Science》社会助长；Bond 与 Titus（1983）《Psychological Bulletin》社会助长元分析ـZajonc (1965), Science, Social facilitation; Bond and Titus (1983), Psychological Bulletin, meta-analysis of social facilitation��id�dff6a72b19b0�body���主流包括活化-整合假说（REM 期随机神经放电被大脑编成故事）和记忆巩固/情绪调节假说（梦重演并整合白天经验）。目前无单一定论，但梦与记忆整理和情绪平衡密切相关。��Leading views include the activation-synthesis hypothesis (random REM neural firing woven into stories) and memory-consolidation/emotional-regulation views (dreams replay and integrate the day). No single answer, but dreams tie closely to memory and mood.�ans��src��Hobson 活化-整合; Stickgold�&Hobson activation-synthesis; Stickgold��id�e184e944d6a0�body���睡眠中海马向新皮层回放当日信息，慢波睡眠巩固陈述性记忆，快速眼动巩固程序性与情绪记忆。斯蒂克戈德等发现学习后睡眠者的保持显著优于睡眠剥夺者。�During sleep the hippocampus replays the day's information to the neocortex; slow-wave sleep consolidates declarative memory and REM consolidates procedural and emotional memory. Stickgold and colleagues found that sleepers retain learned material far better than sleep-deprived people.�ans��src��\Stickgold, R. (2005). 《睡眠依赖性记忆巩固》. 《自然神经科学评论》6卷.�[Stickgold, R. (2005). Sleep-dependent memory consolidation. Nature Reviews Neuroscience, 6.��id�e1b718d93f64�body��h这是“文化适应”的正常过程：面对陌生的语言、规则和习惯，人会经历从兴奋到困惑、失落再到逐渐适应的曲线，有时被称为“文化休克”。大多数人在几个月到一年内会找到新的平衡。给自己适应时间、保持与家乡的联系、同时开放地接触新环境，都能帮助平稳度过。�lIt's a normal part of acculturation: facing unfamiliar language, rules, and customs, people move through excitement, confusion, homesickness, and gradual adjustment — sometimes called culture shock. Most find a new balance within months to a year. Giving yourself time, staying connected to home, and openly engaging the new environment all help you ride it out.�ans��src��APA（文化适应研究）�APA (acculturation research)��id�e1f56f487797�body�ٜ分散学习让大脑在每次提取时付出更多努力，强化神经连接；还能利用“必要难度”原理，比集中突击记得更牢更久。ٸSpaced study forces the brain to work harder each time it retrieves information, strengthening neural connections; this 'desirable difficulty' makes memories last longer than cramming.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�e39c9755247d�body��I聚光灯效应指个体误以为自己处在他人注意的中心。实验让被试穿着尴尬的 T 恤走进房间，事后他们估计的注意到该图案的人数远高于实际比例。原因在于自我关注造成的可及性差异：自己的形象与失误在自己心中格外突出，而他人正忙于关注自身，且难以对锚定在自我视角上的估计做出充分校正。相关的透明度错觉还表明，人们高估了自己的紧张、说谎或情绪能被他人看穿的程度，理解这一点对缓解社交焦虑与公开演讲恐惧有实际帮助。��The spotlight effect is the tendency to believe one occupies the centre of others' attention. In one experiment participants entered a room wearing an embarrassing T-shirt and afterwards estimated far more observers had noticed the image than actually had. The cause is a difference in accessibility created by self-focus: one's own appearance and mistakes are highly salient to oneself while others are preoccupied with their own concerns, and people fail to adjust sufficiently away from an estimate anchored on their own perspective. A related illusion of transparency shows people overestimate how visible their nervousness, lies, or emotions are, which is practically useful for easing social anxiety and fear of public speaking.�ans��src�ټGilovich、Medvec 与 Savitsky（2000）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》聚光灯效应；Gilovich 与 Savitsky（1999）《Current Directions in Psychological Science》ٳGilovich, Medvec and Savitsky (2000), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, The spotlight effect; Gilovich and Savitsky (1999), Current Directions in Psychological Science��id�e539b08038a1�body�ټ在快速眼动期脑电接近清醒状态而身体瘫痪，约 80% 被唤醒者报告生动梦境。霍布森的激活整合模型认为脑干随机放电被皮层整合为梦境叙事。�During REM, brain activity approaches waking levels while the body is paralyzed, and about 80% of awakenings yield vivid dream reports. Hobson's activation-synthesis model holds that random brainstem firing is integrated by the cortex into dream narratives.�ans��src��sHobson, J. A. & McCarley, R. W. (1977). 《REM睡眠的激活整合模型》. 《美国精神病学杂志》134卷.�rHobson, J. A. & McCarley, R. W. (1977). The brain as a dream state generator. American Journal of Psychiatry, 134.��id�e5886b52ff9e�body���暴露疗法是CBT的一种技术，让患者在安全环境下逐步、重复地接触引发恐惧的情境或记忆，从而削弱conditioned（条件反射式）的害怕反应。它对恐惧症和PTSD尤其有效。��Exposure therapy is a CBT technique that has clients safely and gradually, repeatedly face fear-triggering situations or memories, thereby weakening the conditioned fear response. It is especially effective for phobias and PTSD.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�e5a4ec830061�body���《精神障碍诊断与统计手册》第五版由美国精神医学学会出版，是临床诊断和研究中分类精神疾病的权威标准。它提供统一的诊断标准，但不解释病因。�The Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, 5th edition, published by the American Psychiatric Association, is the authoritative standard for classifying mental disorders in clinical and research settings. It provides uniform criteria but not explanations of cause.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�e81615876263�body�ٸ海马体位于颞叶，是把新经验巩固为长期陈述性记忆的关键结构。著名的病人H.M.在海马体被切除后无法形成新长期记忆，证实了它的作用。��The hippocampus, in the temporal lobe, is crucial for consolidating new experiences into long-term declarative memory. The famous patient H.M., after hippocampal removal, could not form new long-term memories, confirming its role.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�e923af03ca4b�body���幸存者偏差指我们只看到活下来/成功的样本，而忽略了失败的沉默大多数。二战时统计返航飞机弹孔而加固未中弹处，正是因为中弹关键部位的飞机根本没回来——失败样本缺失会误导结论。��Survivorship bias means we only see successful/surviving cases and ignore the silent failures. In WWII, planes were reinforced where returning ones were unhit—because planes hit in vital spots never came back. Missing failure data misleads conclusions.�ans��src��Wald 战时统计研究�Wald's wartime statistics��id�e9485d9993f2�body���最近发展区是指儿童独立解决问题的水平与在成人或更有能力同伴帮助下能达到的水平之间的差距。 scaffolding（支架式教学）正是搭建在这一概念之上。��The zone of proximal development is the gap between what a child can do alone and what they can do with help from an adult or more capable peer. Scaffolding in teaching is built directly on this concept.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�e9899a039441�body���气质是先天的、生物基础的情绪与活动反应倾向（如行为抑制性），人格是其受经验塑造后的发展结果。卡根研究发现婴儿期抑制性气质可部分预测儿童期的内向与焦虑倾向。�'Temperament is the inborn, biologically based tendency to react emotionally and behaviorally (such as behavioral inhibition), while personality is its experience-shaped developmental outcome. Kagan found that infant inhibited temperament partly predicts later childhood introversion and anxiety.�ans��src��MKagan, J. (1989). 《气质与气质障碍》. 《美国心理学家》44卷.�\Kagan, J. (1989). Temperamental contributions to social behavior. American Psychologist, 44.��id�eca1b5332575�body��%斯旺的“自我验证”理论（Swann, 1983）指出，人有一种让他人按“自己眼中的我”看待自己的需求，哪怕那是负面自我观。可预测的理解比被夸更让人安心，所以低自尊者有时排斥盲目赞美、靠近会印证其自我形象的关系。�%Swann's self-verification theory (1983) says we need others to see us as we see ourselves, even when that self-view is negative. Predictable understanding feels safer than flattery, so low-self-esteem people may reject blind praise and drift toward relationships that confirm their self-image.�ans��src��hSwann, W.B. (1983)《自我验证动机》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 45(6):1213-1221�fSwann, W.B. (1983). Self-verification. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 45(6), 1213-1221.��id�edc8c844d3f8�body��	心理防御机制是自我用来无意识地减少焦虑的方式，常见类型包括压抑、投射、合理化、否认与升华等。弗洛伊德在 19 世纪末提出这一概念，其女儿 Anna Freud 于 1936 年系统整理成《自我与防御机制》。�6Defense mechanisms are unconscious strategies the ego uses to reduce anxiety, including repression, projection, rationalization, denial, and sublimation. Sigmund Freud introduced the concept in the late 19th century, and Anna Freud systematically cataloged them in The Ego and the Mechanisms of Defence (1936).�ans��src��MAnna Freud《自我与防御机制》（1936）；Funder《人格心理学》�XAnna Freud, The Ego and the Mechanisms of Defence (1936); Funder, The Personality Puzzle��id�ede648859375�body��d安斯沃思设计的标准程序让一岁左右的婴儿在实验室经历母亲离开与返回，观察重点是重聚时的行为而非分离时的哭闹程度。安全型婴儿会主动寻求安抚并较快恢复探索，回避型表现出对母亲的忽视，矛盾型难以被安抚并交替出现依附与反抗，后来又补充了行为混乱的混乱型。跨文化研究发现三类比例存在系统差异，例如日本样本矛盾型偏多、德国样本回避型偏多，且分类会随家庭压力和照护变化而改变，说明它反映的是关系模式而不是婴儿固有的人格特质。�Ainsworth's standardised procedure exposes infants around one year old to a mother's departures and returns in the laboratory, with classification hinging on reunion behaviour rather than how much the baby cried during separation. Secure infants seek comfort and resume exploring fairly quickly, avoidant infants appear to ignore the caregiver, resistant infants are hard to soothe and alternate clinging with anger, and a disorganised category was later added for contradictory behaviour. Cross-cultural work finds systematic differences in the distribution — more resistant classifications in Japanese samples, more avoidant in German ones — and classifications shift with family stress and changes in care, indicating a relationship pattern rather than a fixed infant trait.�ans��src�هAinsworth 等《Patterns of Attachment》（1978）；van IJzendoorn 与 Kroonenberg（1988）《Child Development》跨文化元分析هAinsworth et al., Patterns of Attachment (1978); van IJzendoorn and Kroonenberg (1988), Child Development, cross-cultural meta-analysis��id�edec6565874d�body��P给情绪命名（“我现在很委屈”“我有点害怕”）会激活前额叶，帮助“降温”杏仁核的报警反应，让情绪强度下降，这称为“情感标记”。把混乱的经历写成有条理的故事，还能让人感到更可控。日记、和信任的人聊聊，都是科学支持的有效调节方式。�xNaming an emotion (“I feel hurt,” “I'm scared”) activates the prefrontal cortex and helps cool the amygdala's alarm response, reducing emotional intensity — a process called affect labeling. Turning messy experience into a structured narrative also restores a sense of control. Journaling and talking to a trusted person are both scientifically supported strategies.�ans��src��$APA（情绪标记与情绪调节）�,APA (affect labeling and emotion regulation)��id�f0600bf18acc�body���当行为与自己态度冲突时，人会感到不适，便通过改变态度或合理化行为来减少失调。经典实验中，仅得 1 美元（而非 20 美元）去谎称任务有趣者反而更真心喜欢该任务。�6When behavior conflicts with one's attitude, the resulting discomfort is reduced by changing the attitude or rationalizing the behavior. In the classic study, those paid only one dollar (versus twenty) to falsely call a task fun later liked it more, because insufficient justification prompted attitude change.�ans��src��vFestinger, L. & Carlsmith, J. M. (1959). 《强迫顺从的认知后果》. 《异常与社会心理学杂志》58卷.�_Festinger, L. & Carlsmith, J. M. (1959). Cognitive consequences of forced compliance. JASP, 58.��id�f11166779bce�body���OCD 由反复出现、不受控制的侵入性想法（强迫思维）和为了缓解焦虑而反复执行的仪式化行为（强迫行为）组成。患者通常知道这些想法不合理却难以停止。��OCD consists of recurring, uncontrolled intrusive thoughts (obsessions) and repetitive ritualistic acts (compulsions) performed to relieve anxiety. Sufferers usually recognize the thoughts as irrational yet find them hard to stop.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�f2df6643cb43�body���职业倦怠不是“懒”或“不上进”，而是长期工作压力下的综合反应：情绪耗竭（累到心空）、去人格化（对服务对象越来越冷漠）、成就感下降。常见压力源有过载、缺乏控制、不公平和缺少支持。恢复需要调整负荷、找回自主感、保证睡眠和休息；若持续严重影响生活，寻求专业帮助是明智的选择。��Burnout isn't laziness — it's the accumulated result of chronic work stress: emotional exhaustion (running on empty), depersonalization (growing distant from the people you serve), and reduced accomplishment. Typical drivers include overload, low control, unfairness, and scarce support. Recovery involves adjusting load, restoring autonomy, and protecting sleep and rest; if it persistently disrupts life, seeking professional help is wise.�ans��src��APA（职业倦怠研究）�APA (job burnout research)��id�f2e362876aa7�body���暴露疗法让来访者在安全环境下反复接触引发恐惧的刺激，利用习惯化与消退学习使恐惧反应逐渐降低，并打破通过回避维持焦虑的循环。它常用于恐惧症、PTSD 与强迫症。��Exposure therapy repeatedly presents fear-eliciting cues in a safe setting, relying on habituation and extinction learning to reduce fear responses and break the avoidance cycle that maintains anxiety. It is widely used for phobias, PTSD, and OCD.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�f4f9ba0d53a3�body��I系统一指快速、并行、几乎不耗费主观努力的直觉加工，负责识别面孔、理解母语、对危险作出即时反应；系统二则是缓慢、串行、需要注意资源的受控加工，用于逻辑推理、复杂计算和自我监控。卡尼曼强调多数判断由系统一给出，系统二往往只是事后为直觉寻找理由，因而偏差得以保留。局限在于两个系统更像描述性隐喻而非解剖意义上的独立模块，实证上难以清晰划界，近年研究更倾向用加工特征的连续维度而不是二分标签来刻画。��System 1 denotes fast, parallel, effortless intuitive processing that recognises faces, comprehends one's native language, and reacts instantly to threat, while System 2 is slow, serial, attention-demanding controlled processing used for logical reasoning, deliberate computation, and self-monitoring. Kahneman stressed that most judgements originate in System 1, with System 2 often merely supplying after-the-fact justifications, which is how biases survive. The limitation is that the two systems function as descriptive metaphors rather than anatomically separate modules, the boundary is hard to draw empirically, and recent work prefers continuous dimensions of processing over a binary label.�ans��src�٬Kahneman《思考，快与慢》(2011)；Evans 与 Stanovich(2013)《双系统推理理论》,《认知科学趋势》(Trends in Cognitive Sciences)第17卷第10期,471-481٣Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow (2011); Evans, K. E., & Stanovich, K. E. (2013). Dual-Systems Theory of Reasoning. Trends in Cognitive Sciences, 17(10), 471-481.��id�f585aefa037c�body��"鸡尾酒会效应指人在喧闹环境中仍能专注于某一对话，却能在听到自己名字等显著性刺激时迅速转移注意。它由 Cherry 于 1953 年通过双耳分听实验发现，说明注意具有选择性，且对与自我相关的信息存在“泄漏”式加工。�;The cocktail party effect is the ability to focus on one conversation in a noisy setting while still detecting salient stimuli such as one's own name. Cherry discovered it in 1953 via dichotic listening experiments, showing that attention is selective and allows “leaky” processing of self-relevant information.�ans��src��tCherry 1953 年论文（载 Journal of the Acoustical Society of America）；Eysenck 与 Keane《认知心理学》�dCherry (1953) in Journal of the Acoustical Society of America; Eysenck & Keane, Cognitive Psychology��id�f59d9d99ed1a�body��米尔格拉姆在 1961–1963 年的实验中让参与者在“权威”指令下对“学习者”施加渐增电击，约 65% 的人服从到最高 450 伏。实验表明普通人会在权威命令下做出违背良心的伤害行为，引发关于伦理与服从的深远讨论。�:In experiments from 1961–1963, Milgram had participants administer escalating shocks to a “learner” under an authority's orders; about 65% complied to the maximum 450 volts. The study showed ordinary people may commit harmful acts under authoritative command, sparking lasting debate on ethics and obedience.�ans��src��fMilgram 1963 年论文（载 Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology）；Myers《社会心理学》�UMilgram (1963) in Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology; Myers, Social Psychology��id�f68b82f11931�body��
工作记忆模型由 Baddeley 与 Hitch 于 1974 年提出，认为短期记忆并非单一储存，而是包含中央执行系统、语音回路和视空间模板三个核心成分。后续修订又加入情景缓冲器，用于整合来自各子系统的信息。�"Proposed by Baddeley and Hitch in 1974, the working memory model holds that short-term memory is not a single store but comprises a central executive, a phonological loop, and a visuospatial sketchpad. A later revision added the episodic buffer to integrate information from the subsystems.�ans��src�وBaddeley 与 Hitch 1974 年论文（载 Psychology of Learning and Motivation）及 Baddeley《工作记忆》（Working Memory, 1986）�aBaddeley & Hitch (1974) in Psychology of Learning and Motivation; Baddeley, Working Memory (1986)��id�f6aa1cf85771�body��D大脑在儿童期对语言音素和语法格外敏感，能自然地吸收周围的语言规律，这一敏感期通常在青春期前逐渐收窄。成年人有更好的记忆和学习策略，但在口音和语法的自然习得上常居下风。这解释了很多双语家庭里“孩子成了主力翻译”的现象。�ZDuring childhood the brain is especially sensitive to speech sounds and grammar, absorbing patterns of surrounding languages naturally; this sensitive window narrows around puberty. Adults bring better memory and study strategies but often lag in naturally acquiring accents and grammar. That's why kids often become the family's main translator.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（语言与思维章）�<Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), language and thought chapter��id�f7d65f1b0533�body��X研究一致发现分散复习优于集中复习，且最佳间隔与目标保持期大致成比例：若希望一个月后仍记得，复习间隔安排在数天量级效果最好；若目标是一年后，间隔可拉长到数周。机制上主要有两类解释，一是编码变异性，不同时间的情境线索各异，为记忆提供更多检索路径；二是学习难度假说，间隔后记忆已部分衰退，重新检索所需努力更大，因而巩固更牢。艾宾浩斯的遗忘曲线提供了最早的量化基础，现代间隔重复软件正是这一原理的工程化实现。��Studies consistently show distributed review beats massed review, and the optimal gap scales roughly with the retention interval you care about: to remember something a month later, gaps of a few days work best, while a one-year goal favours gaps of weeks. Two mechanisms are usually invoked: encoding variability, since different sessions supply different contextual cues and thus more retrieval routes, and study-phase difficulty, since a partly faded memory demands more effortful retrieval that consolidates it more firmly. Ebbinghaus's forgetting curve supplied the first quantitative basis, and modern spaced-repetition software is that principle turned into engineering.�ans��src��wCepeda 等（2006）《Psychological Bulletin》分散练习元分析；Ebbinghaus《Über das Gedächtnis》（1885）ٙCepeda et al. (2006), Psychological Bulletin, meta-analysis of distributed practice; Ebbinghaus, Memory: A Contribution to Experimental Psychology (1885)��id�f9bf262bd4c7�body���米勒在1956年提出，人短时记忆可同时保持约5到9个独立信息块。这一发现奠定了工作记忆研究的基础，不过现代研究认为真实容量更接近4个左右。��Miller proposed in 1956 that short-term memory holds about 5 to 9 separate chunks of information. The finding laid the groundwork for working-memory research, though modern estimates put the true capacity closer to around 4.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fb13c95b87ed�body��PTSD 在经历或目睹极端威胁事件后出现，核心为反复闯入的创伤记忆、主动回避相关线索、警觉增高与负性认知改变。症状持续超一个月且影响生活才可诊断。创伤未必只来自战场，事故、暴力均可引发。�PTSD follows experiencing or witnessing an extreme threat, with intrusive trauma memories, active avoidance of cues, hyper-arousal, and negative beliefs. It is diagnosed when symptoms last over a month and impair life. Trauma is not only combat; accidents and violence also trigger it.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�fc000d1c50dd�body���埃克曼认为存在跨文化普遍的基本情绪：快乐、悲伤、恐惧、愤怒、惊讶和厌恶（有时加上轻蔑）。它们都有独特的面部表情，婴儿期即可辨认。��Ekman argued for universal basic emotions—happiness, sadness, fear, anger, surprise, and disgust (sometimes adding contempt)—each with a distinct facial expression recognizable even in infancy.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fc0ac27dc288�body��P理解话语不只是解码字面意思，还要依靠语境、语气和双方共有的背景知识（“共同基础”）。一句话在“它指什么”和“说者想表达什么”之间有很多层，双方预设不同，理解就会分叉。沟通中的很多误解不是“没听清”，而是彼此的默认前提不一样。�aUnderstanding speech goes beyond decoding literal meaning; it relies on context, tone, and shared background knowledge (“common ground”). A sentence carries meaning at several levels, and when speakers and listeners hold different assumptions, interpretation splits. Many misunderstandings aren't about hearing — they're about mismatched defaults.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（语言与思维章）�<Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), language and thought chapter��id�psy_19_001�body��高神经质者对负性刺激的情绪阈值偏低,轻微挫折即可引发较强且消退缓慢的焦虑与烦躁。他们更多依赖反刍、担忧等情绪聚焦策略,而非直接着手解决问题。该特质呈连续分布,高分本身并不等同于临床意义上的障碍。�qPeople high in neuroticism have a lower threshold for negative stimuli, so minor setbacks trigger anxiety and irritability that are intense and slow to fade. They lean on emotion-focused strategies such as rumination and worry instead of tackling problems directly. The trait is continuously distributed, and a high score by itself does not amount to clinical disorder.�ans��src��fBolger与Schilling,Personality and the problems of everyday life,Journal of Personality 59卷3期,1991��Bolger, N., & Schilling, E. A. (1991). Personality and the problems of everyday life: The role of neuroticism in exposure and reactivity to daily stressors. Journal of Personality, 59(3), 355-386.��id�psy_19_004�body��K精神分析取向把症状视为童年冲突与潜意识愿望的象征性表达,治疗围绕领悟、移情与防御的分析展开。CBT 主张症状由当下的认知歪曲和习得性行为模式维持,干预直接指向自动化思维与回避行为。一方回溯历史根源,另一方检验并改写现时的维持机制。��Psychoanalytic approaches read symptoms as symbolic expressions of childhood conflict and unconscious wishes, with treatment organized around insight, transference, and the analysis of defenses. CBT holds that symptoms persist through current cognitive distortions and learned behavior patterns, so intervention targets automatic thoughts and avoidance head-on. One tradition excavates historical roots; the other tests and rewrites present-day maintaining mechanisms.�ans��src��ZBeck 1976 年《认知疗法与情绪障碍》,Breuer 与 Freud 1895 年《癔症研究》�fBeck, Cognitive Therapy and the Emotional Disorders (1976); Breuer & Freud, Studies on Hysteria (1895)��id�psy_19_007�body��Y心流一般出现在目标明确、反馈即时、且个人技能与任务要求大体相称的活动之中。当挑战远超技能时人感到焦虑,技能远超挑战时则滑向无聊,唯有两者的动态平衡能让注意力完全融入当前动作。经验取样法的研究还观察到,心流伴随时间感扭曲与内在动机上升。��Flow tends to arise in activities with clear goals, immediate feedback, and a rough balance between personal skill and task demand. Challenges far beyond skill breed anxiety, while skill far beyond challenge slides into boredom, and only their dynamic equilibrium lets attention fuse completely with ongoing action. Experience-sampling studies add that flow comes with warped time perception and rising intrinsic motivation.�ans��src��sCsikszentmihalyi 1990 年《心流:最优体验心理学》,及其与 Larson 1987 年关于经验取样法的论文ٌCsikszentmihalyi, Flow: The Psychology of Optimal Experience (1990); Csikszentmihalyi & Larson (1987), experience-sampling methodology paper��id�psy_19_010�body���IAT 借助相容与不相容配对之间反应时的差值来推断自动化联结强度,被广泛用于考察刻板印象与内隐态度。质疑集中于三点:其分数与外显态度相关偏弱且受任务顺序影响,个体内的重测稳定性有限,并且它难以区分个人真实信念与环境中弥漫的社会知识。不少研究者据此主张把它当作情境敏感的指标,而非稳定的个体特质来使用。�The IAT infers automatic associative strength from response-time gaps between compatible and incompatible pairings and is widely deployed to probe stereotypes and implicit attitudes. Objections cluster around three points: scores correlate weakly with explicit attitudes and shift with task order, within-person retest stability is limited, and the measure struggles to separate private belief from socially pervasive knowledge. Many researchers accordingly urge treating it as a context-sensitive index rather than a fixed trait.�ans��src��|Greenwald 等 1998 年发表于《人格与社会心理学杂志》的 IAT 方法论文,Gawronski 2019 年的方法学评述قGreenwald et al. (1998), IAT methods paper in Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Gawronski (2019) methodological review��id�psy_19_011�body��\拉塔内等人将社会惰化归因于个体贡献不可辨识所引发的责任分散:当产出以群体合计呈现时,个人努力与结果之间的联系被稀释,搭便车便成了低成本选择。后续实验表明,只要让每个人的成绩可被单独识别,或任务本身具有挑战性与个人意义,惰化幅度就会显著缩小。��Latané and colleagues attributed social loafing to diffusion of responsibility arising when individual contributions cannot be identified: once output is pooled at the group level, the link between personal effort and outcome is diluted, making free riding a low-cost option. Follow-up experiments showed that loafing shrinks markedly when each person's performance is individually identifiable, or when the task itself is challenging and personally meaningful.�ans��src�ٗLatané、Williams 与 Harkins(1979),《人手众多,出力变轻:社会惰化的成因与后果》,《人格与社会心理学杂志》第37卷第6期ٴLatané, B., Williams, K., & Harkins, S. (1979). Many hands make light the work: The causes and consequences of social loafing. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 37(6).��id�psy_19_014�body��斯坦伯格的双系统模型指出,青春期早中期负责奖赏加工的社会情绪系统会在同伴情境下被强烈激活,而前额叶的认知控制系统要等到二十岁出头才发育成熟,两个系统的不同步造成了“油门先于刹车”的失衡。驾驶模拟等实验显示,同伴在场会放大奖赏敏感性,而独处时这种失衡相当轻微,因此冒险高峰集中于同伴在场的高唤起情境。该模型把青少年冒险从“无知或纯粹冲动”重构为特定情境下的调节失灵。��Steinberg's dual systems model holds that the socioemotional system processing reward is strongly activated by peer contexts in early-to-mid adolescence, whereas the prefrontal cognitive control system matures only into the early twenties, producing an imbalance in which the accelerator arrives before the brakes. Driving-simulation experiments show that peer presence amplifies reward sensitivity while the imbalance stays slight when adolescents are alone, so risk-taking peaks in arousing peer-present settings. The model thereby reframes adolescent risk-taking as context-specific regulatory failure rather than sheer ignorance or impulsivity.�ans��src��bSteinberg(2008),《青少年冒险的社会神经科学视角》,《发展评论》第28卷第1期�oSteinberg, L. (2008). A social neuroscience perspective on adolescent risk-taking. Developmental Review, 28(1).��id�psy_19_017�body���后来的研究意识到,低相关有一部分来自效标聚合不足:爱泼斯坦证明把多个情境下的行为加以平均后,特质与行为的相关可以翻倍以上。真正的出路则是“如果-那么”式行为签名——个体拥有稳定的情境-行为对应模式,却不等于在一切场合都以相同方式行事。人格研究由此从追问“特质能否预测行为”转向刻画“谁在何种情境下如何起伏”。��Later work realized that part of the low correlation stemmed from insufficient aggregation of criteria: Epstein demonstrated that averaging behavior across occasions more than doubled trait-behavior correlations. The genuine resolution lay in if-then behavioral signatures—individuals carry stable situation-behavior contingencies without behaving identically everywhere. Research accordingly turned from asking whether traits predict behavior to charting who fluctuates in what way across which contexts.�ans��src��fMischel 与 Shoda(1995),《人格的认知-情感系统理论》,《心理学评论》第102卷第2期�rMischel, W., & Shoda, Y. (1995). A cognitive-affective system theory of personality. Psychological Review, 102(2).��id�psy_20_001�body���该理论由伯纳德·巴尔斯提出,认为脑内存在一个容量有限的全局工作区,进入其中的信息会被广播到众多专门化加工模块。无意识加工是并行且模块化的,而意识通达的标志正是这种串行、面向全脑的广播过程。德阿纳等人随后用fMRI与颅内记录提供支持:意识知觉伴随着顶额网络呈'点燃'式的激活放大。��Proposed by Bernard Baars, the theory holds that the brain contains a capacity-limited global workspace whose contents are broadcast widely to many specialized modules. Unconscious processing runs in parallel and modularly; what marks conscious access is this serial, brain-wide broadcast. Dehaene and colleagues later supported it with fMRI and intracranial recordings showing an 'ignition'-like amplification across frontoparietal networks during conscious perception.�ans��src��_Baars《A Cognitive Theory of Consciousness》(1988); Dehaene & Changeux《Neuron》70卷(2011)�WBaars, A Cognitive Theory of Consciousness (1988); Dehaene & Changeux, Neuron 70 (2011)��id�psy_20_004�body���迈耶以及后来的休伦认为,音乐情绪很大程度上源于听者对后续音响的预测:旋律偏离已习得的音阶统计规律时制造张力,而向主音解决则带来释放感。休伦的ITPRA框架进一步把反应拆解为想象、张力反应与预测评估等阶段,说明恰到好处的意外为何比完全可预测或彻底混乱的序列更打动人。脑成像研究亦发现,音乐的惊喜时刻伴随伏隔核的多巴胺能活动。�"Leonard Meyer, and later David Huron, argue that musical emotion largely arises from listeners' predictions: melodic deviation from learned scale statistics builds tension, while resolution toward the tonic delivers release. Huron's ITPRA framework decomposes the response into imagination, tension reaction, and predictive appraisal stages, explaining why a well-placed surprise moves us more than wholly predictable or chaotic sequences. Neuroimaging likewise finds dopaminergic activity in the nucleus accumbens at moments of musical surprise.�ans��src��`Meyer《Emotion and Meaning in Music》(1956); Salimpoor 等《Nature Neuroscience》14卷(2011)�[Meyer, Emotion and Meaning in Music (1956); Salimpoor et al., Nature Neuroscience 14 (2011)��id�psy_20_010�body���Mednick 主张有创造力的人其语义网络的层级组织更扁平,远隔概念更容易被同时激活,RAT 正是把这种能力操作化:例如由“茅屋、瑞士、蛋糕”想到“奶酪”。RAT 得分与顿悟型问题解决及部分现实创造性成就相关,但它测的是朝向唯一答案的聚合式提取,与发散思维测验所测的观念流畅性并不相同。因此它是联想机制的有效指标,却不足以覆盖创造力的全部成分。�1Mednick argued that creative individuals organize semantic hierarchies flatter, letting distant concepts co-activate more readily, and the RAT operationalizes exactly this ability, as when cottage, Swiss, and cake yield cheese. RAT scores correlate with insight problem solving and some real-world creative achievement, yet the test taps convergent retrieval toward a single answer, distinct from the ideational fluency measured by divergent-thinking tests. It is therefore a valid index of associative mechanisms but cannot cover every component of creativity.�ans��src��nMednick,《The associative basis of the creative process.》,Psychological Review,1962 (DOI: 10.1037/h0048850)�lMednick, 'The associative basis of the creative process.', Psychological Review, 1962, DOI: 10.1037/h0048850��id�psy_20_011�body��|海特的社会直觉主义模型认为,快速的情绪性直觉直接产生道德判断,而推理主要在事后为已定的结论辩护。'道德失声'实验提供了关键证据:面对并无实际伤害的禁忌情境,被试坚称行为是错的却给不出站得住脚的理由。可见理性论证更像律师而非法官,主要用于说服他人,而非形成判断本身。��Haidt's social intuitionist model holds that fast affective intuitions produce moral judgments directly, while reasoning mainly serves as post hoc advocacy for conclusions already reached. Studies of 'moral dumbfounding' supply key evidence: faced with harmless taboo scenarios, participants insist the act is wrong yet cannot give any defensible justification. Reasoning thus behaves more like a lawyer than a judge, built to persuade others rather than to form the judgment itself.�ans��src�ٕHaidt, J. (2001). The emotional dog and its rational tail: A social intuitionist approach to moral judgment. Psychological Review, 108(4), 814–834.ٕHaidt, J. (2001). The emotional dog and its rational tail: A social intuitionist approach to moral judgment. Psychological Review, 108(4), 814–834.��id�psy_20_014�body���格雷戈里的经典解释是深度线索的误用:箭羽向外张开的线段近似远处墙壁的内凹角,视觉系统据此放大对其长度的估计;箭羽向内收拢的线段则被当作近处的凸角而缩小估计。跨文化研究支持其中的习得成分——在几乎缺少直线与直角建筑环境的族群中,对此类几何错觉的敏感度明显更低。不过侧向抑制等纯视网膜层面的机制也能解释部分效应,因此单一成因至今未有定论。�?Gregory's classic account invokes misapplied size constancy: a line with outward-pointing fins resembles the concave inner corner of a far wall, so the visual system scales its length up, while inward-pointing fins are read as a near convex edge and scaled down. Cross-cultural research supports a learned component—groups raised in environments nearly devoid of straight lines and right angles show markedly lower susceptibility to geometric illusions. Yet retinal-level mechanisms such as lateral inhibition also explain part of the effect, so no single cause is settled.�ans��src��Segall, M. H., Campbell, D. T., & Herskovits, M. J. (1966). Cultural differences in the perception of geometric illusions. Science, 151(3713), 1015–1021; Gregory, R. L. (1968). Perceptual illusions and brain models. Proceedings of the Royal Society B, 171(1024), 279–296.�Segall, M. H., Campbell, D. T., & Herskovits, M. J. (1966). Cultural differences in the perception of geometric illusions. Science, 151(3713), 1015–1021; Gregory, R. L. (1968). Perceptual illusions and brain models. Proceedings of the Royal Society B, 171(1024), 279–296.��id�psy_21_001�body��持续的压力刺激使HPA轴反复激活,皮质醇水平长期偏高,从而抑制免疫细胞活性并升高血压。对照实验进一步发现,高应激志愿者在暴露于感冒病毒后的发病率显著更高,说明心理应激能够转化为可测量的躯体后果。�Sustained stress repeatedly activates the HPA axis, keeping cortisol chronically elevated, which suppresses immune-cell activity and raises blood pressure. Controlled experiments further found that highly stressed volunteers developed markedly higher infection rates after exposure to common-cold viruses, showing that psychological stress translates into measurable bodily outcomes.�ans��src��uCohen, Tyrrell & Smith (1991), 心理应激与普通感冒易感性, New England Journal of Medicine, 325(9): 606-612يCohen, Tyrrell & Smith (1991), Psychological Stress and Susceptibility to the Common Cold, New England Journal of Medicine 325(9): 606-612��id�psy_21_004�body��0脑成像研究表明,目睹他人疼痛会选择性激活自身痛觉网络中的情感成分,主要是前扣带回与前岛叶,而初级体感皮层保持相对安静。这种共享的情感表征让旁观者产生替代性不适,也为安慰、帮助等亲社会行为提供了直接的内在动机。��Brain-imaging studies show that witnessing another person's pain selectively engages the affective component of one's own pain network, chiefly the anterior cingulate cortex and anterior insula, while primary somatosensory cortex stays relatively quiet. This shared affective representation generates vicarious discomfort in observers and supplies intrinsic motivation for prosocial acts such as comforting and helping.�ans��src�ٞSinger, Seymour, O'Doherty, Kaube,《Empathy for Pain Involves the Affective but not Sensory Components of Pain》,Science,2004 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1093535)ٜSinger, Seymour, O'Doherty, Kaube, 'Empathy for Pain Involves the Affective but not Sensory Components of Pain', Science, 2004, DOI: 10.1126/science.1093535��id�psy_21_007�body��i该模型把社区感定义为成员的归属体验以及对群体的共同情感联结,包含四个成分:成员资格、影响力(个体影响群体也被群体影响)、需求整合与满足、共享的情感连接。后来的社区感指数量表正是按这四维度编制。该框架至今仍是评估街区凝聚力与设计社区干预的主流工具。��The model defines sense of community as members' feeling of belonging and shared emotional connection to the group, comprising membership, influence (individuals shape the group and are shaped by it), integration and fulfillment of needs, and shared emotional connection. The Sense of Community Index was later built directly on these four dimensions. The framework remains the dominant tool for assessing neighborhood cohesion and designing community interventions.�ans��src��fMcMillan & Chavis (1986), Sense of Community: A Definition and Theory, Journal of Community Psychology�hMcMillan & Chavis (1986), "Sense of Community: A Definition and Theory," Journal of Community Psychology��id�psy_21_011�body���梦境的视觉体验来自快速眼动睡眠期间视觉皮层被内部信号自上而下激活，此时外界输入已被脑干阻断，大脑便用内生信号生成画面。醒来后记不住，是因为该阶段背外侧前额叶活动受到抑制，工作记忆与情景编码能力大幅下降；同时较低的去甲肾上腺素水平也不利于把梦固化成长期记忆。所以梦通常在醒后几分钟内迅速消退。��Dream imagery arises when the visual cortex is activated top-down by internal signals during REM sleep, after external input has been gated off by the brainstem. Recall fails because dorsolateral prefrontal activity is suppressed at this stage, crippling working memory and episodic encoding, while low noradrenaline levels hinder consolidating dreams into long-term memory. That is why dreams typically dissolve within minutes of waking.�ans��src�ٙHobson, Pace-Schott & Stickgold《Consciousness and Cognition》论文 Dreaming and the brain: toward a cognitive neuroscience of conscious states (2000)ْHobson, Pace-Schott & Stickgold, "Dreaming and the brain: toward a cognitive neuroscience of conscious states", Consciousness and Cognition (2000)��id�psy_21_017�body��a健康信念模型的核心变量包括感知易感性、感知严重性、感知益处、感知障碍以及触发行动的线索。该模型预测,当个体估计疾病威胁较大且行动收益超过成本时,更可能去接种疫苗或参加筛查。后来补充的自我效能成分进一步解释了人们能否启动并维持这些行为改变。��The core variables of the Health Belief Model are perceived susceptibility, perceived severity, perceived benefits, perceived barriers, and cues to action. It predicts that people are more likely to get vaccinated or attend screening when they judge the disease threat to be sizable and the benefits of acting to outweigh the costs. A later addition of self-efficacy further explains whether people can initiate and maintain such changes.�ans��src��bRosenstock (1974), Historical origins of the Health Belief Model,《Health Education Monographs》�]Rosenstock (1974), Historical Origins of the Health Belief Model, Health Education Monographs��id�psy_22_001�body���守恒指理解物体的数量或体积不随外形改变而变化。前运算阶段幼儿受知觉外观支配（中心化），只关注单一维度，看到液面升高便判断水变多了；他们又缺乏可逆性思维，无法在心中撤销倾倒动作。约七岁进入具体运算阶段后，儿童能同时协调两个维度并在心里逆转操作，才真正稳定地掌握守恒。��Conservation is the insight that quantity stays unchanged when appearance changes. Preoperational preschoolers are dominated by looks—centration on a single dimension—so a rising liquid level means “more” water. They also lack reversible thinking and cannot mentally undo the pouring. Only around age seven, in the concrete-operational stage, do children coordinate both dimensions and reverse the operation in their head, thereby mastering conservation.�ans��src��u皮亚杰《儿童的数概念》（Piaget, J., 1952 英译本，Routledge & Kegan Paul）及其中液体守恒任务�vPiaget, J. (1952). The Child's Conception of Number. London: Routledge & Kegan Paul (classic liquid-conservation task)��id�psy_22_007�body���认知访谈依据编码特异性原则：提取线索与当初编码情境越匹配，回忆越成功。访谈者引导证人重建案发时的物理与心理情境，鼓励按不同顺序或从不同视角多次回忆，为记忆痕迹开辟多条提取通路；同时禁用诱导性提问，避免向证人植入错误信息。元分析表明它能显著增加正确回忆的细节，而错误细节仅轻微增多，现已成为多国警方询问证人的标准技术。�7The cognitive interview builds on encoding specificity: retrieval succeeds when cues match those present at encoding. Interviewers guide witnesses to reinstate the physical and mental context of the scene and to recall events several times in different orders or perspectives, opening multiple routes into the memory trace, while leading questions are banned so that misleading information is never planted. Meta-analyses show large increases in correct details with only small rises in errors, and the technique has become standard police practice in many countries.�ans��src�يKöhnken, G., Milne, B., Memon, A. & Bull, R.（1999），《心理学、犯罪与法律》5(1–2)，3–27：认知访谈效果元分析نKöhnken, G., Milne, B., Memon, A., & Bull, R. (1999). The cognitive interview: A meta-analysis. Psychology, Crime & Law, 5(1-2), 3-27��id�psy_22_010�body���Saffran 等人让8个月大的婴儿聆听约两分钟无停顿的人造语言音节流，再用听觉偏好程序测试：婴儿听词内音节组合的时间明显短于跨越词边界的组合。原因在于音节间的过渡概率在词内较高、在词边界处骤降，婴儿对这一统计规律敏感，据此把连续语音切成可能的单词。这说明统计学习是语言习得早期即可利用的机制。�?Saffran and colleagues had eight-month-old infants listen for about two minutes to an artificial language delivered without pauses, then tested them with a listening-preference procedure: infants attended less to syllable sequences that formed words than to sequences spanning word boundaries. Transitional probabilities between syllables are high within words and drop sharply at boundaries, and infants track this statistic to carve continuous speech into candidate words. The finding established statistical learning as a mechanism available early in language acquisition.�ans��src�هSaffran, J. R., Aslin, R. N. & Newport, E. L.（1996），Science 第274卷第5294期，1926–1928；doi:10.1126/science.274.5294.1926٤Saffran, J. R., Aslin, R. N., & Newport, E. L. (1996). Statistical learning by 8-month-old infants. Science, 274(5294), 1926-1928. doi:10.1126/science.274.5294.1926��id�psy_22_011�body���这就是间隔效应。分散学习迫使大脑在每次重新接触时完成一次成功提取，而提取本身就会重建并巩固记忆痕迹；两次学习之间的部分遗忘也让再次复习比机械重复加工得更深。集中突击当下很流畅，却容易制造“已经掌握”的错觉，几天后遗忘率明显更高。Cepeda等人2006年的大型元分析证实，间隔安排在各种材料上都能稳定提高长期保持量。�This is the spacing effect. Distributed study forces a successful retrieval attempt at every re-exposure, and retrieval itself rebuilds and consolidates the memory trace; partial forgetting between sessions also makes each review deeper than mechanical rereading. Cramming feels fluent yet breeds an illusion of mastery, and retention drops sharply within days. Cepeda and colleagues' 2006 meta-analysis of hundreds of experiments confirmed that spaced schedules reliably improve long-term retention across many kinds of material.�ans��src�٢Cepeda, Pashler, Vul, Wixted & Rohrer（2006），《心理学通报》132(3)，354–380：分散练习的综述与定量合成；doi:10.1037/0033-2909.132.3.354��Cepeda, N. J., Pashler, H., Vul, E., Wixted, J. T., & Rohrer, D. (2006). Distributed practice in verbal recall tasks: A review and quantitative synthesis. Psychological Bulletin, 132(3), 354-380. doi:10.1037/0033-2909.132.3.354��id�psy_22_014�body���显性监控理论认为，压力促使运动员把注意力转向本已程序化的动作步骤，有意识的语言式控制干扰了自动化的运动程序；分心理论则主张，焦虑引发的担忧念头挤占了工作记忆资源，使执行所需的信息难以维持。Beilock与Carr 2001年的实验区分了两类任务：高度程序化的技能最怕自我聚焦，而依赖费力规则的技能反而受益于刻意关注。�,Explicit-monitoring theory holds that pressure pushes performers to attend consciously to step-by-step control of movements that are already proceduralized, and this deliberate verbal control disrupts the smooth, automated motor program. Distraction theory argues instead that anxiety-driven worry consumes the working-memory resources execution needs. In Beilock and Carr's 2001 experiments the accounts came apart: highly proceduralized skills suffered most under self-focus, whereas tasks governed by effortful rules benefited from deliberate attention.�ans��src��pBeilock & Carr（2001），《实验心理学杂志：应用》7(3)，161–180：技能表现脆弱性研究；ٯBeilock, S. L., & Carr, T. H. (2001). On the fragility of skilled performance: What governs choking under pressure? Journal of Experimental Psychology: Applied, 7(3), 161-180.��id�psy_23_001�body���该理论认为，随年龄增长的中枢神经系统传导减慢是认知老化的基础机制。加工速度下降会限制单位时间内可完成的认知操作数量，并削弱同时保持多份信息的能力，从而间接拉低推理、工作记忆等复杂任务的成绩。大量研究发现速度指标能中介大部分年龄差异，提示干预应注重效率训练与健康生活方式，而非仅针对单一任务反复练习。�GProcessing-speed theory holds that age-related slowing in the central nervous system is a foundational mechanism of cognitive aging. Slower processing limits how many mental operations can be completed in a given time and weakens the capacity to keep several pieces of information concurrently available, indirectly lowering performance on complex tasks such as reasoning and working memory. Because speed measures mediate much of the age variance in large studies, interventions should target processing efficiency and healthy lifestyles rather than rote repetition of single tasks.�ans��src�ّSalthouse, T. A. (1996). 成人认知年龄差异的加工速度理论. Psychological Review, 103(3), 403–428. DOI: 10.1037/0033-295X.103.3.403٥Salthouse, T. A. (1996). The processing-speed theory of adult age differences in cognition. Psychological Review, 103(3), 403–428. DOI: 10.1037/0033-295X.103.3.403��id�psy_23_010�body���Tajfel等人按近乎无意义的标准（如偏好克利或康定斯基的画作）把被试随机分组，再让其在匿名成员之间分配金钱。结果显示被试宁可牺牲本群体的绝对收益，也要拉大内外群体的相对差距，即最大差别策略。可见群际偏倚并不需要现实利益冲突或交往历史，分类本身经由社会认同和对积极独特性的追求即可发挥作用。��Tajfel and colleagues randomly grouped participants by nearly meaningless criteria—such as preferring Klee or Kandinsky paintings—then had them allocate money among anonymous members. Participants sacrificed absolute gains for their own group to widen the relative gap between groups, the maximal difference strategy. Intergroup bias thus requires neither real conflict nor a history of interaction: categorization alone operates through social identity and the pursuit of positive distinctiveness.�ans��src�٧Tajfel、Billig、Bundy 与 Flament 的实验论文 Social Categorization and Intergroup Behaviour，European Journal of Social Psychology，1971，1(2)，149–178。٫Tajfel, Billig, Bundy & Flament, "Social Categorization and Intergroup Behaviour", European Journal of Social Psychology, 1971, 1(2), 149-178, doi:10.1002/ejsp.2420010202.��id�psy_24_003�body��H证据指向强大的先天装备。其一,全世界婴儿都在相近月龄经历咿呀学语、单词句、电报句、语法爆发,顺序惊人一致;其二,儿童听到的输入充满省略、口误与未纠正的错误,却总能输出一套规范得多的语法,乔姆斯基据此提出人脑内置普遍语法的语言习得装置假设;其三,关键期证据来自个案与第二语言研究:青春期前沉浸学习可达母语水平,之后学习几乎总带口音与语法残留。当代共识折中为先天的学习偏向加社会互动微调,而非现成的语法硬盘。�dEvidence points to formidable innate equipment. Babies worldwide babble, produce one-word utterances, telegraphic speech then grammar bursts on similar timetables; children hear messy, ungrammatical input with sparse correction yet output far more regular grammar — Chomsky proposed a language acquisition device with universal grammar; and critical-period evidence shows immersion before adolescence reaches native levels while later learning almost always retains accent and residue. Current consensus blends innate learning biases with social-interaction fine-tuning rather than a ready-made grammar module.�ans��src��6Pinker,《The Language Instinct》,William Morrow,1994�6S. Pinker, The Language Instinct, William Morrow, 1994��id�psy_24_008�body��5思路源于词汇学假设:凡重要到被反复用来形容人的差异,都值得收进科学目录。研究者从英语词典近两万个人格描述词出发层层筛选,再经互评与因素分析压缩,不同团队反复得到同样五个因子:开放性、尽责性、外向性、宜人性、神经质(OCEAN);跨语言重复验证使其成为人格测量的事实标准。大五是维度而非类型——每个人都是五个刻度上的连续坐标;它与绩效、健康行为的关联稳定,但相关不等于命运,测量预测的是倾向而非剧本。��The trick was lexical: any individual difference important enough gets encoded as words — the lexical hypothesis. Researchers distilled over ten thousand trait adjectives from dictionaries, had peers rate each other, and factor-analyzed; different labs kept landing on five factors — openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness, neuroticism (OCEAN). Cross-language replication made Big Five the de facto measurement standard. They are dimensions, not types: everyone is continuous coordinates on five scales; statistical ties to job performance and health are robust, but correlation is not destiny — traits predict tendencies, not scripts.�ans��src�ْGoldberg,《An alternative description of personality: the Big-Five factor structure》,Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 第59卷,1990ُL. R. Goldberg, An alternative description of personality: the Big-Five factor structure, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 59, 1990��id�psy_24_011�body��%情绪科学区分两种调节时机:结果聚焦(已经崩溃后深呼吸压抑)与先行聚焦(在选择接触什么上下功夫)。悲伤音乐属于后者中的认知重评路径:它把弥散的痛苦锚定为审美对象,提供被理解感与陪伴感,让情绪获得表达出口而非压抑反弹;研究显示人在反刍状态下偏好匹配当下心境的音乐,适度聆听与情绪改善相关,但长期沉溺会延长抑郁。真正有效的组合是先共情后转向——允许悲伤存在,再逐步引入意义建构与行为激活。�nEmotion science splits regulation timing: response-focused (deep breaths after collapse) versus antecedent-focused (choosing what you engage with). Sad music works through cognitive reappraisal — it anchors diffuse pain into an aesthetic object, offers felt understanding and companionship, and gives emotion expression without suppression rebound. Studies find people in rumination prefer mood-matched music, with moderate listening tied to improvement but chronic immersion prolonging low mood. The working recipe is empathy first, redirection after — let sadness exist, then build meaning and behavioral activation.�ans��src��LGross 主编,《Handbook of Emotion Regulation》第2版,Guilford Press,2014�NJ. J. Gross ed., Handbook of Emotion Regulation, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2014��id�psy_24_013�body��^早期研究曾担忧双语儿童词汇量单项偏低、混语码是混乱征兆;方法学修正后结论反转:总概念词汇量不低于单语者,幼年混用(如一句中英夹杂)恰是双系统在线的标志,多数儿童在学龄前完成语码分离。神经机制上,双语者前额叶与前扣回负责语言切换的执行控制常年加班,带来抑制控制的轻微优势(即著名的双语优势),尽管近年大样本研究对其稳健性提出质疑。确定收益包括老年失语症恢复更佳与痴呆发病平均推迟约四五年——两套系统不是负担,更像终身锻炼。��Early work feared smaller vocabularies and code-mixing as confusion; methodological corrections reversed the verdict: total conceptual vocabulary matches monolinguals, childhood mixing within sentences actually signals both systems online, and most children separate codes before school age. Neural accounts put prefrontal and anterior cingulate control networks on lifelong language-switching duty, once credited as the bilingual advantage in inhibition — though large recent samples question its robustness. Solid findings include better post-stroke aphasia recovery and dementia onset delayed by roughly four to five years. Two systems are not a burden but a lifetime workout.�ans��src��kBialystok 等,《Bilingualism: consequences for mind and brain»,Trends in Cognitive Sciences 第16卷,2012�iE. Bialystok et al., Bilingualism: consequences for mind and brain, Trends in Cognitive Sciences 16, 2012��id�psy_24_015�body��j霍尔1904年的命名并非夸张而是有生理基础:青春期灰质经历先过度生长后大规模修剪的两段式重塑,其中前额叶皮层——负责计划、冲动抑制与权衡后果的区域——要到二十岁中期才髓鞘化完毕;而主管奖赏与情绪的边缘系统早在十几岁就火力全开。油门先到、刹车后装的错配,解释了青少年冒险行为对同伴存在的极端敏感:有人围观时风险决策显著升级。教育启示不是压制而是借力——把规则前置成习惯、给安全的风险出口(体育、竞赛),让未完成的刹车系统少上高速。��Hall coined storm and stress in 1904, and physiology backs him: adolescent gray matter overproduces then massively prunes, with the prefrontal cortex — planning, impulse control, consequence weighing — not fully myelinated until the mid-twenties, while limbic reward circuits fire at full blast during the teens. An accelerator arriving before brakes explains risk-taking hypersensitive to peers: decisions escalate dramatically under audience. The educational takeaway is channeling, not suppressing — front-load rules as habits and offer safe risk outlets like sport and competition so the unfinished braking system stays off highways.�ans��src��_Casey 等,《The adolescent brain》,Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences 第1124卷,2008�_B. J. Casey et al., The adolescent brain, Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences 1124, 2008��id�psy_24_019�body��e卡尼曼与特沃斯基1979年的前景理论用实验揭示:人对损失的敏感度远高于等额收益(1992年累计前景理论的参数估计中损失厌恶系数约为两倍)。这解释了一堆非理性:股市散户死守亏损股不肯止损(卖出等于把账面亏损变成真实损失);商家把运费从总价中拆出另收(避免涨价感知);谈判中不作为将失去比行动将获得更有说服力。框架效应是其孪生兄弟——手术成功率90%与死亡率10%听起来是完全不同的选择。损失厌恶深植于演化:对祖先而言漏掉危险比错过机会致命得多。��Prospect theory, from Kahneman and Tversky in 1979, showed that losses loom far larger than equivalent gains (the loss-aversion coefficient was estimated at roughly twice that size in the 1992 cumulative representation of uncertainty). This powers a zoo of quirks: investors refuse to sell losing stocks (selling converts paper loss into real loss); merchants split shipping fees out of prices (avoiding perceived hikes); negotiators argue you will LOSE by inaction rather than gain by acting. Framing effects are its twin — ninety percent surgical survival sounds unlike ten percent mortality. Evolution planted it deep: for ancestors, missing danger killed faster than missing opportunity.�ans��src��hKahneman 与 Tversky,《Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk»,Econometrica 第47卷,1979�fD. Kahneman and A. Tversky, Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk, Econometrica 47, 1979��id�psy_26_005�body���直答:仅凭观察榜样就足以完成学习。Bandura等1961年让部分儿童目睹成人对波波玩偶拳打脚踢,这些孩子随后做出的模仿攻击远多于未观看的一组;其后的实验进一步显示,目睹榜样受奖励的孩子模仿得更多,这就是替代强化。观察学习沿注意、保持、再现、动机四个环节推进,无需亲身承受后果,直接动摇了行为须经直接强化才能习得的假设。�Watching a model alone suffices for learning. In 1961 Bandura and colleagues had some children watch an adult kick and punch the Bobo doll; those children later produced far more imitative aggression than children who saw none, and follow-up studies showed that children who saw the model rewarded imitated even more - vicarious reinforcement. Observational learning runs through attention, retention, reproduction and motivation with no firsthand consequence, undercutting the claim that only direct reinforcement shapes behavior.�ans��src�٢Bandura、Ross与Ross论文《Transmission of Aggression through Imitation of Aggressive Models》,Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology 1961(斯坦福大学)٧Bandura A, Ross D & Ross SA, 'Transmission of Aggression through Imitation of Aggressive Models', Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 1961 (Stanford University)��id�psy_26_008�body���直答:这个概念是自我效能感,即个体对自己能否完成特定任务的信心判断。机理:它由四类经验共同塑造——亲身的成败经验分量最重,成功垫高、失败拉低效能;看到与自己相近的人做成事提供替代经验;他人真诚而可信的鼓励构成言语说服;紧张、出汗等生理唤醒也会被解读成能力信号。高效能感者设定更高目标、遇挫更持久,同等能力下的行动力差距由此而来。�The concept is self-efficacy - a person's judgment of whether they can execute a particular task. Four classes of experience shape it: firsthand success and failure carry the most weight, raising or sinking efficacy; watching similar others succeed adds vicarious experience; sincere, credible encouragement works as verbal persuasion; even arousal such as a racing heart gets read as a signal about competence. High-efficacy people set bolder goals and persist longer through setbacks, so drive diverges among equals in ability.�ans��src��zBandura论文《Self-efficacy: Toward a Unifying Theory of Behavioral Change》,Psychological Review 1977(斯坦福大学)�{Bandura A, 'Self-efficacy: Toward a unifying theory of behavioral change', Psychological Review, 1977 (Stanford University)��id�psy_26_011�body���直答:气味线索在慢波睡眠中重新激活了白天形成的记忆痕迹。机理:系统巩固依赖海马把新信息反复回放并转存进新皮层,而气味经嗅觉通路直达海马、几乎不占用注意资源,睡眠中再嗅到同一气味就像按下重播键,fMRI也观察到海马随之激活;这种定向再激活让记忆被更牢地写入皮层长期网络,醒来后提取自然更快更准。��The odor cue reactivates the day's fresh memory traces during slow-wave sleep. Systems consolidation relies on the hippocampus replaying new material into neocortex, and smells reach the hippocampus through a pathway that consumes almost no attention, so smelling the same scent asleep acts like pressing replay - fMRI showed the hippocampus lighting up accordingly. This targeted reactivation locks the memory into long-term cortical networks, so retrieval after waking comes faster and sharper.�ans��src�ُRasch、Büchel、Gais与Born论文《Odor Cues During Slow-Wave Sleep Prompt Declarative Memory Consolidation》,Science 2007(吕贝克大学)ٖRasch B, Büchel C, Gais S & Born J, 'Odor Cues During Slow-Wave Sleep Prompt Declarative Memory Consolidation', Science, 2007 (University of Lübeck)��id�psy_26_014�body���直答:短时正念训练锻炼的是注意系统本身,并非靠放松间接起效。机理:训练要求不加评判地持续觉察呼吸与身体感受,每次把跑掉的心念拉回都是对冲突监控网络的一次操练;Tang等发现仅五天的整合身心训练就提高了注意网络测验中的执行控制成绩,同时皮质醇下降、心率呼吸更平稳,反映前扣带回调控效率增强,而且比刻意专注更省力。�MBrief mindfulness training exercises the attention system itself rather than working indirectly through relaxation. Practitioners hold nonjudgmental awareness of breath and bodily sensations, and every return of a wandering mind is one repetition for the conflict-monitoring network. Tang and colleagues found that five days of integrative body-mind training raised executive-control scores on the Attention Network Test while lowering cortisol and steadying heart rate and breathing - signs of more efficient anterior cingulate regulation that costs less effort than forced concentration.�ans��src�ّTang、Posner等论文《Short-term meditation training improves attention and self-regulation》,PNAS 2007(俄勒冈大学与大连理工大学)٨Tang YY, Posner MI, et al., 'Short-term meditation training improves attention and self-regulation', PNAS, 2007 (University of Oregon & Dalian University of Technology)��id�psy_26_019�body��	直答:规律的正念练习像体能训练塑造肌肉那样,以活动依赖的可塑性改变了脑结构。机理:Hölzel等让长期承受压力的成年人完成标准八周正念减压训练,MRI发现海马、后扣带皮层、颞顶联合区与小脑灰质密度上升,这些区域参与学习记忆、自我参照加工与情绪调节;杏仁核密度的变化则与感知压力的下降相关联。反复的专注觉察持续驱动突触与血管层面的重塑,心理训练由此留下可测量的解剖印记。��Regular mindfulness practice reshapes brain structure through activity-dependent plasticity, much as physical training builds muscle. Hölzel and colleagues put chronically stressed adults through the standard eight-week mindfulness-based stress reduction program; MRI showed denser gray matter in the hippocampus, posterior cingulate cortex, temporo-parietal junction, and cerebellum - regions serving learning and memory, self-referential processing, and emotion regulation - while amygdala changes tracked drops in perceived stress. Sustained focused awareness keeps driving remodeling at synaptic and vascular levels, leaving mental training measurable anatomical traces.�ans��src�ٲHölzel BK 等,《Mindfulness practice leads to increases in regional brain gray matter density》,Psychiatry Research: Neuroimaging,2011 (DOI: 10.1016/j.pscychresns.2010.08.006)ٳHölzel BK et al., 'Mindfulness practice leads to increases in regional brain gray matter density', Psychiatry Research: Neuroimaging, 2011, DOI: 10.1016/j.pscychresns.2010.08.006��id�1b2e195714b9�body���TMS 用脉冲磁场在头皮外非侵入地激活或抑制皮层。研究用它临时干扰某脑区以推断其功能，临床上重复 TMS 已被批准用于治疗难治性抑郁，但效果因人而异。�TMS uses magnetic pulses to non-invasively excite or inhibit cortex through the scalp. Researchers use it to disrupt a region temporarily and infer its function; clinically, repetitive TMS is approved for treatment-resistant depression, though responses vary.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3a974d10b2e6�body���青春期大脑奖励系统对同伴评价高度敏感，独立需求上升，于是同伴成为身份镜像。这并非不爱父母，而是发展出自我的必经；父母从管理者转为安全基地更有效。��The adolescent reward system is hyper-sensitive to peer evaluation and the need for independence rises, so peers become identity mirrors. This is not less love for parents but a step to self; parents work better as a safe base than managers.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�454243a09786�body��/格罗斯与约翰的研究（Gross & John, 2003）发现，倾向用“认知重评”而非“表达抑制”的人，不仅社交更顺、主观更爽，生理上面对压力时心血管反应也更温和。说明情绪调节策略不只是心情问题，会实实在在写进血压和复原力里。�7Gross and John (2003) found that people who favor cognitive reappraisal over expressive suppression are not only socially smoother and subjectively happier but also show milder cardiovascular reactions to stress. Emotion-regulation style is thus not just mood - it is written into blood pressure and resilience.�ans��src��Gross, J.J. & John, O.P. (2003)《揭示感受：重评与抑制》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 85(2):348-362�rGross, J.J. & John, O.P. (2003). Revealing feelings. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 85(2), 348-362.��id�49af4dfc670b�body�ٴ不是。挫折教育的重点是当孩子自然遇到困难时，陪他面对而非替他扫平，并在事后一起复盘。人为制造苦难只会带来无助，而非韧性。ٲNo. The point is to stand with the child through natural setbacks rather than clearing them, and review together afterward. Invented hardship breeds helplessness, not resilience.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�76294780fd2b�body���情感计算综合面部动作编码、语音韵律、生理信号与文本语气，用机器学习把特征映射到情绪类别或维度（效价-唤醒）。它常用于教育、客服与健康监测，但跨文化与个体校准仍是难点。�1Affective computing fuses facial action coding, vocal prosody, physiological signals and text tone, using machine learning to map features to emotion categories or dimensions (valence-arousal). Used in education, service and health monitoring, though cross-cultural and individual calibration remain hard.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�91a812e29b92�body��=“单胺假说”（Schildkraut, 1965）提出，抑郁与脑内去甲肾上腺素、血清素等单胺类神经递质不足有关，这奠定了 SSRI 等药物的思路。它虽能解释部分药效，却过于简化——真实机制还涉及神经可塑、炎症与神经发生，新药正朝这些方向拓展。�The monoamine hypothesis (Schildkraut, 1965) proposes depression involves deficient noradrenaline, serotonin and other monoamines, grounding drugs like SSRIs. Useful yet oversimplified, it misses plasticity, inflammation and neurogenesis, which newer treatments now target.�ans��src��nSchildkraut, J.J. (1965)《情感障碍的儿茶酚胺假说》, American Journal of Psychiatry 122(5):509-522�Schildkraut, J.J. (1965). The catecholamine hypothesis of affective disorders. American Journal of Psychiatry, 122(5), 509-522.��id�92324272d0d4�body���伦内伯格提出语言习得关键期大约在青春期前，此阶段大脑侧化尚未完成，学习语言最自然。错过关键期的个体往往难以获得母语般的发音与语法直觉。��Lenneberg proposed a critical period for language acquisition ending around puberty, when the brain is not yet fully lateralized and language learning is most natural. Those who miss it often struggle to attain native-like pronunciation and grammar.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�97bfd62ec065�body���机器从音高、语速、能量、颤动等声学特征提取情绪线索，再用分类器判断愤怒、快乐、中性等。背景噪声、语种与个体声线会显著影响准确率，因此常需结合文本与语境。��Machines extract emotional cues from pitch, rate, energy and jitter, then classify anger, happiness, neutrality and so on. Background noise, language and individual voice strongly affect accuracy, so text and context are often added.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a66fca4b8c5d�body���因为人格是特质乘以情境的交互：你有跨情境的平均倾向，但具体行为随角色、规则和当下状态调整。人有多面性很正常，并非虚伪，而是适应性地匹配环境。ٸPersonality is trait times situation: you have average tendencies, but behavior shifts with role, rules, and current state. Having different sides is normal adaptation, not dishonesty.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�ae4d34b43a3e�body��信度指测量结果的一致性与稳定性（如重测信度、内部一致性），效度指测量是否真的测到了它声称要测的构念（如效标关联效度、结构效度）。一句常说的话是“效度以信度为前提，但高信度不等于高效度”。�EReliability is the consistency and stability of a measure (e.g., test–retest, internal consistency), while validity is whether it truly measures the construct it claims (e.g., criterion-related, construct validity). A common saying is that validity presupposes reliability, but high reliability does not guarantee validity.�ans��src��wAnastasi 与 Urbina《心理测验》（Psychological Testing, 1997）；Kaplan 与 Saccuzzo《心理测验与测量》�Anastasi & Urbina, Psychological Testing (1997); Kaplan & Saccuzzo, Psychological Testing: Principles, Applications, and Issues��id�bdf724b22469�body��3斯蒂尔与阿伦森的“刻板印象威胁”（Steele & Aronson, 1995）指，被激活的负面群体标签会占用工作记忆并引发焦虑，拖垮表现，形成自我实现的预言。它不是能力问题，而是情境中被额外加载的心理负担，换掉标签语境成绩就能回升。�Steele and Aronson's stereotype threat (1995) means an activated negative group label drains working memory and spikes anxiety, sinking performance in a self-fulfilling loop. It is not ability but an extra situational load; change the label context and scores rebound.�ans��src�يSteele, C.M. & Aronson, J. (1995)《刻板印象威胁与智力测验表现》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 69(5):797-811ٙSteele, C.M. & Aronson, J. (1995). Stereotype threat and the intellectual test performance. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 69(5), 797-811.��id�bdfd8dcba5b7�body���心理韧性指个体在逆境、创伤或压力中恢复并适应的能力，并非不会受伤，而是能反弹与成长。它受社会支持、自我效能和应对方式影响，且可通过练习提升。��Resilience is the ability to recover and adapt after adversity, trauma, or stress—not immunity to harm but the capacity to bounce back and grow. It is shaped by social support, self-efficacy, and coping styles, and can be built through practice.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�d5dd6954df6f�body��K斯威勒的认知负荷理论（Sweller, 1988）把工作记忆负担分成内在负荷（材料本身难度）、外在负荷（糟糕呈现方式）和相关负荷（真正用于学习的投入）。教学若用花哨无关图示抬高外在负荷，就会挤掉相关负荷，所以“少即是多”在这里是认知事实。�,Sweller's cognitive load theory (1988) splits working-memory burden into intrinsic load (task difficulty), extraneous load (poor presentation) and germane load (learning effort). Flashy irrelevant visuals inflate extraneous load and squeeze out germane load, so less is more is a cognitive fact here.�ans��src��WSweller, J. (1988)《问题解决中的认知负荷》, Cognitive Science 12(2):257-285�]Sweller, J. (1988). Cognitive load during problem solving. Cognitive Science, 12(2), 257-285.��id�ded353b0487c�body��韦克斯勒于 1939 年编制的量表分言语与操作多个分测验，给出总智商及分量表指数，适用成人与儿童（WAIS、WISC）。现代 IQ 测验按正态分布标定，均值 100、标准差 15，约 95% 的人落在 70–130 区间。�
Wechsler's scales from 1939 include multiple verbal and performance subtests yielding a full-scale IQ and index scores for adults (WAIS) and children (WISC). Modern IQ is normed to a normal distribution with mean 100 and SD 15, so about 95% score between 70 and 130.�ans��src��aWechsler《成人智力量表》（WAIS, 1955）；Kaplan 与 Saccuzzo《心理测验与测量》ىWechsler, Wechsler Adult Intelligence Scale (WAIS) (1955); Kaplan & Saccuzzo, Psychological Testing: Principles, Applications, and Issues��id�f9f6f95c96fa�body��特质是相对稳定、跨情境一致的人格倾向（如一个人通常是否焦虑），而状态是短暂、随情境波动的心理体验（如某次考试前的紧张）。这一区分由 Cattell 等人在因素分析法研究人格结构时确立，是人格测量的基础。�5A trait is a relatively stable, cross-situational disposition (e.g., whether someone is generally anxious), whereas a state is a transient, situation-bound experience (e.g., nervousness before one exam). Cattell and others established this distinction through factor-analytic studies of personality structure.�ans��src��rCattell《人格的科学分析》（The Scientific Analysis of Personality, 1965）；Funder《人格心理学》�VCattell, The Scientific Analysis of Personality (1965); Funder, The Personality Puzzle��id�psy_25_011�body��y有用,而且原理明确。缓慢的深呼气会激活副交感神经系统——身体的刹车装置,让心率减慢、血压下降。关键技巧是呼气比吸气长(如吸4秒呼6秒),拉长的呼气对迷走神经的刺激最强。这就是为什么冥想、瑜伽、射击运动员瞄准前都用呼吸调节状态:它是随身携带、随时可用的情绪遥控器。�SIt works with clear physiology: slow extended exhales activate the parasympathetic brake system slowing heart rate and blood pressure. The trick is exhaling longer than inhaling (four in, six out) since long out-breaths stimulate the vagus nerve most. Meditation, yoga and marksmen all use it — a pocket emotion remote available anytime.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�psy_25_013�body��k1964年纽约吉诺维斯案引发研究:人越多,每人施救的可能性越低。两大机制在作怪:责任分散(这么多人总会有人管的)与多元无知(别人都没动,可能不严重吧)。破解方法已被写进急救培训:求助时指定具体的人——穿蓝衣服的先生请帮我打120!被点名的人责任瞬间集中,行动率大增。�lAfter the 1964 Kitty Genovese case research found crowds reduce individual helping through two forces: diffusion of responsibility (someone will call) and pluralistic ignorance (nobody moved so it must be fine). First-aid training now teaches the fix: name a specific person — you in blue, call 120! Pointed-out duty concentrates instantly and action rates soar.�ans��src��z《十万个为什么》第六版大脑与认知分册,总主编韩启德,分册主编杨雄里,少年儿童出版社,2013ٗTen Thousand Whys, 6th ed., Brain and Cognition volume, chief editor Han Qide, volume editor Yang Xiongli, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�154ef30d453e�body��间隔效应指将学习分散在多个时段（间隔重复）比集中时间一次性学习（填塞）能取得更好的长期保持。这一规律最早由 Ebbinghaus 在 19 世纪研究遗忘曲线时发现，并得到大量现代教育心理学实验的支持。�3The spacing effect is that distributing study across sessions (spaced repetition) yields better long-term retention than massing it in one session (cramming). Ebbinghaus first observed it in the 19th century while studying the forgetting curve, and it is strongly supported by modern educational psychology.�ans��src�٧Ebbinghaus《记忆》（Memory: A Contribution to Experimental Psychology, 1885）；Dunlosky 等 2013 年综述（载 Psychological Science in the Public Interest）�aEbbinghaus, Memory (1885); Dunlosky et al. (2013) in Psychological Science in the Public Interest��id�43ba7b10af54�body���系列位置效应指人们在学习一串项目时，对开头（首因效应）和结尾（近因效应）的项目记忆最好、中间最差。Murdock 于 1962 年用自由回忆实验证实，常被解释为短时与长时记忆双储存的结果。�The serial position effect is the tendency to recall best the first (primacy effect) and last (recency effect) items in a list, and worst the middle. Murdock demonstrated it in 1962 with free-recall experiments, often explained by separate short- and long-term memory stores.�ans��src�٘Murdock,《The serial position effect of free recall》,Journal of Experimental Psychology,1962 (DOI: 10.1037/h0045106)；Sternberg《认知心理学》ٖMurdock, 'The serial position effect of free recall', Journal of Experimental Psychology, 1962, DOI: 10.1037/h0045106; Sternberg, Cognitive Psychology��id�477dc1e88511�body�ٴ在“脚手架”式支持里，孩子先摸索、大人只在卡住时给一点提示，能长出真正的胜任感。什么都代劳，反而夺走了练习解决问题机会。٬In scaffolded support the child explores first and the adult gives a small hint only when stuck, building real competence. Doing it all robs the chance to practice solving.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�4ac163dbea4f�body��?依恋是进化出的安全感机制，促进生存与学习。�BAttachment is an evolved safety bond aiding survival and learning.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�b66cbaaa1cf1�body���奖励在提示-例行-奖励回路中标记行为值得重复，大脑释放多巴胺强化连接。及时、稳定的小奖励比遥远大奖励更有效，因为大脑更看重当下的正向反馈。��Rewards mark a behavior as worth repeating in the cue-routine-reward loop, with dopamine reinforcing the link. Timely, consistent small rewards beat distant big ones—the brain values immediate positive feedback.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�bea1eadf59c9�body�ٴ很多时候说谎是发展阶段：幼儿分不清想象与现实，大些的孩子才懂“说谎能避免麻烦”。把它当信号去了解原因，比贴标签更有帮助。ٱOften lying is developmental: toddlers mix imagination with reality, older children learn lying avoids trouble. Treat it as a signal to understand the cause rather than a label.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�8611322a74c4�body���手势并非单纯的附带动作：它能外化尚未成形的想法、减轻工作记忆负担，并帮助听者理解。研究表明让儿童边说边比划能促进数学与语言任务的推理。��Gesture is not mere decoration: it externalizes half-formed ideas, offloads working memory and helps listeners understand. Studies show encouraging children to gesture while explaining improves reasoning in math and language tasks.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8ccdb20eeb1c�body���维果茨基提出，孩子能在他人帮助下做到、却还不能独立做到的部分叫最近发展区。脚手架是逐步撤除的提示与支持，让学习者从依赖走向独立。ټVygotsky's zone of proximal development is what a learner can do with help but not alone. Scaffolding is prompts and support withdrawn step by step, moving from dependence to independence.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�ab19077fcf20�body�ٽ这叫同质性：相似的人让我们感到被理解、验证自己的偏好，且互动成本更低。相似也增加重复接触（邻近效应），而熟悉感本身会提升好感。��Called homophily: similar people make us feel understood and validate our tastes, with lower interaction cost. Similarity also raises repeated contact (proximity), and familiarity itself boosts liking.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b66313e529a5�body���皮亚杰指出前运算阶段（约 2-7 岁）儿童难以采择他人视角，以为别人看到/想到和自己一样，这是认知发展阶段限制，而非自私。随心理理论成熟，他们逐渐能理解他人有不同想法。��Piaget noted preoperational kids (about 2-7) struggle to take others' perspectives, assuming others see/think as they do—a developmental limit, not selfishness. As theory of mind matures, they grasp that others have different thoughts.�ans��src��Piaget 认知发展�Piaget's cognitive development��id�fb3cb84a6ce5�body�ٱ这叫“社会参照”：婴幼儿还不会判断危险程度，会借用照顾者的表情来决定自己该怕还是该放松。大人镇定，孩子往往也更快平静。��Called social referencing, infants cannot yet judge how dangerous something is and borrow the caregiver's expression to decide whether to fear or relax. A calm adult helps the child settle faster.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�017b00b6a8a2�body���它的核心是把工作切成有边界的时段，降低启动阻力和拖延；但对深陷“心流”或需长段思考的人，频繁打断反而伤效率。关键不在钟，而在找到自己的专注节奏。��Its core is slicing work into bounded sessions to lower start-up friction and procrastination, but for people in flow or needing long thinking, frequent breaks hurt. The point is not the timer but finding your own focus rhythm.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�02244dcb3c68�body�ٺ心理学称“注意力残留”：切换任务时，上一件事还占着一部分注意力没退场。频繁切换让大脑始终处于半加载状态，效率与精力双双下降。ټCalled attention residue, when you switch tasks part of your attention stays stuck on the previous one. Frequent switching keeps the brain half-loaded, draining both efficiency and energy.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0c8380933fec�body�ٽ目前证据不支持“按风格教学更好”的假设（匹配假说）。人们确有偏好，但混合多通道学习通常更有效。别让风格标签限制了尝试其他方法。��Evidence does not support the meshing hypothesis that teaching to style improves learning. People have preferences, but mixed multisensory learning usually works better. Do not let style labels block other methods.�ans��src�ٞPashler, H., McDaniel, M., Rohrer, D. 与 Bjork, R. (2008). 《学习风格：概念与证据》. Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 9(3), 105-119.ٟPashler, H., McDaniel, M., Rohrer, D., & Bjork, R. (2008). Learning styles: Concepts and evidence. Psychological Science in the Public Interest, 9(3), 105-119.��id�13b06f65c7b2�body��闭眼静坐会让长期回避的念头浮现，少数人出现解离或焦虑加重，尤其在创伤史者中。负责任的课程会教导睁眼、缩短时长、回到锚点，并建议有严重症状者先寻求专业评估；正念不是人人随时都适用的万能药。�;Sitting with eyes closed can surface long-avoided thoughts; a few experience derealization or rising anxiety, especially with trauma history. Responsible courses teach eyes-open, shorter sessions and returning to an anchor, and advise professional assessment for severe symptoms. Mindfulness is not a universal fix.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�19d997e7d84f�body���情绪粒度指人们精确区分和命名不同情绪状态的能力。粒度越高，越能准确识别自己是失望还是羞耻，从而选择更合适的调节方式。它是情绪能力的重要指标。��Emotional granularity is the ability to precisely distinguish and label different emotional states. Higher granularity lets people tell disappointment from shame and choose more fitting regulation strategies. It is a key indicator of emotional skill.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1ce68b081753�body��成功老龄化由罗和卡恩提出，强调三个要素：低患病与残疾风险、高身体与认知功能、积极参与生活。它把老化从“避免疾病”扩展为“保持功能与联结”。现代观点更强调主观幸福感与个体差异，而非单一标准。�cSuccessful aging, proposed by Rowe and Kahn, emphasizes three elements: low risk of disease and disability, high physical and cognitive function, and active engagement with life. It expands aging from merely avoiding illness to maintaining function and connection. Modern views add subjective well-being and individual difference rather than one standard.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�205a90a5035e�body���现状偏差指默认选项或当前状态被过度偏好，源于损失厌恶、惰性与切换成本。它解释为何默认勾选的器官捐献率远高于需主动勾选，也提醒设计者善用默认。��Status-quo bias is over-preferring the default or current state, from loss aversion, inertia and switching costs. It explains why opt-out organ donation far exceeds opt-in, and reminds designers to use defaults wisely.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3337c3c73911�body���同时体验两种相反情绪（如喜悦又担忧）称为矛盾情绪，它在复杂决策中能促使更谨慎的信息加工。适度矛盾情绪与更灵活的思维相关。完全单一的情绪未必最优。�$Experiencing two opposite emotions at once, such as joy mixed with worry, is called mixed or ambivalent emotion, and it can prompt more careful information processing in complex decisions. Moderate ambivalence relates to more flexible thinking. Uniform single emotions are not always optimal.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�338191c0ab3a�body���清醒梦是在梦中意识到这是梦并保持元意识的状态，常伴随前额叶在 REM 中的异常激活。它被视为一种在线元认知训练窗口，研究显示训练可提升现实中元认知与自我觉察。��Lucid dreaming is realizing this is a dream while dreaming, with unusual prefrontal activation during REM. Seen as a window for online metacognition, training it has been linked to improved real-world metacognition and self-awareness.�ans��src��LaBerge 清醒梦研究�LaBerge's lucid dream research��id�353f6f330a86�body�ٷ研究更支持后者：韧性常在安全的连接中长出来——有人可依靠、被理解，人才更敢面对挫折。它不是硬撑，而是“我知道不是一个人”。��Research favors the latter: resilience grows in safe connection, with someone to lean on and be understood, so people dare face setbacks. It is not gritting alone but knowing I am not by myself.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�370d3ea0add5�body���思路包括联系信任的人陪在身边、前往就近的急诊或社区心理服务、让家人协助保管可能用到的危险物。关键是别独自硬扛，把“此刻安全”放在第一位。��Pathways include reaching a trusted person to stay with you, going to nearby emergency or community mental health services, and having family secure items that could be used for harm. The key is not coping alone and putting safety now first.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�3da4af74d134�body���元科学研究科学本身如何运作：发表体系、激励机制与方法质量。它通过大规模重复、注册报告与开放实践，找出系统性偏见并修正，让心理学证据更稳健可累积。��Metascience studies how science itself works—publishing, incentives and method quality. Via large replications, registered reports and open practice, it finds and fixes systemic bias, making psychological evidence more robust and cumulative.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�3dbab4a03540�body���部分裂脑病人在特殊测试中表现出两套可分离的反应与意图，引发“一个脑两个心智”的讨论。但日常中仍是一个统一主体，左右更多在信息隔离下各管一段，而非真正分裂成两个人。�	Some split-brain patients show separable responses and intentions in special tasks, prompting talk of 'two minds in one brain'. But in daily life there remains one unified agent; the hemispheres mostly handle separate channels under info isolation, not two persons.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3fed0802b400�body���现状偏误指人们倾向于维持现状、不做改变，即便替代方案可能更好，因为改变带来不确定感和损失预期。它在医疗、投资和制度选择中广泛存在。意识到“不作为也是选择”可减轻它。�#Status quo bias is the tendency to keep things as they are rather than change, even when alternatives may be better, because change brings uncertainty and expected loss. It appears widely in medical, investment, and institutional choices. Realizing 'inaction is also a choice' can reduce it.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�474fdf811d04�body���短视频和社交 App 用“可变奖励”（你永远不知道下一条好不好看）持续激活多巴胺的“预期”回路，让停止变得很难。与其靠意志力硬扛，把手机放远、关掉推送、设定固定时段更有效。�!Short-video and social apps use variable rewards (you never know if the next clip is good) to keep the dopamine prediction circuit active, making it hard to stop. Rather than relying on willpower, moving the phone away, silencing notifications and setting fixed usage windows works better.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4ae6ab10a7d4�body��␀McEwen 提出，反复或慢性应激导致身体调节系统（HPA、心血管、代谢、免疫）反复失衡，磨损累积成多系统病理风险。它用血压、皮质醇、炎症等生物指标综合打分，把压力伤身变成可测量概念。�1McEwen coined allostatic load: repeated/chronic stress makes regulatory systems (HPA, cardiovascular, metabolic, immune) repeatedly imbalance, accumulating wear into multisystem disease risk. It scores biomarkers like blood pressure, cortisol, and inflammation—making stress damages the body measurable.�ans��src��McEwen (1998)�McEwen (1998)��id�4bea444c194c�body���驱力理论强调内在匮乏（如饥饿）产生驱力推动行为，诱因理论强调外部目标（如奖励）的拉动力。现代动机观常把两者结合。它们分别解释了“推力”与“拉力”。��Drive theory stresses internal deficits, like hunger, creating drives that push behavior, while incentive theory stresses external goals, like rewards, pulling behavior. Modern views often combine both. They explain 'push' and 'pull' respectively.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�51a56b7fcd8a�body���自传体记忆是个人生活事件的记忆，兼具情景细节和人生阶段的概括。它受自我图式和文化叙事影响，常随重述而重塑。这类记忆既反映真实经历，也包含重构的成分。�3Autobiographical memory is memory for personal life events, blending specific episodic detail with broader life-period summaries. It is shaped by self-schemas and cultural narratives and is often reshaped each time it is retold. Such memories reflect real experience yet also contain reconstructed elements.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�51d248b32323�body���研究并不支持“集体主义压制创造力”这种简单论断，二者关系其实很微妙。集体主义环境可能提升协作型、社会导向的创造力，但有时会抑制极端个人主义或异议；个人主义环境则更利于独立出新，却可能缺少团队协同。创造力取决于任务类型、心理安全感，以及文化是否同时鼓励关系和谐与探索性思考。��Research does not support a simple 'collectivism kills creativity' claim; the relationship is nuanced. Collectivist contexts can boost collaborative, socially-oriented creativity while sometimes discouraging radical individualism or dissent, whereas individualist settings may foster independent novelty but less group synergy. Creativity depends on task type, psychological safety, and whether a culture encourages both relational harmony and exploratory thinking.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�55a07eb6dd2b�body���研究（如 Gottman）发现，决定关系质量的不是冲突频率，而是“修复尝试”——一句玩笑、一个拥抱能否把双方拉回合作。会修复的关系，吵完反而更懂彼此。��Research such as Gottman's shows what predicts quality is not conflict frequency but repair attempts, a joke or a hug that pulls both back to teamwork. Relationships that repair actually understand each other better after a fight.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�56ae67a14ed5�body���Gollwitzer 提出把目标写成如果出现 X 情境，我就做 Y 行为的具体计划，把触发与行动预先绑定，减少执行时的决策消耗与拖延。研究显示它能显著提升目标达成，尤其在习惯自动化前作为桥梁。��Gollwitzer's if X situation arises, then I do Y pre-binds trigger to action, cutting deliberation and procrastination at execution. Studies show it markedly lifts goal attainment, bridging the gap before habits automate.�ans��src��Gollwitzer (1999)�Gollwitzer (1999)��id�5d0c77e7f90d�body��研究表明人格具中等稳定性：随年龄有可预测的平均变化（如尽责性、宜人性上升，神经质下降，所谓成熟原则），且重大生活事件与刻意干预可推动个体改变。遗传设定范围，但环境与努力在范围内塑形。�.Research shows rank-order stability is moderate: mean levels shift predictably with age (conscientiousness/agreeableness rise, neuroticism falls—the maturity principle), and major life events or deliberate intervention can shift individuals. Genes set a range; environment and effort shape within it.�ans��src��Roberts 人格发展�"Roberts on personality development��id�697f81138ef4�body���情绪传染指个体在无意识中模仿他人表情和姿态，从而“感染”相似情绪，常通过镜像机制实现。它在亲密关系和服务场景中尤其明显。理解它有助于管理群体氛围。�Emotional contagion is when people unconsciously mimic others' expressions and postures and thereby 'catch' similar feelings, often via mirroring. It is especially noticeable in close relationships and service settings. Understanding it helps manage group moods.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�69ed51430c5f�body���研究更支持“马赛克”观点：每个人的大脑都是两性特征的混合，群体平均差异很小且高度重叠。用“男脑/女脑”给人贴标签，既过度也易强化刻板印象。��Research favors a mosaic view: each brain mixes both sexes' features, group averages differ little and overlap heavily. Labeling people by male or female brain overstates and reinforces stereotypes.�ans��src�ٜJoel, D. 等 (2015). 《超越生殖器的性别：人类大脑的“马赛克”》. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, 112(50), 15468-15473.ّJoel, D., et al. (2015). Sex beyond the genitalia: The human brain mosaic. Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, 112(50), 15468-15473.��id�6e06c7ba3d24�body���人对近期奖励过度偏好、对远期奖励迅速贬值，其贴现曲线是双曲线而非指数。于是当下轻松总是赢过未来收益，导致存钱难、健身荒——解决靠缩短反馈距离（小目标、即时反馈）。��People over-prefer near rewards and steeply devalue distant ones along a hyperbolic curve, not exponential. So immediate ease beats future gain, causing poor saving and skipped workouts; fixes shorten feedback distance via small goals and instant cues.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�6edadc112169�body�ٽ舒服多是即时消耗的快感，意义来自与目标、他人和价值的连接，能支撑人在困难里也感到值得。研究把“意义”列为幸福感的核心维度之一。��Comfort is mostly consumed-on-the-spot pleasure, while meaning comes from links to goals, others and values, sustaining a sense of worth through hardship. Research lists meaning as a core dimension of well-being.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�703c7d29f88a�body���简单问题是如何实现感知、记忆、报告等功能的机制，可用神经科学逐步解答；困难问题是为何这些处理会伴随主观感受（ qualia）。功能可解释，感受却仍无公认答案。��Easy problems are mechanisms for perception, memory and reporting, answerable by neuroscience step by step; the hard problem is why such processing is accompanied by subjective feel (qualia). Function is explainable, feeling is not yet.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�714011d0e811�body���近年研究发现皮层可沿连续维度（梯度）组织，例如从感知模态区到抽象联合区的模态梯度。它把大脑看成平滑变化的地图而非硬切分区，更能解释认知的连续性与个体差异。�)Recent work shows cortex is organized along continuous dimensions (gradients), such as a modality gradient from sensory to abstract association regions. It treats the brain as a smoothly varying map rather than hard modules, better capturing the continuity of cognition and individual differences.�ans��src�٫Dohmatob, Richard, Pinho, Thirion,《Brain topography beyond parcellations: Local gradients of functional maps》, NeuroImage, 2021 (DOI: 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2020.117706)٧Dohmatob, Richard, Pinho, Thirion, 'Brain topography beyond parcellations: Local gradients of functional maps', NeuroImage, 2021, DOI: 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2020.117706��id�71aed80dbd1c�body��b隔代抚养指祖辈承担主要养育角色，其影响取决于质量而非形式：温暖稳定的隔代照料可成为支持资源，但代际教养观念冲突或资源不足可能增加风险。研究多显示与依恋和学业结果无必然好坏，关键在关系质量与亲子联结是否维持。它是特定社会文化下的多样安排。��Grandparental rearing means grandparents take the main caregiving role; its effect depends on quality, not the form. Warm stable care can be a support, yet conflicts in parenting beliefs or scarce resources raise risk. Research shows no fixed good or bad link to attachment or school outcomes; what matters is relationship quality and kept parent bonds. It is a varied arrangement across cultures.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�749d24c4a598�body��Tedeschi 与 Calhoun 提出，部分人在经历危机后报告人际关系更紧密、人生优先级更清晰、个人力量感增强等正向变化。成长不与痛苦抵消，而是通过对意义的重新建构与主动应对，在裂痕中长出新视角。�Tedeschi and Calhoun found some report positive change after crisis—closer relationships, clearer priorities, stronger personal strength. Growth does not cancel pain; through meaning reconstruction and active coping, new perspectives grow from the rupture.�ans��src��Tedeschi 与 Calhoun (2004)�Tedeschi & Calhoun (2004)��id�753e93a6ea4c�body���关系自我指把我是谁与重要关系绑定；当关系自我突出时，人们用妈妈会怎么想来导航选择。脑成像研究发现，东亚人在自我相关任务中内侧前额叶对母亲与自己的反应模式更相似。�␀The relational self binds who I am to important relationships; when salient, people navigate choices via what would my mother think. Brain imaging shows East Asians' medial prefrontal cortex responds more similarly to mother and self in self-related tasks.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�75fad29cf272�body���健康素养是获取、理解并运用健康信息的能力。低素养者更易误用药物、漏诊、住院，是健康不平等的重要中介；清晰沟通与可视化比责怪个人更有效。��Health literacy is accessing, understanding and using health information. Low literacy links to misuse, missed diagnosis and hospitalization—a key mediator of health inequality; clear communication and visuals beat blaming individuals.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8377503572db�body��Milgram 发现约 65% 的普通参与者会在权威指令下对他人施加看似致命的电击，仅因实验者负责。它揭示人会在层级与渐进承诺下把道德责任外移，但后续研究强调服从也受情境与个体价值观调节，并非单纯人性邪恶。�;Milgram found ~65% of ordinary participants delivered apparently lethal shocks under authority's orders, citing the experimenter is responsible. It shows people offload moral responsibility under hierarchy and gradual commitment—but later work stresses obedience is moderated by context and values, not pure evil.�ans��src��Milgram (1963)�Milgram (1963)��id�85989a31d944�body���Lazarus 认为压力不在事件本身，而在一手的初级评价（这事对我有威胁吗？）与次级评价（我能应付吗？）。同一事件因评价不同可为挑战或威胁，说明认知重构是减压关键。��Lazarus argued stress is not in the event but in appraisal: primary (is this a threat?) and secondary (can I cope?). The same event becomes challenge or threat by appraisal—so cognitive reappraisal is key to reducing stress.�ans��src��Lazarus 与 Folkman (1984)�Lazarus & Folkman (1984)��id�8be3cfa69350�body�ٴ示弱释放出“我是真实的人”的信号，降低了对方的距离感，也邀请对方同样坦诚。适度暴露不安比永远坚强，更容易换来信任与亲近。٩Vulnerability signals I am a real person, lowers the other's distance and invites equal honesty. Admitting unease beats constant strength in earning trust and closeness.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8dc719ed71fb�body���病耻感来自“求助=软弱或有缺陷”的误解，让人害怕被贴标签、被另眼相看。把它重新看作“和感冒一样去处理健康问题”，能降低这道心理门槛。ټStigma grows from the false link of help-seeking with weakness or flaw, fearing labels and sideways looks. Reframing it as handling a health issue like a cold lowers that mental threshold.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�93b143d797c0�body���没有科学证据支持梦能预言未来。梦多是对记忆、情绪和随机神经活动的重组，偶尔“应验”多因巧合或自我实现。把梦当警示可以，但当作预言并不可靠。�There is no scientific evidence that dreams predict the future. Dreams mostly recombine memory, emotion, and random neural activity, and occasional 'hits' are coincidence or self-fulfillment. Treating dreams as warnings is fine, but as prophecies they are unreliable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�99ed998e2d46�body���因为亲近的人被默认为“安全基地”，我们潜意识地觉得在他们面前不必维持形象、不会被轻易抛弃。但这恰恰说明关系值得更好的表达，而非情绪的垃圾桶。��We treat close ones as a safe base, unconsciously feeling we need not keep up appearances and will not be abandoned. Yet this means the relationship deserves better expression, not to be an emotional dump.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9ee88af5633b�body���行为遗传学（双生子研究）估计大五特质遗传率约 40-50%，即群体差异中约一半与基因相关，但非注定。遗传率是群体统计量，不决定个人，且基因通过环境与表观遗传持续互动。�Behavior genetics (twin studies) puts Big Five heritability around 40-50%—about half the population variation links to genes, but not destiny. Heritability is a population statistic, not a personal verdict, and genes interact with environment via epigenetics.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a018a85626c3�body���述情障碍指难以识别、区分和用语言描述自己的情绪，常伴外化思维与缺乏幻想。它并非单一疾病，而是一种跨诊断的特质，与抑郁、创伤后应激等相关。提升情绪觉察的训练可部分改善。�Alexithymia is difficulty identifying, distinguishing, and putting feelings into words, often with externally oriented thinking and few fantasies. It is not one disease but a trait across diagnoses, linked to depression and PTSD. Training in emotion awareness can partly help.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a317037c7788�body���多项荟萃显示，正念对焦虑、抑郁的疗效约为药物的一半到相当，且副作用少、停药后复发更低，但起效较慢、需坚持。它常被定位为辅助治疗而非一律替代药物。�Several meta-analyses show mindfulness's effect on anxiety and depression ranges from half to comparable to medication, with fewer side effects and lower relapse after stopping, but slower onset and needing adherence. It is usually positioned as adjunct, not a blanket replacement.�ans��src��{Goyal 等（2014）《JAMA Internal Medicine》冥想项目系统综述；Kabat-Zinn《Full Catastrophe Living》（1990）كGoyal et al. (2014), JAMA Internal Medicine, systematic review of meditation programmes; Kabat-Zinn, Full Catastrophe Living (1990)��id�a7f9585a0ad9�body���当结果好于预期，多巴胺上升强化刚才的行为；坏于预期则下降，提示别再这样。这个误差信号是强化学习的核心，大脑借此不断调整策略——它解释了我们为何从成败中不知不觉学会。�!When outcomes beat expectation, dopamine rises and reinforces the just-made action; worse than expected, it falls and signals stop. This error signal is the core of reinforcement learning, letting the brain tune strategy—explaining how we learn from success and failure without noticing.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a9e90598ee4b�body���睡眠瘫痪发生在入睡或醒来时，意识已清醒但身体暂时无法动弹，常伴随压迫感和幻觉。它因快速眼动期的肌肉麻痹与清醒不同步所致，通常短暂且无害。保持冷静多能自行缓解。�.Sleep paralysis occurs when falling asleep or waking, with consciousness alert but the body temporarily unable to move, often with pressure sensations and hallucinations. It comes from REM muscle paralysis being out of sync with wakefulness and is usually brief and harmless. Staying calm lets it pass.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�aaca3d986791�body�ٺ翻旧账把一次具体矛盾变成“你一贯如此”的消极归因，对方会感到被全盘否定而进入防守。就事论事、只谈当下这件事，更可能真正解决。ٺDragging up the past turns one conflict into a negative trait label, making the other feel wholly rejected and defensive. Sticking to the current issue gives a real chance of resolution.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b50bcc874bca�body���它把行为改变分为前意向、意向、准备、行动、维持五阶段。同一人不同行为处于不同阶段，干预要匹配阶段（如对“不想改”者先提意识，而非直接给计划）。��The model stages change as precontemplation, contemplation, preparation, action, maintenance. A person sits in different stages for different habits; match the nudge to the stage—raise awareness before plans for the unwilling.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b657f884acd8�body���实验室对 3 分钟呼吸空间这类短暂练习的研究显示，它们能带来可测量的状态变化：主观压力与焦虑下降、生理唤醒降低（如心率，部分研究还有皮质醇），注意控制和“去中心化”能力提升。效果温和且短暂，增强的是当下的情绪调节，而非替代长期训练。这说明即便极短的正念也能改变状态。��Laboratory studies of brief practices like a 3-minute breathing space show measurable state shifts: lower self-reported stress and anxiety, reduced physiological arousal (e.g., heart rate, and cortisol in some studies), and improved attentional control and decentering. The effects are modest and temporary, enhancing present-moment regulation rather than replacing longer training. They show that even tiny doses of mindful attention can shift state.�ans��src��o《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 冥想研究卷;Nature Human Behaviour 正念元分析�eAnnual Review of Psychology (meditation research); Nature Human Behaviour (mindfulness meta-analysis)��id�b69e36067a4f�body�ٱ情绪像波浪，进步中夹着反复是常态，不代表“没用”或“复发”。把起伏看作康复的一部分，反而能减少因“又变差”而来的挫败。ٰMood moves in waves, and progress with setbacks is normal, not proof of uselessness or relapse. Taking the swings as part of recovery reduces the defeat of feeling worse again.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�bcca84ede666�body���晕轮效应指对一个人某一特质的良好印象，会扩散到对其整体和其他特质的评价，比如好看的人也被视为更聪明。它是认知上的“以偏概全”。在招聘和审判中需特别注意。��The halo effect is when a good impression of one trait spreads to overall and other-trait judgments of a person, such as attractive people being seen as smarter. It is a cognitive 'generalizing from a part.' It needs attention in hiring and judgments.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�bf36ebd995de�body���源监控错误指人们记对了内容却搞错了信息来源，比如把听来的事当成自己经历过的。随着年龄增长或分心，这类错误更常见。它解释了为何回忆的来源并不可靠。�A source-monitoring error occurs when people recall the content correctly but misattribute its origin, such as mistaking something heard for something personally experienced. Such errors become more common with age or distraction. It shows why the source of a memory is often unreliable.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c0324fb2a068�body��#人类学家本尼迪克特提出：耻感文化靠外部评价约束行为，罪感文化靠内在良知。这一二分被批评过于简化，但研究确实发现东亚更倾向他人指向的羞耻情绪，西方更常体验自我指向的内疚，二者对补救行为的影响不同。�%Benedict proposed shame cultures are governed by external judgment, guilt cultures by internal conscience. The dichotomy is criticized as simplistic, yet studies do find East Asians experience more other-directed shame and Westerners more self-directed guilt, with different effects on repair.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c03fd7df8b03�body���遗忘不全是失败：大脑通过突触弱化、神经发生覆盖等机制主动丢弃无用信息，腾出容量、避免干扰。研究称有意义的遗忘利于概括与灵活决策——记太牢反而可能被旧例卡住。�'Forgetting is not all failure: the brain actively discards useless information via synaptic weakening and neurogenesis-based overwrite, freeing capacity and avoiding interference. Meaningful forgetting aids generalization and flexible decisions; remembering too well can trap us in old examples.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c0b0d495fe10�body�ٽ这叫“快乐水车”（享乐适应）：人对好事的感受会很快回到基线。真正可持续的满足更多来自关系、成长和意义，而非不断加码的外在获得。��Called the hedonic treadmill, our feelings about good events quickly return to baseline. Lasting satisfaction comes more from relationships, growth and meaning than from ever-bigger external gains.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�c0f27dcb69cd�body���执行功能含抑制控制、工作记忆与认知灵活性三大核心，像大脑的油門与方向盘。它在学前快速成熟，预测学业成就、社交与长期健康，且可通过游戏与结构化训练提升。��Executive function comprises inhibitory control, working memory, and cognitive flexibility—the brain's gas and steering. It matures rapidly in preschool, predicts achievement, social skill, and long-term health, and is trainable via games and structure.�ans��src��Diamond 执行功能�Diamond on executive function��id�c9b34210ebab�body���战斗-逃跑-僵住是三种威胁反应；僵住由副交感主导的紧张性不动，在无法战胜或逃脱时出现，能镇痛并降低被注意。它常被误读为软弱，其实是古老的生存反射。��Fight, flight and freeze are three threat responses; freezing is parasympathetic-led tonic immobility that appears when one can neither win nor escape, numbing pain and reducing noticeability. Misread as weakness, it is an ancient survival reflex.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cbf828e96cc1�body���默许偏差指不论内容都倾向答“同意”；社会赞许性是把自己描得比真实更符合社会期待。这些反应风格会污染跨文化或自我评价数据，需在问卷设计中用反向题和效度量表控制。�Acquiescence bias is the tendency to agree regardless of content; social desirability is portraying oneself better than reality. These response styles contaminate cross-cultural or self-report data and must be controlled with reversed items and validity scales in design.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�cf9e686744fd�body���虚假记忆是人们对从未发生或细节不符事件的错误回忆，常由暗示、想象和错误信息植入造成。洛夫特斯的研究表明，提问方式就能让人“记得”没发生过的事。这给目击者证词带来重要启示。�IFalse memories are mistaken recollections of events that never happened or happened differently, often created by suggestion, imagination, and misleading information. Loftus's research showed that the wording of questions can make people 'remember' events that did not occur. This has major implications for eyewitness testimony.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d8cee54c16c5�body���边界是清楚自己能接受和不能接受什么，并用尊重的方式表达。它不是疏远，而是让关系可持续的前提——没有边界的人容易积怨，反而伤关系。��A boundary is knowing and respectfully stating what you will and will not accept. It is not distance but the basis for a sustainable relationship; without boundaries resentment builds and the bond suffers.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�dbd7e8dfd266�body�ٺ这叫“规划谬误”：人倾向于只想理想路径，忽略意外和切换成本。一个好用的补丁是“参考过去类似任务实际花了多久”，而非凭感觉估。پCalled the planning fallacy, we picture only the ideal path and ignore surprises and switching costs. A useful fix is anchoring on how long similar tasks actually took before, not a feeling.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�de5fa9b3df01�body���Tajfel 指出，人把自我价值部分建立在所属群体上，会通过内群体偏爱、外群体贬低来提升自尊。即使随机分组也会产生偏爱，说明群体冲突未必源于真实利益，而源于我们 vs 他们的身份建构。��Tajfel argued self-worth partly rests on group membership, so people boost esteem via in-group favoritism and out-group derogation. Even random groups show bias—conflict needn't stem from real interests but from us vs them identity construction.�ans��src��Tajfel 与 Turner (1979)�Tajfel & Turner (1979)��id�e024e954ba6a�body��刻板印象威胁指当某个群体成员担心自己会印证负面刻板印象时，焦虑反而拖垮表现，形成自我实现的预言。例如女性在数学考前被提醒“女性不擅长”成绩更易下降。它说明环境暗示能直接损耗能力发挥。�Stereotype threat is that when a group member fears confirming a negative stereotype, anxiety undermines performance, a self-fulfilling prophecy. For example, women reminded women are bad at math score lower. It shows environmental cues can directly drain performance.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e23c9ee7c25d�body���成就动机指追求卓越、克服挑战以达成标准的驱动力，由麦克利兰等研究。高成就动机者偏好中等难度任务并重视反馈。它与创业和学业表现相关。��Achievement motivation is the drive to excel and master challenges against standards, studied by McClelland and others. High achievers prefer moderate-difficulty tasks and value feedback. It relates to entrepreneurship and academic performance.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e63752cef757�body��恐惧诉求用恐吓让人改变行为，如反吸烟广告。研究表明仅有恐惧不够，还必须提供可行且有效的应对方案，否则会引发否认或回避。温斯泰因的“保护动机理论”强调威胁与效能共同决定说服成败。�Fear appeals use scare tactics to change behavior, like anti-smoking ads. Research shows fear alone is not enough; a feasible effective response must be offered or people deny or avoid. Protection motivation theory stresses threat and efficacy together decide success.�ans��src��bRobert Cialdini,《Influence: The Psychology of Persuasion》Harper Business;中译《影响力》�7R. B. Cialdini, Influence, Harper Business; Chinese ed.��id�e9a050d63be6�body��镜像神经元在做自己与看别人做时都放电，被认为支撑动作理解与模仿，是儿童通过观察和仿效快速学习的基础之一。但镜像系统决定一切的说法被夸大，模仿还依赖更高层的社会认知与意图理解。�6Mirror neurons fire both when acting and when observing action, thought to support action understanding and imitation—one basis for children's fast observational learning. But claims that mirror systems explain everything are overstated; imitation also needs higher social cognition and intent understanding.�ans��src��Rizzolatti 镜像神经元�Rizzolatti's mirror neurons��id�f9421866942f�body���不是。解离性身份障碍（旧称多重人格）是罕见、严重的创伤相关障碍，身份切换伴随记忆断层；而人人都有不同场合下的不同面向，是正常现象。把两者混为一谈既不科学也易污名化。�No. Dissociative identity disorder, formerly multiple personality, is a rare, severe trauma-linked disorder with memory gaps across identities, while everyone shows different sides in different contexts, which is normal. Confusing them is both unscientific and stigmatizing.�ans��src�ق美国精神医学协会 (2013). 《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（第五版，DSM-5）》. American Psychiatric Association.ٓAmerican Psychiatric Association. (2013). Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (5th ed., DSM-5). American Psychiatric Association.��id�fb3e1787541d�body�ٴ清醒梦是做梦时意识到自己在做梦，有些人还能在梦中主动操控情节。它可通过现实检验等练习诱发。研究用它探索意识与睡眠的关系。��A lucid dream is one in which the dreamer knows they are dreaming and some can deliberately steer the plot. It can be induced through reality-testing practices. Research uses it to explore consciousness and sleep.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fc2093b032dd�body���MBCT 把正念觉察与认知治疗结合：让人看清念头只是念头，在复发早期如低心境不陷入反刍。大型试验显示，对三次以上抑郁发作的人，MBCT 降低复发率约与药物维持相当。�MBCT combines mindful awareness with cognitive therapy: seeing thoughts as just thoughts, so early warning signs like low mood do not trigger rumination. Large trials show MBCT roughly matches maintenance medication in lowering relapse for those with three or more episodes.�ans��src�يKuyken, Crane, Dalgleish,《Does mindfulness based cognitive therapy prevent relapse of depression?》, BMJ, 2012 (DOI: 10.1136/bmj.e7194)نKuyken, Crane, Dalgleish, 'Does mindfulness based cognitive therapy prevent relapse of depression?', BMJ, 2012, DOI: 10.1136/bmj.e7194��id�02c7200aa07d�body��O动物实验发现，记忆被提取后会短暂进入不稳定状态，需要再次合成蛋白才能重新稳定，这个窗口期内的干预可以修改记忆的情绪强度。基于此，研究者尝试在唤起创伤记忆后给予普萘洛尔等阻断肾上腺素作用的药物，试图削弱记忆的情绪成分而保留事实内容，部分随机试验报告了症状改善。此外，行为学范式如提取后立即进行消退训练也被用于降低恐惧复发。目前的争议在于人类研究结果不够一致，边界条件如记忆年龄与提取强度仍需明确。��Animal work showed that a retrieved memory briefly becomes labile and requires new protein synthesis to restabilise, so intervening within that window can alter the memory's emotional intensity. Building on this, researchers have given propranolol and other adrenergic blockers after deliberately reactivating a traumatic memory, aiming to weaken its emotional component while preserving factual content, and several randomised trials report symptom improvement. Behavioural variants such as retrieval followed immediately by extinction training have also been used to reduce return of fear. The open controversy is that human findings are inconsistent and boundary conditions such as memory age and strength of reactivation remain to be pinned down.�ans��src�ّNader、Schafe 与 LeDoux（2000）《Nature》记忆再固化；Brunet 等（2018）《American Journal of Psychiatry》普萘洛尔随机试验ٙNader, Schafe and LeDoux (2000), Nature, on memory reconsolidation; Brunet et al. (2018), American Journal of Psychiatry, randomised trial of propranolol��id�038dbc0e5bca�body�ٺ去个性化指个体在群体中因身份隐匿而削弱自我约束、责任感下降，更易做出平日不会做的冲动或攻击行为。网络匿名环境常加剧这一现象。��Deindividuation is when being part of a crowd and anonymous lowers self-restraint and responsibility, making impulsive or aggressive acts more likely. Online anonymity often intensifies the effect.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�03c72965ff6f�body���心理学研究显示，宗教和灵性通常通过三条路径支持心理健康：提供意义感和解释框架、提供稳定的社会支持、以及提供仪式化的应对方式（祈祷、冥想、节庆）来舒缓焦虑。当然，这些都是群体统计趋势，个人差异很大；无信仰者同样可以靠意义感、亲密关系和应对技巧获得韧性与平静。关键在于“联结”本身。��Psychological research suggests religion and spirituality support mental health through three routes: a sense of meaning and explanatory framework, stable social support, and ritualized coping (prayer, meditation, festivals) that eases anxiety. These are group-level trends with large individual variation; nonreligious people gain the same resilience and calm through meaning, close relationships, and coping skills. Connection itself is what matters.�ans��src��$APA（宗教与心理健康研究）�)APA (religion and mental health research)��id�03e9993ac552�body���该理论以行为态度、主观规范与感知行为控制共同决定行为意向，再由意向预测实际行为。干预可通过改变这些前因信念来推动锻炼、戒烟等健康行为，其中感知控制常是瓶颈。�The theory of planned behavior holds that attitudes, subjective norms, and perceived behavioral control shape behavioral intention, which predicts action. Interventions shift these antecedent beliefs to promote exercise or smoking cessation, with perceived control often the bottleneck.�ans��src�٤Sheeran, Conner, Norman,《Can the theory of planned behavior explain patterns of health behavior change?》,Health Psychology,2001 (DOI: 10.1037/0278-6133.20.1.12)٢Sheeran, Conner, Norman, 'Can the theory of planned behavior explain patterns of health behavior change?', Health Psychology, 2001, DOI: 10.1037/0278-6133.20.1.12��id�050b9454a2ef�body��	默认模式网络（DMN）在静息、走神、自传式思考时活跃，在 REM 梦中也高度参与。它串联过去经验以构建自我叙事，梦与白日梦可能都是 DMN 主导的离线和自我相关的模拟，有助于整合身份与规划未来。�8The default mode network (DMN) activates during rest, mind-wandering, and autobiographical thought, and is heavily engaged in REM dreams. It stitches past experience into a self-narrative; dreams and daydreams may both be DMN-led offline, self-related simulations aiding identity integration and future planning.�ans��src��Raichle DMN; Fox�Raichle DMN; Fox��id�05e3617266e5�body���p 值只反映数据与零假设的相容程度，并不表示效应大小或实际重要性，也容易受样本量影响。美国统计协会指出，p 值低于阈值不应被当作「真相」的证据，须结合效应量与置信区间解读。��A p-value only gauges compatibility of data with the null, not effect size or practical importance, and is sensitive to sample size. The ASA warns a threshold-crossing p is not evidence of truth and must be read with effect sizes and confidence intervals.�ans��src��G美国统计协会(ASA) p值声明;《心理学年度评论》方法卷�cAmerican Statistical Association (ASA) statement on p-values; Annual Review of Psychology (methods)��id�065743dd780d�body���在专家积累了大量结构化经验的领域（如棋手、护士识症），直觉是基于模式匹配的快速判断，往往准确。但在低经验、高风险或统计稀疏的领域，直觉易偏，应让系统2复核。�	In domains where experts hold vast structured experience (chess, nurses spotting deterioration), intuition is fast pattern-matching and often accurate. In low-experience, high-stakes or statistically sparse contexts, intuition errs and System 2 should double-check.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0678a49ffd6f�body��G这叫确认偏误：大脑在搜索和解读信息时会系统性地偏向自己已有的信念，忽略反例，甚至把模糊信息往自己方向解释。它节省认知资源，但也让我们难以更新观点。主动“寻求反对自己的证据”是少数能对冲它的方法，也是科学思维的核心习惯。�^Confirmation bias: when seeking and interpreting information, the brain systematically favors existing beliefs, ignores counterexamples, and reads ambiguous evidence its own way. It saves cognitive effort but blocks updating. Actively hunting evidence against your view is one of the few countermeasures — and the core habit of scientific thinking.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�06d84db89b7b�body��#莫斯科维的“少数派影响”研究（Moscovici, 1976）发现，只要少数派保持一致、自信且不惜被孤立，就能动摇多数派的私下态度，促发真正的思考而非表面服从。与从众相反，少数派靠的是“差异性”撬动群体的认知重构。�6Moscovici's minority influence work (1976) shows that a consistent, confident, isolation-accepting minority can shift the majority's private attitudes and spark real thought rather than mere public compliance. Opposite to conformity, the minority leverages distinctiveness to reconstruct the group's cognition.�ans��src��EMoscovici, S. (1976)《社会影响与社会变迁》, Academic Press�IMoscovici, S. (1976). Social Influence and Social Change. Academic Press.��id�07c782faeb20�body��(Festinger 提出，当行为与新信念冲突时会产生不适感，人会通过改变态度来减少紧张。经典实验里，付 1 美元（低理由）为无聊任务说谎的人，比付 20 美元的人更后来觉得任务有趣——因为低报酬无法外归因，只能改内态度。�(Festinger argued that behaving against a belief creates discomfort, resolved by changing attitudes. In his study, people paid 1 dollar (weak external reason) to lie about a dull task later found it more enjoyable than those paid 20—with no external excuse, they changed their internal attitude.�ans��src��Festinger (1957)�Festinger (1957)��id�091406a4cb42�body�ٱ经典观点认为成年人工作记忆能同时容纳约 7±2 个独立信息块（组块），现代人研究更倾向 4±1 个。通过“组块化”可扩大有效容量。٧The classic view is that adults hold about 7±2 separate chunks in working memory; more recent estimates suggest around 4±1. 'Chunking' can expand effective capacity.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�0bcb75655c37�body���闪光灯记忆指人们对重大事件（如地震、名人离世）当时情景的生动记忆。虽然人们非常确信这些记忆，但研究显示其细节并不比普通记忆更准确。高度自信并不等于高准确度。�NFlashbulb memories are vivid recollections of the circumstances in which people learned about major events, such as earthquakes or a celebrity's death. Although people feel extremely confident about them, research shows their details are not markedly more accurate than ordinary memories. High confidence does not equal high accuracy.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�0dc722e69408�body��库利提出“镜像自我”，认为我们通过想象别人如何看待自己来形成自我概念。儿童的自我概念从具体外在（年龄、喜好）逐渐发展到抽象内在（品格、价值观）。同伴反馈在青春期对自我概念影响尤其大。�Cooley proposed the 'looking-glass self', that we form self-concept by imagining how others see us. Children's self-concept moves from concrete external traits (age, likes) to abstract internal ones (character, values). Peer feedback strongly shapes self-concept during adolescence.�ans��src��Cooley / 自我发展研究�"Cooley / self-development research��id�0f267926e29f�body��Rosenhan 于 1973 年安排 8 名假病人（自诉幻听）进入精神病院，入院后表现正常，却无人被识破，且出院诊断多为“精神分裂症缓解期”。实验揭示精神诊断标签的顽固性与诊断标准的不可靠，推动了诊断体系的改革。�^In 1973 Rosenhan had eight confederates (complaining only of a hallucinated voice) admitted to psychiatric hospitals; once inside they acted normally yet none were detected, and discharges carried diagnoses like “schizophrenia in remission.” The study exposed the stickiness of psychiatric labels and unreliability of diagnosis, spurring reforms.�ans��src��ERosenhan 1973 年论文（载 Science）；Comer《异常心理学》�6Rosenhan (1973) in Science; Comer, Abnormal Psychology��id�1081b8479db6�body���积极心理学用 PERMA 描述心盛：积极情绪、投入、关系、意义、成就共同饱满的状态。它不只是“没有心理疾病”，而是人在多个维度上真正蓬勃发展。��Positive psychology uses PERMA for flourishing: positive emotion, engagement, relationships, meaning and achievement all full. It is not merely no disorder but a person genuinely thriving across dimensions.�ans��src��ASeligman (2011),《Flourish: A New Vision of Happiness》, Viking�PSeligman, M. E. P. (2011). Flourish: A New Vision of Happiness. New York: Viking��id�119a8e2876c7�body���变化盲视指人们即使盯着画面，也常常注意不到其中明显的变化，尤其是当变化发生在眨眼或镜头切换的瞬间。这说明注意资源有限，我们只加工少数信息。它常被用于研究感知与意识的边界。�Change blindness is that people often fail to notice obvious changes in a scene even while looking at it, especially across a blink or cut. It shows attention is limited and we process only a little information. It is used to study the boundary of perception and consciousness.�ans��src��Simons & Chabris 研究�Simons & Chabris research��id�12c21bc0f7fa�body��@洛夫特斯的经典研究让被试观看交通事故录像，随后提问中把撞击描述为相撞还是猛撞，用词更激烈的一组不仅估计车速更快，一周后还更可能错误地报告看到了并不存在的碎玻璃。后续研究表明，通过家人配合的暗示可以让相当比例的成年人形成童年在商场走失等从未发生的记忆。这些结果说明提取时的语言、期待与事后信息会被整合进记忆表征，主观的清晰与自信程度并不能保证准确性，这对目击者证词的司法使用有直接影响。��In Loftus's classic study participants watched a traffic accident film and were then asked how fast the cars were going when they hit or smashed into each other; the harsher wording produced higher speed estimates and, a week later, more false reports of broken glass that was never in the film. Later work showed that suggestion with family collusion can lead a substantial minority of adults to remember events such as being lost in a shopping mall as children that never occurred. Language, expectations, and post-event information are thus integrated into the memory representation, so vividness and confidence do not guarantee accuracy — a direct concern for the legal use of eyewitness testimony.�ans��src�ٙLoftus 与 Palmer（1974）《Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior》；Loftus 与 Pickrell（1995）《Psychiatric Annals》商场走失范式ٗLoftus and Palmer (1974), Journal of Verbal Learning and Verbal Behavior; Loftus and Pickrell (1995), Psychiatric Annals, the lost-in-the-mall paradigm��id�14db3fef7286�body�٫前额叶皮层负责执行功能，包括计划、决策、冲动控制和工作记忆。它发育较晚，直到二十多岁才完全成熟，因此青少年易冲动。��The prefrontal cortex supports executive functions such as planning, decision making, impulse control, and working memory. It matures late, not fully until the twenties, which partly explains adolescent impulsivity.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�16ab823b60b1�body��+塔杰费尔用抛硬币或对抽象画的偏好等毫无意义的标准把被试分成两组，成员彼此匿名、没有互动也没有实际利益关联，随后请他们分配点数。结果被试系统性地偏向本组成员，甚至在有更高绝对收益的方案面前，仍宁愿选择让本组相对领先的分配。这说明单纯的分类就足以引发群际区分，社会认同理论据此提出人们通过让内群优于外群来获得积极的自我评价。这一发现把偏见的来源从资源竞争扩展到认同需求本身。��Tajfel divided participants by meaningless criteria such as a coin toss or a preference between abstract paintings, keeping members anonymous with no interaction and no material stake, then asked them to allocate points. Participants systematically favoured their own group and often preferred allocations that maximised the in-group's relative advantage over ones giving their group more in absolute terms. Mere categorisation is therefore enough to generate intergroup differentiation, and social identity theory accounts for it by arguing people derive positive self-evaluation from seeing their in-group as superior. The finding extended the roots of prejudice from resource competition to identity needs themselves.�ans��src�ٌTajfel（1971）《European Journal of Social Psychology》社会分类与群际行为；Tajfel 与 Turner（1979）社会认同理论论文ٳTajfel et al. (1971), European Journal of Social Psychology, Social categorization and intergroup behaviour; Tajfel and Turner (1979), An integrative theory of intergroup conflict��id�18668447ee2e�body��4为控制严重癫痫而切断胼胼体的患者，两半球之间的直接信息交流被阻断。斯佩里与加扎尼加设计的实验把刺激只呈现给一侧视野：呈现给右半球的物体患者无法用言语说出名称，却能用左手从遮挡的物品中挑出对应物；呈现给左半球的则可以正常报告。这确立了语言输出主要依赖左半球，而空间与整体性加工偏向右半球。研究还发现左半球倾向为不明原因的行为编造解释，这一虚构倾向对理解自我叙事的构建有深远意义。��In patients whose corpus callosum was severed to control severe epilepsy, direct communication between the hemispheres is interrupted. Sperry and Gazzaniga presented stimuli to a single visual field: an object shown to the right hemisphere could not be named aloud, yet the left hand could pick out the matching item from hidden objects, while stimuli shown to the left hemisphere were reported normally. This established that speech output depends mainly on the left hemisphere while spatial and holistic processing leans right. The work also revealed a left-hemisphere tendency to confabulate explanations for behaviour it did not initiate, with lasting implications for how self-narratives are constructed.�ans��src��dSperry（1968）《American Psychologist》半球断连与意识；Gazzaniga《The Bisected Brain》�}Sperry (1968), American Psychologist, Hemisphere deconnection and unity in conscious awareness; Gazzaniga, The Bisected Brain��id�18eaee7b8919�body��迁移学习指在一个情境中学到的知识或技能应用到另一个情境，分为正迁移（促进）和负迁移（干扰）。例如会骑自行车有助于学电动车，但母语发音可能干扰外语。理解迁移能帮我们设计更通用的教学。�3Transfer of learning is applying knowledge or skill from one context to another, as positive transfer (help) or negative transfer (interference). Riding a bike helps with an e-scooter, but native pronunciation can interfere with a foreign language. Understanding transfer helps design more general teaching.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（学习章）�0Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), learning chapter��id�1970f9a92bcd�body�ٴ凝聚力高的队沟通更顺、逆境更稳，但前提看任务凝聚力（为赢）而非仅社交凝聚力。过强社交黏性有时庇护松懈，需以目标把人粘合。��Cohesive teams communicate better and stay steadier under adversity, but task cohesion (to win) matters more than social cohesion. Over-strong social glue can shield slack; bond people through goals.�ans��src�ٓTZINER,《RELATION BETWEEN SOCIAL COHESION AND TEAM PERFORMANCE IN SOCCER TEAMS》,Perceptual and Motor Skills,2003 (DOI: 10.2466/pms.96.1.145-148)ّTZINER, 'RELATION BETWEEN SOCIAL COHESION AND TEAM PERFORMANCE IN SOCCER TEAMS', Perceptual and Motor Skills, 2003, DOI: 10.2466/pms.96.1.145-148��id�1ac97370861f�body���镜像神经元在个体自己执行某动作或观察他人执行同一动作时都会放电，最早由里佐拉蒂在猕猴脑中发现。它被认为是模仿、共情和语言演化的神经基础之一。��Mirror neurons fire both when an individual performs an action and when observing another do the same, first discovered by Rizzolatti in monkey brains. They are considered a neural basis for imitation, empathy, and language evolution.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�1ad49d136898�body��^血清素假说源于早期药理观察：提升突触间血清素水平的药物能缓解症状，因此推断病因是血清素不足。一项覆盖多类证据的伞形综述汇总了血清素代谢物浓度、受体与转运体影像、色氨酸耗竭实验及基因关联研究，未能找到支持血清素水平或活性总体降低的一致证据。这并不意味着抗抑郁药无效，随机对照试验显示中重度抑郁患者可获得优于安慰剂的收益，但作用机制可能涉及神经可塑性与情绪加工偏向的改变，简单的化学失衡叙事已不足以描述病理。��The serotonin hypothesis grew from early pharmacology: drugs that raise synaptic serotonin relieve symptoms, so a serotonin deficit was inferred as the cause. An umbrella review pooling several evidence streams — serotonin metabolite levels, receptor and transporter imaging, tryptophan depletion studies, and genetic association work — found no consistent support for globally reduced serotonin levels or activity. This does not mean antidepressants are ineffective, since randomised trials show benefit over placebo in moderate to severe depression, but their mechanism likely involves neuroplasticity and shifts in emotional processing bias, and the simple chemical imbalance narrative no longer describes the pathology.�ans��src�ٓMoncrieff 等（2022）《Molecular Psychiatry》血清素与抑郁伞形综述；Cipriani 等（2018）《The Lancet》抗抑郁药网络元分析٨Moncrieff et al. (2022), Molecular Psychiatry, umbrella review of serotonin and depression; Cipriani et al. (2018), The Lancet, network meta-analysis of antidepressants��id�1adcf8bdb432�body���该效应指能力不足者往往高估自己（缺乏元认知来识别错误），而能力强者反而可能低估自己（误以为别人也一样懂）。随着真实技能提升，自信先降后升，呈曲线关系。��The effect: low-skilled people overestimate themselves (lacking metacognition to spot errors), while highly skilled ones may underestimate (assuming others know it too). Confidence dips then rises with real competence—a curvilinear relation.�ans��src��Kruger 与 Dunning (1999)�Kruger & Dunning (1999)��id�1b552a497609�body���MMPI 是应用最广的客观人格与临床量表之一，包含多个效度量表以检测作答是否认真或掩饰。它用实证标准（而非理论）区分不同临床群体，常用于评估与筛查。�The MMPI is among the most widely used objective personality and clinical inventories, with validity scales detecting careless or defensive responding. It uses empirical criteria rather than theory to distinguish clinical groups and is used for assessment and screening.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�1cfb72f15730�body��E麦高夫的“情感增强记忆”研究表明，情绪唤起会激活杏仁核，进而“标记”海马体优先巩固该段经历（McGaugh, 2000; Cahill & McGaugh, 1998）。肾上腺素与皮质醇等应激激素像加粗了记忆的墨迹，所以生死关头、公开出丑的片段常比平淡日子清晰得多。�0McGaugh's work on emotional enhancement of memory shows arousal activates the amygdala, which then tags the hippocampus to prioritize that episode (McGaugh, 2000; Cahill & McGaugh, 1998). Stress hormones like adrenaline and cortisol bolden the ink, so moments of danger or public shame outlast dull days.�ans��src��PMcGaugh, J.L. (2000)《记忆的百年巩固研究》, Science 287(5451):248-251�WMcGaugh, J.L. (2000). Memory - a century of consolidation. Science, 287(5451), 248-251.��id�1d836b732011�body��%原始报告强调普通人在权威指令下会施加看似危险的电击，服从率之高震动了学界。研究者后来查阅耶鲁大学档案中的录音与被试事后问卷，发现相当比例的被试怀疑电击是假的，而怀疑程度与服从行为相关；实验者的说服话术也远比程序说明中的四句标准提示灵活多变。这些发现并未否认情境压力的作用，但把解释重心从盲目服从转向了对情境定义的接受、对科学事业的认同以及被试与实验者之间的互动过程。�The original reports emphasised that ordinary people would deliver apparently dangerous shocks under an authority's instruction, and the high obedience rates shocked the field. Researchers later examined recordings and post-experiment questionnaires in the Yale archives and found a substantial share of participants doubted the shocks were real, with that scepticism correlating with compliance, while the experimenter's prods were far more improvised than the four standard lines described in the procedure. These findings do not deny the power of the situation, but they shift the explanation from blind obedience toward acceptance of the situation's definition, identification with the scientific enterprise, and the interactive dynamics between participant and experimenter.�ans��src�١Milgram（1963）《Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology》；Perry《Behind the Shock Machine》（2013）；Haslam 与 Reicher（2012）《PLOS Biology》يMilgram (1963), Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology; Perry, Behind the Shock Machine (2013); Haslam and Reicher (2012), PLOS Biology��id�1e912112d10b�body�ٽ情绪调节需认知控制资源；强行压抑负面情绪会占用工作记忆、损害随后任务表现（情绪调节耗损）。这解释了压力大时更难专心、更易出错。��Regulating emotion draws on cognitive-control resources; forcing down negative feeling consumes working memory and impairs later tasks (regulation depletion). It explains why under stress we concentrate worse and err more.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�21680ebe9b7b�body���认知架构是用一套固定结构与规则模拟人类感知、记忆、决策的计算框架，目标是统一解释多种认知任务。它们把心理学理论变成可运行模型，用来预测反应时与错误模式。�Cognitive architectures are computational frameworks with fixed structures and rules simulating human perception, memory and decision-making, aiming to unify explanations across tasks. They turn psychological theory into runnable models predicting reaction times and errors.�ans��src���Liu,《QN-ACES: Integrating Queueing Network and ACT-R, CAPS, EPIC, and Soar Architectures for Multitask Cognitive Modeling》,International Journal of Human-Computer Interaction,2009 (DOI: 10.1080/10447310902973182)��Liu, 'QN-ACES: Integrating Queueing Network and ACT-R, CAPS, EPIC, and Soar Architectures for Multitask Cognitive Modeling', International Journal of Human-Computer Interaction, 2009, DOI: 10.1080/10447310902973182��id�2294be6192a2�body�١清醒梦是做梦时意识到“我在做梦”并能一定程度上操控剧情的状态，多发生在 REM 期，可通过现实检验等训练提升频率。ْA lucid dream is realizing 'I'm dreaming' and partly controlling the plot, mostly in REM; frequency can be trained via reality-testing techniques.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�23a48e7a0a5a�body��^该模型最初包含三部分：负责言语材料的语音回路、处理视觉与空间信息的视空间画板，以及分配注意、协调子系统的中央执行系统，后来又补充了整合多通道信息并与长时记忆对接的情节缓冲器。与把短时记忆看作单一容量仓库的旧观念相比，它能解释为什么同时进行言语与空间任务的干扰远小于两个言语任务，也能解释语音相似性效应和词长效应。临床上，脑损伤患者可以只损失言语工作记忆而空间能力完好，这种分离为多成分结构提供了直接证据。��The model began with three parts: a phonological loop for verbal material, a visuospatial sketchpad for visual and spatial information, and a central executive that allocates attention and coordinates the subsystems, later joined by an episodic buffer that binds multimodal information and interfaces with long-term memory. Unlike the older view of short-term memory as one undifferentiated store, it explains why pairing a verbal with a spatial task interferes far less than pairing two verbal tasks, and it accounts for phonological similarity and word-length effects. Clinically, brain-injured patients can lose verbal working memory while spatial span stays intact, a dissociation that directly supports the multi-component architecture.�ans��src�٤Baddeley 与 Hitch（1974）《Recent Advances in Learning and Motivation》工作记忆章节；Baddeley（2000）《Trends in Cognitive Sciences》情节缓冲器ٟBaddeley and Hitch (1974), Working Memory, in Recent Advances in Learning and Motivation; Baddeley (2000), Trends in Cognitive Sciences, on the episodic buffer��id�23c27f51928c�body���陈述性知识是“知道是什么”（事实与事件），可有意识回忆；程序性知识是“知道怎么做”（如骑车、游泳），往往自动化、难以用语言描述。两者依赖不同的脑系统。��Declarative knowledge is 'knowing that'—facts and events—which can be consciously recalled; procedural knowledge is 'knowing how'—like riding a bike or swimming—often automatic and hard to put into words. They rely on different brain systems.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�245992980679�body���米勒 1956 年归纳出神奇数字七加减二，依据的是允许被试默默复述、组块化甚至借助长时记忆知识的传统跨度任务。柯万重新审视后指出，一旦用防止复述与组块的实验设计，例如变化检测或呈现后立即干扰，纯粹的注意焦点容量只有约四个组块。因此差别不在于谁算错，而在于测量条件不同：七加减二反映了包含复述与知识支持的整体表现，四则接近核心容量的下限。�ZMiller's 1956 magical number seven plus or minus two came from classic span tasks that let participants rehearse silently, chunk items, and draw on long-term knowledge. Cowan re-examined the evidence and argued that once designs block rehearsal and chunking — as in change detection or immediate interference after presentation — the pure focus-of-attention capacity is only about four chunks. The disagreement is therefore about measurement conditions rather than arithmetic: seven reflects overall performance with rehearsal and knowledge support, while four approximates the core capacity limit.�ans��src��nMiller（1956）《Psychological Review》神奇数字七；Cowan（2001）《Behavioral and Brain Sciences》�jMiller (1956), Psychological Review, The magical number seven; Cowan (2001), Behavioral and Brain Sciences��id�2655505afae5�body���职业压力研究（如Karasek的“要求—控制模型”）发现，真正有害的不是工作量本身，而是“高要求＋低控制”的组合：任务多但几乎没有决策权时，健康风险最大。社会支持（同事和上级的理解）能显著缓冲压力。所以“扛得住”的人往往不是更拼命，而是拥有更多资源：能调整节奏、有人分担、知道自己有选择。��Job-strain research (e.g., Karasek's demand–control model) finds the real hazard isn't workload itself but “high demand plus low control”: heavy demands with little decision latitude carry the greatest health risk. Social support from colleagues and supervisors buffers much of this. So people who “hold up” usually aren't tougher — they have more resources: adjustable pace, people to share with, and a felt sense of choice.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�275a214765a9�body���这叫“群体思维”：团队为了维持表面一致而压抑异议。当凝聚力强、领导强势、外部压力大时，成员会自我审查、随声附和，把“一团和气”误当成“达成共识”，还不自觉地低估风险和对手。破解方法包括指定“魔鬼代言人”故意唱反调、领导最后发言、用匿名方式收集意见，让不同声音有制度性的出口。��That's groupthink: a team suppresses dissent to preserve harmony. With high cohesion, a dominant leader, and external pressure, members self-censor and go along, mistaking politeness for consensus while underestimating risks and rivals. Remedies include appointing a devil's advocate, having the leader speak last, and gathering anonymous input so dissenting voices have an institutional outlet.�ans��src��APA（群体决策研究）�$APA (group decision-making research)��id�2843bd0ffb90�body��框架效应指同一个问题的不同表述方式会改变人的选择：把手术说成“90%存活”比“10%死亡”更让人接受，尽管信息等价。它说明决策受表述而非事实本身影响。公共沟通和医疗告知都需谨慎使用框架。�'The framing effect is that different wordings of the same problem change choices: saying a surgery has '90% survival' is more acceptable than '10% death', though equivalent. It shows decisions are shaped by phrasing, not just facts. Public communication and medical consent need careful framing.�ans��src��Tversky & Kahneman 框架实验�&Tversky & Kahneman framing experiments��id�2950005a570d�body�ٜ进化塑造的直觉擅长处理具体风险而非抽象概率，加上可得性、代表性等偏差，使我们常误判“罕见却醒目”的事件。ٕIntuition evolved for concrete risks, not abstract probabilities; with availability and representativeness biases, we misjudge rare-but-vivid events.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�297dd95c20e0�body���韦纳认为人们把成败归因于能力、努力、任务难度、运气等因素，并沿稳定性与可控性维度归类。把失败归于可控的努力不足比归于稳定的能力欠缺更利于后续努力。�Weiner argued people attribute success or failure to ability, effort, task difficulty, luck, and similar factors, classified by stability and controllability. Blaming failure on controllable lack of effort, rather than stable lack of ability, better sustains future effort.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�298a24875d69�body���该理论认为我们先有生理反应、再据此体验情绪：看到熊先心跳加速，然后才“感到”害怕。它把情绪视为身体变化的副产品，与常识“先怕再逃”相反。��The theory holds that we first have a bodily reaction and then experience the emotion from it: you see a bear, your heart races, and then you 'feel' afraid. It treats emotion as a byproduct of bodily change, reversing the common 'fear then flee' order.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2b84b9e28db8�body���巴德利提出，工作记忆由中央执行系统统一调度，下面分设语音回路（处理声音和语言信息）、视觉空间画板（处理图像和空间信息）和情景缓冲器（把各来源信息整合成连贯片段）。所以边听讲边做笔记会互相挤占语音回路，而边看图边听语音则相对不冲突。这也解释了为什么“分通道”学习（图文声并用）常更有效。��Baddeley's model splits working memory into a central executive plus three subsystems: the phonological loop (speech and sound), the visuospatial sketchpad (images and space), and the episodic buffer (integrating information into coherent episodes). Listening while taking notes competes for the same loop, while looking at a diagram while listening clashes less. That's why multimodal learning often works better.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（认知心理学章）�<Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), cognitive psychology chapter��id�2bb391b1467b�body�ٟ即使“治疗”本身无效，患者的期望、治疗关系与仪式感也能带来真实症状改善，说明心理背景本身就是疗效的一部分。ٮEven with an inert 'treatment,' a patient's expectation, the therapeutic relationship, and ritual can produce real symptom relief, showing context itself is part of the cure.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2bdf559d5c0d�body�ٴ关系受“社会资本”与当下需求驱动：升学、搬家、育儿等转折会改变谁与我们日常相连。这不是薄情，而是关系随生活结构自然流动。��Ties are driven by social capital and current needs: transitions like school, moving or parenting change who we live alongside daily. This is not coldness but relationships naturally flowing with life structure.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2c293132e925�body��詹姆斯-兰格理论认为，我们并非先感到害怕再逃跑，而是先对身体变化（如心跳加快）产生知觉，然后才体验到情绪。也就是说“因为我们发抖，所以感到害怕”。这挑战了“情绪在前、身体反应在后”的常识。�0The James-Lange theory holds that we do not feel fear and then run; rather, we perceive bodily changes (such as a racing heart) first and then experience the emotion. In other words, 'we feel afraid because we tremble'. This challenges the common-sense view that emotion comes before the bodily response.�ans��src��James-Lange 情绪理论�James-Lange emotion theory��id�2caee1c8b0cf�body���这是“元认知”——对自己认知过程的监控。成绩好的学生常在自测后准确判断薄弱点，再针对性下功夫；而新手常把“眼熟”误当成“掌握”，因为再认比回忆容易得多，这就是“熟悉感陷阱”。训练元认知很简单：合上书本默写、向自己或他人讲解、先预估考试分数再对照实际——准确性会逐步提高。��That's metacognition — monitoring one's own cognitive processes. Strong students judge their weak spots accurately after self-testing and work on them; novices mistake familiarity for mastery, because recognition is far easier than recall — the “familiarity trap.” Training metacognition is straightforward: recall without the book, explain aloud, predict your exam score and compare. Accuracy improves with practice.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�2d45ad9ccc09�body���常模是某一代表性群体在测验上的得分分布，用来解释个体分数的相对位置。没有常模，单个原始分几乎没有可比意义，跨文化使用尤需注意常模的适用性。��A norm is the score distribution of a representative reference group, used to interpret an individual's relative standing. Without norms, a raw score is barely meaningful; cross-cultural use especially requires attention to norm appropriateness.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�2d7db66ab220�body��8极少数“天然短睡者”携带 DEC2 等基因的突变，让他们用更短睡眠获得同等恢复（Fu 等, 2009, Science）。这类变异影响了生物钟与睡眠深度的调控，并非靠意志硬撑；对绝大多数人而言，长期少睡仍会损害记忆与代谢，所以不应盲目模仿。�AA tiny fraction of natural short sleepers carry mutations such as DEC2 that let them recover fully on far less sleep (Fu et al., 2009, Science). These variants reshape clock and sleep-depth regulation and are not willpower; for most people chronic short sleep still harms memory and metabolism, so copying them is unwise.�ans��src��_Fu, Y.-H. 等 (2009)《转录因子 DEC2 突变延长睡眠时间》, Science 325(5942):866-870�|Fu, Y.-H. et al. (2009). The transcription factor DEC2 confers resistance to sleep deprivation. Science, 325(5942), 866-870.��id�2daec389c474�body���学习迁移指在一个情境中学到的知识或技能影响另一情境中的表现，分为正迁移（促进）与负迁移（干扰）。理解概念的深层结构比机械练习更利于迁移。��Transfer of learning is when knowledge or skill gained in one context affects performance in another, as positive transfer (help) or negative transfer (interference). Grasping deep structure aids transfer more than rote practice.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�2dfb9424c24e�body��|奥尔波特提出四个促进条件：群体间地位平等、共同追求的目标、合作而非竞争的互动结构，以及权威或制度的明确支持。佩蒂格鲁与特罗普的大规模元分析纳入五百多项研究，确认接触与偏见降低存在稳定的负相关，满足奥尔波特条件时效应更强，但即使不完全满足也有一定效果。后续研究还发现，跨群体友谊、共情与减少焦虑是主要中介机制，而通过媒体或想象的间接接触也能产生较弱的类似效果。需要注意的是因果方向存在选择效应，偏见较低的人更可能主动寻求接触。��Allport specified four facilitating conditions: equal status between groups, common goals, cooperative rather than competitive interaction, and explicit support from authorities or institutions. Pettigrew and Tropp's meta-analysis of more than five hundred studies confirmed a robust negative association between contact and prejudice, stronger when Allport's conditions are met yet still present when they are not fully satisfied. Later work identified cross-group friendship, empathy, and reduced anxiety as the main mediators, and found weaker but real effects for indirect contact through media or imagined encounters. A caveat is selection: less prejudiced people are more likely to seek contact in the first place, complicating causal inference.�ans��src�ٕAllport《The Nature of Prejudice》（1954）；Pettigrew 与 Tropp（2006）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》接触理论元分析٢Allport, The Nature of Prejudice (1954); Pettigrew and Tropp (2006), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, meta-analytic test of intergroup contact theory��id�2f95b3575196�body���默认选项利用现状偏差与惰性：被预选的方案采纳率远高于需主动选的。它广泛用于器官捐献、节能与订阅，是“助推”的核心工具，也引发家长式干预的争议。��Defaults exploit status-quo bias and inertia: pre-selected options are adopted far more than those needing action. Used in organ donation, energy saving and subscriptions, it is core to 'nudging,' with paternalism debate.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�2fffd75c3e61�body��近期模型在标准化错误信念任务上通过率接近人类，但它们是从海量文本统计出行为模式，而非拥有真实信念表征。这引发争论：表面通过不等于具备内省式的他人心智理解，更像高级模式匹配。�Recent models pass standard false-belief tasks near human level, but they derive patterns from massive text, not genuine belief representations. Debate continues: passing is not possessing introspective understanding of others' minds—it may be advanced pattern matching.�ans��src���Lombardi, Lenci,《What Do You Mean? Exploring the Alleged Theory of Mind Abilities of Large Language Models》, Transactions of the Association for Computational Linguistic, 2026 (DOI: 10.1162/tacl.a.807)��Lombardi, Lenci, 'What Do You Mean? Exploring the Alleged Theory of Mind Abilities of Large Language Models', Transactions of the Association for Computational Linguistic, 2026, DOI: 10.1162/tacl.a.807��id�34ae1414704b�body���每次提取记忆，它都会短暂变得不稳定，再存回时可能混入新信息——这正是错误信息效应的神经基础。实验借此削弱创伤记忆的恐惧成分，也提示回忆并非录像。��Each time a memory is retrieved it becomes briefly unstable and may mix in new information on re-storage—the neural basis of the misinformation effect. Experiments use this to weaken fear in traumatic memories and show recall is not a video.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�36ea476c6b3f�body��BCI 记录大脑信号（如运动皮层电图或头皮 EEG），用解码算法把神经活动模式映射为光标移动、机械臂或文字输出。它依赖使用者学习调控特定神经表征，目前主要用于辅助运动障碍者，离“读心”还很远。�BA BCI records neural signals (e.g., electrocorticography or scalp EEG) and uses decoding algorithms to map activity patterns onto cursor movement, a robotic arm or text. It depends on users learning to modulate specific neural representations; today it mainly assists people with motor impairment, far from 'mind reading'.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3956aba088b6�body���Asch 后续发现，当被试匿名写下答案，从众率大幅下降——公开场合顺从多为保面子、不被排斥，私下则按事实。这说明很多从众是表演性的社会顾虑，而非真看不清。�Asch's later work found conformity dropped sharply when answers were written anonymously; public compliance is mostly face-saving and avoidance of exclusion, while private answers follow facts. Much conformity is performative social caution, not failed perception.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3abaf41b277c�body�ٮ麦克利兰提出人有三种社会动机：成就、权力与亲和。高成就需求者偏好中等难度、反馈清晰的任务，并愿意为成功承担适度风险。��McClelland proposed three social motives—achievement, power, and affiliation. Those high in need for achievement prefer moderately difficult tasks with clear feedback and accept moderate risk for success.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3ae9598ca24a�body���横断研究在同一时点比较不同年龄群，快速但不易区分年龄效应与世代效应；纵向研究追踪同一群体随时间变化，能分离个体发展轨迹却耗时且面临流失偏倚。二者常被交叉序列设计互补。��Cross-sectional studies compare age groups at one time—fast but confound age with cohort effects; longitudinal studies track the same people, separating developmental trajectories yet costly and prone to attrition bias. Sequential designs combine both.�ans��src��B《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 方法卷�%Annual Review of Psychology (methods)��id�3b595cce4c88�body���当快速连续呈现刺激时，识别出一个目标后短时间内第二个目标常被漏检，仿佛注意“眨了一下眼”。它反映对第一个目标的充分加工暂时占用了有限的意识报告资源。��In rapid serial presentation, detecting one target briefly blinds us to a second target soon after, as if attention 'blinked'. It reflects that fully processing the first target temporarily consumes limited conscious reporting capacity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3bb21aa06492�body���个体主义文化成员更倾向于将行为归因于个人特质，而集体主义文化成员更常考虑情境与关系因素。这种差异部分源于自我构念的不同，并在跨文化实验中被稳定重复。�Members of individualistic cultures more often attribute behavior to personal dispositions, whereas collectivist cultures weigh situational and relational factors. This difference partly stems from self-construal and replicates across cross-cultural experiments.�ans��src��_《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 文化心理卷;Nature Human Behaviour�IAnnual Review of Psychology (cultural psychology); Nature Human Behaviour��id�3bd26c03ed4c�body��}敬畏是在面对宏大、超出日常理解的事物时产生的情绪，核心体验是“自我变小、与世界相连”。研究显示，敬畏会降低自我关注，让人更慷慨、更愿意帮助他人，同时伴随着迷走神经活动增强带来的平静感。看自然风景、凝视星空、欣赏艺术都可能唤起敬畏，是低成本的心理健康资源。�oAwe arises when we confront something vast that transcends everyday understanding; its core is a sense of a smaller self connected to the world. Studies find awe reduces self-focus, increases generosity and prosocial behavior, and is accompanied by calming vagal activity. Nature views, a starry sky, or great art can trigger it — a low-cost psychological resource.�ans��src��APA（敬畏情绪研究）�APA (awe research)��id�3cb45f936d7b�body��h当匿名感增强、注意被群体行动吸引时，个人的自我觉察下降，叫“去个体化”。此时内在标准和愧疚感被暂时减弱，人更容易被即时情绪和群体行为带动。网络匿名区、演唱会人群都可能出现这种现象。意识到“匿名让我更容易冲动”，有助于在情绪上头时提前踩刹车。�RWhen anonymity rises and attention is drawn to group action, self-awareness drops — “deindividuation.” Internal standards and guilt weaken, and people follow immediate emotions and the crowd. It shows up in anonymous online spaces and packed concerts. Knowing “anonymity makes me impulsive” helps you brake before emotion peaks.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（群体行为章）�.Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), crowd behavior��id�3d42679733f1�body��0“恐惧管理理论”（Greenberg 等, 1990）认为对死亡的觉察会触发存在性焦虑，于是人靠坚守文化价值观与自尊来对抗它。实验里被提示死亡的人，会更褒奖符合自身价值观者、贬低异见者，说明对不朽符号的追求是行为的隐形引擎。�MTerror Management Theory (Greenberg et al., 1990) holds that awareness of death stirs existential anxiety, so people defend cultural values and self-esteem to counter it. In experiments, those reminded of death reward value-conforming others and punish dissenters, revealing a hidden engine behind our quest for symbolic immortality.�ans��src��qGreenberg 等 (1990)《恐惧管理理论的证据》, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 58(2):308-318��Greenberg, J., Pyszczynski, T., Solomon, S., Rosenblatt, A., Veeder, M. & Kirkland, S. (1990). Evidence for terror management theory. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 58(2), 308-318.��id�3dddb8c2d4fb�body��.该测验通过比较相容与不相容配对条件下的反应时差异，测量概念与评价之间的自动联结强度，被广泛用于研究内隐偏见。元分析发现，测验分数与外显行为指标的相关通常较弱，重测信度也低于常规人格量表，因此不适合用于评估或筛选个体。但在群体与区域层面，汇总的测验分数与一些社会结果指标存在关联。较为稳妥的定位是把它当作研究自动化社会认知的实验工具，而不是判定某人是否会歧视他人的诊断手段。��The test infers the strength of automatic associations between concepts and evaluations from response-time differences between congruent and incongruent pairings, and it is widely used to study implicit bias. Meta-analyses find its scores correlate only weakly with overt behavioural measures and that test-retest reliability is lower than for conventional personality scales, so it is unsuitable for evaluating or screening individuals. At group or regional level, aggregated scores do track some social outcomes. The defensible position is to treat it as a laboratory tool for studying automatic social cognition rather than a diagnostic of whether a given person will discriminate.�ans��src�ٽGreenwald、McGhee 与 Schwartz（1998）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》；Oswald 等（2013）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》IAT 预测效度元分析��Greenwald, McGhee and Schwartz (1998), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Oswald et al. (2013), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, meta-analysis of IAT predictive validity��id�3e8c358b3801�body���焦虑的核心是杏仁核——大脑的威胁检测器，它能抢在前额叶皮层理性评估之前迅速启动警报（心跳加快、呼吸变浅、想逃跑）。前额叶负责“刹车”和重新评估，但它在警报下的工作效率会下降。如果杏仁核长期过度警觉（高估威胁、低估应对能力），就构成焦虑障碍的神经基础。好消息是，认知行为疗法和暴露训练能逐步降低这种过度警觉，这是可塑的。��The core of anxiety is the amygdala — the brain's threat detector — which fires the alarm (racing heart, shallow breathing, urge to flee) before the prefrontal cortex can rationally evaluate. The prefrontal cortex brakes and reappraises, but works worse under alarm. Chronic amygdala hypervigilance (overestimating threat, underestimating coping) underlies anxiety disorders. The hopeful part: CBT and exposure training measurably lower that hypervigilance — it is plastic.�ans��src��G《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（焦虑与情绪神经科学章）�BPsychology and Life (Zimbardo), anxiety and affective neuroscience��id�3edf7c4b9743�body��现象意识是“有感受”的主观状态本身；取用意识是该信息能否被报告、推理与控制行为。两者可分离——有些状态你隐隐感到却说不出，也有信息可用却无感受，区分它们有助于厘清意识研究。�!Phenomenal consciousness is the subjective state of 'having a feel'; access consciousness is whether that info can be reported, reasoned with and used to act. They can dissociate—some feelings are ineffable, some info is usable without feel—a key distinction in consciousness research.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�3ee875804b52�body��s抽象版任务要求检验若一面是元音则另一面是偶数这类条件规则，多数被试只翻验证性的卡片而忽略最关键的否定后件，反映出确认倾向和对逻辑蕴含的直觉误用。但如果把同一逻辑结构换成检查饮酒年龄这类社会契约情境，正确率会大幅上升。对此有两种主要解释：一是内容效应与熟悉度提供了可用的语义线索，二是进化心理学提出人类具备专门检测欺骗与违规者的推理机制。实验之所以重要，在于它显示推理表现高度依赖问题的表征方式，而非单纯的一般逻辑能力。��In the abstract version participants must test a conditional rule such as if one side shows a vowel then the other shows an even number, and most turn only the confirming card while neglecting the crucial potential falsifier, revealing a confirmation tendency and misuse of logical implication. Recast with the same logical structure as a social contract, such as checking a drinking-age rule, accuracy rises sharply. Two accounts compete: content effects and familiarity supply usable semantic cues, and evolutionary psychologists propose a specialised mechanism for detecting cheaters and rule violators. The task matters because it shows reasoning performance depends heavily on how a problem is represented rather than on general logical competence alone.�ans��src��wWason（1968）《Quarterly Journal of Experimental Psychology》；Cosmides（1989）《Cognition》社会契约推理�qWason (1968), Quarterly Journal of Experimental Psychology; Cosmides (1989), Cognition, social contract reasoning��id�3f61271c2f2d�body��随机对照试验显示 MBSR 可显著降低焦虑、抑郁与慢性疼痛患者的症状严重程度，并伴随前额叶与默认网络活动重塑。但效应量多为中等，且长期效果与师资质量高度相关，需避免夸大其适用范围。�"Randomized trials report MBSR reduces symptoms of anxiety, depression, and chronic pain, accompanied by shifts in prefrontal and default-mode network activity. Effects are typically moderate, long-term outcomes depend on teacher quality, and claims about its scope should not be overstated.�ans��src��o《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 冥想研究卷;Nature Human Behaviour 正念元分析�eAnnual Review of Psychology (meditation research); Nature Human Behaviour (mindfulness meta-analysis)��id�40952b476e55�body��预注册要求研究者在数据收集前公开研究假设、样本量与分析计划，使事后「数据挖掘」与灵活更改难以伪装成先验假设。它区分了探索性与验证性研究，提升结论可信度，但需配合透明方能见效。��Preregistration requires posting hypotheses, sample size, and analysis plans before data collection, making post-hoc data mining hard to pass as a priori. It separates exploratory from confirmatory work and raises credibility, but only with transparency.�ans��src��NNature Human Behaviour 开放科学方法;《心理学年度评论》方法卷�TNature Human Behaviour (open science methods); Annual Review of Psychology (methods)��id�40ec4e23585b�body���费斯汀格提出，当人的行为与信念冲突时会产生不舒服的心理紧张，叫认知失调。为减轻不适，人会改态度、改行为或找理由。例如花钱买了不喜欢的物品后，反而会更说服自己它值得。�+Festinger proposed that when behavior conflicts with beliefs, people feel uncomfortable mental tension called cognitive dissonance. To reduce it, they change attitudes, actions, or find justifications. For example, after buying something they dislike, people may convince themselves it was worth it.�ans��src��Festinger 1957 理论�Festinger 1957 theory��id�42b6c8274324�body���CBT 多聚焦改变扭曲想法的内容；ACT 则主张不与念头争辩，而是接纳不适、明确价值并承诺行动（认知解离+正念+价值）。它把目标从“消除症状”转为“带着症状过有意义的生活”。�CBT often changes the content of distorted thoughts; ACT instead advises not wrestling with thoughts but accepting discomfort, clarifying values and committing to action (defusion + mindfulness + values). Its goal shifts from 'remove symptoms' to 'live meaningfully with them'.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�43a639bdccd0�body���这叫“自我妨碍”：为了保护自尊，预先制造“失败的理由”——考前不复习、熬夜、声称“我根本没准备”。如果考砸，可以归咎于没复习而不是没能力；如果考好，则显得“天赋高”。它短期内保护自我形象，长期却损害成绩和自信。更健康的路径是把“怕失败”换成“努力本身就是成长”，允许自己不完美地尝试。��That's self-handicapping: creating excuses in advance to protect self-esteem — skipping study, staying up late, insisting “I didn't prepare.” Fail then gets blamed on lack of preparation, not ability; success looks like raw talent. It shields the self-image short-term but erodes grades and confidence long-term. A healthier path is trading “fear of failure” for “effort is growth” and allowing imperfect attempts.�ans��src��APA（自我妨碍研究）� APA (self-handicapping research)��id�43ca40adad6f�body���刻板印象和偏见可以是外显的（自己承认），也可以是内隐的——自动激活、迅速、常与个人价值观冲突。内隐联想测验（IAT）这类工具通过反应时来测量无意识联想的速度差异。内隐偏见来自长期接触的媒体和文化刻板印象，不是个人道德污点；但正视它的存在，并用跨群体接触、反刻板印象想象去主动校正，是减少歧视行为的有效途径。��Stereotypes and prejudice can be explicit (acknowledged) or implicit — automatic, fast, often clashing with our own values. Tools like the Implicit Association Test (IAT) measure unconscious associations through response times. Implicit bias grows from media and cultural stereotypes, not personal moral failure; but acknowledging it and actively correcting via intergroup contact and counter-stereotypic imagery is an evidence-based way to reduce discriminatory behavior.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（偏见章）�1Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), prejudice chapter��id�446aa2f198bd�body���元分析用统计方法把多个独立研究合并，估算整体效应并看异质性（为何结果不同）。它比单一研究稳健，但前提是纳入研究质量与发表偏倚可控。��Meta-analysis statistically combines independent studies to estimate an overall effect and examine heterogeneity (why results differ). It is sturdier than one study, yet depends on study quality and controlled publication bias.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�449e36a7b681�body��#Gross 于 1998 年提出情绪调节过程模型，将策略按情绪产生的时间进程排列：情境选择、情境修正、注意分配、认知重评与反应抑制。其中“认知重评”（改变对事件的解读）通常比“表达抑制”更有利于情绪健康与社交。�jGross's 1998 process model orders regulation strategies along the timeline of emotion generation: situation selection, situation modification, attentional deployment, cognitive reappraisal, and response inhibition. Cognitive reappraisal (changing how one interprets an event) generally benefits well-being and social functioning more than expressive suppression.�ans��src��hGross 1998 年论文（载 Review of General Psychology）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�TGross (1998) in Review of General Psychology; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�450f473ce4ec�body��.埃克曼等人主张存在若干普遍的基本情绪，各自具有特定的面部表情、生理模式与神经回路，跨文化面部识别研究是主要证据。巴雷特则提出，情绪并非天生的离散类别，而是大脑基于内感受信号、情境与习得的情绪概念实时建构的类别，元分析显示所谓专属的自主神经模式与脑区定位并不稳定。分歧还延伸到方法论：强制选择标签的识别任务可能人为制造了普遍性，而自由标注与跨文化田野研究得到的结果更为多样。��Ekman and colleagues argue for a small set of universal basic emotions, each with a characteristic facial expression, physiological signature, and neural circuitry, with cross-cultural facial recognition studies as the main evidence. Barrett counters that emotions are not innate discrete categories but categories the brain constructs in real time from interoceptive signals, context, and learned emotion concepts, noting that meta-analyses fail to find stable emotion-specific autonomic patterns or dedicated brain regions. The dispute extends to method: forced-choice labelling tasks may manufacture apparent universality, whereas free labelling and cross-cultural field studies yield considerably more variability.�ans��src��hEkman（1992）《Cognition and Emotion》基本情绪论；Barrett《How Emotions Are Made》（2017）�jEkman (1992), Cognition and Emotion, An argument for basic emotions; Barrett, How Emotions Are Made (2017)��id�47070eba78c8�body��,精神分裂症的正性症状是正常功能的“过度或扭曲”，如幻觉、妄想和思维紊乱；负性症状则是正常功能的“缺失或减退”，如情感淡漠、意志缺乏和社会退缩。这一区分由 Crow 等人提出，对预后判断与药物研发具有重要意义。�$Positive symptoms are excesses or distortions of normal function—hallucinations, delusions, disorganized thinking—while negative symptoms are deficits—flat affect, avolition, social withdrawal. Crow and others proposed this distinction, which matters for prognosis and drug development.�ans��src��WCrow 1980 年论文（载 British Journal of Psychiatry）；Comer《异常心理学》�HCrow (1980) in British Journal of Psychiatry; Comer, Abnormal Psychology��id�471febf8daed�body���CBT 模型里三者互相影响：灾难化想法导致焦虑导致回避，而改任一边都会牵动其余。自助进阶可从记录自动思维、检验、换行动的小循环练起，比空想更有效。�In the CBT model the three loop: catastrophic thought brings anxiety brings avoidance, and changing any one moves the others. Advanced self-help practices the small loop of logging automatic thoughts, testing and changing actions, better than blank thinking.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�491ef67cdbe3�body�ل这是社会认同的本能：通过归类获得归属感与自尊，但也会带来外群体偏见，需靠共同目标来化解。ِIt's an instinct of social identity—categorizing gives belonging and self-esteem but can breed out-group bias, which shared goals help reduce.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�49cdf2a86f92�body�ي当人或动物反复经历无法控制的负面事件，会学会“努力也没用”而放弃尝试，与抑郁和被动密切相关。ًAfter repeated uncontrollable bad events, organisms learn 'effort is useless' and stop trying—closely linked to depression and passivity.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�49d41a564b6f�body���这是“自我对话”，运动心理训练的标准工具。研究表明，功能性自我对话（指导动作、给自己打气）能改善注意分配和自信，而消极的自我批判（“我真没用”）会损害表现。语言会占用注意力资源，所以“说什么”和“怎么说”影响很大。把内心的批评换成温和、具体、教练式的指令，考试和面试同样受益。��That's self-talk, a standard tool in sport psychology training. Research shows functional self-talk (instructional cues, encouragement) improves attention and confidence, while harsh self-criticism (“I'm useless”) hurts performance. Language consumes attentional resources, so both content and tone matter. Replacing inner criticism with calm, specific, coach-like instructions helps in exams and interviews too.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4a11316b3a11�body���突触可塑性指神经元之间连接强度可随经验改变，LTP是其中反复激活使突触变强、信号传递更高效的过程。它被广泛视为学习与记忆在细胞层面的基础。�
Synaptic plasticity means the strength of connections between neurons can change with experience; LTP is the process where repeated activation strengthens a synapse and makes signaling more efficient. It is widely viewed as the cellular basis of learning and memory.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�4a6d27536615�body�ل能力最低的人往往高估自己，因为缺少识别错误的元认知；而高手反而可能因标准更高而低估自己。ٞThe least skilled tend to overestimate themselves because they lack the metacognition to spot errors, while experts may underestimate due to higher standards.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�4b3b0c770ef3�body��前瞻性记忆是指记得在将来某个时刻去做某件事，比如“下班顺路买牛奶”或“三小时后吃药”。它依赖执行功能和情境线索的触发，比起回忆过去更难被意识监控。随着年龄增长，前瞻性记忆容易下降。�Prospective memory is remembering to do something in the future, such as 'buy milk on the way home' or 'take medicine in three hours'. It relies on executive function and contextual cues, and is harder to monitor consciously than recalling the past. It tends to decline with age.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4b6e5213ae10�body���社会认同理论（塔杰菲尔）指出，人们把自我的一部分建立在所属群体上，并通过对内群体偏好获得自尊。即使分组标准纯属随机（如按硬币分A/B组），成员也会偏爱自己组、把更多资源留给自己组。这种认同本身无害，但它解释了刻板印象和偏见为何如此顽固——它们服务于“我们更好”的自我价值感。��Social identity theory (Tajfel) holds that part of the self-concept rests on group membership, and self-esteem is boosted by in-group favoritism. Even random groupings — say, assigned to A or B by a coin flip — produce bias: members favor their own and give more resources to it. Such identification is harmless by itself, but it shows why stereotypes and prejudice are so stubborn: they serve the sense that “we are better.”�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（群体过程章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), group processes��id�4c2a4e472d69�body���夜里疲劳削弱前额叶的调控，加上“情绪一致性记忆”让我们更容易提取消极片段，判断会偏保守甚至绝望。把重要决定留到精力恢复后的白天，能避免被暂时的情绪态带偏。�␀At night fatigue weakens prefrontal control, and mood-congruent memory makes negative snippets easier to retrieve, skewing judgment toward despair. Postpone big decisions until daytime when energy returns, to avoid being led by a temporary emotional state.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�4d04a741c4cb�body��p皮亚杰认为从12岁左右进入形式运算阶段：能对抽象命题进行逻辑推理，能“假设—演绎”地想“如果……那么……”，而不必依赖眼前的具体事物。这让青少年能够系统检验假设、思考未来与理想。当然，是否充分发展也受教育和环境支持影响，不是年龄一到就自动全部出现。��Piaget placed the formal operational stage around age 12: people can reason logically about abstract propositions and run hypothetical “if...then” thought without concrete objects in front of them. That enables systematic hypothesis testing, thinking about the future, and ideals. Whether it fully develops also depends on education and environmental support — it's not automatic at a set age.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（认知发展章）�5Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), cognitive development��id�4e58e92f9926�body���时间折扣指奖励的主观价值随延迟而下降，常用双曲线模型描述。神经经济学研究显示，即时奖励更多激活边缘系统，而延迟选择依赖前额叶调控，二者竞争强度可预测成瘾与储蓄等行为差异。�Temporal discounting means a reward's subjective value declines with delay, often fit by a hyperbolic model. Neuroeconomics shows immediate rewards recruit limbic regions while delayed choices rely on prefrontal control; their competition predicts addiction and saving behavior.�ans��src��NNature Human Behaviour 跨期决策研究;《心理学年度评论》决策卷�\Nature Human Behaviour (intertemporal choice); Annual Review of Psychology (decision making)��id�4ee0dc1d85ce�body��m早期研究提出，双语者需要持续抑制非目标语言，这种日常训练会迁移到一般性的冲突监控与切换能力，并可能延缓痴呆症状出现。质疑来自多方面：大样本研究与预注册重复常未发现优势，早期文献存在显著结果更易发表的偏差，双语群体往往在移民背景、社会经济地位与教育经历上与单语群体不可比。目前较为审慎的看法是，双语在语言控制的特定任务上确有可测差异，但泛化到一般执行功能的强主张证据不足，认知储备方面的效应仍需更严格的纵向设计检验。�Early studies proposed that bilinguals must continuously suppress the non-target language, and that this daily practice transfers to general conflict monitoring and switching ability, perhaps delaying the onset of dementia symptoms. Doubts arose from several directions: large-sample studies and preregistered replications often find no advantage, the early literature shows bias toward publishing significant results, and bilingual samples typically differ from monolingual ones in immigration background, socioeconomic status, and schooling. The cautious current view is that measurable differences exist on specific language-control tasks, evidence for the strong generalisation to executive function is weak, and cognitive reserve effects need more rigorous longitudinal designs.�ans��src�ٙBialystok 等（2012）《Trends in Cognitive Sciences》双语与认知；Paap 与 Greenberg（2013）《Cognitive Psychology》双语优势质疑研究٩Bialystok et al. (2012), Trends in Cognitive Sciences, Bilingualism and cognition; Paap and Greenberg (2013), Cognitive Psychology, challenges to the bilingual advantage��id�50d89c980209�body��传统观点认为情绪是进化固定的、由特定脑区触发的普遍反应。建构理论主张情绪是大脑用身体感受（内感）、概念和情境实时预测并构建的产物，不同文化会构建出不同情绪类别，情绪并非被动触发而是主动生成。�GThe traditional view sees emotions as evolved, universally triggered reactions in fixed brain circuits. The construction view holds that emotions are predictions the brain builds in real time from bodily sensations, concepts, and context; cultures construct different emotion categories—emotions are generated, not triggered.�ans��src��Barrett (2017)�Barrett (2017)��id�530b9c753822�body���Seligman 发现，人对坏事的解释落在“暂时/特定/外在”还是“永久/普遍/内在”，会影响后续状态。把失败归因为具体可控的因素，是可以训练出来的习惯。��Seligman found how we explain bad events, as temporary, specific and external versus permanent, broad and internal, shapes what follows. Blaming failure on specific controllable factors is a trainable habit.�ans��src��.Seligman, M. E. P. (1991). 《学习乐观》.�,Seligman, M. E. P. (1991). Learned Optimism.��id�54438b967c11�body��学习迁移指在一个情境习得的知识/技能应用于另一情境。近迁移（相似情境）容易，远迁移（差异大）困难，受元素相似性与抽象原理掌握程度影响。过度情境绑定的练习会阻碍迁移，而强调底层原理促进迁移。�Transfer is applying learned knowledge/skill to a new context. Near transfer (similar contexts) is easy; far transfer is hard, shaped by surface similarity and grasp of underlying principles. Over context-bound practice blocks transfer; emphasizing abstract principles promotes it.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�5461b72a0cee�body���从众分两类：信息性（别人可能更懂，跟着准）与规范性（想被接纳，跟着安全）。前者改善决策，后者导致盲目跟随；辨别动机才能既借群体智慧又保独立。��Conformity splits into informational (others may know better) and normative (want acceptance). The former improves decisions, the latter blinds; telling them apart lets you borrow crowd wisdom yet stay independent.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�54931237df7d�body��早期习惯化解释认为反复暴露会逐渐削弱恐惧反应本身，但复发现象与情境依赖性提示原有记忆并未消失。克拉斯克等人提出抑制性学习模型：暴露过程建立了新的安全联结，与旧的威胁联结在提取时竞争，因此治疗效果取决于新记忆能否在多样情境中被优先提取。由此推出的优化策略包括制造预期违背而非单纯降低焦虑、跨情境与多线索练习、变化强度而非固定递增，以及减少安全行为对新学习的削弱。��Early habituation accounts assumed repeated exposure gradually weakens the fear response itself, but relapse and context-dependence indicate the original memory persists. Craske and colleagues proposed an inhibitory learning model in which exposure creates a new safety association that competes with the old threat association at retrieval, so outcomes depend on whether the new memory is retrieved preferentially across contexts. Practical implications follow: engineer violations of expectancy rather than merely lowering anxiety, practise across varied contexts and cues, vary intensity instead of strictly grading it upward, and curtail safety behaviours that undermine the new learning.�ans��src�ِCraske 等（2014）《Behaviour Research and Therapy》最大化暴露治疗；Bouton（2002）《Biological Psychiatry》消退与复发研究ْCraske et al. (2014), Behaviour Research and Therapy, Maximizing exposure therapy; Bouton (2002), Biological Psychiatry, on extinction and relapse��id�569ee50efdf8�body���群体思维是贾尼斯提出的现象：追求团队和谐与一致会使成员压制异议、忽视风险，导致糟糕决策。它常见于封闭、高压、凝聚力强的决策群体。��Groupthink, described by Janis, occurs when the drive for harmony and unanimity leads members to suppress dissent and ignore risks, producing poor decisions. It is common in closed, high-pressure, highly cohesive decision groups.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�56e9053fda39�body���不同认知测验成绩彼此正相关，统计上可提取出一个共同因子 g，解释各测验的共享方差。支持者认为 g 反映神经效率等通用资源，批评者则强调具体能力与文化偏差，争论仍在继续。�␀Different cognitive tests correlate positively; statistically a common factor g explains their shared variance. Supporters link g to general resources like neural efficiency, while critics stress specific abilities and cultural bias—the debate continues.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�58802bcf5fa8�body���Neff 提出三成分：正念（不淹没情绪）、共通人性（承认人人会失败）、自我友善（像对好友般温和）。它不等于自怜或放任，而是用善意面对失误，从而腾出空间去调整行为。��Neff's three parts: mindfulness (not drowning in emotion), common humanity (everyone fails), self-kindness (gentle as to a friend). It is not self-pity or indulgence but facing mistakes with kindness, freeing space to adjust behavior.�ans��src��ZNeff, K. D. (2003). 《自我关怀量表的开发与验证》. 《自我与身份》2卷.�kNeff, K. D. (2003). Development and validation of a scale to measure self-compassion. Self and Identity, 2.��id�5895686debcf�body���在强调和谐的互依型文化，规范性从众（为不丢脸、不合群而跟随）更高；Asch 范式的复现研究发现东亚被试更易随大流，但也更愿为集体协调让步。这反映文化价值，而非更没主见。�In harmony-valuing interdependent cultures, normative conformity (to avoid losing face or standing out) runs higher; Asch-paradigm replications find East Asians more likely to follow, yet also more willing to yield for group coordination. It reflects values, not less backbone.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5984c4d64b2e�body���EMDR 让患者在回想创伤时跟随左右眼动，声称能减轻痛苦，对 PTSD 确有疗效证据。但眼动本身是否关键存疑——对照试验显示其效果可能来自暴露与再加工，而非眼球运动，故机制仍争议。�)EMDR has patients recall trauma while following side-to-side eye movements, claiming relief, with evidence for PTSD. But whether the eye movement is essential is doubtful—controlled trials suggest benefits may come from exposure and reprocessing, not the saccades, so the mechanism is contested.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�5a7dddd6d4a7�body�ٺ荣格认为除个人无意识外，人类还共享一套遗传而来的“集体无意识”，内含原型等普遍意象。它试图解释跨文化神话与梦境中的相似主题。��Jung argued that beyond the personal unconscious, humans share an inherited 'collective unconscious' containing universal images called archetypes. It aims to explain similar themes across cultures' myths and dreams.�ans��src��}Jung, C. G. (1959).《The Archetypes and the Collective Unconscious》, Collected Works Vol. 9/1, Princeton University Press.�xJung, C. G. (1959). The Archetypes and the Collective Unconscious. Collected Works Vol. 9/1. Princeton University Press.��id�5b2a94422fe8�body���柏林智慧范式把智慧定义为关于生活实则的对策性知识加反思加共情，并非随年龄自动获得；它更与阅历的多样性与反思深度相关，而非单纯年岁。��The Berlin paradigm defines wisdom as pragmatic life knowledge plus reflection plus empathy; it is not auto-granted by age but tracks the diversity of experience and depth of reflection, not mere years.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�5bdb0822b367�body�ٯCBT 是一种结构化心理治疗，帮助识别并修正导致痛苦的“自动负面思维”，用更现实的想法改变情绪与行为，对抑郁焦虑证据充分。ٻCBT is a structured therapy that identifies and rewrites automatic negative thoughts, using more realistic thinking to change mood and behavior; well-evidenced for depression and anxiety.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5c6f80eff6d4�body�� 认知负荷理论由 Sweller 于 1988 年提出，认为工作记忆容量有限，学习任务若占用过多“内在”或“外在”认知负荷会阻碍图式建构。有效教学应通过减少无关负荷、促进相关负荷来帮助学生形成长期记忆中的知识结构。�)Proposed by Sweller in 1988, Cognitive Load Theory holds that working memory is limited, and tasks imposing excessive intrinsic or extraneous load hinder schema construction. Effective instruction reduces extraneous load and supports germane load to build knowledge structures in long-term memory.�ans��src�ٳSweller, J.,《Cognitive Load During Problem Solving: Effects on Learning》, Cognitive Science, 1988 (DOI: 10.1207/s15516709cog1202_4)；Sweller 等《认知负荷理论手册》ٶSweller, J., 'Cognitive Load During Problem Solving: Effects on Learning', Cognitive Science, 1988, DOI: 10.1207/s15516709cog1202_4; Sweller et al., Handbook of Cognitive Load Theory��id�5d31f57768eb�body��R特雷斯曼的特征整合理论（Treisman & Gelade, 1980）认为，颜色、形状等“特征”在前期注意阶段被平行自动登记，但要把它们绑定成完整物体需要集中注意。当注意资源被抢走时，特征会错误组合成“错觉结合”，于是出现了红帽子配蓝衣服的“幽灵对象”。�HTreisman and Gelade's feature-integration theory (1980) says basic features like color and shape are registered automatically and in parallel, but binding them into one object needs focused attention. When attention is stolen, features miscombine into illusory conjunctions - hence the ghost of a red-hat-with-blue-shirt person.�ans��src��dTreisman, A. & Gelade, G. (1980)《注意的特征整合理论》, Cognitive Psychology 12(1):97-136�qTreisman, A. & Gelade, G. (1980). A feature-integration theory of attention. Cognitive Psychology, 12(1), 97-136.��id�5d6880278568�body��#关键期指某能力只能在极窄时间窗内获得，错过则几乎不可弥补，如某些动物视觉发育。敏感期则指某时期学习最容易，但之后仍可习得，只是更费力，多数人类能力属此类。区分二者避免把“晚学”误判为“不能学”。�@A critical period is a narrow window when an ability must be acquired or it is largely lost, as in some animal visual development. A sensitive period is when learning is easiest but still possible later, only harder; most human abilities fit this. The distinction avoids mistaking later learning for impossible learning.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�5ec93bf4e8d2�body��情景记忆是个人亲身经历的具体事件（如昨天生日聚会发生了什么），带有时空背景。语义记忆是关于世界的事实和概念知识（如“巴黎是法国首都”），不依赖具体经历。两者都属于长时记忆中的陈述性记忆。�9Episodic memory is memory of specific personal events with a time and place, like what happened at yesterday's birthday party. Semantic memory is factual and conceptual knowledge, like 'Paris is the capital of France', independent of personal experience. Both are types of declarative memory in long-term storage.�ans��src��Tulving 记忆分类�Tulving memory taxonomy��id�5ed70484a8db�body���EEG 通过头皮电极记录大脑电活动，时间分辨率高但空间定位粗；fMRI 通过血氧水平间接反映神经活动，空间分辨率高但时间分辨率较低。两者常互补使用。��EEG records the brain's electrical activity via scalp electrodes, with high time but coarse spatial resolution; fMRI indirectly maps neural activity via blood oxygen, with high spatial but lower time resolution. The two are often used complementarily.�ans��src��$《生物心理学》（皮内尔）�Biopsychology (Pinel)��id�609fb6fe2594�body��通过比较同卵（遗传 100%）与异卵（约 50%）双胞胎在分开或共同抚养下的相似度，可分解遗传率、共享与非共享环境。普洛明等研究显示多数人格特质的遗传率约 40% 到 50%，非共享环境影响更大。�BBy comparing similarity of monozygotic (100% genetic) and dizygotic (about 50%) twins raised together or apart, researchers decompose heritability, shared environment, and non-shared environment. Plomin and colleagues found most personality traits are about 40 to 50% heritable, with non-shared environment mattering more.�ans��src��ePlomin, R., DeFries, J. C., Knopik, V. S., Neiderhiser, J. M. (2013). 《行为遗传学》(第6版).�8Plomin, R. et al. (2013). Behavioral Genetics (6th ed.).��id�60eb0f70de18�body���内隐态度较难短期消除，但接触积极反例、换位思考想象、重复配对新联结可小幅减弱。更稳的是改变环境线索与制度（如盲审），而非指望个人想通就好。�"Implicit attitudes are hard to erase quickly, but contact with positive counterexamples, perspective-taking imagination and repeated new pairings can weaken them modestly. More robust is changing environmental cues and institutions like blind review, not just hoping individuals see reason.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�63342a4ee5ca�body���文化适应研究区分四种策略：整合（既保留原文化认同，又参与新文化）、同化（放弃原文化）、分离（只守原文化）、边缘化（两边都不投入）。大量研究认为“整合”与最好的心理适应相关，而“边缘化”风险最高。不过最优策略也取决于社会是否包容——文化适应是双向的，不是单方面“变成别人”。��Acculturation research distinguishes four strategies: integration (keeping heritage identity while participating in the new culture), assimilation (giving it up), separation (clinging to it), and marginalization (engaging neither). A large body of research links integration with the best adjustment and marginalization with the worst — though the ideal also depends on how welcoming society is. Acculturation is two-way, not just “becoming someone else.”�ans��src��!APA（文化适应策略研究）�'APA (acculturation strategies research)��id�65d7e19e477a�body��n久远而反复讲述、带有强烈情感的事件，经过多年反复加工，记忆非常牢固；而“钥匙放哪”这类情境记忆依赖编码时的注意力，一走神就存不进去。年龄相关的记忆变化主要是“提取变慢、易受干扰”，而不是记忆消失。固定放钥匙的位置、使用提醒清单，就能很好地弥补。��Distant, often-recounted, emotionally rich events are consolidated for years and stay vivid, while “where did I put the keys” is a context memory that depends on attention at encoding — a moment of distraction and it never lands. Age-related memory change is mostly slower retrieval and more interference, not memory loss. A fixed spot for keys and reminder lists compensate beautifully.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�668ba65048e1�body���迪纳将主观幸福感操作为生活满意度（认知评价）与正、负情感频率（情感成分）的组合。常用量表如生活满意度量表，区分了快乐的瞬间感受与对整体的理性评估。�:Diener operationalized subjective well-being as a combination of life satisfaction (cognitive evaluation) and the frequency of positive and negative affect (affective components). Standard tools such as the Satisfaction With Life Scale distinguish momentary feelings of pleasure from a rational overall assessment.�ans��src��BDiener, E. (1984). 《主观幸福感》. 《心理公报》95卷.�EDiener, E. (1984). Subjective well-being. Psychological Bulletin, 95.��id�6a120b095883�body�ِ心理理论指理解他人拥有与自己不同的想法、信念和意图的能力，儿童约 4 岁逐步掌握，是社交认知的核心。٬Theory of mind is the ability to understand that others have different beliefs, intentions, and knowledge—usually developing around age 4 and central to social cognition.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�6a6c6602fa92�body���行为遗传学研究发现，人格约40%到50%可归因于遗传，其余来自环境和独特经历。基因设定倾向，环境塑造表现。人格在成年后相对稳定但仍可缓慢变化。�
Behavior genetic studies find about 40% to 50% of personality is attributable to heredity, the rest from environment and unique experiences. Genes set tendencies; environment shapes expression. Personality is fairly stable after adulthood yet can still shift slowly.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6ae90c25667b�body���该理论主张人类先天具备一套语言习得的神经生物基础（普遍语法），儿童只需暴露于语言输入即可触发参数设定。它用刺激贫乏论说明复杂语法无法仅靠模仿获得。�The theory claims humans are innately equipped with a neurobiological basis for language acquisition (universal grammar), and exposure to input merely triggers parameter setting. It uses the poverty-of-stimulus argument to show complex grammar cannot be learned by imitation alone.�ans��src��6Chomsky, N. (1965). 《句法理论的若干问题》.�4Chomsky, N. (1965). Aspects of the Theory of Syntax.��id�6c3e733d40f8�body���研究指童年逆境可通过教养方式、家庭情绪氛围与表观遗传（基因表达被环境修饰）跨代影响；并非记忆遗传，而是风险与环境的传递。觉察这一链条有助于截断循环。�Research shows childhood adversity transmits across generations via parenting, family emotional climate and epigenetics (environment modifying gene expression); not memory inheritance but risk and environment transfer. Seeing this chain helps break the cycle.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6c871a365193�body��)该理论认为工作记忆容量有限，学习受内在（材料难度）、外在（呈现方式冗余）和相关（促进图式）三类负荷影响。良好设计应减少外在负荷、管理内在负荷、最大化相关负荷，例如拆分步骤、去除无关信息、用样例引导。�1Cognitive load theory says working memory is limited; learning is shaped by intrinsic (material difficulty), extraneous (poor presentation), and germane (schema-building) load. Good design cuts extraneous load, manages intrinsic, maximizes germane—e.g., chunk steps, remove clutter, use worked examples.�ans��src��Sweller (1988)�Sweller (1988)��id�6f7ed18a873d�body���有。求助帖下人人以为别人已报警或已安慰，结果无人行动；匿名还降低责任感。研究提示，公开事件中指定具体人行动、或自己率先回应，能打破沉默。��Yes. Under a help post everyone assumes someone else already called or consoled, so none act; anonymity lowers responsibility. Research suggests naming a specific actor or responding first yourself breaks the silence.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�6f9e42b95dfe�body��R开放科学合作组织在 2015 年组织多个实验室重复了一百项心理学研究，结果只有约三分之一到四成达到统计显著，且平均效应量约为原始报告的一半。诊断出的原因包括对显著性阈值的选择性报告、事后调整假设、样本量不足导致的低统计效力，以及缺少直接重复的激励。随后的改革包括预注册与注册报告、公开数据与分析代码、多实验室协作的大规模重复项目，以及期刊对效应量与置信区间的报告要求，美国心理学会等机构也更新了报告标准。��The Open Science Collaboration had many laboratories repeat one hundred psychology studies in 2015, and only about a third to two-fifths reached statistical significance while average effect sizes were roughly half those originally reported. Diagnosed causes include selective reporting around significance thresholds, hypothesising after results are known, low statistical power from small samples, and the absence of incentives for direct replication. Reforms followed: preregistration and registered reports, open data and analysis code, large multi-lab replication consortia, and journal requirements to report effect sizes and confidence intervals, with bodies such as the American Psychological Association updating reporting standards.�ans��src�٤Open Science Collaboration（2015）《Science》重复百项心理学研究；Simmons、Nelson 与 Simonsohn（2011）《Psychological Science》假阳性心理学ٻOpen Science Collaboration (2015), Science, Estimating the reproducibility of psychological science; Simmons, Nelson and Simonsohn (2011), Psychological Science, False-positive psychology��id�6ff4963f61d9�body���自我决定论认为自主、胜任与关系三种基本需要满足时，外在动机可内化为自主动机，带来更持久的投入与幸福感。当这些需要受挫，动机退化为外部强加的控制型动机。�Self-determination theory holds that satisfying autonomy, competence, and relatedness supports internalization of extrinsic motivation into autonomous drive, sustaining engagement and well-being. Frustration of these needs yields controlled, externally pressured motivation.�ans��src�١Ryan, Deci,《Self-Determination Theory: Basic Psychological Needs in Motivation, Development, and Wellness》,Guilford Press,2017 (DOI: 10.1521/978.14625/28806)ٟRyan, Deci, 'Self-Determination Theory: Basic Psychological Needs in Motivation, Development, and Wellness', Guilford Press, 2017, DOI: 10.1521/978.14625/28806��id�700ae94b7912�body��双相障碍以反复发作的躁狂（或轻躁狂）与抑郁交替为特征，伴随昼夜节律失调、奖赏系统过度敏感与睡眠需求减少。神经影像显示杏仁核与纹状体反应性异常，遗传度约 60%–80%，但环境触发同样关键。�6Bipolar disorder features recurrent manic or hypomanic episodes alternating with depression, along with circadian disruption, hypersensitive reward systems, and reduced sleep need. Neuroimaging shows atypical amygdala and striatal reactivity; heritability is about 60%–80%, yet environmental triggers matter.�ans��src��I美国精神医学学会 DSM-5;《心理学年度评论》双相障碍卷�VAmerican Psychiatric Association DSM-5; Annual Review of Psychology (bipolar disorder)��id�73357ae0a85b�body��
部分随机对照研究发现长期正念练习与较低炎症标记（如 IL-6）、更好抗体反应相关，机制可能经降低应激与改善睡眠。效应中等且受方法质量影响，不能替代疫苗或治疗，但支持心理影响身体的路径。�Some RCTs link long-term mindfulness to lower inflammation markers like IL-6 and better antibody response, possibly via less stress and better sleep. Effects are moderate and method-dependent; it does not replace vaccines or treatment but supports mind-body pathways.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�735b8c322383�body��前瞻记忆是记住在未来某个时刻执行某个意图（如服药、赴约），分基于时间和基于事件两类。它依赖执行功能和注意监控，老年人在无明显提醒时尤其容易失败，因默认模式网络与额叶功能减弱。�Prospective memory is remembering to perform an intention in the future (e.g., taking medication), split into time- and event-based types. It relies on executive control and monitoring; older adults especially fail without explicit cues due to weaker frontal and default-mode function.�ans��src��Einstein 与 McDaniel (1990)�Einstein & McDaniel (1990)��id�7392a79c9b31�body�ٽ塔勒布的反脆弱指系统受冲击后不仅恢复还变得更强。心理上近似“压力接种”：适度可控的逆境提升后续应对力，但需剂量得当，过载则伤。ٽTaleb's antifragility: systems grow stronger after shocks. Psychologically near 'stress inoculation'—moderate controllable adversity boosts later coping, but dose matters; overload harms.�ans��src��cTedeschi, R. G. & Calhoun, L. G. (1996). 《创伤后成长量表》. 《创伤压力杂志》9卷.�lTedeschi, R. G. & Calhoun, L. G. (1996). The Posttraumatic Growth Inventory. Journal of Traumatic Stress, 9.��id�753990607d9a�body���实验中约 65% 的被试在权威指令下愿意施加致命电击（实际为假电）。它揭示普通人对权威的高度服从，但也因欺骗与潜在心理伤害引发伦理反思，并催生了现代知情同意规范。�%About 65% of participants were willing to administer what they believed were lethal shocks under authority orders (actually fake). It revealed high obedience to authority among ordinary people but sparked ethical debate over deception and potential harm, shaping modern informed-consent norms.�ans��src��gMilgram, S. (1963). 《对破坏性服从的行为研究》. 《异常与社会心理学杂志》67卷.�aMilgram, S. (1963). Behavioral study of obedience. Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 67.��id�77dd9bd2cdc2�body���科尔伯格提出三个水平六个阶段：前习俗（避罚与利己）、习俗（取悦他人与遵守法规）、后习俗（社会契约与普遍伦理原则）。他认为道德推理随认知成熟而逐步提升。�Kohlberg described three levels and six stages: preconventional (avoid punishment, self-interest), conventional (please others, obey rules), and postconventional (social contract, universal ethical principles). He argued moral reasoning advances with cognitive maturity.�ans��src��'《发展心理学》（桑特洛克）� Life-Span Development (Santrock)��id�79a24eaf1c9e�body��$“DRM 范式”（Deese, 1959; Roediger & McDermott, 1995）用一组语义相关的词诱出从未出现过的“关键诱饵”错误记忆。它证明记忆不是录像回放，而是依语义网络“脑补”重建，连严谨被试都会自信地记错，对目击证词警示极大。�=The DRM paradigm (Deese, 1959; Roediger & McDermott, 1995) uses semantically related words to elicit confident false memories of a never-present critical lure. It proves memory is not video replay but a meaning-based reconstruction, so even careful subjects confidently err - a stark warning for eyewitness testimony.�ans��src�ْRoediger, H.L. & McDermott, K.B. (1995)《制造虚假记忆》, Journal of Experimental Psychology: Learning, Memory, and Cognition 21(4):803-814ٖRoediger, H.L. & McDermott, K.B. (1995). Creating false memories. Journal of Experimental Psychology: Learning, Memory, and Cognition, 21(4), 803-814.��id�7c125627bc85�body�ٷ循证实践强调将最佳研究证据、临床者的专业判断与患者的价值观和偏好相结合来制定治疗方案。它避免仅凭个人经验或流行疗法做决定。��Evidence-based practice integrates the best research evidence, the clinician's expertise, and the patient's values and preferences in treatment planning. It guards against decisions based solely on personal experience or fashions.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�7c5040cb4ca9�body���下丘脑视交叉上核是主生物钟，接收视网膜光照信号并协调外周钟。夜间黑暗促使松果体分泌褪黑素、反馈抑制视交叉上核并诱发睡意，光照则抑制其分泌并重置相位。�7The suprachiasmatic nucleus in the hypothalamus is the master clock, receiving retinal light signals and coordinating peripheral clocks. Darkness at night prompts the pineal gland to secrete melatonin, which feeds back to inhibit the SCN and induce sleepiness, while light suppresses melatonin and resets phase.�ans��src��mMoore, R. Y. & Eichler, V. B. (1972). 《视交叉上核与肾上腺皮质酮节律》. 《脑研究》42卷.�lMoore, R. Y. & Eichler, V. B. (1972). Loss of a circadian adrenal corticosterone rhythm. Brain Research, 42.��id�7ced14be37a8�body���联觉是一种感官交叉现象，比如看到数字就“尝到”味道或听到声音就“看到”颜色，约 4% 的人天生拥有。它源于感官脑区之间异常的连接或激活泄漏。��Synesthesia is a crossing of the senses—e.g., seeing colors when hearing sounds or tasting flavors from numbers—present in about 4% of people, from atypical connections or 'leakage' between sensory brain areas.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�7e90fdae14ec�body���科尔伯格通过“海因茨偷药”之类的两难故事发现，道德推理大致经历三个水平：前习俗水平（避罚和利己）、习俗水平（遵守规则和他人期望）、后习俗水平（依据内化的普遍原则）。大多数人停留在习俗水平。后续研究提醒我们，这只是道德推理的发展路径，不等于实际行为，而且女性的关爱取向（吉尔根）可能被早期模型低估。��Kohlberg's Heinz dilemma and similar stories suggest moral reasoning develops through three levels: preconventional (avoiding punishment, self-interest), conventional (following rules and others' expectations), and postconventional (acting on internalized universal principles). Most people stay at the conventional level. Later work notes this maps reasoning, not necessarily behavior, and that care-based concerns (Gilligan) were underweighted in the original model.�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（道德发展章）�1Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), moral development��id�7e9f183ae0af�body���盲视患者因初级视皮层损伤而主观「看不见」某侧视野，却能凭直觉准确指向或避开该处刺激。这说明无意识视觉通路仍可驱动行为，表明视觉加工与主观意识并非同一过程。��In blindsight, patients with primary visual cortex damage deny seeing stimuli in a field yet accurately point to or avoid them. It shows unconscious visual pathways can drive behavior, separating visual processing from subjective awareness.�ans��src��@《神经科学》(Bear 等);Nature Human Behaviour 意识研究�KNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Nature Human Behaviour (consciousness research)��id�7ecd3d3d1516�body��框架效应指选项的客观结果相同，但用收益还是损失框架表述会系统性改变偏好（Tversky 与 Kahneman）。例如 90% 存活比 10% 死亡更易被接受，说明决策受表述而非纯粹概率支配，违背理性期望效用理论。�The framing effect: identical objective outcomes are chosen differently depending on whether framed as gains or losses. 90% survive beats 10% die though they are the same—showing choices follow wording, not pure probability, violating expected utility theory.�ans��src��Tversky 与 Kahneman (1981)�Tversky & Kahneman (1981)��id�7ecf5c0b20a4�body�ٴ布朗和库利克提出，人们对震惊性公共事件（如重大灾难）会留下异常鲜明、自认为准确的记忆。但研究也显示这类记忆同样可能出错。��Brown and Kulik proposed that people form unusually vivid, confidently accurate memories of shocking public events such as major disasters. Research shows, however, that such memories can still be wrong.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�7f3dd6290fef�body���该理论由巴尔斯提出、迪昂等人用神经证据拓展，认为当某信息被丘脑-皮层网络广泛广播并整合进全局工作空间时，才进入意识。未被广播的加工则停留于无意识，解释了注意与意识的耦合。�Proposed by Baars and extended neurobiologically by Dehaene, the theory holds that information becomes conscious only when broadcast widely through thalamocortical networks into a global workspace; unbroadcast processing remains unconscious, explaining attention-consciousness coupling.�ans��src��@《神经科学》(Bear 等);Nature Human Behaviour 意识研究�KNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Nature Human Behaviour (consciousness research)��id�7fcc0c76516b�body�ٷ当注意力集中在某处时，即使画面发生明显变化（如物体消失、人物替换），我们也常常注意不到，说明注意是“聚光灯”而非全景记录。٩When attention is focused elsewhere, we often fail to notice obvious changes (objects vanishing, people swapped), showing attention is a spotlight, not a full recording.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�80576f167742�body���斯皮尔曼发现不同智力测验得分彼此正相关，于是用因素分析提取出一个共同因子 g，代表一般认知能力。各测验还含特定因子 s，但 g 最能预测学业与职业成就。�Spearman observed that scores on different intelligence tests correlated positively and used factor analysis to extract a common factor g representing general cognitive ability. Each test also has a specific factor s, but g best predicts academic and occupational achievement.�ans��src��YSpearman, C. (1904). 《一般智力的客观测定》. 《美国心理学杂志》15卷.�fSpearman, C. (1904). General intelligence, objectively determined. American Journal of Psychology, 15.��id�826973e894f8�body���恐惧习得依赖基底外侧杏仁核对条件刺激与无条件刺激联结的编码；消退并非抹除原记忆，而是在前额叶与杏仁核回路中形成竞争性抑制记忆。勒杜用神经解剖研究证实了这两条可分离的通路。�2Fear acquisition depends on the basolateral amygdala encoding the link between conditioned and unconditioned stimuli; extinction does not erase the original memory but forms a competing inhibitory memory within prefrontal-amygdala circuits. LeDoux's neuroanatomical work confirmed these separable pathways.�ans��src��WLeDoux, J. E. (2000). 《脑中的情绪回路》. 《神经科学年度评论》23卷.�WLeDoux, J. E. (2000). Emotion circuits in the brain. Annual Review of Neuroscience, 23.��id�82acd03d85d7�body�ٓ人们在判断时过度依赖最先接触的信息（锚），即使它无关，后续估计也会围绕它偏移，如先见高价再谈折扣。ٰPeople rely too heavily on the first piece of information (the anchor); later estimates drift around it even when it's irrelevant, e.g., seeing a high price before negotiating.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�8508aae322cb�body���实验显示普通大学生在狱警与囚犯角色中迅速表现出虐待与顺从，津巴多归因于情境力量。但该实验因样本小、指导语干预与可重复性质疑而受批评，后续研究难以完全复制其效应。�)The study showed ordinary students rapidly displayed cruelty and submission in guard and prisoner roles, which Zimbardo attributed to situational forces. It has been criticized for small samples, leading instructions, and weak replicability, with later work failing to fully reproduce the effects.�ans��src��QZimbardo, P. G. (1971). 《监禁的力量与病理》. 美国国会证词报告.�YZimbardo, P. G. (1971). The power and pathology of imprisonment. Congressional Testimony.��id�858e2b621b7c�body���边缘型人格障碍以情绪不稳定、强烈而不稳定的人际关系、自我形象混乱以及冲动和自伤行为为特征。它常伴随对被抛弃的极度恐惧，可通过辩证行为疗法等改善。��Borderline personality disorder features unstable mood, intense and unstable relationships, a disturbed self-image, and impulsivity or self-harm. It often involves intense fear of abandonment and can improve with dialectical behavior therapy.�ans��src��2《精神障碍诊断与统计手册（DSM-5）》�=Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders (DSM-5)��id�859959968d62�body���主动回忆迫使大脑重建记忆痕迹并选择正确的检索线路，这个过程本身修改并强化了通往目标记忆的通路，还会暴露知识缺口以便针对性补学。罗迪格与卡皮克的实验显示，短期测验中反复阅读组表现更好，但一周后测试时练习检索组的保持率显著更高，形成典型的交叉曲线。这也说明学习者常凭当下的流畅感判断掌握程度，从而系统性地低估了测验式学习的价值。�'Actively recalling forces the brain to reconstruct a memory trace and select a successful retrieval route, and that process itself modifies and strengthens the path to the target while exposing gaps for targeted study. In Roediger and Karpicke's experiments the rereading group did better on an immediate test, but after a week the retrieval-practice group retained far more, producing the classic crossover pattern. The finding also shows learners judge mastery by momentary fluency and therefore systematically undervalue testing as a learning tool.�ans��src��xRoediger 与 Karpicke（2006）《Psychological Science》测验增强学习；Karpicke 与 Blunt（2011）《Science》�oRoediger and Karpicke (2006), Psychological Science, Test-enhanced learning; Karpicke and Blunt (2011), Science��id�874f4e299e12�body���这叫“禀赋效应”：一旦拥有某物，就会不自觉地给它更高估值，因为“放弃”会触发损失厌恶——失去的痛苦被大脑放大。脑成像研究显示，面对“可能失去自己拥有的物品”时，情绪相关脑区的活动比“可能得到”更强。这就是二手交易总谈不拢的原因：同一件东西在买卖双方眼里价格不同。�ZThat's the endowment effect: owning something inflates its value because giving it up triggers loss aversion — the pain of losing is amplified. Neuroimaging shows stronger emotion-related brain responses to losing what we own than to gaining. That's why second-hand deals often collapse: the same item is priced differently by buyer and seller.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�8768515ee7fb�body���认知模型认为焦虑来自对威胁的灾难化解读与“无法应对”的信念；回避虽短期减压，却剥夺了“其实没出事”的校正经验，使恐惧泛化。暴露与重评打破此循环。��The cognitive model sees anxiety as catastrophizing threat plus 'I can't cope' beliefs; avoidance eases fear briefly but denies the corrective lesson that nothing happened, generalizing fear. Exposure and reappraisal break the loop.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8791a9c9fb7e�body�ٽ洛克认为明确而具挑战性的目标比“尽力就好”更能提升绩效，且需要有反馈才能生效。目标通过引导注意、动员努力和激发策略来驱动行为。��Locke held that specific, challenging goals improve performance more than 'do your best,' and work best with feedback. Goals drive behavior by directing attention, mobilizing effort, and prompting strategy.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�88677abe08ec�body��梅尔扎克与沃尔提出，脊髓背角存在类似闸门的中间神经元网络，来自粗大 A-beta 触压纤维的输入会抑制细小 C 纤维与 A-delta 纤维携带的痛信号传递，因此揉搓、振动或经皮电刺激能关小闸门。理论还引入下行调控通路，说明注意、情绪与预期可以经由脑干和皮质影响疼痛体验，为疼痛不等于组织损伤程度提供了机制框架。它直接催生了经皮神经电刺激等临床技术，也是现代生物心理社会疼痛模型的起点。��Melzack and Wall proposed a gate-like network of interneurons in the dorsal horn of the spinal cord, where input from large A-beta touch and pressure fibres inhibits transmission of pain signals carried by small C and A-delta fibres, so rubbing, vibration, or transcutaneous electrical stimulation partly closes the gate. The theory also introduced descending control pathways, explaining how attention, emotion, and expectation act through brainstem and cortex to shape the pain experience and providing a mechanism for why pain does not simply mirror tissue damage. It directly inspired clinical techniques such as transcutaneous electrical nerve stimulation and launched the modern biopsychosocial model of pain.�ans��src��aMelzack 与 Wall（1965）《Science》疼痛机制新理论；Melzack《The Challenge of Pain》�hMelzack and Wall (1965), Science, Pain mechanisms: a new theory; Melzack and Wall, The Challenge of Pain��id�88907dced631�body�پ心理账户指人把钱按来源/用途分账（奖金、工资、彩票），对不同账户消费倾向不同，违背钱等价。它解释为何舍得花“返现”却省“工资”。ٲMental accounting splits money by source/use (bonus, salary, lottery), spending each differently despite equal value. It explains splurging 'cashback' while skimping on 'salary.'�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�8af9a5c38a20�body���去人性化是把他人看作缺乏完整心智或人性的过程，可分工具化（当作物）和动物化（当作兽）。它是偏见、歧视乃至暴力的心理前奏，常通过否认同类的感受或能动能力实现。�Dehumanization is treating others as lacking full humanity or mind, split into mechanization (as objects) and animalization (as beasts). It precedes prejudice, discrimination and violence, often by denying others' capacity to experience or to act as agents.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�8d2686d10c1d�body�� 研究发现抑郁与海马体积缩小、前额叶-边缘系统功能连接异常，以及下丘脑-垂体-肾上腺轴过度激活相关。这些神经内分泌与结构改变并非孤立，而是与早年创伤、慢性压力等心理社会因素通过表观遗传机制相互塑造。�GDepression is associated with reduced hippocampal volume, altered prefrontal-limbic connectivity, and hyperactivity of the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis. These neurobiological changes interact with psychosocial factors such as early trauma and chronic stress through epigenetic mechanisms rather than acting in isolation.�ans��src��k《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 抑郁神经机制卷;《神经科学》(Bear 等)�TAnnual Review of Psychology (neurobiology of depression); Neuroscience (Bear et al.)��id�8f70047dafe4�body��成瘾与中脑边缘多巴胺系统密切相关：成瘾物质和过度行为让多巴胺异常大量释放，制造强烈的“想要”，并逐渐让奖赏系统对正常愉悦变得麻木，于是只有更强刺激才够“爽”。同时，线索（地点、人、画面）会唤醒条件化的渴求，而前额叶的抑制控制被削弱，形成恶性循环。成瘾是慢性脑疾病而非道德缺陷，科学的戒断需要药物、行为治疗和社会支持的组合，复发也是过程的一部分，不等于失败。�BAddiction involves the mesolimbic dopamine system: substances and compulsive behaviors trigger abnormally large dopamine surges that create intense “wanting,” gradually numbing the reward system to ordinary pleasure — so stronger stimuli are needed to feel good. Meanwhile cues (places, people, images) evoke conditioned craving while prefrontal inhibitory control weakens — a vicious cycle. Addiction is a chronic brain disorder, not a moral failing; recovery combines medication, behavioral therapy, and social support, and relapse is part of the process, not failure.�ans��src��NIMH（成瘾的神经科学）� NIMH (neuroscience of addiction)��id�8fb5e5755c72�body���脑成像研究发现，同伴在场会放大青少年奖赏脑区的反应，让“被同伴看到”的刺激格外诱人，而负责自我控制的前额叶此时还不够成熟，两者不同步就推高了冒险。这不是“被带坏”，而是社会奖赏系统与控制系统的发育时间差。给青少年提供安全的冒险出口（运动、竞赛、创作）和可以讨论风险的空间，能把冲动引向成长。��Neuroimaging shows peers' presence amplifies adolescent reward-brain responses, making “being seen by friends” especially enticing, while the still-immature prefrontal control system lags behind — the mismatch drives risk-taking. It's not “bad influence” but a developmental gap between social-reward and control systems. Offering safe outlets for risk (sports, competition, creation) and space to talk it through channels the impulse toward growth.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�92dea8916ece�body���伦内伯格提出语言主要在童年早期（约 2 到 12 岁）自然习得，过了青春期语法习得明显变难。关键证据来自野孩案例与对移民的研究：成年后才接触第二语言者难以达到母语级语法。�%Lenneberg proposed that language is acquired naturally mainly in early childhood (about ages 2 to 12) and becomes much harder after puberty. Key evidence comes from feral-child cases and immigrant studies: those first exposed to a second language in adulthood rarely reach native-like grammar.�ans��src��5Lenneberg, E. (1967). 《语言的生物学基础》.�9Lenneberg, E. (1967). Biological Foundations of Language.��id�96b08f3acf82�body���左枕颞叶的“视觉词形区”（VWFA）会对字母串产生特异性反应，支持快速词形识别。它由识字经验塑造，把原本用于物体的视觉回路“再利用”，显示文化如何重塑脑结构。��The visual word form area (VWFA) in left occipitotemporal cortex responds selectively to letter strings and supports fast visual recognition of words. It is shaped by literacy and recycles visual circuitry, showing how culture reshapes brain organization.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�96d06b423103�body��^大量比较研究发现，规范实施的主流疗法在多数常见障碍上的疗效差异较小，这一现象被称为渡渡鸟裁决。共同因素模型认为，治疗联盟、来访者的期待与投入、治疗师提供的解释框架和情绪表达机会，解释了相当部分的疗效变异，其中治疗师之间的差异往往大于疗法之间的差异。反对意见指出，某些障碍确有特异性优势疗法，例如强迫症的暴露与反应阻断、恐惧症的暴露治疗，因此更稳妥的结论是共同因素设定了基线，特定技术在特定诊断上提供增量。��Large comparative literatures find that competently delivered mainstream therapies differ modestly in outcome for most common disorders, a pattern known as the dodo bird verdict. Common factors models attribute much of the variance to the therapeutic alliance, client expectations and engagement, and the provision of a coherent explanatory framework plus space for emotional expression, with differences between therapists frequently exceeding differences between treatments. Critics note genuine specificity for some conditions — exposure with response prevention for obsessive-compulsive disorder, exposure for phobias — so the safer conclusion is that common factors set the baseline while specific techniques add increments for particular diagnoses.�ans��src�ًWampold 与 Imel《The Great Psychotherapy Debate》（第2版，2015）；Flückiger 等（2018）《Psychotherapy》治疗联盟元分析٘Wampold and Imel, The Great Psychotherapy Debate (2nd ed., 2015); Fluckiger et al. (2018), Psychotherapy, meta-analysis of the alliance-outcome relation��id�9769254ad6ef�body��+内隐联想测验通过测量被试对两两配对概念（如种族与正负词汇）的反应时差异，推断其无意识联结强度。反应越快代表两类概念在心理上越紧密。尽管 IAT 预测个别歧视行为的能力存在争议，它仍是研究内隐态度的主流工具。�HThe Implicit Association Test infers unconscious associations from differences in response times when pairing concepts (e.g., race with pleasant/unpleasant words); faster pairing implies tighter mental linkage. While its power to predict individual discrimination is debated, it remains a mainstream tool for implicit attitudes.�ans��src��K《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 态度与改变卷�;Annual Review of Psychology (attitudes and attitude change)��id�98c32f294363�body��前景理论提出人们在「价值函数」上以当前参照点为轴呈现反射状风险态度：收益区风险厌恶、损失区风险寻求。它用概率权重函数解释对小概率的过度加权，从而解释保险与赌博并存的矛盾行为。�Prospect theory replaces linear utility with a value function referenced to the status quo, showing risk aversion in gains and risk seeking in losses. A probability-weighting function explains overweighting of small probabilities, accounting for coexisting insurance and gambling.�ans��src��Y《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 决策卷;Nature Human Behaviour�EAnnual Review of Psychology (decision making); Nature Human Behaviour��id�99d61010a409�body��%雷克尔等的“默认模式网络”（DMN, Raichle 等, 2001）发现，休息、走神、回想自我时，一组脑区反而更活跃。DMN 负责自我参照、自传体记忆与社交推演，过度活跃又与抑郁反刍相关，说明“放空”是大脑最耗能的后台之一。�YRaichle and colleagues' default mode network (DMN, 2001) shows a set of regions fire up precisely when we rest, mind-wander or think about ourselves. The DMN handles self-reference, autobiographical memory and social simulation, and its overactivity links to depressive rumination - so zoning out is among the brain's costliest background modes.�ans��src��DRaichle 等 (2001)《脑功能的默认模式》, PNAS 98(2):676-682�TRaichle, M.E. et al. (2001). A default mode of brain function. PNAS, 98(2), 676-682.��id�9ad774feba1a�body��该理论主张自控像肌肉一样消耗有限资源，先完成一项抑制任务会削弱随后的自控表现，早期实验大量支持这一预测。质疑来自三方面：多实验室大规模预注册重复研究未能稳定复现效应，效应量接近于零；元分析在校正发表偏差与小样本偏倚后，原有证据大幅缩水；血糖作为损耗资源的解释也与生理测量不符。当前较受支持的替代解释强调动机、注意分配与对努力的主观意愿变化，而非固定能量池的耗尽。��The theory held that self-control draws on a limited resource like a muscle, so performing an inhibition task first weakens subsequent self-control, and early experiments supplied abundant support. Three lines of doubt followed: large multi-lab preregistered replications failed to reproduce the effect reliably, with estimates near zero; meta-analyses corrected for publication bias and small-study effects shrank the original evidence drastically; and the glucose-as-fuel account fitted poorly with physiological measurements. Favoured alternatives now emphasise shifting motivation, attention allocation, and willingness to exert effort rather than depletion of a fixed energy pool.�ans��src�٦Hagger 等（2016）《Perspectives on Psychological Science》多实验室重复研究；Inzlicht 与 Schmeichel（2012）《Perspectives on Psychological Science》ٙHagger et al. (2016), Perspectives on Psychological Science, multi-lab replication; Inzlicht and Schmeichel (2012), Perspectives on Psychological Science��id�9bb154f3bf08�body���自恋型人格表现为夸大自我重要性、渴求赞美、缺乏共情，同时脆弱的自尊依赖外部肯定。它不同于健康的高自尊。严重时属于人格障碍范畴，需专业评估。�Narcissistic personality shows grandiosity, need for admiration, and lack of empathy, with fragile self-esteem relying on external validation. It differs from healthy high self-esteem. Severe forms fall under personality disorder and need professional assessment.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9cc8e6ea6d0a�body���行为研究发现，损失的心理冲击约为同等收益的2倍（损失厌恶）。脑成像显示，面对损失时，杏仁核等情绪脑区反应更强烈，而收益激活的奖赏回路相对温和。这种不对称可能来自进化：失去食物、地位或安全的代价，往往大于多获得一份的收益，所以大脑给损失加了更高的权重。理解这一点，有助于在投资、购物和做选择时保持冷静。��Behavioral research finds losses feel roughly twice as impactful as equal gains (loss aversion). Neuroimaging shows emotion-related regions like the amygdala react more strongly to losses, while reward circuits respond more mildly to gains. The asymmetry may be evolutionary: losing food, status, or safety usually costs more than gaining a little, so the brain weights losses heavily. Knowing this helps you stay calm in investing, shopping, and choices.�ans��src�ّTom、Fox、Trepel 与 Poldrack,《The Neural Basis of Loss Aversion in Decision-Making Under Risk》,Science,2007 (DOI: 10.1126/science.1134239)ًTom, Fox, Trepel & Poldrack, 'The Neural Basis of Loss Aversion in Decision-Making Under Risk', Science, 2007, DOI: 10.1126/science.1134239��id�9d4ab0dd87d0�body��#沙赫特和辛格提出，情绪由生理唤醒和对唤醒的“认知标签”共同决定：先有身体激动，再由情境解释成具体情绪。例如同样的心跳加快，在游乐场被解释为兴奋，在黑暗小巷被解释为恐惧。这说明认知会塑造情绪体验。�DSchachter and Singer proposed that emotion results from both physiological arousal and a cognitive 'label' for that arousal: the body is stirred first, then the situation defines the emotion. The same racing heart can be labeled excitement at a fair or fear in a dark alley. This shows cognition shapes emotional experience.�ans��src��Schachter-Singer 理论�Schachter-Singer theory��id�9e8b0565b1d0�body���走神是注意自然漂移仍在线；白日梦是主动想象未来或愿望；解离是感觉与自我或环境脱节的异常状态，常与创伤相关。三者程度与功能不同，不能混为一谈。�Mind-wandering is natural attentional drift while still online; daydreaming is active imagination of future or wishes; dissociation is an abnormal feeling of detachment from self or surroundings, often trauma-linked. Their degree and function differ and should not be conflated.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9f0b009edcf5�body��青少年期奖赏相关系统（腹侧纹状体）成熟早于负责抑制控制的前额叶皮层，形成「成熟错位」。这导致对同伴与即时奖赏高度敏感，而冲动控制相对滞后，是冒险与物质使用易发期的神经基础。�Adolescent reward systems (ventral striatum) mature earlier than the prefrontal cortex governing inhibition, creating a maturational mismatch. This heightens sensitivity to peers and immediate rewards while impulse control lags, explaining the peak in risk-taking.�ans��src��I《神经科学》(Bear 等);Nature Human Behaviour 青少年神经发育�LNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Nature Human Behaviour (adolescent neuroscience)��id�9f28a36b0561�body���婴儿是出色的“统计学习者”：8个月大的婴儿听两分钟人造语言后，就能根据音节之间的转移概率（哪些音节总是一起出现）切分出“单词”。这不需要被人教，而是大脑自动计算规律的能力。正因如此，学语言最好的环境是大量真实、有互动的人声输入，而不是被动看屏幕。婴儿期超强的规律探测能力会随年龄逐渐转向更成熟但更专门化的语言加工。��Infants are superb “statistical learners”: 8-month-olds hearing two minutes of artificial speech segment “words” by tracking transitional probabilities between syllables — which ones always co-occur. No teaching required; the brain computes regularities automatically. That's why rich, interactive human input beats passive screen time for language learning. Infancy's powerful pattern detection gradually matures into more specialized adult language processing.�ans��src��%Science（统计学习经典研究）�,Science (classic statistical learning study)��id�9f4c97aef043�body��	情绪传染指人们无意识地模仿他人的表情、声音和姿势，触发自身相应情绪（具身模仿）。Hatfield 等指出，这种模仿-反馈环路经镜像系统运作，使情绪在群体中会像病毒般扩散，影响团队氛围与决策。�Emotional contagion is unconsciously mimicking others' expressions, voice, and posture, which triggers matching feelings (embodied mimicry). Hatfield et al. show a mimicry-feedback loop via mirror systems spreads emotion through groups, shaping team mood and decisions.�ans��src��Hatfield 等 (1994)�Hatfield et al. (1994)��id�9f6a009780d1�body��人格障碍是长期、僵化且跨情境的模式，明显偏离文化期望，并导致显著痛苦或功能损害，如边缘型或反社会型。正常人格差异虽多样却不致严重失能。诊断强调“适应不良”与“持久稳定”，而非单纯的性格特别。�GA personality disorder is a long, rigid, cross-situational pattern markedly deviating from cultural expectations and causing distress or impairment, such as borderline or antisocial types. Normal personality variation is diverse but not severely disabling. Diagnosis stresses maladaptiveness and stability, not mere uniqueness.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�9f94b64a64a7�body���元认知是对思考的思考（如我现在的念头只是担心，不是事实）。提升元认知能让你不被念头带着跑；正念与认知去融合都训练这一点，是自助进阶的核心肌肉。��Metacognition is thinking about thinking, like this thought is just worry, not fact. Raising it stops you being dragged by thoughts; mindfulness and cognitive defusion train it, the core muscle of advanced self-help.�ans��src��cFlavell 1979 年论文（载 American Psychologist）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�OFlavell (1979) in American Psychologist; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�a026f27266c5�body���效标关联效度指测验分数与外部效标（如实际工作表现、后续成绩）之间的相关程度，分同时效度与预测效度。它是选拔类测验最看重的证据之一。��Criterion-related validity is the correlation between test scores and an external criterion such as job performance or later achievement, split into concurrent and predictive validity. It is among the most valued evidence for selection tests.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�a0a08c412ce9�body���Schacter 将记忆失误归为七类：易逝、分心（遗忘相关），以及错认、暗示、偏差、纠缠、持久（扭曲相关）。它们不是缺陷，而是适应性系统的副产物——例如遗忘让大脑高效，但代价是失真。� Schacter groups memory failures into seven sins: transience and absent-mindedness (forgetting), plus misattribution, suggestibility, bias, persistence, and intrusions (distortion). They are side effects of an adaptive system—forgetting keeps the brain efficient at the cost of accuracy.�ans��src��Schacter (1999)�Schacter (1999)��id�a49bc50ff744�body��5重新评估是在情绪产生前改写对事件的解读（如把威胁看成挑战），从源头降低负性反应；压抑则是强压表达，虽表面平静却增加生理负担和记忆成本。Gross 的过程模型显示，早期干预（重新评估）比晚期（压抑）更有效且更少代价。�Reappraisal reframes the event's meaning early (threat to challenge), reducing negative response at the source; suppression forces down expression, staying calm outwardly but raising physiological and memory costs. Gross's process model favors early reappraisal over late suppression.�ans��src��Gross 情绪调节模型� Gross's emotion regulation model��id�a5f50bc7d605�body���贝克提出抑郁的认知三角：对自己、世界和未来都持消极看法。抑郁时大脑对负性信息的注意、记忆和解读都会增强，正性信息反而被过滤，形成恶性循环——心情差更注意坏事，注意坏事心情更差。认知行为疗法就是通过识别、检验和改写这些自动负性思维来打断循环。抑郁不是“想开点”就能解决的意志问题，它是可以被科学理解的脑与认知状态。�	Beck's cognitive triad: depression involves negative views of self, world, and future. Depressed brains show enhanced attention, memory, and interpretation of negative information while filtering positives — a vicious cycle where low mood amplifies noticing bad things and noticing bad things deepens low mood. CBT breaks this by identifying, testing, and revising automatic negative thoughts. Depression is not a willpower failure you can “cheer up” out of; it's a brain-and-cognition state science can understand.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（抑郁章）�*Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), depression��id�a77a42cfdff0�body���卡尼曼把思维分成两个系统：系统1快速、自动、凭直觉，几乎不费力；系统2缓慢、刻意、需要努力和资源。大部分判断由系统1完成，只有它意识到不对劲时，系统2才启动检查——而它常常懒得启动。所以“2+2=？”你脱口而出，而“球拍和球共1.1美元”这类题却会被直觉带偏。知道这个分工，是减少判断失误的第一步。��Kahneman splits thinking into two systems: System 1 is fast, automatic, and intuitive, nearly effortless; System 2 is slow, deliberate, effortful. Most judgments run on System 1, and System 2 only takes over when alerted — and it often can't be bothered. That's why you answer “2+2” instantly but get tripped by the bat-and-ball puzzle. Knowing this division is step one toward fewer judgment errors.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（判断与决策章）�<Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), judgment and decision making��id�a84c9cef43d9�body���为治疗顽固性癫痫，H.M. 接受了双侧内侧颞叶包括大部分海马的切除，术后智力与语言保持正常，短时记忆完好，却无法形成新的情景与语义记忆，出现严重的顺行性遗忘。关键发现是他在镜像描画等运动技能任务上能逐日进步，尽管每次都声称从未做过，这证明程序性学习不依赖海马。因此记忆不再被视为单一能力，而被划分为陈述性与非陈述性两大系统，各有不同的神经基础。��To treat intractable epilepsy H.M. underwent bilateral removal of the medial temporal lobes including most of the hippocampus; afterwards his intelligence, language, and short-term memory were preserved but he could no longer form new episodic or semantic memories, leaving profound anterograde amnesia. The decisive observation was that he improved day by day on motor skills such as mirror drawing while insisting he had never attempted the task, proving procedural learning does not depend on the hippocampus. Memory was consequently reconceived not as a single faculty but as declarative and non-declarative systems with distinct neural substrates.�ans��src�لScoville 与 Milner（1957）《Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery and Psychiatry》；Corkin《Permanent Present Tense》（2013）�uScoville and Milner (1957), Journal of Neurology, Neurosurgery and Psychiatry; Corkin, Permanent Present Tense (2013)��id�a85d2002c47d�body��=在慢波睡眠期，海马内白天形成的神经元放电序列会以压缩速度重放，并与皮层慢振荡、丘脑纺锤波耦合，把记忆逐步转移到新皮层实现系统性巩固，这一过程对陈述性记忆尤为关键。快眼动睡眠则与情绪记忆的调节、程序性技能的稳定和记忆间的联结整合关系更密切，有助于提取规则和产生新颖联想。实验上，午睡或整夜睡眠后记忆保持优于等长的清醒时段，而在慢波睡眠中播放学习时的气味或声音线索可以定向增强特定记忆。��During slow-wave sleep, hippocampal firing sequences formed during the day are replayed at compressed speed and coupled with cortical slow oscillations and thalamic spindles, gradually transferring memories to neocortex in what is called systems consolidation, a process especially important for declarative material. REM sleep is more closely tied to regulating emotional memory, stabilising procedural skills, and integrating associations across memories, which supports rule extraction and novel connections. Experimentally, retention after a nap or a night of sleep exceeds an equal period of wakefulness, and replaying an odour or sound cue from learning during slow-wave sleep can selectively strengthen the associated memory.�ans��src�كRasch 与 Born（2013）《Physiological Reviews》睡眠中的记忆巩固；Rudoy 等（2009）《Science》定向记忆再激活نRasch and Born (2013), Physiological Reviews, About sleep's role in memory; Rudoy et al. (2009), Science, targeted memory reactivation��id�a8720cceead9�body��R强版本的沃尔夫假说（语言决定思维）已被证明过度，但温和的“语言相对论”有扎实证据：颜色词越多的语言，其使用者区分相近色更快；习惯把“谁做的”说清楚的语言（如英语），其使用者回忆事故时更容易记住施动者，而施动者可省略的语言（如日语、西班牙语）的使用者则较少记住施动者信息。语言更像“习惯性的思维路径”——它不锁死思维，但会让你在某些分类上更熟练。双语者因在不同语言间切换，常展现出更灵活的视角切换。��The strong Sapir–Whorf claim that language determines thought is discredited, but “weak” linguistic relativity has solid evidence: speakers of languages with more color terms discriminate nearby hues faster, and speakers of languages that typically state who did something (like English) remember the agent of an accident better, whereas speakers of languages that allow omitting the agent (like Japanese or Spanish) remember the agent less often. Language acts more like a habitual thinking pathway — it doesn't trap thought but makes some categorizations more practiced. Bilinguals, switching between systems, often show more flexible perspective-taking.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�a92e658306a2�body���间隔重复是根据遗忘曲线，在即将忘记前复习，使记忆保持最久；闪卡把问题写一面、答案写另一面，便于自测。现代软件（如 Anki）用算法自动安排复习时间。这是被实证支持的高效记忆法。�"Spaced repetition reviews material just before forgetting, based on the forgetting curve, to keep memory longest; flashcards put a question on one side and answer on the other for self-testing. Modern apps like Anki schedule reviews automatically. It is an evidence-backed efficient method.�ans��src��wCepeda 等（2006）《Psychological Bulletin》分散练习元分析；Ebbinghaus《Über das Gedächtnis》（1885）ٙCepeda et al. (2006), Psychological Bulletin, meta-analysis of distributed practice; Ebbinghaus, Memory: A Contribution to Experimental Psychology (1885)��id�a9710eb5548a�body��F功能磁共振研究在颞下皮层发现纺锤状面孔区，它对面孔的反应显著强于其他物体，支持面孔加工具有专门机制的观点。反对者认为该区域反映的是对高度熟练类别的精细区分能力，例如鸟类专家看鸟、汽车迷看车时也会激活。先天性面孔失认症患者在没有明显脑损伤和智力问题的情况下终身难以识别面孔，却能正常辨认物体，而获得性病例则往往伴随该区域损伤；这类双向分离支持面孔加工在功能上相对独立，但专门化程度仍在争论。��Functional MRI identified a fusiform face area in inferior temporal cortex that responds far more strongly to faces than to other objects, supporting a dedicated face-processing mechanism. Critics argue the region reflects fine-grained discrimination within any highly practised category, since it also activates when bird experts view birds or car enthusiasts view cars. People with developmental prosopagnosia struggle lifelong to recognise faces despite no evident brain injury or intellectual impairment while identifying objects normally, and acquired cases typically involve damage to this region; such double dissociations support relative functional independence for face processing, though the degree of specialisation remains debated.�ans��src�ٕKanwisher、McDermott 与 Chun（1997）《Journal of Neuroscience》纺锤状面孔区；Gauthier 等（2000）《Nature Neuroscience》专长假说ٕKanwisher, McDermott and Chun (1997), Journal of Neuroscience, The fusiform face area; Gauthier et al. (2000), Nature Neuroscience, expertise account��id�a9b8f5103f8d�body���行为研究显示，养成一个新习惯平均需要两个多月（常见数据约66天），且因行为复杂度差异极大。习惯顽固是因为它刻在大脑的“线索—行为—奖赏”环路上，改变不是删除，而是用新行为逐渐覆盖旧回路，过程中旧回路仍会短暂“抢跑”。复发不是失败，而是学习信号：每次复发都提供了调整策略的机会。��Behavioral research suggests forming a new habit takes about two months on average (a widely cited figure is 66 days), varying hugely with task complexity. Habits persist because they're encoded in a cue–behavior–reward loop; change means building a new behavior over the old circuit, which keeps briefly “firing first.” Relapse isn't failure — it's feedback: each lapse is a chance to refine the strategy.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�ab29d85471a4�body���这叫群体极化：讨论后，群体平均立场会朝初始倾向更极端的方向移动。原因是多方面的——成员听到更多支持自己立场的论据（信息池偏向）、想在群体中显得更合群更坚定（社会比较），以及自己人被认同带来的强化。危险在于，本来温和的声音会在群体中消失，甚至滑向危险的“集体思维”。�lGroup polarization: after discussion, the group's average stance moves further toward its initial lean. Reasons include a pool of arguments biased toward the existing lean, social comparison (wanting to seem loyal and decisive), and reinforcement from being accepted. The risk is that moderate voices fade and the group can drift toward hazardous “groupthink.”�ans��src��8《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（群体影响章）�/Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), group influence��id�ac716b01a3ac�body��m斯蒂尔与阿伦森最初发现，当测验被描述为诊断能力且提示了群体身份时，处于负面刻板印象下的被试成绩下降，机制被解释为担忧证实刻板印象所引发的额外认知负荷与焦虑。近年来的多实验室重复研究与考虑发表偏差的元分析显示，效应量比早期报告小得多，在部分场景中不显著，而干预效果在实地随机试验中也不稳定。目前较稳妥的表述是：情境线索确实能影响表现，但效应依赖具体人群、任务难度与身份显著性，不能简单套用于解释群体间的整体成绩差距。��Steele and Aronson originally found that when a test was framed as diagnostic of ability and group identity was made salient, members of negatively stereotyped groups performed worse, explained by the extra cognitive load and anxiety of fearing one would confirm the stereotype. Multi-lab replications and meta-analyses adjusting for publication bias now report much smaller effects, non-significant in some settings, and field randomised trials of interventions show inconsistent benefits. The defensible summary is that situational cues can influence performance, but the effect depends on the specific population, task difficulty, and identity salience, and cannot be applied wholesale to explain group-level achievement gaps.�ans��src�٘Steele 与 Aronson（1995）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》；Flore 与 Wicherts（2015）《Journal of School Psychology》元分析ُSteele and Aronson (1995), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Flore and Wicherts (2015), Journal of School Psychology, meta-analysis��id�ac98ea04376b�body��4米歇尔的原始研究发现，能为更大奖励延迟满足的幼儿在若干年后学业与社会适应表现更好，这被广泛解读为自控力决定人生成就。后来一项样本量大得多、并控制家庭社会经济地位与母亲教育水平的重复研究发现，延迟时间与青少年期学业成绩的相关虽仍存在，但幅度大约减半，且在纳入背景变量后大部分预测力被吸收。这提示等待能力部分是资源稳定与信任环境的产物，把它单纯归结为个体意志品质会掩盖结构性因素。��Mischel's original work found that preschoolers who could delay gratification for a larger reward showed better academic and social outcomes years later, widely read as self-control determining life success. A much larger replication that controlled for family socioeconomic status and maternal education found the association between delay time and adolescent achievement still present but roughly half as large, with much of the predictive power absorbed once background variables entered the model. Waiting ability is therefore partly a product of stable resources and a trustworthy environment, and reducing it to individual willpower obscures structural factors.�ans��src�ّMischel、Shoda 与 Rodriguez（1989）《Science》延迟满足研究；Watts、Duncan 与 Quan（2018）《Psychological Science》重复研究ٓMischel, Shoda and Rodriguez (1989), Science, Delay of gratification in children; Watts, Duncan and Quan (2018), Psychological Science, replication��id�acf0fd12c08f�body���双语者一生都在做“语言控制”：选择目标语言并抑制另一门语言，这种日常练习会锻炼前额叶的执行功能（如抑制控制、任务转换）。一些脑成像研究显示，双语者在这些任务上的效率有时更高，双语经验还可能把晚年认知衰退推迟数年。不过研究仍在推进、个体差异很大，双语更像一种持续的“大脑健身”，而不是速效药。��Bilinguals constantly perform language control — selecting the target language while suppressing the other — and this everyday exercise trains prefrontal executive functions such as inhibition and task switching. Some neuroimaging studies find bilinguals perform these tasks more efficiently, and bilingual experience may delay late-life cognitive decline by a few years. Research continues and individuals vary greatly; bilingualism is more like sustained mental exercise than a quick fix.�ans��src��$APA（双语与认知储备研究）�1APA (bilingualism and cognitive reserve research)��id�ad7dae410e25�body��t情绪调节研究区分两种常见策略：认知重评是“改变对事件的解释”，表达抑制是“压下情绪的外在表现”。长期使用抑制，大脑要持续调用资源维持表面平静——这会升高生理唤醒、消耗精力，并与更高的压力水平和更低的幸福感相关。重评需要练习，但长期更省力、更可持续。��Emotion regulation research contrasts two common strategies: cognitive reappraisal changes how we interpret an event, while expressive suppression pushes down the outward display. Chronic suppression keeps the brain working to maintain a calm surface — raising physiological arousal, draining energy, and linking to more stress and less well-being. Reappraisal takes practice but is more effort-efficient and sustainable.�ans��src��APA（情绪调节策略）�#APA (emotion regulation strategies)��id�ae3c251c60e0�body��6图尔文把这种“心理时间旅行”定义为情景记忆的延伸：不仅能回忆过去，还能把自我投射到未来构建尚未发生的场景（Tulving, 2002; Suddendorf & Corballis, 2007）。它依赖海马体与默认模式网络，被认为是规划、拖延与焦虑共同的根源能力。�VTulving framed mental time travel as an extension of episodic memory: not just recalling the past but projecting the self into the future to build scenes not yet real (Tulving, 2002; Suddendorf & Corballis, 2007). It relies on the hippocampus and default mode network and is a root capacity behind planning, procrastination and anxiety alike.�ans��src��pSuddendorf, T. & Corballis, M.C. (2007)《心理时间旅行的进化》, Annual Review of Psychology 58:299-326�nSuddendorf, T. & Corballis, M.C. (2007). The evolution of foresight. Annual Review of Psychology, 58, 299-326.��id�aefff9bd69ed�body���感觉与运动皮层按身体部位呈“侏儒图”分布，且可因使用重塑：盲人阅读盲文时视觉皮层被“征用”，音乐家的手指对应区更大。这体现了使用依赖性可塑性。��Sensory and motor cortex map the body as a homunculus and can be reshaped by use: blind readers recruit visual cortex for Braille, musicians have enlarged finger maps. This is use-dependent plasticity.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�af0571359171�body��前景理论用一条以参照点为原点的价值函数刻画选择：收益区间凹向下、损失区间凸向上，且损失一侧更陡，通常损失带来的痛感约为等额收益快感的两倍。由此可推出面对确定收益时倾向回避风险，面对确定损失时反而愿意赌一把以求翻盘，这解释了投资者过早卖出盈利股票而死守亏损股票的处置效应。理论还用决策权重函数说明人们高估极小概率、低估中等概率，从而同时购买保险和彩票。��Prospect theory describes choice with a value function anchored at a reference point: concave over gains, convex over losses, and steeper on the loss side, so a loss typically hurts about twice as much as an equivalent gain pleases. It follows that people avoid risk when facing sure gains but accept gambles when facing sure losses in hopes of breaking even, which explains the disposition effect of selling winning stocks too early while clinging to losers. A decision-weight function further captures overweighting of very small probabilities and underweighting of moderate ones, letting the same person buy both insurance and lottery tickets.�ans��src��xKahneman 与 Tversky（1979）《Econometrica》前景理论；Odean（1998）《Journal of Finance》处置效应实证ـKahneman and Tversky (1979), Econometrica, Prospect theory; Odean (1998), Journal of Finance, evidence on the disposition effect��id�b1578d51fa16�body��+耶克斯-多德森定律由 Yerkes 与 Dodson 于 1908 年提出，认为唤醒水平与任务表现呈倒 U 形关系：适度唤醒最优，过低令人懈怠、过高引发焦虑。且该最优唤醒点随任务难度变化，复杂任务需要较低唤醒，简单任务可耐受较高唤醒。�;Proposed by Yerkes and Dodson in 1908, the law states performance follows an inverted-U relationship with arousal: moderate arousal is optimal, too little breeds lethargy and too much causes anxiety. The optimal point also shifts with task difficulty—complex tasks need lower arousal, simple ones tolerate higher.�ans��src�هYerkes 与 Dodson 1908 年论文（载 Journal of Comparative Neurology and Psychology）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�qYerkes & Dodson (1908) in Journal of Comparative Neurology and Psychology; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�b24cc71171e6�body��心智感知指我们判断某对象（人、动物、机器人、自然）拥有多少心智——分为感受能力（感受痛苦/愉悦）和能动能力（意图/自控）。它解释了为何我们会对宠物、AI 甚至自然灾害“赋灵”，也是去人性化的反过程。��Mind perception is judging how much mind an entity has, split into capacity for experience (feeling pain/pleasure) and agency (intent/self-control). It explains why we animate pets, AI or even nature, and is the reverse of dehumanization.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b3bac7c55b64�body��*鲍尔比提出，婴儿与主要照料者形成的情感联结叫依恋，安斯沃思通过“陌生情境”实验区分出安全型、焦虑-矛盾型和回避型等。安全的依恋有助于儿童探索世界并建立健康的人际关系。依恋模式在成年亲密关系中也会体现。�HBowlby proposed that the emotional bond an infant forms with a primary caregiver is called attachment; Ainsworth's 'Strange Situation' identified secure, anxious-ambivalent, and avoidant types. Secure attachment helps children explore the world and build healthy relationships. Attachment patterns also appear in adult intimacy.�ans��src��Bowlby & Ainsworth 依恋理论�$Bowlby & Ainsworth attachment theory��id�b81bfaea7de6�body��:该理论假定工作记忆容量有限，把负荷分为内在负荷、外在负荷与相关负荷：内在负荷取决于内容本身的复杂度，外在负荷来自糟糕的呈现方式，相关负荷则用于建构图式。设计原则由此推出，例如把图与对应文字放在一起以避免分散注意效应，删除装饰性插图以减少冗余，为新手提供完整的样例讲解而不是纯粹的问题求解。值得注意的是专长逆转效应：对已有图式的学习者，详尽指导反而成为多余负荷，此时应转向独立解题。�|The theory assumes working memory is limited and distinguishes intrinsic load set by content complexity, extraneous load created by poor presentation, and germane load devoted to building schemas. Design rules follow: place diagrams next to their explanatory text to avoid the split-attention effect, strip decorative illustrations that add redundancy, and give novices fully worked examples rather than unguided problem solving. Notably, the expertise reversal effect means that for learners who already possess the relevant schema, detailed guidance becomes redundant load and practice should shift toward independent problem solving.�ans��src��}Sweller（1988）《Cognitive Science》认知负荷理论；Sweller、Ayres 与 Kalyuga《Cognitive Load Theory》（2011）�[Sweller (1988), Cognitive Science; Sweller, Ayres and Kalyuga, Cognitive Load Theory (2011)��id�b84c8ec3dc1a�body���健康信念模型指出，改变健康行为需要同时具备：感知威胁的严重性、感知自己的易感性、相信行动有好处、相信障碍可克服，还有“行动线索”。吸烟者常低估个人风险（“我又没得病”），加上尼古丁依赖和日常习惯的阻力，行动就迟迟启动不了。所以有效的戒烟干预不是讲道理，而是逐项降低障碍：替代品、同伴支持、具体到“明天怎么做”的计划。��The Health Belief Model says behavior change requires perceived severity, personal susceptibility, perceived benefits, manageable barriers, and a cue to act. Smokers often underestimate personal risk (“I'm not sick”), and nicotine dependence plus daily habits add resistance, so action stalls. Effective cessation isn't lecturing — it's lowering each barrier: substitutes, social support, and a concrete “what to do tomorrow” plan.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�b8a65f6fe243�body��C英国的罗马尼亚收养研究追踪了从极端剥夺环境被跨国收养的儿童，发现六个月前离开机构的儿童发展基本追平对照组，而六个月后才离开的儿童在青少年与成年期仍有较高比例出现注意缺陷、类似自闭的社会性异常与认知损伤。布加勒斯特早期干预项目采用随机分配设计，把机构养育儿童安置到寄养家庭，结果显示越早安置，智商、语言与依恋安全性的改善越明显。两项研究共同支持敏感期概念，也表明干预时机比干预强度更关键。��The English and Romanian Adoptees study followed children adopted internationally out of extreme deprivation and found those who left institutions before six months of age largely caught up with comparison groups, while those who left later showed elevated rates of inattention, quasi-autistic social difficulties, and cognitive impairment persisting into adolescence and adulthood. The Bucharest Early Intervention Project used random assignment to move institutionalised children into foster care and found that earlier placement produced larger gains in IQ, language, and attachment security. Together they support the notion of sensitive periods and indicate that the timing of intervention matters more than its intensity.�ans��src�قRutter 等英国罗马尼亚收养研究（ERA）系列论文；Nelson 等（2007）《Science》布加勒斯特早期干预项目لRutter et al., English and Romanian Adoptees study publications; Nelson et al. (2007), Science, Bucharest Early Intervention Project��id�b978a1bda6a6�body���延迟满足的核心是前额叶（执行控制）与边缘系统（即时奖赏）的竞争：即时奖励在脑中被加权放大，而且距离越近越诱人。米歇尔的棉花糖研究发现，能用转移注意（不看糖、想别的）的孩子等待更久——不是单纯“忍”，而是改变注意策略。后续研究还发现，这种能力可随环境安全感和练习提升，并非天生注定。��Delaying gratification is a contest between the prefrontal cortex (executive control) and limbic reward circuits: immediate rewards are over-weighted, and the closer the better. In Mischel's marshmallow studies, kids who waited longest used attention strategies — looking away, distracting themselves — rather than pure willpower. Later work adds that the ability improves with a felt sense of safety and practice; it isn't destiny.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�b9ea8b9c2dd6�body��?科尔伯格基于道德两难故事提出三水平六阶段：前习俗（避罚与利己）、习俗（取悦他人与维护规则）和后习俗（社会契约与普遍伦理原则）。该理论描绘道德推理从外在奖惩向内在原则的发展，但因其以男性样本为主而受到 Gilligan 的批评。�]Kohlberg proposed three levels and six stages of moral reasoning—preconventional (avoid punishment, self-interest), conventional (please others, uphold rules), and postconventional (social contract, universal principles). It traces moral reasoning from external sanctions to internal principles, though Gilligan criticized its male-biased samples.�ans��src��XKohlberg《道德发展阶段的心理学》（1969）；Berk《毕生发展心理学》�TKohlberg, Stages of Moral Development (1969); Berk, Development Through the Lifespan��id�ba8e77547b30�body��U琼斯与哈里斯让被试阅读支持或反对某位领导人的短文，并明确告知作者是被指定立场的，被试仍推断文章观点反映了作者的真实态度。这种把行为直接对应到内在特质、低估情境约束的倾向被称为对应偏差或基本归因错误。原因包括行为在知觉上比情境更显著、对情境力量的估计需要额外认知努力，以及人们默认他人的行为出自选择。研究还发现，强调情境信息、要求被试解释他人为何不得不如此，或让其亲身处于同一角色，能部分削弱该偏差。��Jones and Harris had participants read essays for or against a leader while being told explicitly that the writer's position had been assigned, yet participants still inferred the essay reflected the writer's true attitude. This tendency to map behaviour directly onto inner traits while discounting situational constraints is called correspondence bias or the fundamental attribution error. Contributing factors include the perceptual salience of the actor relative to the situation, the extra cognitive effort needed to weigh situational force, and a default assumption that behaviour is chosen. Highlighting situational information, asking participants to explain why the person had no alternative, or placing them in the same role can partly reduce the bias.�ans��src�ٖJones 与 Harris（1967）《Journal of Experimental Social Psychology》；Gilbert 与 Malone（1995）《Psychological Bulletin》对应偏差综述َJones and Harris (1967), Journal of Experimental Social Psychology; Gilbert and Malone (1995), Psychological Bulletin, The correspondence bias��id�bb9864cda880�body���完全来得及。成年大脑持续保持可塑性，学习新技能（乐器、语言、编程）会生成新的突触连接；虽然没有儿童期那样的吸收速度，但成年人靠策略、经验和自律来弥补。研究还显示，持续学习和丰富活动是维持晚年认知健康、延缓衰退的重要因素——“认知储备”就是在一次次新学习中累积的。学得慢不等于学不会，只是路径不同。��Absolutely not too late. The adult brain keeps its plasticity, and learning new skills (instruments, languages, coding) forges new connections. Lacking a child's absorption speed, adults compensate with strategy, experience, and discipline. Research also shows continued learning and rich activity are key to maintaining late-life cognition and delaying decline — cognitive reserve accumulates through each new learning episode. Slower isn't the same as impossible; it's just a different route.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�bbb26f695fa3�body���该理论认为个体通过群体成员身份获得自尊，倾向于内群偏好与外群贬损以提升正面区分。最小群体范式实验显示，仅凭任意分组即可诱发偏好，说明分类本身足以产生偏见。�5The theory holds that people derive self-esteem from group membership and favor the in-group while derogating the out-group to achieve positive distinctiveness. Minimal-group-paradigm experiments showed that arbitrary grouping alone can induce bias, meaning categorization itself suffices to create prejudice.�ans��src��kTajfel, H. & Turner, J. C. (1979). 《群际冲突的整合理论》. 见《群际关系社会心理学》.قTajfel, H. & Turner, J. C. (1979). An integrative theory of intergroup conflict. In The Social Psychology of Intergroup Relations.��id�bc12431483bf�body��,沙赫特与辛格于 1962 年提出，情绪由两部分构成：生理唤醒加上个体对唤醒的“认知标签”。他们用肾上腺素实验证明，当人感到莫名唤醒却无合理解释时，会依据环境线索为情绪“命名”，说明认知在情绪体验中起关键作用。�0Schachter and Singer proposed in 1962 that emotion comprises physiological arousal plus a cognitive label for that arousal. Their epinephrine experiment showed that when people feel unexplained arousal, they name the emotion from situational cues, indicating cognition's key role in emotional experience.�ans��src��oSchachter 与 Singer 1962 年论文（载 Psychological Review）；Gerrig 与 Zimbardo《心理学与生活》�YSchachter & Singer (1962) in Psychological Review; Gerrig & Zimbardo, Psychology and Life��id�bc58a2f8e3ad�body��R最初的动物实验表明，经历无法逃避的电击后，动物在可以逃避的情境中也放弃尝试，被解释为学到了反应与结果无关这一预期。神经生物学研究后来发现，被动本身是面对长期厌恶刺激的默认反应，而背侧中脑背侧被盖与前额叶通路在检测到可控性时会主动抑制这种被动，因此真正被学到的是可控性而不是无助。迈尔与塞利格曼据此重述理论：习得的是控制感，无助是缺乏该学习时的默认状态，这一修正也改变了对抑郁与心理弹性干预的理解。��The original animal experiments showed that after inescapable shock, animals stopped trying to escape even when escape became possible, interpreted as learning the expectation that responses and outcomes are independent. Later neurobiology found passivity is instead the default response to prolonged aversive stimulation, and that circuits involving the dorsal raphe and prefrontal cortex actively suppress it once controllability is detected — so what is learned is control, not helplessness. Maier and Seligman restated the theory accordingly: control is learned and helplessness is the default when that learning is absent, a revision that also reshaped thinking about interventions for depression and resilience.�ans��src�ٕSeligman 与 Maier（1967）《Journal of Experimental Psychology》；Maier 与 Seligman（2016）《Psychological Review》习得性无助五十年ٍSeligman and Maier (1967), Journal of Experimental Psychology; Maier and Seligman (2016), Psychological Review, Learned helplessness at fifty��id�bcfb8de02a01�body��Spearman 于 1904 年通过因素分析发现，各种心智测验成绩之间存在正相关，可用一个潜在的“一般智力因素 g”来解释，同时各测验还有各自的特殊因素 s。g 因素至今仍是智力研究中最被广泛支持的结构之一。�Through factor analysis in 1904, Spearman found positive correlations among diverse mental tests, explained by a latent “general intelligence factor g” plus specific factors s for each test. The g factor remains one of the most widely supported structures in intelligence research.�ans��src��pSpearman 1904 年论文（载 American Journal of Psychology）；Kaplan 与 Saccuzzo《心理测验与测量》فSpearman (1904) in American Journal of Psychology; Kaplan & Saccuzzo, Psychological Testing: Principles, Applications, and Issues��id�bd56003c6dc8�body���阅读障碍是一种神经发育性的学习困难，最常见的根源是“语音意识”薄弱——难以把口语中的声音切分成更小的单位，并映射到字形上。脑成像常显示负责字形—语音转换的区域活动偏弱，而这与智力或态度无关。及早发现并配合系统语音训练，多数孩子能显著进步，阅读障碍人群里也走出了许多科学家和艺术家。��Dyslexia is a neurodevelopmental learning difficulty whose most common root is weak phonological awareness — trouble segmenting spoken sound and mapping it to letters. Brain imaging often shows reduced activity in regions that convert print to sound, and this has nothing to do with intelligence or attitude. Early identification with systematic phonics training helps most children improve substantially, and many scientists and artists have had dyslexia.�ans��src��ADavid Myers Nathan DeWall,《Psychology》Worth Publishers 多版�LD. G. Myers and C. N. DeWall, Psychology, Worth Publishers, various editions��id�bf62b7f6de3f�body�٠主要指童年期（尤其 0–7 岁）大脑对母语语音和语法最具可塑性的窗口；错过关键期后习得第二语言更难达到母语水平。ٱIt's the childhood window (roughly 0–7 years) when the brain is most plastic for native phonology and grammar; after it, achieving native-like second-language skill is harder.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c04c19277b3a�body���前景理论解释了这个现象：人不是按绝对结果做决定，而是以某个“参照点”衡量得失。同一信息用“获得”框架（存活率）呈现时被当成收益，用“失去”框架（死亡率）呈现时被当成风险，而损失被格外看重，所以“90%康复”更有说服力。健康信息设计因此要谨慎选词，读者也需要提醒自己：话术会改变感受，但事实没有变。��Prospect theory explains this: people judge outcomes relative to a reference point, not in absolute terms. Framed as a gain (survival rate), the same fact reads as a benefit; framed as a loss (mortality), it reads as a risk — and losses weigh extra, so “90% recover” persuades more. Health messaging must choose words carefully, and readers should remember: the words changed, the facts didn't.�ans��src��2《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（决策章）�0Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), decision chapter��id�c14431860af3�body�� 弗林效应指 20 世纪多国人群在标准化 IQ 测验上的得分平均每十年上升数分的现象，由 James Flynn 于 1984 年系统报告。学界将其归因于营养、教育、环境复杂化等因素，近年在部分国家又出现得分回落的“反弗林效应”。�*The Flynn effect is the widespread rise of about several IQ points per decade on standardized tests during the 20th century, systematically reported by James Flynn in 1984. Attributed to nutrition, education, and environmental complexity, some countries now show a reversing “anti-Flynn” trend.�ans��src��UFlynn 1984 年论文（载 Nature）；Kaplan 与 Saccuzzo《心理测验与测量》�fFlynn (1984) in Nature; Kaplan & Saccuzzo, Psychological Testing: Principles, Applications, and Issues��id�c20a81253c2e�body��&镜像神经元在个体执行动作和观察同类动作时都放电，最初在猴子中发现，被炒作成共情与模仿的万能机制。但在人类中证据主要来自动态成像而非单细胞记录，其解释力已被学界谨慎限定，不能单独解释复杂的社会理解。�aMirror neurons fire both when an animal acts and when it observes the same action, first found in monkeys and hyped as a universal mechanism for empathy and imitation. In humans evidence is mostly indirect imaging, not single-cell recording, and their explanatory power is now cautiously bounded—they cannot alone explain complex social understanding.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c27fdee2935b�body�ٮ样本若不能代表总体（如只访问网民、志愿者），结论就被偏向。代表性随机抽样本难但关键；方便样本适合探索，不宜直接外推。��If the sample can't represent the population (only netizens, volunteers), conclusions skew. Representative random sampling is hard but key; convenience samples suit exploration, not direct generalization.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�c44db0c124bc�body���最后一阶段是自我整合对绝望：回顾一生感到有意义则安宁，否则陷于遗憾。研究支持生命回顾与代际传承（把经验传给后辈）能提升晚年期幸福感。��The last stage is integrity versus despair: reviewing life as meaningful brings peace, otherwise regret. Research supports life review and generativity—passing experience to the young—in raising late-life well-being.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c45f61f3327d�body���微表情是极短的不随意面部抽动，被一些训练宣称能暴露谎言，但严格研究未发现可靠测谎效果。表情与内在情绪并非一一对应，依赖微表情判断诚实既不科学也易误伤。�␀Micro-expressions are very brief involuntary facial movements touted to expose lies, but rigorous studies find no reliable lie-detection effect. Expressions do not map one-to-one to inner emotion, so judging honesty by them is unscientific and error-prone.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c4e4673f7694�body�ى述情障碍指难以识别、命名和表达自身情绪，约 10% 的人受影响，常与焦虑、抑郁及人际关系困难相关。ٷAlexithymia is difficulty identifying, naming, and expressing one's own emotions, affecting about 10% of people and often linked to anxiety, depression, and relationship difficulties.�ans��src��mSifneos (1973) 提出述情障碍概念；《精神障碍诊断与统计手册》DSM-5(美国精神医学会)�gSifneos (1973) coining of alexithymia; APA Diagnostic and Statistical Manual of Mental Disorders, DSM-5��id�c5c62c659cd0�body���卷积网络在海量数据上能超越人类辨脸，却会被对抗样本（细微噪点）轻易骗过，而人类对此稳健。差异提示人脑用了结构化的三维与语义先验，AI 更多是统计相关性，二者互补而非等同。�Convolutional networks can surpass humans at face ID given data, yet are fooled by adversarial perturbations (tiny noise) that humans shrug off. The gap suggests human vision uses structured 3D and semantic priors, while AI leans on correlations—complementary, not equivalent.�ans��src��SGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y. 与 Courville, A. (2016). 《深度学习》. MIT Press.�MGoodfellow, I., Bengio, Y., & Courville, A. (2016). Deep Learning. MIT Press.��id�c6739801586a�body���睡眠剥夺最先损害注意维持、工作记忆与高阶执行功能，而简单反射相对保留。迪明与丁格斯的研究显示，清醒 17 到 19 小时的认知损伤相当于约 0.05% 的血醇水平。�Sleep deprivation first impairs sustained attention, working memory, and higher executive functions, while simple reflexes are relatively spared. Durmer and Dinges showed that 17 to 19 hours awake produces cognitive impairment comparable to a blood alcohol level of about 0.05%.�ans��src��pDurmer, J. S. & Dinges, D. F. (2005). 《睡眠剥夺的神经行为后果》. 《神经病学研讨会》25卷.�rDurmer, J. S. & Dinges, D. F. (2005). Neurocognitive consequences of sleep deprivation. Seminars in Neurology, 25.��id�c76a99fd996e�body�٢悲伤音乐在安全距离内触发情绪释放，促进催乳素等安抚激素分泌，并带来“被理解”的共情满足，称为“愉悦的悲伤”。ٴSad music triggers emotion release at a safe distance, promotes comforting hormones like prolactin, and gives empathic satisfaction of being 'understood'—a 'pleasurable sadness.'�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c9a69733366a�body���这叫享乐适应：人会对持续不变的好事快速“习惯化”，情绪基线随之回落。中彩票者的幸福感在数月后基本回到原来水平，就是这个现象。但研究也发现，某些快乐反而“耐适应”——比如与人的连接、做有意义的事、不断有新体验的旅行。把钱花在体验而不是物品上，往往能买到更持久的幸福。��Hedonic adaptation: people habituate to steady good fortune quickly and the emotional baseline drifts back down. Lottery winners largely return to baseline happiness within months. But research finds some joys are more “adaptation-proof” — connection with people, meaningful activity, and new experiences like travel. Spending on experiences rather than objects tends to buy longer-lasting happiness.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（幸福心理学章）�7Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), psychology of happiness��id�ca09f3c3d14c�body��7双过程理论将思维分为快速、自动、不费力且常凭直觉的“系统一（System 1）”与缓慢、需要努力和逻辑分析的“系统二（System 2）”。Stanovich 与 West 于 2000 年系统提出这一区分，Kahneman 在 2011 年的著作中将其普及并用于解释判断偏差。�/Dual-process theories divide thinking into “System 1,” which is fast, automatic, effortless, and intuitive, and “System 2,” which is slow, effortful, and analytic. Stanovich and West systematically proposed the distinction in 2000, and Kahneman popularized it in 2011 to explain judgment biases.�ans��src��uStanovich 与 West 2000 年论文（载 Behavioral and Brain Sciences）；Kahneman《思考，快与慢》（2011）�bStanovich & West (2000) in Behavioral and Brain Sciences; Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow (2011)��id�ca94a9caf973�body��系统综述显示，正念冥想类项目对焦虑、抑郁与疼痛有小到中等的改善，证据强度在与主动对照条件比较时明显下降，而对注意、物质使用、睡眠与体重等结果的证据不足或不一致。方法学问题包括缺少积极对照、参与者难以盲化、依赖自评量表以及不良反应报告不足。较有说服力的结论是，八周正念减压课程等结构化项目对情绪症状有可重复的适度收益，但把冥想当作广谱疗法或替代循证治疗缺乏根据。��Systematic reviews report small to moderate improvements in anxiety, depression, and pain from mindfulness meditation programmes, with evidence strength dropping noticeably when active control conditions are used, while findings for attention, substance use, sleep, and weight are insufficient or inconsistent. Methodological problems include scarce active controls, the impossibility of blinding participants, reliance on self-report scales, and under-reporting of adverse effects. The defensible conclusion is that structured programmes such as eight-week mindfulness-based stress reduction yield replicable modest benefits for mood symptoms, but treating meditation as a broad-spectrum remedy or a substitute for evidence-based treatment is unsupported.�ans��src��{Goyal 等（2014）《JAMA Internal Medicine》冥想项目系统综述；Kabat-Zinn《Full Catastrophe Living》（1990）كGoyal et al. (2014), JAMA Internal Medicine, systematic review of meditation programmes; Kabat-Zinn, Full Catastrophe Living (1990)��id�caf97f1ae854�body���隐性歧视来自无意识的内隐态度，当事人可能真诚否认偏见却仍在简历、距离、语气上差别对待；它比公开歧视更难察觉也更普遍，需用结构化测量（如内隐联想测验）才显形。�Subtle discrimination springs from unconscious implicit attitudes; people may sincerely deny bias yet treat others differently in resumes, distance and tone. It is harder to spot and more common than overt bias, surfacing only via structured measures like the IAT.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cb411fc03eed�body���交错学习指把不同但相关的题型混合练习，而非集中练一种（分块）。它初期更吃力、正确率略低，却迫使学习者辨别情境，提升后续辨别与迁移能力。��Interleaving mixes practice of different but related types rather than blocking one. It feels harder and is slightly less accurate at first, yet forces learners to discriminate contexts and improves later discrimination and transfer.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cc1090fec23e�body���班杜拉提出，自我效能感是个体对自己能否完成某特定任务的信念。高自我效能的人更敢于挑战、坚持更久，并在困难前更少焦虑。它可通过成功经验、榜样和积极反馈来提升。�Bandura defined self-efficacy as a person's belief in their ability to accomplish a specific task. Those with high self-efficacy take on challenges, persist longer, and feel less anxiety before difficulties. It can be raised through success experiences, models, and positive feedback.�ans��src��Bandura 社会认知理论�Bandura social cognitive theory��id�cd38607cdf32�body���习惯由“线索—行为—奖赏”回路维持。刚开始靠前额叶刻意决策，反复执行后，控制权逐渐下移到基底节，行为变得自动，几乎不消耗注意力，大脑因此不再“讨论”要不要做。改习惯最有效的方法是保持旧线索、替换行为（如用喝水替换刷手机），保留原有奖赏，同时减少触发旧习惯的环境线索。理解回路，比单纯靠意志力更有效。��Habits run on a cue–behavior–reward loop. They start as deliberate prefrontal decisions, but repetition hands control down to the basal ganglia, making the action automatic and nearly attention-free — the brain stops “debating” it. The most effective change strategy keeps the old cue but swaps the behavior (e.g., drinking water instead of scrolling), preserves the reward, and removes environmental triggers. Understanding the loop beats raw willpower.�ans��src��;《心理学与生活》(津巴多)（习惯与学习章）�3Psychology and Life (Zimbardo), habits and learning��id�cf5b586e3d3c�body���群体极化的两个主要机制是说服性论证与社会比较：讨论中成员听到大量支持既有倾向的新论据，从而强化原有立场；同时人们希望被看作是群体价值的合格代表，倾向把观点表述得比平均水平更鲜明。当群体在成员构成上本就同质，接触到的反面论据稀少，极化更明显。桑斯坦把这一机制用于分析同质化的网络社群与陪审团评议，指出隔离的信息环境会系统性放大初始倾向。�YGroup polarisation rests on two mechanisms: persuasive arguments, as members hear many new reasons supporting the prevailing leaning and so strengthen their own, and social comparison, as people want to be seen as good representatives of group values and therefore state positions somewhat more sharply than the average. Polarisation is strongest when the group is already homogeneous so that counterarguments are scarce. Sunstein applied the mechanism to homogeneous online communities and jury deliberation, arguing that segregated information environments systematically amplify initial tendencies.�ans��src��rMyers 与 Lamm（1976）《Psychological Bulletin》群体极化现象；Sunstein《Going to Extremes》（2009）�tMyers and Lamm (1976), Psychological Bulletin, The group polarization phenomenon; Sunstein, Going to Extremes (2009)��id�d0e4f5b9ec45�body��&荣格认为除个人无意识外，人类共享一层“集体无意识”，其中沉淀着跨文化的普遍意象，即原型，如母亲、英雄、阴影。原型通过梦、神话和象征显现，影响性格与意义感。该概念偏向人文解释，缺乏可证伪的实证检验。�9Jung held that beyond personal unconscious, humans share a collective unconscious holding universal cross-cultural images called archetypes, such as mother, hero, and shadow. Archetypes appear in dreams, myths, and symbols, shaping character and meaning. The idea is humanistic and lacks easily falsifiable tests.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d176b2ceb6e6�body���慢性压力使下丘脑垂体肾上腺轴持续分泌皮质醇，长期高浓度皮质醇抑制海马神经发生并损伤树突，损害记忆与情绪调节。麦克尤恩用异态负荷概括这种累积损耗。�Chronic stress keeps the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis secreting cortisol, and prolonged high cortisol suppresses hippocampal neurogenesis and damages dendrites, impairing memory and emotion regulation. McEwen coined allostatic load to capture this cumulative wear and tear.�ans��src��vMcEwen, B. S. (1998). 《应激、适应与疾病：稳态应变与异态负荷》. 《纽约科学院年鉴》840卷.هMcEwen, B. S. (1998). Stress, adaptation, and disease: Allostasis and allostatic load. Annals of the New York Academy of Sciences, 840.��id�d239f08a336d�body��工作记忆是暂时保存并操作信息的认知系统，是推理和学习的核心。巴德利的工作记忆模型包含语音回路、视觉空间画板和中央执行系统。米勒提出短时记忆容量约为“7±2”个组块，现代研究认为更接近4±1个。�?Working memory is the cognitive system that temporarily holds and manipulates information, central to reasoning and learning. Baddeley's model includes the phonological loop, visuospatial sketchpad, and central executive. Miller proposed a capacity of about '7±2' chunks, while modern research suggests closer to 4±1.�ans��src��)Baddeley 工作记忆模型；Miller 1956�*Baddeley working memory model; Miller 1956��id�d2a424975812�body���默认模式网络是一组在大脑休息、不做具体任务时活跃度升高的脑区，包括内侧前额叶和后扣带回等。它与自我反思、回忆往事和畅想未来有关。当人专注外部任务时，该网络活动会下降。�OThe default mode network is a set of brain regions, including the medial prefrontal cortex and posterior cingulate, that become more active when the brain is at rest and not focused on a task. It is linked to self-reflection, recalling the past, and imagining the future. Its activity decreases when a person focuses on external tasks.�ans��src��神经影像研究（Raichle）�Neuroimaging research (Raichle)��id�d42d827a323d�body��#特质是相对稳定、跨时间的人格倾向（如“容易焦虑”的性格），状态是暂时的、由情境引发的心理体验（如“此刻很紧张”）。同一人在不同情境下状态会变，但特质相对稳定。区分二者能避免把一时情绪误判为性格。�QA trait is a relatively stable, cross-time personality tendency (e.g., an 'anxious' disposition), while a state is a temporary, situation-triggered experience (e.g., 'feeling nervous right now'). A person's states change with situations, but traits stay fairly stable. Distinguishing them avoids mistaking a momentary mood for character.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d44b9f23be31�body���预测编码认为大脑不断生成对感官输入的预测，只向上传递“预测误差”而非全部信息，再用误差更新模型。这一框架统一了解释感知、注意与行动，也启发了类脑 AI 的设计。��Predictive coding says the brain constantly predicts sensory input and passes only 'prediction errors' upward, updating its model from those errors. The framework unifies perception, attention and action and inspires brain-like AI design.�ans��src�ُRauss, Pourtois,《What is Bottom-Up and What is Top-Down in Predictive Coding?》,Frontiers in Psychology,2013 (DOI: 10.3389/fpsyg.2013.00276)ٍRauss, Pourtois, 'What is Bottom-Up and What is Top-Down in Predictive Coding?', Frontiers in Psychology, 2013, DOI: 10.3389/fpsyg.2013.00276��id�d53a577cd060�body��社会认同理论认为个体通过所属群体获得自我价值，并倾向于对内群体偏好、对外群体贬低以提升自尊。Tajfel 与 Turner 于 1979 年提出，并通过“最小群体范式”实验证明，仅基于随意分类就能引发偏袒行为。�Social identity theory holds that people derive self-worth from group membership and favor the in-group over out-groups to boost self-esteem. Tajfel and Turner proposed it in 1979 and, using the minimal group paradigm, showed that arbitrary categorization alone can produce favoritism.�ans��src��tTajfel 与 Turner 1979 年论文（载 The Social Psychology of Intergroup Relations）；Myers《社会心理学》�aTajfel & Turner (1979) in The Social Psychology of Intergroup Relations; Myers, Social Psychology��id�d5b75c13f38a�body���人在小步让步后更难拒绝后续更大要求（脚在门内/渐次服从），因公开承诺与自我一致感被锁定。组织里的“升级承诺”则是对失败项目继续加码，受沉没成本与面子驱动。�After small concessions people resist bigger later demands less (foot-in-the-door / graduated compliance), locked by public commitment and self-consistency. Escalation of commitment is pouring more into a failing project, driven by sunk cost and face-saving.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d630ff47cc70�body���DBT 最初为反复自伤、情绪极端不稳的边际人格者设计，融合认知行为技术与正念、痛苦耐受、情绪调节等技能。它强调在“接纳”与“改变”间取得辩证平衡。��DBT was built for people with self-injury and extreme emotional instability (borderline personality), blending CBT with mindfulness, distress tolerance and emotion-regulation skills. It balances 'acceptance' and 'change' dialectically.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�d83ca21a5e1a�body��E1971年津巴多把大学生随机分为“狱警”和“囚犯”，模拟监狱环境，结果很快出现了虐待与顺从的角色行为，实验被迫提前终止。它想说明情境和角色能强烈影响行为，但后来也因伦理和方法问题受到批评。它提醒我们环境和制度对人的塑造力。�\In 1971 Zimbardo randomly assigned students to 'guard' and 'prisoner' roles in a mock prison; abusive and submissive behaviors emerged quickly, and the study was stopped early. It aimed to show that situations and roles strongly shape behavior, though later criticized for ethics and method. It reminds us how environments and systems shape people.�ans��src��Zimbardo 1971 实验�Zimbardo 1971 experiment��id�d88359ac9f94�body��该研究被长期引用来说明角色与情境足以让普通人变得残酷。后来公开的原始录音与档案显示，研究者对狱警进行了明确的态度指导，鼓励制造心理压力；部分参与者事后承认在表演角色，招募广告本身也筛选出对监狱生活感兴趣的人群，此外研究没有对照组，观察者深度介入且兼任典狱长。因此实验更接近一次带有需求特征的角色扮演演示，而非能推断因果的对照研究，其结论应被视为提出假设而非确证。��The study has long been cited to show that roles and situations alone can turn ordinary people cruel. Released tapes and archives later revealed that the researchers explicitly coached guards and encouraged them to create psychological pressure, some participants admitted afterwards to performing a role, the recruitment advertisement itself selected people interested in prison life, and there was no control group while the lead investigator both observed and acted as prison superintendent. The exercise therefore resembles a demonstration of role-play under strong demand characteristics rather than a controlled study licensing causal inference, and its conclusions should be treated as hypothesis-generating.�ans��src�ٌHaney、Banks 与 Zimbardo（1973）《International Journal of Criminology and Penology》；Le Texier（2019）《American Psychologist》�|Haney, Banks and Zimbardo (1973), International Journal of Criminology and Penology; Le Texier (2019), American Psychologist��id�d96a0e1d2e56�body��该假说认为语言结构影响甚至决定认知方式。弱版本（语言影响思维）得到颜色词与空间框架等实验支持，强版本（语言决定思维）已被反驳。维纳沃等对俄语蓝绿色范畴的研究是经典弱版本证据。�hThe hypothesis holds that linguistic structure influences or even determines cognition. The weak version (language influences thought) is supported by experiments on color terms and spatial frames, while the strong version (language determines thought) has been refuted. Winawer et al.'s study of Russian blue-green categories is classic weak-version evidence.�ans��src��YWinawer, J. 等 (2007). 《俄语蓝揭示语言对颜色辨别的影响》. PNAS 104卷.�gWinawer, J. et al. (2007). Russian blues reveal effects of language on color discrimination. PNAS, 104.��id�da9a75ce26f7�body���强烈恐惧时，杏仁核把事件按“威胁”深度编码，而负责时间感和语境的前额叶-海马系统在极度应激下记录会模糊，导致记忆缺乏“这已经过去了”的标签，再次触发时就像重新发生。闪回不是软弱，而是记忆系统被劫持的结果。循证治疗（如长期暴露、眼动脱敏与再加工、认知加工疗法）能重新标记记忆、恢复安全感，创伤后反应是可以治愈的。��Under intense fear, the amygdala encodes the event as a threat, while the prefrontal-hippocampal system that anchors time and context records poorly under extreme stress — so the memory lacks the label “this is over,” and re-triggering feels like it's happening again. Flashbacks aren't weakness; they're the memory system being hijacked. Evidence-based treatments (prolonged exposure, EMDR, cognitive processing therapy) can re-label memories and restore safety — trauma reactions are treatable.�ans��src��$APA（创伤后应激障碍治疗）�APA (PTSD treatment)��id�db8bc2f1bae4�body��7费斯廷格与卡尔史密斯让被试完成枯燥任务，再请他们向下一位参与者说这项任务很有趣，一组获得一美元，另一组获得二十美元。结果拿一美元的人事后对任务的评价明显更正面，因为二十美元提供了充足的外部理由，无需改变私下看法；而一美元不足以解释自己的言行，认知不一致带来的不适促使他们调整态度以自圆其说。这一范式确立了失调理论的核心预测，也提示激励设计中过高的外部报酬可能削弱内在态度的转变。��Festinger and Carlsmith had participants perform a tedious task and then tell the next participant it was interesting, paying one group one dollar and the other twenty. Those paid a dollar afterwards rated the task as significantly more enjoyable, because twenty dollars supplied an ample external justification that left private opinion untouched, whereas one dollar could not explain their own behaviour and the resulting discomfort pushed them to adjust their attitude to restore consistency. The paradigm established dissonance theory's core prediction and warns that overly generous external rewards can undercut genuine internal attitude change.�ans��src�ٌFestinger 与 Carlsmith（1959）《Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology》；Festinger《A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance》（1957）�}Festinger and Carlsmith (1959), Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology; Festinger, A Theory of Cognitive Dissonance (1957)��id�dc045e948fac�body��+特沃斯基与卡尼曼让被试先转动一个操纵过的转盘，再估计联合国中非洲国家的比例，转到较大数字的一组给出的估计明显更高，尽管数字来源与问题毫无关系。机制主要有两条：不充分调整，即人们以锚为起点向目标方向调整但停得太早；以及选择性可及性，锚点激活了与之一致的信息，使这些内容在判断时更容易被想起。锚定在专家身上同样出现，例如房地产估价受挂牌价影响，事先警告往往只能部分削弱效应。��Tversky and Kahneman had participants spin a rigged wheel before estimating the share of African nations in the United Nations, and those who landed on a larger number gave markedly higher estimates even though the number was transparently irrelevant. Two mechanisms dominate: insufficient adjustment, where people start from the anchor and move toward the target but stop too soon, and selective accessibility, where the anchor primes anchor-consistent information that then comes to mind during judgement. Anchoring appears in experts too — real-estate appraisals shift with listing prices — and forewarning typically reduces the effect only partially.�ans��src�ٳTversky 与 Kahneman（1974）《Science》不确定条件下的判断；Northcraft 与 Neale（1987）《Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes》房产估价研究٭Tversky and Kahneman (1974), Science, Judgment under uncertainty; Northcraft and Neale (1987), Organizational Behavior and Human Decision Processes, property appraisal study��id�df06d0b85c2a�body��传统解释把安慰剂效应归于欺骗造成的期待，但卡普查克团队在肠易激综合征、慢性腰痛等试验中发现，明确告知药片无活性成分并解释身心反应原理后，患者的症状评分仍显著改善。可能的机制包括治疗仪式与关系提供的期待、条件化反应，以及症状报告本身对注意与解释的敏感性。这类研究的价值在于把安慰剂研究与伦理要求调和，同时提醒临床试验的对照设计必须区分药理作用与治疗情境作用。��The classic account attributes placebo effects to expectancy created by deception, yet Kaptchuk's group found in trials for irritable bowel syndrome and chronic low back pain that symptom scores improved significantly even when patients were told the pills contained no active ingredient and were given a rationale about mind-body responses. Plausible mechanisms include expectancy generated by the treatment ritual and clinical relationship, conditioned responses, and the sensitivity of symptom reporting to attention and interpretation. Such work reconciles placebo research with ethical requirements while reminding trialists that control designs must separate pharmacological action from the effects of the treatment context.�ans��src�نKaptchuk 等（2010）《PLOS ONE》肠易激综合征开放标签安慰剂试验；Carvalho 等（2016）《Pain》慢性腰痛试验ًKaptchuk et al. (2010), PLOS ONE, open-label placebo in irritable bowel syndrome; Carvalho et al. (2016), Pain, chronic low back pain trial��id�e179ed19636b�body���短期断联可降低焦虑与错失恐惧、提升当下感，但效果多在回归旧习惯后衰减；更持久的是建立使用界限而非一次性戒断。研究强调可持续的边界，而非苦行式清零。��Short detox lowers anxiety and FOMO and raises presence, but gains fade once old habits return; more durable is building use boundaries than one-off quitting. Research stresses sustainable limits over ascetic zeroing-out.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e2adbd65cba6�body��R经典的萨莉与安妮任务要求儿童预测一个不知道物品被移动的人会去哪里寻找，通过它意味着儿童理解他人可以持有与现实不符的信念，通常在四岁左右达成。但用注视时间或期待性眼动作为指标的非言语范式显示，十五个月甚至更小的婴儿在他人信念被违背时表现出惊讶反应。争论焦点在于早期反应是否已构成真正的心理理论，还是仅反映对行为规律的统计学习，因此当前研究更强调区分内隐的行为预期与需要语言与执行功能支持的外显推理。��The classic Sally-Anne task asks a child to predict where someone who did not see an object moved will look for it, and passing implies understanding that others can hold beliefs contrary to reality, typically achieved around age four. Nonverbal paradigms using looking time or anticipatory eye movements, however, show that infants as young as fifteen months react with surprise when another agent's belief is violated. The dispute is whether such early responses constitute genuine theory of mind or merely statistical learning about behavioural regularities, so current research distinguishes implicit behavioural expectations from explicit reasoning that depends on language and executive function.�ans��src��rWimmer 与 Perner（1983）《Cognition》；Onishi 与 Baillargeon（2005）《Science》婴儿错误信念研究�fWimmer and Perner (1983), Cognition; Onishi and Baillargeon (2005), Science, infant false-belief study��id�e3de9a9be93d�body��1兰格的实验显示，当彩票情境中加入选择号码、熟悉度、竞争对手或练习机会等本与结果无关的技能线索时，被试对中奖概率的主观估计明显上升。机制在于人们用技能情境的启发式来解读随机事件，同时倾向把成功归因于自身操作、把失败归因于外部干扰，从而维持了控制感。这一偏差在赌博行为、股票交易与迷信仪式中都有体现，适度的控制错觉与心理健康正相关，但在需要准确风险评估的场景中会造成系统性误判。��Langer's experiments showed that adding skill cues irrelevant to the outcome — choosing one's own lottery numbers, familiarity with the tickets, a visibly incompetent competitor, or practice trials — raised participants' subjective estimates of winning. The mechanism is that people apply heuristics from skill situations to interpret random events, while attributing successes to their own actions and failures to external interference, which preserves a sense of control. The bias appears in gambling, stock trading, and superstitious rituals; a moderate illusion of control correlates with psychological wellbeing, but it produces systematic misjudgement wherever accurate risk assessment matters.�ans��src�ٕLanger（1975）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》控制错觉；Thompson 等（1998）《Psychological Bulletin》控制错觉综述٠Langer (1975), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, The illusion of control; Thompson et al. (1998), Psychological Bulletin, review of illusory control��id�e4d2f37f984c�body���这叫麦格克效应：大脑把视觉口型和听觉信息自动整合成统一的语音知觉。放“ba”的声音配“ga”的口型，大多数人“听到”的是介于两者之间的“da”。这揭示了语音知觉是多感官的，也解释了为什么戴口罩或视频卡顿时更容易听不清别人说话。大脑在做证据合并：结合视觉与听觉信息，给出最可能的解释。��Known as the McGurk effect: the brain automatically integrates visual lip movements and acoustic information into a single speech percept. A “ba” sound dubbed over “ga” lips makes most people hear “da,” something between the two. It reveals that speech perception is multisensory — and why masks or choppy video make speech harder to follow. The brain fuses visual and auditory evidence, choosing the most plausible interpretation.�ans��src��$APA（多感觉言语知觉研究）�-APA (multisensory speech perception research)��id�e501070021fe�body���心智化是推断自己与他人信念、意图和情绪的能力，依赖内侧前额叶、颞顶联合区等网络。它让我们理解别人的行为“为何如此”，也是共情、沟通与社会合作的基础。�Mentalizing is the ability to infer others' and our own beliefs, intentions and emotions, relying on networks including medial prefrontal and temporoparietal junction. It lets us grasp why someone acted as they did and underpins empathy, communication and cooperation.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e53345bcad2c�body���该领域研究心理、神经与免疫系统的交互：慢性压力通过皮质醇抑制淋巴细胞与自然杀伤细胞功能，降低抗病毒与抗肿瘤免疫监视。科恩等的实验显示报告高压力者更易感染鼻病毒。�9This field studies interactions among psychological, neural, and immune systems: chronic stress uses cortisol to suppress lymphocyte and natural-killer cell function, lowering antiviral and anti-tumor immune surveillance. Cohen et al. showed that people reporting high stress were more likely to catch rhinovirus.�ans��src�لCohen, S., Tyrrell, D. A. J., Smith, A. P. (1991). 《心理压力与普通感冒易感性》. 《新英格兰医学杂志》325卷.�zCohen, S. et al. (1991). Psychological stress and susceptibility to the common cold. New England Journal of Medicine, 325.��id�e63dff8fe290�body���心理词典是我们脑中储存词形、语音、语义与语法信息的网络，词与词通过意义与语音联结成网。提取一个词会部分激活其邻居（语义/语音启动），所以有时会说错音近或义近的词。�The mental lexicon is the networked store of word forms, sounds, meanings and grammar; words are linked by sense and sound. Retrieving a word partially activates neighbors (semantic/phonological priming), which is why we sometimes produce similar-sounding or similar-meaning words.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e730815c4cf2�body���马基雅维利主义是“黑暗三联征”之一，指为达目的而操纵他人、讲究策略、情感疏离的倾向。它与共情低和功利取向相关。在职场和政治中常被研究。��Machiavellianism, one of the 'dark triad,' is a tendency to manipulate others for goals, be strategic, and stay emotionally detached. It links to low empathy and utilitarian aims. It is studied in workplace and politics.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e79141076136�body���自我实现预言指一个错误期望引发的行为最终使期望成真，例如老师对学生的高期望真的提升了其成绩（皮格马利翁效应）。它说明预期能塑造现实。�A self-fulfilling prophecy is when a false expectation triggers behaviors that make the expectation come true, such as a teacher's high expectations actually raising students' achievement (the Pygmalion effect). It shows that expectations can shape reality.�ans��src��$《社会心理学》（阿伦森）�The Social Psychology (Aronson)��id�e8080f5d03b5�body��困难问题指：即使说清大脑如何加工信息，仍解释不了“为何有主观体验”（为何红色对你是那种感受）。当前 AI 能模拟功能却无证据拥有内在感受，因此机器意识仍是开放且高度争议的哲学-科学难题。�(The hard problem: even if we explain how the brain processes information, we still can't explain why there is subjective experience (why red feels that way to you). Today's AI can simulate function but shows no evidence of inner feel, so machine consciousness remains an open, contested question.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e8907ef1925a�body���注意力恢复理论认为自然环境提供柔软的迷恋，让定向注意（前额叶）休整；研究测得自然步行后注意力与情绪改善、皮质醇下降。哪怕看绿植视频也有微弱效果。��Attention Restoration Theory holds nature offers soft fascination that rests directed attention (prefrontal); studies show improved attention and mood and lower cortisol after nature walks, even weak effects from plant videos.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�eb4f65eb292c�body��:在经典的数量守恒任务中，实验者把一排纽扣拉长后再次提问，学龄前儿童常改口说变多了，皮亚杰据此认为前运算阶段的儿童缺乏守恒概念。批评者指出，任务的语言与语用设置容易误导：连续两次问同一个问题暗示答案应当改变，而实验者刻意的操作也被儿童理解为提示。麦加里格与唐纳森把变化改为顽皮泰迪熊的破坏行为，使操作显得偶然，儿童的正确率显著上升，说明部分失败源于对成人意图的解读而非逻辑能力缺失。��In the classic number conservation task the experimenter spreads out a row of counters and repeats the question, and preschoolers often switch to saying there are now more, which Piaget took as evidence that preoperational children lack conservation. Critics observed that the task's language and pragmatics mislead: asking the same question twice implies the answer should change, and the adult's deliberate rearrangement is read as a hint. When McGarrigle and Donaldson attributed the change to a naughty teddy bear so that it looked accidental, children's accuracy rose markedly, showing part of the failure stems from interpreting adult intentions rather than from missing logic.�ans��src��Piaget《The Child's Conception of Number》（1952）；McGarrigle 与 Donaldson（1974）《Cognition》顽皮泰迪熊实验�yPiaget, The Child's Conception of Number (1952); McGarrigle and Donaldson (1974), Cognition, the naughty teddy experiment��id�ed9e05d953fd�body���前瞻性记忆是记得在未来某个时刻执行计划好的行为，比如按时服药或赴约，与回想过去事件的回溯性记忆不同。它依赖大脑的执行功能与线索触发。�Prospective memory is remembering to perform an intended action at a future time, such as taking medicine or keeping an appointment, unlike retrospective memory which recalls past events. It depends on executive function and on cues that trigger the intention.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�f20bde918983�body���关键节点包括内侧前额叶（自我与他人表征）、颞顶联合区（视角采择）、梭状回（面孔）与杏仁核（社会威胁评估）。它们组成灵活的网络，而非单一“社会脑”模块。��Key hubs include medial prefrontal cortex (self/other representation), temporoparietal junction (perspective-taking), fusiform face area and amygdala (social-threat evaluation). They form a flexible network rather than one 'social brain' module.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f2507403298b�body���拉扎勒斯认为情绪产生于对事件的评价：先判断它是否与己相关（初评价），再判断能否应对（次评价）。同一事件因评价不同会引发不同情绪。��Lazarus held that emotion arises from appraisal of an event: first whether it matters to you (primary appraisal), then whether you can cope (secondary appraisal). The same event can thus trigger different emotions depending on appraisal.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f3443c1e057e�body��I原始研究发现，能力最低的被试显著高估自己的相对排名，而能力最高者略微低估，被通俗解读为无知者最自信。批评者指出，这种图形也可能由回归到均值与量表天花板效应自然产生：由于自评与客观成绩相关不完全，任何按真实成绩分组的比较都会出现低分组高估、高分组低估的模式。经统计模拟等方法重新分析后，学界目前认为元认知能力差异确实存在，但效应的强度被原始呈现方式放大了，且不支持无知者比专家更自信的强版本。��The original studies found that the least skilled participants substantially overestimated their percentile standing while the most skilled slightly underestimated theirs, popularly read as the ignorant being the most confident. Critics noted the same graph can arise from regression to the mean plus scale ceiling effects: because self-assessment correlates imperfectly with performance, any grouping by true score will show low scorers overestimating and high scorers underestimating. After reanalyses using simulation and other methods, the consensus is that genuine differences in metacognitive accuracy exist but the effect's magnitude was inflated by the original presentation, and the strong claim that novices are more confident than experts is not supported.�ans��src�قKruger 与 Dunning（1999）《Journal of Personality and Social Psychology》；Nuhfer 等（2017）《Numeracy》统计再分析�Kruger and Dunning (1999), Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Nuhfer et al. (2017), Numeracy, statistical reanalysis��id�f53ec1fa67ec�body���重大公共事件引发强烈情绪与反复叙述，使人对当时情境形成生动、细节丰富且高度自信的记忆。塔拉里科与鲁宾在美国九一一事件后连续追踪同一批被试，发现随时间推移，闪光灯记忆的一致性下降幅度与普通日常记忆相当，但被试对它的生动感和信心几乎不衰减。这提示情绪主要强化了记忆的主观体验与元认知判断，而非其客观保真度，重复讲述反而可能引入并固化误差。�_Major public events trigger strong emotion and repeated retelling, producing memories of one's own circumstances that feel vivid, detailed, and highly confident. Tracking the same participants after the September 11 attacks, Talarico and Rubin found the consistency of flashbulb memories declined over time at about the same rate as ordinary everyday memories, while ratings of vividness and confidence barely dropped. Emotion therefore seems to boost the subjective experience and metacognitive appraisal of memory rather than its objective fidelity, and repeated retelling can introduce and cement errors.�ans��src�ِTalarico 与 Rubin（2003）《Psychological Science》；Hirst 等（2015）《Journal of Experimental Psychology: General》十年追踪研究نTalarico and Rubin (2003), Psychological Science; Hirst et al. (2015), Journal of Experimental Psychology: General, ten-year follow-up��id�f5f80ce490d5�body��1猕猴前运动皮层中的一类神经元在猴子自己抓握和观看他人抓握时都会放电，这一发现被推广用于解释共情、语言起源与孤独症，形成了流行叙事。批评者指出，人类中直接的单细胞证据有限，动作理解在失用症或运动系统受损的患者中并未全面崩塌，且这类反应可能来自感觉运动联结的学习而非先天的理解机制。目前较稳妥的表述是，镜像性质的反应参与动作预测与模仿，但把它当作社会认知的统一解释缺乏充分证据。��A class of neurons in macaque premotor cortex fires both when the monkey grasps an object and when it watches another grasp, and the finding was extended to explain empathy, the origins of language, and autism, generating a popular narrative. Critics point out that direct single-cell evidence in humans is sparse, that action understanding does not collapse wholesale in patients with apraxia or damaged motor systems, and that such responses may arise from learned sensorimotor associations rather than an innate comprehension mechanism. The prudent formulation is that mirror-like responses contribute to action prediction and imitation, but treating them as a unified explanation of social cognition is not adequately supported.�ans��src�ٵRizzolatti 与 Craighero（2004）《Annual Review of Neuroscience》镜像神经元系统；Hickok（2009）《Journal of Cognitive Neuroscience》对镜像神经元解释的批评ٮRizzolatti and Craighero (2004), Annual Review of Neuroscience, The mirror-neuron system; Hickok (2009), Journal of Cognitive Neuroscience, critique of mirror neuron accounts��id�f6259c53aa04�body���谢泼德和梅茨勒让被试判断两个三维物体是否相同，只是角度不同。反应时间随旋转角度线性增加，说明人在脑中像转动实物一样旋转心理图像。��Shepard and Metzler asked participants to judge whether two 3D objects were the same despite differing orientations. Reaction time increased linearly with rotation angle, suggesting people mentally rotate images much like turning a physical object.�ans��src��'《认知心理学》（斯滕伯格）� Cognitive Psychology (Sternberg)��id�f747e0f7ed14�body��.多项荟萃分析（如 Kirsch 等 2008 年研究）发现，轻中度抑郁患者中抗抑郁药的疗效有相当部分可由安慰剂解释，药物与安慰剂的差异在重症群体中更明显。这促使学界反思抑郁症的生化模型，并强调心理治疗与安慰剂效应的作用。�2Multiple meta-analyses (e.g., Kirsch et al., 2008) found that much of antidepressant benefit in mild-to-moderate depression is explained by placebo, with drug–placebo differences clearer in severe cases. This prompted rethinking of the biochemical model and highlighted psychotherapy and placebo effects.�ans��src��MKirsch 等 2008 年论文（载 PLoS Medicine）；Comer《异常心理学》�AKirsch et al. (2008) in PLoS Medicine; Comer, Abnormal Psychology��id�f7786bb463a0�body���习惯形成涉及从目标导向的背内侧纹状体向习惯化的背外侧纹状体的控制转移，伴随基底节中「提示-行为-奖赏」回路的固化。一旦自动化，行为由情境线索直接触发，不再依赖结果评估。��Habit formation involves a shift from goal-directed dorsomedial to habit-based dorsolateral striatum control, consolidating a cue-behavior-reward loop in the basal ganglia. Once automated, context cues trigger behavior without outcome evaluation.�ans��src��@《神经科学》(Bear 等);Nature Human Behaviour 习惯研究�CNeuroscience (Bear et al.); Nature Human Behaviour (habit research)��id�f7d2b8ce7551�body���IIT 用 Φ 度量系统“不可还原的整合程度”，认为意识正比于一个系统整合信息的能力。它预言某些复杂网络有意识、简单并联装置没有，但如何与脑实测对应仍争议巨大。�+IIT quantifies consciousness with Φ, the irreducible degree of integration, holding that consciousness scales with a system's capacity to integrate information. It predicts some complex networks are conscious while simple parallel devices are not, but linking Φ to the brain remains hotly debated.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�f85a6f316a1e�body���能，这就是神经可塑性。学习时，突触连接会加强或新建（突触可塑性），某些情况下邻近脑区会接管受损区域的功能。伦敦出租车司机海马体（空间记忆中心）后部明显增大，是成人脑可塑性的经典证据。不过“黄金期”确实存在——儿童期可塑性最强，成年后需要更多主动练习和更长时间。刻意练习、运动和充足睡眠都能促进可塑性，终生都在发生。��Yes — neuroplasticity. Learning strengthens and creates synapses (synaptic plasticity), and adjacent regions can take over functions after injury. London taxi drivers show enlarged posterior hippocampus (the spatial-memory hub), a classic adult-plasticity case. A “golden window” is real — plasticity peaks in childhood and needs more deliberate practice later — but plasticity continues for life, boosted by deliberate practice, exercise, and good sleep.�ans��src��(Nature（2020年神经可塑性综述）�(Nature (review on neuroplasticity, 2020)��id�f95dc5acead9�body���群体极化指群体讨论后立场比成员初始平均更极端。机制包括社会比较（希望显得比同伴更坚定）、说服性论证（听到更多同向理由）以及去个体化后的责任稀释，常被用于解释在线极端化。�Group polarization is the shift toward more extreme positions after discussion, driven by social comparison (appearing more committed), persuasive arguments (exposure to one-sided reasons), and reduced individual accountability. It helps explain online radicalization.�ans��src��H《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 群体过程卷�-Annual Review of Psychology (group processes)��id�f9d2ed9ae524�body���胼胝体切断后，左右半球无法交换信息。加扎尼加的实验显示左半球擅长语言与序列分析，右半球更擅空间与整体加工，但两侧均具独立意识，挑战了「单一自我」的简单图景。�<After severing the corpus callosum, hemispheres cannot share information. Gazzaniga's experiments showed the left hemisphere specializes in language and sequential analysis, the right in spatial and holistic processing, with each hemisphere capable of independent awareness, complicating the notion of a single self.�ans��src��4《神经科学》(Bear 等);美国心理学会(APA)�DNeuroscience (Bear et al.); American Psychological Association (APA)��id�fa40ea9280a7�body���ACT 先接纳无法立刻改变的感受，再据价值采取行动，而非先消灭情绪再生活。它与解决问题不矛盾：对可控的解决，对不可控的接纳，双轨并行反而减少内耗。��ACT first accepts feelings that cannot change at once, then acts on values rather than waiting to kill the emotion. It does not conflict with solving problems: address what is controllable, accept what is not, in parallel, which cuts inner struggle.�ans��src��ZHayes, S.C., Strosahl, K. & Wilson, K.G. (1999)《接纳与承诺疗法》, Guilford Press�eHayes, S.C., Strosahl, K.D. & Wilson, K.G. (1999). Acceptance and Commitment Therapy. Guilford Press.��id�fbf0f1f61c34�body���比约克提出，某些增加编码难度的操作会降低当下的表现，却提升长期保持与迁移，例如交错练习不同题型、延迟提供反馈、自己生成答案而非直接阅读。原因在于表现与学习并不等同：顺畅的重复只是强化了当前情境下的提取流畅度，而困难迫使学习者构建更多线索、更完整的辨别规则。风险在于难度必须落在学习者能力范围内，若超出便只是挫败，所以叫合意困难而非任意困难。�{Bjork proposed that certain manipulations which raise encoding difficulty lower immediate performance yet improve long-term retention and transfer — interleaving problem types, delaying feedback, or generating an answer instead of reading it. The reason is that performance and learning are not the same: smooth repetition mainly boosts retrieval fluency in the current context, whereas difficulty forces learners to build more cues and sharper discrimination rules. The catch is that the difficulty must stay within the learner's reach, since beyond it there is only frustration — hence desirable rather than arbitrary difficulty.�ans��src�ٖBjork（1994）《Metacognition: Knowing about Knowing》合意困难章节；Rohrer 与 Taylor（2007）《Instructional Science》交错练习研究٬Bjork (1994), Memory and metamemory considerations in the training of human beings, in Metacognition: Knowing about Knowing; Rohrer and Taylor (2007), Instructional Science��id�fcac97e98e08�body���米歇尔指出跨情境行为一致性远低于预期，强调具体情境与认知情感单元的作用。此后学界转向如果……那么……一致性及特征激活观，调和了特质与情境之争。�Mischel argued that cross-situational behavioral consistency was far lower than assumed, emphasizing specific situations and cognitive-affective units. Later work shifted to if-then consistency and trait-activation views, reconciling the trait-versus-situation debate.�ans��src�ًMischel, W. (1968). 《人格与评估》; Mischel & Shoda (1995). 《人格与心理评估中的认知情感单元》. 《心理评论》.قMischel, W. (1968). Personality and Assessment; Mischel & Shoda (1995). A cognitive-affective system theory. Psychological Review.��id�fe6e82dd58bf�body�پ斯金纳区分连续强化与间歇强化；固定比率/间隔与可变比率/间隔。可变比率（如赌博）最能维持高且稳定的反应率， extinction（消退）也最慢。��Skinner distinguished continuous from intermittent reinforcement, with fixed vs. variable ratio and interval schedules. Variable-ratio schedules (like gambling) produce the highest, steadiest response rates and the slowest extinction.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�fe9ca7d3bfde�body���该模型在中央执行系统统辖下包含语音环路（复述言语信息）、视空间画板（维持空间图像）与情景缓冲器（整合多通道信息）。它区分了被动存储与主动操控，是认知心理学核心框架。�Baddeley's model, under a central executive, includes the phonological loop (verbal rehearsal), visuospatial sketchpad (spatial images), and episodic buffer (multimodal integration). It separates passive storage from active manipulation and anchors cognitive psychology.�ans��src��_《心理学年度评论》(Annual Review of Psychology) 认知卷;《神经科学》(Bear 等)�CAnnual Review of Psychology (cognition); Neuroscience (Bear et al.)��id�ff6c06cc449f�body��g全基因组关联研究表明，精神分裂症、双相障碍与抑郁症都是高度多基因的，成百上千个位点各自贡献极小效应，把它们加权求和得到多基因风险评分。以精神分裂症为例，该评分在群体层面能解释相当比例的遗传易感性差异，但对单个个体的预测精度远低于临床可用标准，高分者大多并不发病。局限还包括训练样本以欧洲血统为主导致跨人群迁移效果下降、评分与环境因素的交互难以刻画，以及告知风险可能带来污名化，因此目前主要用于研究分层而非诊断。��Genome-wide association studies show schizophrenia, bipolar disorder, and depression are highly polygenic, with hundreds or thousands of loci each contributing tiny effects that can be summed into a weighted polygenic risk score. For schizophrenia such scores explain a meaningful share of variation in genetic liability at the population level, yet individual predictive accuracy falls well short of clinical usability and most high scorers never develop the illness. Further limits include training samples dominated by European ancestry, which degrades portability across populations, difficulty modelling gene-environment interplay, and the stigma risk of disclosing scores, so their current role is research stratification rather than diagnosis.�ans��src�ٷ精神病基因组学联盟（Psychiatric Genomics Consortium）精神分裂症全基因组关联研究；Martin 等（2019）《Nature Genetics》多基因评分跨人群可迁移性ٛPsychiatric Genomics Consortium genome-wide association studies of schizophrenia; Martin et al. (2019), Nature Genetics, on portability of polygenic scores��id�ff9354ecc872�body���IRT 用模型描述题目难度、区分度与答题者能力的关系，使不同试卷的分数可公平比较（量表等值）。它取代了古典真分数理论，是现代大型测验（如 PISA）的底层方法。��IRT models the relationship between item difficulty, discrimination and person ability, letting scores from different test forms be compared fairly (equating). It supersedes classical test theory and underlies modern large-scale assessments like PISA.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�psy_19_003�body��}Moscovici 与 Zavalloni 先让被试匿名记录各自立场,再经过集体讨论后重新评定,结果群体判断系统性地向初始倾向的极端一端移动。社会比较机制解释为成员为了显得高于平均水平而加码表态,说服性论据机制则强调讨论暴露了更多同方向理由。该效应在冒险与保守两个方向上均得到重复验证。��Moscovici and Zavalloni first recorded participants’ stances privately, then had them re-rate after collective discussion, and group judgments shifted systematically toward the extreme end of the initial tendency. Under social comparison, members stake out stronger positions to appear above average; under persuasive-arguments theory, discussion simply surfaces more same-direction reasons. Replications have captured the effect in both risky and cautious directions.�ans��src��hMoscovici 与 Zavalloni 1969 年发表于《人格与社会心理学杂志》的群体极化实验报告�tMoscovici & Zavalloni (1969), group-polarization experiment reported in Journal of Personality and Social Psychology��id�psy_19_006�body��l以是否经历主动探索、是否建立稳定承诺交叉分类,可得到四种状态:兼具两者者为同一性获得,有危机而无定论者为延缓,未加探索就接受外界安排者为早闭,两者皆无者为弥散。Meeus 等人的多年追踪显示,多数转变经由延缓走向获得,说明探索性危机更像建设性阶段而非单纯动荡。��Crossing active exploration with firm commitment yields four statuses: identity achievement pairs both, moratorium carries crisis without resolution, foreclosure accepts external arrangements without searching, and diffusion shows neither. Multi-year tracking by Meeus and colleagues finds most transitions running from diffusion or foreclosure through moratorium into achievement, casting exploratory crisis as a constructive phase rather than mere turbulence.�ans��src�ٲMarcia 1966 年发表于《人格与社会心理学杂志》的状态分类研究,Meeus 等 2010 年发表于《儿童发展》的五波纵向追踪研究(81卷5期,1565-1581页)��Marcia (1966) in Journal of Personality and Social Psychology; Meeus, van de Schoot, Keijsers, Schwartz, & Branje (2010). On the progression and stability of adolescent identity formation. Child Development, 81(5), 1565-1581.��id�psy_19_009�body���设计通过对比同卵与异卵双胞胎在某特质上的组内相关,把同卵相似度超出异卵的部分换算成遗传度估计。整套推理默认两类双胞胎共享环境的程度一致,即相等环境假定;批评者指出父母往往给同卵双胞胎更一致的穿着与教养,从而人为抬高其相似性。扩展家系设计与收养数据正是为校正这一偏差而引入。��The design contrasts within-pair correlations of monozygotic and dizygotic twins on a trait, converting whatever extra resemblance identical pairs show into a heritability estimate. The whole inference rests on the equal-environments assumption that both twin types share settings equally; critics counter that parents tend to dress and rear identical twins alike, inflating their similarity artificially. Extended-family designs and adoption data were introduced precisely to correct this distortion.�ans��src�ٟLoehlin 与 Nichols 1976 年基于全国优秀生双生子样本的报告,及 Plomin 等人《行为遗传学》第七版(Worth Publishers,2017)的综述章节��Loehlin & Nichols (1976). Heredity, Environment, and Personality: A Study of 850 Sets of Twins (National Merit twin sample); Plomin, DeFries, Knopik, & Neiderhiser. Behavioral Genetics, 7th ed., Worth Publishers, 2017, review chapters.��id�psy_19_013�body���该矩阵把若干特质与若干方法的两两相关排成一张表:若同一特质跨方法的相关明显高于其余单元格,说明工具捕捉到的是特质本身而非方法伪影,这构成聚合效度的证据。反过来,若恰好共用同一测量方法的不同特质之间相关同样很高,则提示分数被共同方法变异污染,构念边界已经失效。理想模式要求“异法同质”相关压过“同法异质”相关,从而同时立起聚合与区分两条证据线。�TThe matrix arranges pairwise correlations among several traits and several methods: when same-trait cross-method correlations clearly exceed the remaining cells, the instrument is capturing the trait rather than method artifact, which constitutes convergent evidence. Conversely, if different traits that merely share one measuring method correlate just as strongly, scores are contaminated by common method variance and construct boundaries collapse. The ideal pattern requires heteromethod-monotrait correlations to dominate monomethod-heterotrait ones, erecting both lines of evidence at once.�ans��src��zCampbell 与 Fiske(1959),《用多质多法矩阵验证聚合效度与区分效度》,《心理学通报》第56卷第2期ٓCampbell, D. T., & Fiske, D. W. (1959). Convergent and discriminant validation by the multitrait-multimethod matrix. Psychological Bulletin, 56(2).��id�psy_19_016�body��他们论证,心理学被试大多来自西方、受过教育、工业化、富裕且民主的社会,而这些人群在公平博弈、视错觉、空间推理等任务上恰恰是全球分布中的离群点,于是便利样本得出的规律可能只是局部规范被误认作物种特征。又因为期刊极少报告样本的文化背景,理论家难以察觉自己的“普遍”命题踩在极其狭窄的证据底座上。作者主张用人口学透明的报告方式和跨人群比较设计来取代单一样本的外推。�{They argued that psychology draws most participants from Western, educated, industrialized, rich, and democratic societies—populations that are outliers in global distributions on fairness games, visual illusion, and spatial reasoning—so patterns from convenience samples may mistake local norms for species-wide traits. Because journals rarely report the cultural background of samples, theorists can overlook that their universal propositions stand on an extremely narrow evidence base. The authors urged demographically transparent reporting and cross-population comparison designs in place of extrapolation from a single group.�ans��src��nHenrich、Heine 与 Norenzayan(2010),《世上最奇特的人群?》,《行为与脑科学》第33卷第2-3期�}Henrich, J., Heine, S. J., & Norenzayan, A. (2010). The weirdest people in the world? Behavioral and Brain Sciences, 33(2-3).��id�psy_19_019�body��贾尼斯开出的症状清单包括:刀枪不入的错觉、对外群体的刻板化、成员对异议的自我审查、全体一致的幻觉,以及自封的“思想卫士”压制不利信息;这些症状合流后造成备选方案排查不全、风险评估缺位。操作层面,“成员开会前已自我沉默”“领导者在讨论早期就亮明偏好”可作为可核查的预警信号。他的处方是领导者暂缓表态、引入外部专家质询并将团队分组独立审议,以恢复议事规范的开放性。��Janis's symptom checklist includes illusions of invulnerability, stereotyping of outgroups, members' self-censorship of dissent, illusions of unanimity, and self-appointed mindguards suppressing adverse information; flowing together, these produce an incomplete survey of alternatives and absent risk appraisal. Operationally, members silencing themselves before meetings and leaders stating preferences early in discussion serve as verifiable warning signs. His prescription was leaders withholding their positions, summoning outside experts for challenge, and splitting the team into independent subgroups to restore open deliberative norms.�ans��src��}Janis(1982),《群体思维:政策决策与惨败的心理学研究》(增订第2版),波士顿 Houghton Mifflin 出版公司�|Janis, I. L. (1982). Groupthink: Psychological Studies of Policy Decisions and Fiascoes (2nd ed.). Boston: Houghton Mifflin.��id�psy_20_003�body���海特等人主张人类道德直觉建立在若干进化而来的心理基础之上,涵盖关爱/伤害、公平/欺骗、忠诚/背叛、权威/颠覆与圣洁/堕落五个维度。跨文化问卷显示,自由派主要依赖关爱与公平两种基础,而保守派对五种基础的权重更为均衡。这种“基础敏感性差异”解释了双方为何互指对方失德,也为跨意识形态的沟通提供了可操作的诊断框架。��Jonathan Haidt and colleagues argue that moral intuition rests on evolved psychological foundations spanning care/harm, fairness/cheating, loyalty/betrayal, authority/subversion, and sanctity/degradation. Cross-cultural surveys show liberals rely chiefly on care and fairness, whereas conservatives weight all five foundations more evenly. This difference in foundation sensitivity explains why each side deems the other immoral, and offers an operational diagnostic for cross-ideological dialogue.�ans��src��XHaidt & Graham《Social Justice Research》20卷(2007); Graham 等《JPSP》100卷(2011)�QHaidt & Graham, Social Justice Research 20 (2007); Graham et al., JPSP 100 (2011)��id�psy_20_009�body���因为它把恒定的物理输入与变化的主观体验解耦了:凡是放电随知觉而非随刺激翻转的神经元,就是 NCC 的候选者。Logothetis 团队在清醒猕猴上的单细胞记录显示,颞下皮层等高级视觉区的神经元跟随知觉切换发放,而初级视皮层多数细胞仍在追踪刺激本身,说明意识相关活动更多集中在高级表征区。该范式由此成为区分前意识加工与意识通达的标准实验手段。�&Rivalry decouples constant physical input from fluctuating experience: any neuron whose firing flips with perception instead of with the stimulus is an NCC candidate. Single-unit recordings in awake macaques by Logothetis's group revealed that inferior-temporal neurons fired in step with perceptual switches while most V1 cells kept tracking the stimulus, placing consciousness-related activity preferentially in higher representational areas. The paradigm thereby became a standard tool for separating preconscious processing from conscious access.�ans��src��|Logothetis, N. K., & Schall, J. D. (1989). Neuronal correlates of subjective visual perception. Science, 245(4919), 761-763.�|Logothetis, N. K., & Schall, J. D. (1989). Neuronal correlates of subjective visual perception. Science, 245(4919), 761-763.��id�psy_20_013�body���梅因与所罗门借助逐帧分析发现,紊乱型婴儿呈现策略崩解的迹象:接近照料者时突然转身、僵住,或同时出现趋近与回避的矛盾动作序列。元分析证实其最强的预测因素是父母对孩子构成恐吓,或父母自身显露出受惊状态——当本应充当安全港湾的人同时也是威胁来源时,婴儿无法组织出一致的应对策略。这类儿童日后出现解离症状与外化行为问题的风险显著升高。�<Through freeze-frame analysis, Main and Solomon found that disorganized infants show signs of strategic breakdown: approaching the caregiver while suddenly turning away, freezing, or emitting contradictory sequences of simultaneous approach and avoidance. Meta-analyses confirm the strongest predictor is caregiving that frightens the child or reveals the parent herself alarmed—when the presumed safe haven is also the source of threat, no coherent strategy can be organized. These children face markedly elevated later risks of dissociation and externalizing problems.�ans��src���Lyons-Ruth, K., & Jacobvitz, D. (2008). Attachment disorganization: Unresolved loss, relational violence, and lapses in behavioral and attentional strategies. In J. Cassidy & P. R. Shaver (Eds.), Handbook of Attachment (2nd ed.). Guilford Press.��Lyons-Ruth, K., & Jacobvitz, D. (2008). Attachment disorganization: Unresolved loss, relational violence, and lapses in behavioral and attentional strategies. In J. Cassidy & P. R. Shaver (Eds.), Handbook of Attachment (2nd ed.). Guilford Press.��id�psy_20_016�body���注意力恢复理论认为,自然环境以“柔性魅力”吸引自下而上的注意,让耗竭的自上而下定向注意网络得以休整;而城市街道充满需要主动抑制的刺激,持续消耗执行资源。乌尔里希对胆囊切除术后患者的回溯分析发现,窗外可见树木的患者住院时间更短、镇痛剂用量更少,说明接触自然元素具有可测量的恢复效益。��Attention Restoration Theory holds that natural settings engage attention bottom-up through soft fascination, letting the fatigued top-down directed-attention network recuperate, whereas busy streets are full of stimuli that must be actively inhibited and keep draining executive resources. Ulrich's retrospective analysis of cholecystectomy patients found that those whose windows faced trees had shorter stays and used fewer analgesics, showing measurable restorative effects of contact with natural elements.�ans��src���Kaplan, S. (1995). The restorative benefits of nature: Toward an integrative framework. Journal of Environmental Psychology, 15(3), 169-182; Ulrich, R. S. (1984). View through a window may influence recovery from surgery. Science, 224(4647), 420-421�yKaplan, S. (1995), Journal of Environmental Psychology, 15(3): 169-182; Ulrich, R. S. (1984), Science, 224(4647): 420-421��id�psy_20_019�body���格林的双加工模型认为,个人化困境(亲手推人)强烈激活以杏仁核为核心的情境情绪系统,产生对直接身体伤害的排斥;非个人化困境(扳动道岔)则更多调用前额叶支持的功利权衡,两个系统的竞争强度决定了反应延迟与立场摇摆。库什曼进一步区分行动—后果与意图—后果的不同编码方式,说明人们对造成同等伤害的不同手段会给出系统性不同的道德评价。�Greene's dual-process model holds that personal dilemmas (pushing with your own hands) strongly engage a situational emotion system centered on the amygdala, producing aversion to direct bodily harm, whereas impersonal dilemmas (throwing the switch) lean more on prefrontal utilitarian weighing; the competition between the two systems shapes response latencies and vacillation. Cushman further distinguishes how action-outcome and intention-outcome are encoded, explaining why people systematically judge different means to the same harm.�ans��src��Greene, J. D. et al. (2001). An fMRI investigation of emotional engagement in moral judgment. Science, 293(5537), 2105-2108; Cushman, F. (2013). Action, outcome, and value: A dual-system framework for morality. Personality and Social Psychology Review, 17(4), 273-292وGreene, J. D. et al. (2001), Science, 293(5537): 2105-2108; Cushman, F. (2013), Personality and Social Psychology Review, 17(4): 273-292��id�psy_21_006�body��}检索练习迫使学习者主动重建记忆痕迹,这一过程本身会修改并巩固记忆表征,而重读只是提升当下的流畅感。Roediger 与 Karpicke 的实验发现,学习后一周,检索组的遗忘量约为重复学习组的一半,尽管重读组当时自我感觉更好。这类“合意困难”说明主观流畅性与真实保持之间存在系统性分离。��Retrieval practice forces learners to actively reconstruct memory traces, a process that itself modifies and consolidates the representation, whereas rereading only boosts momentary fluency. In Roediger and Karpicke's experiments, one week after study the retrieval conditions forgot roughly half as much as restudying conditions, even though rereaders felt more confident at first. Such desirable difficulties show that subjective fluency and actual retention systematically dissociate.�ans��src��rRoediger, Karpicke,《Test-Enhanced Learning》,Psychological Science,2006 (DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x)�pRoediger, Karpicke, 'Test-Enhanced Learning', Psychological Science, 2006, DOI: 10.1111/j.1467-9280.2006.01693.x��id�psy_21_009�body���McEwen 指出,机体通过交感神经与 HPA 轴的反复激活来适应压力,但应激反应若过于频繁或迟迟不能关闭,就会累积为生理损耗,即非稳态负荷。其表现包括血压、皮质醇与炎症标志物持续偏高以及调节弹性下降。纵向研究发现它能预测心血管疾病和认知衰退,已成为生物行为医学的核心测量指标之一。��McEwen argued that the body adapts to stress through repeated activation of the sympathetic nervous system and the HPA axis, but responses that fire too often or fail to shut off accumulate as physiological wear and tear — allostatic load. It shows up as chronically elevated blood pressure, cortisol, and inflammatory markers alongside declining regulatory flexibility. Longitudinal studies link it to cardiovascular disease and cognitive decline, making it a core measure in biobehavioral medicine.�ans��src��cMcEwen (1998), Protective and Damaging Effects of Stress Mediators, New England Journal of Medicine�eMcEwen (1998), "Protective and Damaging Effects of Stress Mediators," New England Journal of Medicine��id�psy_21_013�body���政治心理学把这归因于动机性推理：人在处理信息时会无意识地优先保护既有的身份认同与群体归属，对本方立场的反例设置更高证据门槛。功能磁共振实验显示，这类推理更多调用情绪与身份相关的回路，而不是纯粹的逻辑分析区域。这也解释了为什么摆事实常常消不掉极化，有时反而诱发逆火效应。��Political psychology traces this to motivated reasoning: when processing information, people unconsciously give priority to protecting existing identities and group loyalties, holding counter-evidence to their side to a stricter standard. Neuroimaging experiments show such reasoning recruits circuits tied to emotion and identity rather than purely analytic ones. This also explains why presenting facts often fails to dissolve polarization and sometimes backfires instead.�ans��src��{Kahan 等,《Motivated numeracy and enlightened self-government》,Behavioural Public Policy,2017 (DOI: 10.1017/bpp.2016.2)�|Kahan et al., 'Motivated numeracy and enlightened self-government', Behavioural Public Policy, 2017, DOI: 10.1017/bpp.2016.2��id�psy_21_016�body���注意瞬脱指在快速序列视觉呈现流中,第二个目标出现在第一个目标之后约200至500毫秒时,其正确报告率显著下降的现象。Raymond、Shapiro与Arnell在1992年通过双目标RSVP范式首次系统刻画了这一效应,发现即使两个目标都清晰呈现,T2仍常被漏报。这说明注意在时间维度上是离散分配的,完成一次目标识别后需要约半秒才能重新配置到后续刺激。�The attentional blink refers to the sharp drop in correct reports of a second target when it appears roughly 200 to 500 milliseconds after a first target within a rapid serial visual presentation stream. Raymond, Shapiro, and Arnell first characterized it systematically in 1992 using a dual-target RSVP paradigm, finding that even clearly presented second targets are frequently missed. It shows that attention is allocated across time in a discrete fashion, requiring about half a second to reconfigure after identifying one target.�ans��src�٧Raymond, Shapiro & Arnell (1992), Temporary suppression of visual processing in an RSVP task,《Journal of Experimental Psychology: Human Perception and Performance》٢Raymond, Shapiro & Arnell (1992), Temporary Suppression of Visual Processing in an RSVP Task, Journal of Experimental Psychology: Human Perception and Performance��id�psy_21_019�body��Hobson与McCarley在1977年提出,梦起源于REM睡眠期间脑桥的自发放电,这些信号上行激活皮层后由前脑加以整合,编织出看似连贯的叙事,因此梦本身不承载专门设计的功能意义。Revonsuo在2000年提出的威胁模拟理论则主张,梦在进化中承担了模拟危险情境的训练功能,让人能在无真实风险的环境中演练觉察与逃避反应。二者的根本分歧在于梦究竟只是神经活动的副产品,还是具有适应价值的认知功能。�wHobson and McCarley proposed in 1977 that dreams originate in spontaneous pontine firing during REM sleep; these signals ascend to activate the cortex and are then synthesized by the forebrain into seemingly coherent narratives, so dreams carry no purpose-built functional meaning. The threat simulation theory advanced by Revonsuo in 2000 instead claims that dreaming evolved to rehearse dangerous situations, allowing individuals to practice detection and avoidance responses without real risk. Their fundamental disagreement is whether dreams are merely by-products of neural activity or cognitive functions with adaptive value.�ans��src�ٷHobson & McCarley (1977), The brain as a dream state generator,《American Journal of Psychiatry》;Revonsuo (2000), The reinterpretation of dreams,《Behavioral and Brain Sciences》ٮHobson & McCarley (1977), The Brain as a Dream State Generator, American Journal of Psychiatry; Revonsuo (2000), The Reinterpretation of Dreams, Behavioral and Brain Sciences��id�psy_22_003�body���该效应指：练习提取某类别的部分项目后，同类未练习项目变得更难回忆。机制在于竞争与抑制：提取时，共享线索的相关项目作为竞争者被激活，须受抑制才能选中目标，抑制并留下持久的提取代价；Anderson 等的提取练习范式为此提供了系统证据。它提醒复习应覆盖全部要点，也解释了目击者访谈中谈及一个细节可能妨碍相邻细节的回忆。�*This effect refers to unpracticed items of a category becoming harder to retrieve after some of its members receive retrieval practice. The mechanism is competition and inhibition: while retrieving a target, associates sharing its cue are activated as competitors and must be suppressed for the target to win, leaving a lasting retrieval cost, as shown in Anderson and colleagues' retrieval-practice paradigm. It counsels covering every point when reviewing, and helps explain why asking a witness about one detail can momentarily block adjacent details.�ans��src�ٹAnderson, M. C., Bjork, R. A. & Bjork, E. L.（1994），《实验心理学杂志：学习、记忆与认知》20(5)，1063–1087；doi:10.1037/0278-7393.20.5.1063；提取练习范式��Anderson, M. C., Bjork, R. A., & Bjork, E. L. (1994). Remembering can cause forgetting: Retrieval dynamics in long-term memory. Journal of Experimental Psychology: Learning, Memory, and Cognition, 20(5), 1063-1087. doi:10.1037/0278-7393.20.5.1063��id�psy_22_006�body���安静眼指动作启动前对目标或关键参照点保持约100毫秒以上的最后一段稳定注视。较长的安静眼期让大脑以一致的视觉信息编制运动程序，减少无关刺激的干扰并抑制过早的注视转移。高尔夫推杆、篮球投篮与飞镖的训练研究显示，延长这最后一次注视可稳定提高命中率，且在高压情境下收益更大。��The quiet eye is the final steady fixation on a target or key reference location, held for roughly 100 ms or more just before movement begins. A longer quiet-eye period feeds the motor program consistent visual information, limits interference from irrelevant stimuli, and suppresses premature gaze shifts. Training studies in golf putting, basketball shooting, and darts show that lengthening this last fixation reliably raises accuracy, with even larger gains under pressure.�ans��src�َVickers, J. N.《知觉、认知与决策训练：行动中的安静眼》第1版（2007，Human Kinetics 出版社）；安静眼训练范式مVickers, J. N. (2007). Perception, Cognition, and Decision Training: The Quiet Eye in Action (1st ed.). Champaign, IL: Human Kinetics��id�psy_22_009�body���任务要求儿童先按颜色给卡片分类，随后改为按形状分类。3岁儿童常继续按颜色分，出现固着性错误：旧的颜色规则已形成优势反应，而抑制它并把新维度纳入计划所需的反思能力与抑制控制尚未成熟，于是旧规则持续主导行为。多数儿童在4岁左右能顺利完成转换，该任务因此成为评估学前执行功能与认知灵活性的经典范式。�Children must first sort cards by color and then switch to sorting by shape. Three-year-olds often persist with color—the perseverative error—because the old rule has become a prepotent response, while the reflection and inhibitory control needed to override it and fold the new dimension into their plan are still immature, so the outdated rule keeps dominating behavior. Most children pass the post-switch phase around age four, which has made the task a classic index of preschool executive function and cognitive flexibility.�ans��src�ٝZelazo,《The Dimensional Change Card Sort (DCCS): a method of assessing executive function in children》,Nature Protocols,2006 (DOI: 10.1038/nprot.2006.46)ٛZelazo, 'The Dimensional Change Card Sort (DCCS): a method of assessing executive function in children', Nature Protocols, 2006, DOI: 10.1038/nprot.2006.46��id�psy_22_013�body���用贝叶斯定理估算：每10万人中约100名患者几乎全部检出，另有约999名健康人被误报，故阳性者真患病的概率约为100÷(100+999)≈9%。Casscells等人1978年在《新英格兰医学杂志》发表的调查中，多数医生答70%—95%。原因在于基础比率忽视：代表性启发式让人紧盯检测准确率，无视先验概率的主导作用。�	By Bayes' theorem: out of 100,000 people, roughly 100 true cases are nearly all detected, while about 999 healthy people are falsely flagged, so a positive result implies a genuine probability near 100/(100+999) ≈ 9%. In the survey Casscells and colleagues published in the New England Journal of Medicine in 1978, most physicians answered between 70% and 95%. Such base-rate neglect reflects the representativeness heuristic: attention locks onto the test's accuracy while low prevalence quietly dominates the outcome.�ans��src�يCasscells, Schoenberger & Graboys（1978），《新英格兰医学杂志》299(18)，999–1001：医生解读临床化验结果的调查٪Casscells, W., Schoenberger, A., & Graboys, T. B. (1978). Interpretation by physicians of clinical laboratory results. New England Journal of Medicine, 299(18), 999-1001.��id�psy_22_016�body���该模型提出两条相对独立的路径：持续的高工作要求（如超负荷、时间压力）会耗竭身心能量，经由健康损耗过程催生倦怠；自主性、反馈、上级支持等工作资源则经动机激发过程提升投入，并能缓冲高要求的伤害。倦怠与否取决于要求与资源的动态平衡，资源充足时同样的高负荷未必致倦。��The model posits two independent processes. Sustained demands such as overload and time pressure erode energy through a health-impairment pathway, producing exhaustion. Resources like autonomy, feedback, and supervisor support fuel engagement via a motivational pathway and buffer the impact of high demands. Whether heavy workload breeds burnout therefore depends on the dynamic balance of demands and resources, not on workload alone.�ans��src�٠Demerouti, Bakker, Nachreiner & Schaufeli,《The job demands-resources model of burnout.》,Journal of Applied Psychology,2001 (DOI: 10.1037/0021-9010.86.3.499)ٞDemerouti, Bakker, Nachreiner & Schaufeli, 'The job demands-resources model of burnout.', Journal of Applied Psychology, 2001, DOI: 10.1037/0021-9010.86.3.499��id�psy_22_019�body���该原则主张：提取成功取决于测验情境提供的线索是否与编码时形成的线索相匹配。潜水员分别在岸上或水下学习单词表，随后在相同或不同环境中回忆；学习与测试环境一致时自由回忆显著更佳，错位则明显下滑，提示许多遗忘源于线索失配而非记忆痕迹消失。此效应在自由回忆中最强，在有强线索支持的再认中很弱。��The principle states that retrieval succeeds when cues available at test match those established during encoding. Divers studied word lists either on land or underwater and later recalled them in the same or the other environment; free recall was markedly better when learning and testing contexts matched and fell sharply when they mismatched. Much forgetting thus reflects cue mismatch rather than trace loss—an effect strongest in free recall and weak in recognition, where strong cues are supplied.�ans��src�ٵGodden 与 Baddeley,《CONTEXT‐DEPENDENT MEMORY IN TWO NATURAL ENVIRONMENTS: ON LAND AND UNDERWATER》,British Journal of Psychology,1975 (DOI: 10.1111/j.2044-8295.1975.tb01468.x)ٱGodden & Baddeley, 'CONTEXT‐DEPENDENT MEMORY IN TWO NATURAL ENVIRONMENTS: ON LAND AND UNDERWATER', British Journal of Psychology, 1975, DOI: 10.1111/j.2044-8295.1975.tb01468.x��id�psy_23_003�body���执行意图把一个目标意图改写为“若情境X出现，就执行反应Y”的条件式计划。它将行动控制权外包给环境线索：预设情境一旦出现，反应便被自动唤起，无需当下重新权衡，从而提高启动概率，并保护目标追求免受分心与自我调节资源耗损的干扰。Gollwitzer与Sheeran对94项独立研究的元分析得出平均效应量约d＝0.65，且效应可推广到健康行为与情绪调节等领域。�6An implementation intention rewrites a goal intention as a conditional plan: “if situation X arises, then I will perform response Y.” Control over action is delegated to situational cues—once the specified situation occurs, the response is triggered automatically without fresh deliberation, raising initiation rates and shielding goal pursuit from distraction and depleted self-regulatory resources. Gollwitzer and Sheeran's meta-analysis of 94 independent tests yielded a mean effect of about d = 0.65, generalizing to health behavior and emotion regulation.�ans��src���Gollwitzer, P. M., & Sheeran, P. (2006). 执行意图与目标达成：效果与过程的元分析. Advances in Experimental Social Psychology, 38, 69–119. DOI: 10.1016/S0065-2601(06)38002-1��Gollwitzer, P. M., & Sheeran, P. (2006). Implementation intentions and goal achievement: A meta-analysis of effects and processes. Advances in Experimental Social Psychology, 38, 69–119. DOI: 10.1016/S0065-2601(06)38002-1��id�psy_23_006�body���SMPY由Julian Stanley于1971年在约翰斯·霍普金斯大学创立，1990年代初起由Lubinski与Benbow在范德堡大学接续，已追踪数千名能力居前1%的青少年。数据显示，跳级、提前入学等加速措施与更高的博士学位获得率、更多的高影响力论文和专利相关，且未发现社交情绪适应受损的可靠证据。这挑战了“加速会妨碍儿童社会化”的传统顾虑，支持按认知准备度而非年龄安排课程。�5Founded by Julian Stanley at Johns Hopkins University in 1971 and continued from the early 1990s by Lubinski and Benbow at Vanderbilt, SMPY has followed thousands of adolescents scoring in the top 1% of ability. Its data link acceleration—grade skipping, early college entrance—to higher rates of doctorates, influential publications and patents, with no reliable evidence of impaired social-emotional adjustment. This challenges the traditional worry that acceleration harms socialization and supports matching curricula to cognitive readiness rather than age.�ans��src���Rimrodt, S., Lubinski, D., Benbow, C. P., & Peters, M. S. E. (2015). Academic Acceleration. In D. L. Burkholder (Ed.), The Cambridge Handbook of Giftedness (2nd ed.). Cambridge University Press.��Rimrodt, S., Lubinski, D., Benbow, C. P., & Peters, M. S. E. (2015). Academic acceleration. In D. L. Burkholder (Ed.), The Cambridge Handbook of Giftedness (2nd ed.). Cambridge University Press.��id�psy_23_013�body���匹配假说主张，应对成效取决于策略与情境可控性的契合度。Folkman 与 Lazarus 发现：压力源可控时，问题焦点应对预示更好的适应；压力源不可控时，执意解决问题容易受挫，接纳、认知重评等情绪焦点方式反而伴随更少症状。Vitaliano 等的实证检验同样显示，应对与可控性错配者抑郁症状显著更多——关键不在哪种应对最好，而在何时用哪种应对。�CThe goodness-of-fit hypothesis holds that a strategy succeeds when it matches how controllable the stressor is. Folkman and Lazarus found that problem-focused coping predicted better adjustment under controllable stressors, whereas with uncontrollable ones stubborn problem-solving bred frustration while acceptance and cognitive reappraisal went with fewer symptoms. Empirical tests by Vitaliano and colleagues likewise showed markedly more depressive symptoms when coping and controllability mismatched—the question shifts from which coping is best to which coping fits when.�ans��src���Folkman, S., & Lazarus, R. S. (1985). If It Changes It Must Be a Process. Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 49(1), 150–170；Vitaliano, P. P., DeWolfe, D. J., Maiuro, R. D., Russo, J., & Katon, W. (1990). Appraised Changeability of a Stressor as a Modifier of the Relationship Between Coping and Depression. Journal of Consulting and Clinical Psychology, 58(6), 858–861.�SFolkman & Lazarus (1985), If It Changes It Must Be a Process, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology, 49(1), 150-170; Vitaliano, DeWolfe, Maiuro, Russo & Katon (1990), Appraised changeability of a stressor as a modifier of the relationship between coping and depression, Journal of Consulting and Clinical Psychology, 58(6), 858-861.��id�psy_23_019�body���自我决定理论称之为奖励削弱或过度合理化效应：预期的物质奖励促使人把行为原因归于外部报酬，自主感与兴趣受损，撤除奖励后投入随之下降。Deci、Koestner 与 Ryan 汇总一百多个受控实验的元分析确认了该效应，对儿童与高趣味任务最为明显。实践中宜以信息性反馈与认可替代控制性奖赏。��Self-determination theory calls this the undermining or overjustification effect: expected material rewards lead people to attribute their behavior to external pay, eroding autonomy and interest, so engagement falls once rewards stop. A meta-analysis pooling more than one hundred controlled experiments by Deci, Koestner, and Ryan confirms the effect, strongest for children and highly interesting tasks. In practice, replace controlling rewards with informational feedback and recognition.�ans��src���Deci, Koestner & Ryan,《A meta-analytic review of experiments examining the effects of extrinsic rewards on intrinsic motivation.》,Psychological Bulletin,1999 (DOI: 10.1037/0033-2909.125.6.627)��Deci, Koestner & Ryan, 'A meta-analytic review of experiments examining the effects of extrinsic rewards on intrinsic motivation.', Psychological Bulletin, 1999, DOI: 10.1037/0033-2909.125.6.627��id�psy_26_002�body���关键在于理由不足。20美元为当众说违心话提供了充分的外部理由,认知之间没有冲突,态度照旧;1美元远远不够解释这种言行不一,它与「我不是随意骗人的人」的自我认知失衡,个体只能把对任务的真实态度向正面拉来消解失调。由内在压力促成的态度改变,因此比金钱买来的更深刻也更持久。��The key is insufficient justification. Twenty dollars fully excuses publicly vouching for a boring task, so cognitions stay consistent and attitudes stay put. One dollar cannot cover that mismatch between words and belief, which clashes with seeing oneself as no casual liar, so the person resolves the tension by pulling the private attitude toward genuinely enjoying the task. Change driven by this inner pressure runs deeper and lasts longer than bought compliance.�ans��src�ٕFestinger 与 Carlsmith,《Cognitive consequences of forced compliance.》,The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology,1959 (DOI: 10.1037/h0041593)ّFestinger & Carlsmith, 'Cognitive consequences of forced compliance.', The Journal of Abnormal and Social Psychology, 1959, DOI: 10.1037/h0041593��id�psy_26_020�body��直答:大脑发育存在敏感期,社会剥夺持续越久,留给恢复的窗口就越窄。机理:Nelson、Zeanah与Fox把福利院幼儿随机分入优质寄养或继续机构照护:约两岁前进入寄养的孩子智商提升最突出,依恋紊乱明显减少;留在机构或较晚离开者在认知与脑电活动上的损伤长期延续。早期社会输入引导突触修剪与回路成熟,错过窗口后语言与执行功能难以完全恢复,这一随机设计为干预时机提供了因果级证据。��Brain development runs on sensitive periods, so the longer social deprivation lasts the narrower the window left for recovery. Nelson, Zeanah, and Fox randomized institutionalized toddlers to quality foster care or continued institutional care: children placed before roughly age two showed the sharpest gains in IQ and clear reductions in disordered attachment, whereas those who stayed or left later carried enduring deficits in cognition and EEG activity. Early social input steers synaptic pruning and circuit maturation, and language plus executive function never fully rebound once the window closes - the random design supplies causal evidence that timing matters.�ans��src�٬Nelson、Zeanah与Fox主持的布加勒斯特早期干预项目论文《Cognitive Recovery in Socially Deprived Young Children》,Science 2007(哈佛大学/马里兰大学)��Nelson CA III, Zeanah CH & Fox NA, 'Cognitive Recovery in Socially Deprived Young Children: The Bucharest Early Intervention Project', Science, 2007 (Harvard University / University of Maryland)��id�051521e8cefd�body��/米尔格拉姆让被试在“权威”指令下对他人施加逐步增强的电击（实为假装），结果多数人会服从到危险电压。它揭示普通人在权威合法化下可能做出伤害行为，情境力量强于性格预设。该实验因伦理问题成为研究规范的转折点。�2Milgram had subjects administer what they thought were rising electric shocks to others under an authority's orders; most obeyed to dangerous levels. It shows ordinary people can harm under legitimized authority, with situation outweighing disposition. Its ethics sparked a turning point in research rules.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1b79415b4f1c�body���这就是“表达性书写”：把混乱的念头外化成文字，能减轻工作记忆的负担，也让人用更旁观的视角重新组织问题。研究发现它可改善情绪甚至睡眠。��This is expressive writing: externalizing messy thoughts into words lightens working-memory load and lets you reorganize problems from a more observer-like view. Studies link it to better mood and even sleep.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�1ed1a8eccb55�body���霍布森提出，梦是脑干在睡眠中随机激活产生的神经信号，大脑皮质再把这些信号整合编成看似合理的故事。它强调梦源于生理信号而非隐藏含义。这一假说挑战了梦的“象征解析”。�&Hobson proposed that dreams arise from random neural signals activated by the brainstem during sleep, which the cortex then integrates into seemingly coherent stories. It stresses dreams come from physiological signals rather than hidden meanings. This challenges symbolic dream interpretation.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�20d64af48422�body���自我决定理论认为自主性、胜任感与关系感是人的三种基本心理需求。当环境支持这三种需求时，外在动机更易内化，个体的幸福感与持久投入更高。��Self-determination theory holds that autonomy, competence, and relatedness are three basic psychological needs. When the environment supports these needs, extrinsic motivation is more readily internalized and well-being and sustained engagement rise.�ans��src��iRyan, R. M. & Deci, E. L. (2000). 《自我决定理论与内在动机》. 《美国心理学家》55卷.�WRyan, R. M. & Deci, E. L. (2000). Self-determination theory. American Psychologist, 55.��id�212342b134f3�body�ٖPERMA 指积极情绪、投入、关系、意义与成就。它把幸福从单一快乐感拓展为多维可测量结构，用于积极干预设计。��PERMA stands for Positive emotion, Engagement, Relationships, Meaning, and Accomplishment. It expands happiness from a single feeling of pleasure into a multidimensional, measurable structure used to design positive interventions.�ans��src��1Seligman, M. E. P. (2011). 《持续的幸福》.�_Seligman, M. E. P. (2011). Flourish: A Visionary New Understanding of Happiness and Well-being.��id�23f171f38393�body��&青少年奖赏系统（如腹侧纹状体）对同伴与新鲜刺激高度敏感，而认知控制的前额叶成熟滞后，造成“油门快、刹车慢”。在情绪唤醒或同伴在场时，这种失衡尤为明显。它从机制上解释了为何青春期冒险多于儿童或成人。�IAdolescent reward systems, such as the ventral striatum, are highly sensitive to peers and novelty, while the cognitive-control prefrontal cortex matures later, creating a fast accelerator and slow brake. The imbalance is strongest under arousal or peer presence. It mechanistically explains why risk-taking peaks in adolescence.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�335e762da19f�body��␀BPD 以情绪不稳、强烈而不稳定的人际关系、害怕被抛弃以及冲动自伤行为为特征。患者常伴随不稳定的自我形象和强烈的被遗弃恐惧。辩证行为疗法（DBT）等专门针对情绪调节的干预效果较好。�BPD features unstable mood, intense unstable relationships, fear of abandonment, and impulsive self-harm. Sufferers often have a shifting self-image and strong abandonment fear. Dialectical behavior therapy (DBT) targeting emotion regulation works relatively well.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�34e97f9adc20�body���每个“现在做什么”的临时决定都消耗意志力，累积成决策疲劳；时间块提前把选择定好，省下脑力留给真正重要的事。它把“随机应变”换成“预先承诺”。پEvery spur-of-the-moment what now choice spends willpower and builds decision fatigue; time blocks pre-decide, saving mental energy for what matters. It swaps improvising for pre-commitment.�ans��src��CBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011)《意志力》, Penguin Press�kBaumeister, R.F. & Tierney, J. (2011). Willpower: Rediscovering the Greatest Human Strength. Penguin Press.��id�420ec50e5a87�body���这涉及“具身认知”与行为激活：舒展的姿态和主动的言行会改变生理反馈与他人回应，正向的互动又反过来强化自我感受。不过它不能替代真实的能力积累，只是降低了开头的阻力。�This draws on embodied cognition and behavioral activation: open posture and assertive actions change physiological feedback and how others respond, and those positive responses reinforce self-view. It does not replace real skill building, but it lowers the friction of starting.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�45a064fde0f9�body���愤怒激活交感神经系统，肾上腺素与皮质醇上升，心跳加快、肌肉绷紧，这是古老的“战斗或逃跑”准备。意识到“这是身体的警报而非事实”，就能给理性留出介入的空间。��Anger activates the sympathetic nervous system: adrenaline and cortisol rise, heart rate and muscle tension increase, an ancient fight-or-flight preparation. Recognizing this as a body alarm rather than fact leaves room for reason to step in.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�490d08d688b3�body��&罗夏测验呈现十张对称墨迹图，让受测者自由描述看到什么，再通过编码系统分析反应的位置、决定因素与内容。它属于投射测验，假设人会把内在结构投射到模糊刺激上。现代使用需严格标准化，其效度在学界仍有争论。�1The Rorschach presents ten symmetrical inkblots, asking what the person sees, then codes location, determinants, and content. It is a projective test based on the idea that people project inner structure onto ambiguous stimuli. Modern use requires strict standardization, and its validity remains debated.�ans��src��《心理与教育测量》�$Psychological Testing and Assessment��id�6d512bc1b838�body���代表性启发式让人们根据某事与典型样本的相似程度来做判断，却忽略基础概率。比如认为安静的人更可能是图书管理员而非农民，无视农民数量更多。这会导致统计误判。�The representativeness heuristic leads people to judge by how much something resembles a typical case, ignoring base rates. For instance, assuming a quiet person is more likely a librarian than a farmer, despite far more farmers. This causes statistical errors.�ans��src��yDaniel Kahneman,《Thinking, Fast and Slow》Farrar Straus Giroux,2011;中译《思考，快与慢》中信出版社,2012�_D. Kahneman, Thinking, Fast and Slow, FSG, 2011; Chinese ed.《思考，快与慢》CITIC, 2012��id�8b219616b938�body���双重编码理论认为，图像同时激活视觉表象系统和言语系统两条独立通道，形成冗余编码，因此比仅言语编码的文字更易回忆。言语与图像之间的联结还能互为检索线索。�Dual-coding theory holds that images activate two independent channels, the visual and the verbal, creating redundant encodings that are easier to recall than words encoded verbally alone. The link between verbal and imaginal codes also serves as mutual retrieval cues.�ans��src��/Paivio, A. (1971). 《意象与言语过程》.�0Paivio, A. (1971). Imagery and Verbal Processes.��id�91493d02d5a9�body���这涉及“现状偏差”与“延迟折扣”：当下的放松立刻兑现，而健康的代价发生在遥远的未来，大脑天然更重眼前。用“提前半小时手机离床”这种微小、具体的环境设计，比空喊自律更有效。�!This reflects status-quo bias and delay discounting: the relief is immediate while the health cost is delayed, and the brain weights the near more heavily. Tiny concrete environment changes, like keeping the phone away from bed thirty minutes earlier, beat vague calls for self-discipline.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a1652c6d9991�body���心理学称其为“情绪标注”：用语言标记情绪会激活语言相关脑区、抑制杏仁核的过度反应，相当于给情绪降了温。这比反复琢磨“我怎么了”更有效。��Called affect labeling, naming an emotion engages language-related brain regions and dampens excessive amygdala reactivity, cooling the feeling. It works better than brooding over what is wrong with me.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�a2a692e6f29e�body���弗雷德里克森提出，积极情绪能短暂拓展人的注意、思维和行动范围，并长期建构身体、认知和社会资源。这与消极情绪收缩注意的模型相反。该理论解释了积极情绪的累积价值。�=Frederickson proposed that positive emotions briefly broaden a person's attention, thinking, and action repertoire, and over time build lasting physical, cognitive, and social resources. This contrasts with models where negative emotions narrow attention. The theory explains the cumulative value of positive emotion.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b52b42e99b10�body��,神经可塑性指大脑结构与连接随经验、学习和损伤而重组的能力，贯穿整个生命周期但儿童期最强。例如盲人的听觉皮层会“接管”部分视觉区功能，练习可增厚相关皮层。可塑性说明先天与后天并非固定分工，而是持续互动。�cNeuroplasticity is the brain's ability to rewire its structure and connections through experience, learning, and injury; strongest in childhood but lifelong. For example, blind individuals' auditory cortex takes over some visual functions, and practice thickens relevant cortex. Plasticity means nature and nurture are not fixed but interact continuously.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b9f6daf21d1d�body���外显态度是人们能意识并报告的对某群体的看法，内隐态度则是无意识、自动激活的偏好或偏见。两者常不一致，需用内隐联想测验测量。它解释了“言行不一”的偏见来源。�	Explicit attitudes are conscious, reportable views toward a group, while implicit attitudes are unconscious, automatically activated preferences or biases. They often disagree and require tests like the Implicit Association Test. This explains biased 'say-do' gaps.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c0290a395ac4�body��塔菲尔提出人会把自我价值部分来自所属群体，于是倾向于内群体偏爱、外群体贬低以提升自尊。它用“分类-认同-比较”解释偏见与群际冲突的来源。该理论是理解民族、球队与组织认同的基石。�+Tajfel proposed that part of self-worth comes from group membership, so people favor the in-group and downgrade the out-group to boost esteem. It explains prejudice and conflict via categorization, identity, and comparison. It is the base for understanding ethnic, team, and organizational identity.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c23c5ac3ae57�body���基本归因错误指人们在解释他人行为时，过度归因于性格而忽略情境因素。比如把别人迟到归为“不靠谱”而非堵车。它在强调个人主义的文化中更明显。��The fundamental attribution error is the tendency to explain others' behavior by personality while overlooking situational factors, such as calling someone late 'unreliable' rather than noting traffic. It is stronger in individualistic cultures.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�c73f630b6dfd�body��津巴多把志愿者随机分饰狱警与囚犯，很快角色行为失控，狱警变得专横、囚犯消沉，实验提前终止。它常被引证说明情境与角色预设能压倒个人品格。但该实验因方法与伦理受批评，结论需谨慎解读。�#Zimbardo randomly assigned volunteers as guards and prisoners; roles soon ran away, guards turned authoritarian and prisoners despondent, ending the study early. It is cited as showing situation and role can override character. Criticized for method and ethics, its conclusions need caution.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�cdee025a42e6�body�ٽ优势视角认为，从已有的特质与能力出发，投入产出比更高、也更易进入心流；缺点只需补到“不拖后腿”。扬长带短，比死磕短板更可持续。��The strengths view holds that starting from existing traits yields higher return and easier flow, while weaknesses need only reach not holding you back. Building on strength beats grinding the weak spot.�ans��src��FMihaly Csikszentmihalyi,《Flow》Harper & Row,1990;中译《心流》�:M. Csikszentmihalyi, Flow, Harper & Row, 1990; Chinese ed.��id�e570d4c85aeb�body��/神经性厌食等进食障碍源于生物、心理与社会因素交织：对体形的过度评价、完美主义与控制需求，加上文化对瘦的推崇与家庭互动模式。它绝非“爱美”那么简单，而是高致死风险的精神障碍。治疗需营养恢复与心理干预并行。�ZAnorexia and related eating disorders arise from intertwined biological, psychological, and social factors: over-evaluation of shape, perfectionism and control needs, plus cultural thin-ideal pressure and family patterns. It is far more than vanity and is a high-fatality disorder. Treatment needs nutritional restoration with psychological care.�ans��src��4American Psychiatric Association,《DSM-5》APA,2013�2American Psychiatric Association, DSM-5, APA, 2013��id�f00a6de897fc�body���间隔重复利用记忆留存率下降到一定阈值时再复习的时机，触发更深的提取练习。相比集中练习，分布练习减少了重复暴露的边际效应，迫使大脑在提取时付出更多努力，从而强化突触可塑性。�$Spaced repetition schedules review when retention has dropped to a threshold, triggering deeper retrieval practice. Compared with massed practice, distributed practice reduces the diminishing returns of repeated exposure and forces more effortful retrieval, strengthening synaptic plasticity.�ans��src��hCepeda, N. J. 等 (2006). 《分布式练习对学习保持的影响》. 《心理科学通报》132卷.�fCepeda, N. J. et al. (2006). Distributed practice in verbal recall tasks. Psychological Bulletin, 132.��id�f138f8bbfa2e�body�� 信号检测论把知觉判断看作在噪声中辨别有无信号。击中指有信号时正确报告“有”，虚报指无信号却误报“有”；漏报和正确拒斥是另两类结果。通过击中率与虚报率可分离出人的辨别力与反应偏向（谨慎或冒险）。�QSignal detection theory treats perception as detecting a signal amid noise. A hit is correctly saying yes when a signal is present, and a false alarm is saying yes when none is present; miss and correct rejection are the other two outcomes. Hit and false-alarm rates separate a person's sensitivity from response bias, cautious or risky.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�10d6396bac4f�body��.格拉茨与罗默的“情绪调节困难量表”（DERS, Gratz & Roemer, 2004）把调节能力拆成六个维度：觉察、理解、接纳、冲动控制、目标行为、策略使用。它把模糊的“情绪化”变成可打分的具体短板，常用于临床评估与干预方案的定制。�3Gratz and Roemer's Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale (DERS, 2004) breaks regulation into six facets: awareness, clarity, acceptance, impulse control, goal-directed behavior and strategy use. It turns vague emotional into scoreable specific gaps, guiding clinical assessment and tailored intervention.�ans��src��"Gratz, Roemer,《Multidimensional Assessment of Emotion Regulation and Dysregulation: Development, Factor Structure, and Initial Validation of the Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale》,Journal of Psychopathology and Behavioral Assessment,2004 (DOI: 10.1023/b:joba.0000007455.08539.94)� Gratz, Roemer, 'Multidimensional Assessment of Emotion Regulation and Dysregulation: Development, Factor Structure, and Initial Validation of the Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale', Journal of Psychopathology and Behavioral Assessment, 2004, DOI: 10.1023/b:joba.0000007455.08539.94��id�2b151601acd5�body���统计显著只看是否不像巧合，大样本下极小的效应也能“显著”却无实际意义；效应量（如 Cohen's d）衡量大小。读研究要看两者，而非只盯 p 值。ټSignificance only asks 'unlikely by chance'; with huge samples, trivial effects turn 'significant' yet meaningless. Effect size (e.g., Cohen's d) measures magnitude. Read both, not just p.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�50831369f741�body���当两个不同的反应任务在几百毫秒内先后出现，第二个反应会延迟，因为中央加工阶段一次只能处理一个。它说明“并行反应”受限于决策瓶颈，是多任务延迟的经典证据。��When two response tasks appear within a few hundred ms, the second response lags because the central stage can only process one at a time. It shows parallel responding is bottlenecked by a decision stage—classic evidence for multitasking delay.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�5e3dc2a8bef2�body���二者是双向的：缺觉会放大杏仁核反应、削弱前额叶调控，使负面情绪更难管理；反过来，焦虑抑郁也会破坏睡眠结构（尤其 REM 与深睡）。形成恶性循环，因此改善任一侧都能缓解另一侧。�It is bidirectional: sleep loss amplifies amygdala reactivity and weakens prefrontal control, worsening mood regulation; conversely, anxiety/depression disrupt sleep architecture (especially REM and deep sleep). A vicious cycle—improving either side eases the other.�ans��src��Yoo, S. S., et al. (2007). The impact of sleep deprivation on decision making: Decrements in prefrontal and increases in amygdala-related neural activity.《Brain, Behavior, and Immunity》21(1), 64-69; Walker, M. P. (2017).《Why We Sleep》, Riverhead Books.��Yoo, S. S., et al. (2007). The impact of sleep deprivation on decision making: Decrements in prefrontal and increases in amygdala-related neural activity. Brain, Behavior, and Immunity, 21(1), 64-69. Walker, M. P. (2017). Why We Sleep. Riverhead Books.��id�6215e1526f5b�body���认知重构是CBT中的技术，帮助患者识别自动化负性思维，并用更客观、均衡的想法替代它们，从而改变情绪与行为。它体现“想法影响感受”这一核心原理。��Cognitive restructuring is a CBT technique that helps clients identify automatic negative thoughts and replace them with more balanced, realistic ones, thereby changing emotion and behavior. It rests on the core idea that thoughts influence feelings.�ans��src��ZJudith Beck,《Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond》第2版,Guilford Press,2011�XJ. S. Beck, Cognitive Behavior Therapy: Basics and Beyond, 2nd ed., Guilford Press, 2011��id�6b88ce28a557�body��长期逆境（忽视、虐待、贫困）可改变 HPA 轴与杏仁核-前额叶回路，提升应激敏感性。表观遗传机制（如 DNA 甲基化）能在不改 DNA 序列下调节基因表达，使早期环境标记身体，但许多效应在安全感与干预下可逆。�<Chronic adversity (neglect, abuse, poverty) can alter the HPA axis and amygdala-prefrontal circuits, raising stress sensitivity. Epigenetics (e.g., DNA methylation) regulates gene expression without changing the sequence, marking the body by early environment—but many effects reverse with safety and intervention.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�6e7784426d5a�body���p值是在“零假设为真”前提下，看到当前数据或更极端的概率，并非“假设为真的概率”，也不代表效应大小。p<0.05只说不太像巧合，不等于重要或可靠。��The p-value is the probability of the data (or more extreme) if the null is true—not the probability the hypothesis is true, nor the effect size. p<0.05 merely says not much like chance, not important or reliable.�ans��src��nRoger Hock,《Forty Studies That Changed Psychology》Pearson 多版;中译《改变心理学的40项研究》�YR. R. Hock, Forty Studies That Changed Psychology, Pearson, various editions; Chinese ed.��id�732b608773d5�body���掌握目标者关注“学会没”，敢犯错、用深层策略；表现目标者关注“显得聪明”，避挑战、遇挫易弃。课堂氛围与评价方式会引导其中一种取向。��Mastery-goal students care 'did I learn,' risk errors and use deep strategies; performance-goal students care 'look smart,' avoid challenge and quit on failure. Classroom climate and grading steer which orientation forms.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�880d4195b313�body���前扣带回皮层（ACC）像冲突探测器：当竞争反应同时激活（如 Stroop 任务），它发出信号，前额叶再调配注意解决冲突。这一“监测—调控”环路是自控与抗干扰的核心。�The anterior cingulate cortex (ACC) acts like a conflict detector: when competing responses co-activate (e.g., Stroop), it signals and the prefrontal cortex allocates attention to resolve it. This monitor-control loop underpins self-control and distraction resistance.�ans��src�٦Botvinick, M., Braver, T. S., Barch, D. M., Carter, C. S., & Cohen, J. D. (2001). Conflict monitoring and cognitive control.《Psychological Review》108(3), 624-652.٣Botvinick, M., Braver, T. S., Barch, D. M., Carter, C. S., & Cohen, J. D. (2001). Conflict monitoring and cognitive control. Psychological Review, 108(3), 624-652.��id�9d18b1e8defd�body�ٽ交易型领导用奖惩换绩效（管当下），变革型领导以愿景与赋能激励成长（管方向）。后者常关联更高投入与创新，但需真诚而非表演式魅力。��Transactional leaders exchange rewards for performance (manage now); transformational leaders inspire growth via vision and empowerment (manage direction). The latter links to higher engagement and innovation, but needs sincerity, not showy charisma.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�9fb857f87351�body��莱恩汉的“辩证行为疗法”（DBT, Linehan, 1993）为边缘型人格障碍而建，把正念、痛苦耐受、情绪调节与人际效能四大模块结合起来。它在接纳与改变之间取“辩证”平衡，实证显示能显著降低自伤与自杀行为。�Linehan's dialectical behavior therapy (DBT, 1993) was built for borderline personality disorder, combining mindfulness, distress tolerance, emotion regulation and interpersonal effectiveness. Balancing acceptance with change, it has empirically reduced self-harm and suicidal behavior.�ans��src��TLinehan, M.M. (1993)《边缘型人格障碍的认知行为治疗》, Guilford Press�hLinehan, M.M. (1993). Cognitive-Behavioral Treatment of Borderline Personality Disorder. Guilford Press.��id�a0e4a1f660a2�body���一些学者主张存在文化特异的“心智模块”（如东亚更关系本位、西方更分析式认知），另一些强调人类共通底层加表面差异。折中看法：普遍机制之上，文化像“旋钮”调出不同默认。��Some argue for culture-specific modules (East Asian relational, Western analytic cognition); others stress universal bases with surface variation. The compromise: universal mechanisms on which culture acts like a dial setting different defaults.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b5a67100c7a4�body���独立型自我通过自我提升维持自尊，互依型自我则靠谦虚维持关系和谐；跨文化实验显示东亚被试常低估自己成绩，西方常高估。这是文化脚本，不是能力差异。�Independent selves maintain self-esteem via self-enhancement, interdependent selves via modesty to keep harmony; cross-cultural experiments show East Asians often under-rate their performance and Westerners over-rate. It is a cultural script, not a competence gap.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�b7f20df70509�body�ٷ依恋理论指出，照顾者是可预测、可回应的“安全基地”时，孩子才敢向外探索并学会调节自己。父母先稳住，孩子才有样板去处理情绪。��Attachment theory says when the caregiver is a predictable, responsive safe base, the child dares to explore and learns to self-regulate. Parents steady first, giving the child a model for handling emotion.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�bcccb282a019�body���生成效应指由学习者自己生成答案或例子（而非被动接收）时记忆更好。主动建构触发更深的语义加工与检索路线，但前提是生成接近正确，否则错误也会一并被巩固。�The generation effect is better memory when learners produce answers or examples themselves rather than passively receive them. Active construction engages deeper semantic processing and retrieval routes, provided the output is near-correct or wrong versions get consolidated too.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�d1865d699aae�body��自我损耗认为意志力的心理能量会被消耗、后续自控力下降。但大规模复现失败与开放科学质疑使其地位动摇；更稳妥的解释是动机与信念（如意志力有限的信念本身）调节努力，而非存在单一能量池。�Ego depletion claimed a limited mental energy for self-control depletes with use. Large failed replications and open-science scrutiny have weakened it; a safer view is that motivation and beliefs (e.g., believing willpower is limited) modulate effort, not a single energy tank.�ans��src��Baumeister; 复现争议�Baumeister; replication debate��id�e79c5ef9601a�body��Q“眼动脱敏与再加工”（EMDR, Shapiro, 1989）让来访者在留意创伤图像的同时跟随治疗师手指做双侧刺激，痛苦感随之下降，被多国 PTSD 指南纳入推荐（如 APA, 2017）。其机制仍存争议，主流假说认为双侧刺激类似 REM 睡眠，帮助大脑把未消化的记忆重新整合。�bEye Movement Desensitization and Reprocessing (EMDR, Shapiro, 1989) has clients hold the trauma image while following bilateral stimulation; distress drops and it is recommended in PTSD guidelines (e.g., APA, 2017). Mechanism is debated, but a leading hypothesis likens bilateral stimulation to REM sleep helping the brain reprocess unmetabolized memory.�ans��src���Shapiro, F.,《Eye movement desensitization: A new treatment for post-traumatic stress disorder》, Journal of Behavior Therapy and Experimental Psychiatry, 1989 (DOI: 10.1016/0005-7916(89)90025-6)；美国心理学会(APA)PTSD临床指南(2017)��Shapiro, F., 'Eye movement desensitization: A new treatment for post-traumatic stress disorder', Journal of Behavior Therapy and Experimental Psychiatry, 1989, DOI: 10.1016/0005-7916(89)90025-6; APA Clinical Practice Guideline for PTSD (2017).��id�e91a7d5a68f1�body���元认知监测是评估自己懂没懂（如信心判断），控制是据此调整学习（多花时间、换策略）。二者可脱节：人们常因流畅错觉而高估掌握，监测失灵导致控制失效。��Metacognitive monitoring judges how well you know (confidence); control adjusts learning (more time, new strategy). They can disconnect: fluency illusions make people overrate mastery, so faulty monitoring yields faulty control.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�e9e513388809�body��“接纳与承诺疗法”（ACT, Hayes 等, 1999）属第三波认知行为疗法，核心是把与痛苦念头对抗的精力，转为接纳、澄清价值并承诺行动。它通过认知解离、接纳、当下等六大过程，提升心理灵活性，而非消灭症状。�IAcceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT, Hayes et al., 1999) is a third-wave CBT that redirects energy from fighting painful thoughts toward acceptance, value clarification and committed action. Via six processes - defusion, acceptance, present-moment and others - it builds psychological flexibility rather than erasing symptoms.�ans��src��ZHayes, S.C., Strosahl, K. & Wilson, K.G. (1999)《接纳与承诺疗法》, Guilford Press�eHayes, S.C., Strosahl, K.D. & Wilson, K.G. (1999). Acceptance and Commitment Therapy. Guilford Press.��id�eab0adaf0be0�body���新生儿会多看对称、接近群体平均的脸，这被认为是进化出的健康线索偏好——对称与平均常指示低寄生虫负荷与良好发育。该偏好先于文化学习，支持审美偏好的生物基础。�Newborns look longer at symmetric, average faces, seen as an evolved preference for health cues—symmetry and averageness often signal low parasite load and good development. This preference precedes cultural learning, supporting biological bases of aesthetic taste.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�edbd17d649d1�body��元认知是对自己认知过程的监控与调节（计划、监控、评估）。高元认知者能准确判断我会/不会，从而合理分配复习；元认知错觉（如流畅性误判）会让人高估掌握度。校准判断与表现，是高效学习的核心。�1Metacognition is monitoring and regulating your own cognition (planning, monitoring, evaluating). High metacognition means accurately judging I know/don't know to allocate study well; the fluency illusion makes people overrate mastery. Calibrating judgment to performance is central to effective learning.�ans��src�٤Flavell,《Metacognition and cognitive monitoring: A new area of cognitive–developmental inquiry.》,American Psychologist,1979 (DOI: 10.1037/0003-066x.34.10.906)٢Flavell, 'Metacognition and cognitive monitoring: A new area of cognitive–developmental inquiry.', American Psychologist, 1979, DOI: 10.1037/0003-066x.34.10.906��id�eea4bc7f9bd6�body���习惯记忆与具体情境线索（地点、情绪、同伴）绑定；即使行为停止，神经通路仍在，旧线索一出现就自动唤起渴求。所以改变更有效的是避开或改写线索，而非只靠意志清零。��Habit memory is bound to specific cues—place, mood, companions; even after stopping, the pathway remains and old cues automatically trigger craving. So change works better by avoiding or rewriting cues than by willpower alone.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�efd5c25ccef6�body���预测编码理论认为大脑不断用内部模型预测感官输入，只向上传递“预测误差”。知觉与学习就是持续缩小误差、更新模型的过程，这一框架统一了注意、幻觉与贝叶斯推理。�#Predictive coding holds the brain constantly predicts sensory input with an internal model and transmits only prediction errors upward. Perception and learning are the process of minimizing error and updating the model—a framework unifying attention, hallucinations and Bayesian inference.�ans��src�ُRauss, Pourtois,《What is Bottom-Up and What is Top-Down in Predictive Coding?》,Frontiers in Psychology,2013 (DOI: 10.3389/fpsyg.2013.00276)ٍRauss, Pourtois, 'What is Bottom-Up and What is Top-Down in Predictive Coding?', Frontiers in Psychology, 2013, DOI: 10.3389/fpsyg.2013.00276��id�fccec46c405b�body���权力距离衡量社会接受不平等权力的程度。高权力距离文化更服从权威、少质疑老师/老板；低权力距离更平权、鼓励参与。理解它可避免跨文化误解，而非评判优劣。�␀Power distance measures how unequally power is accepted. High-PD cultures obey authority and rarely challenge teachers/bosses; low-PD are egalitarian and participatory. Understanding it prevents cross-cultural misunderstanding, not judging which is better.�ans��src��P戴维·迈尔斯,《社会心理学》第11版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�OD. Myers, Social Psychology, 11th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�psy_26_004�body���直答:每次提取都会迫使旧记忆再走一遍巩固流程,即再巩固。机理:线索唤起把已稳定的记忆痕迹打回分子层面的不稳定态,须靠新的蛋白质合成才能重新固定;Nader等2000年在Nature发表的大鼠杏仁核实验证明,再激活后阻断蛋白合成可抹除条件性恐惧的行为表达。这个数小时的可塑窗口,正是暴露疗法等干预强调在记忆唤起后及时介入的原因。��Every retrieval forces an old memory through consolidation once more - reconsolidation. A retrieval cue knocks the stable trace back into a molecularly unstable state that must restabilize through new protein synthesis. Nader and colleagues showed in Nature in 2000 that blocking protein synthesis in the rat amygdala after reactivation erased the behavioral expression of conditioned fear. That plastic window of a few hours is why exposure-based interventions stress acting soon after a memory is evoked.�ans��src�٘Nader、Schafe与LeDoux论文《Fear memories require protein synthesis in the amygdala for reconsolidation after retrieval》,Nature 2000(纽约大学)١Nader K, Schafe GE & LeDoux JE, 'Fear memories require protein synthesis in the amygdala for reconsolidation after retrieval', Nature, 2000 (New York University)��id�psy_26_009�body���主张:裁决依赖有限的认知资源,连续权衡使法官疲惫,便退回最省力的默认选项——驳回申请、维持现状。证据:Danziger等分析千余次庭审发现,有利裁定占比在早晚餐歇后骤升、其后逐案递减。软肋:案件排布并非随机,案型轻重、律师水平与相邻案件的相关都可能伪造出这种节律;后续大样本重分析大多未能复现,效应更可能来自序列混杂而非纯粹的资源耗竭,故宜当作警示线索而非定论。�{Claim: rulings run on a finite cognitive resource, so hours of weighing cases exhaust judges into the least-effort default of denying parole. Evidence: analyzing over a thousand hearings, Danziger and colleagues found favorable rulings surged after morning and lunch breaks and declined case by case. Weak points: dockets were not randomized, so case severity, counsel quality, and correlation between neighboring files could forge the rhythm; later large-scale reanalyses mostly failed to replicate it. The effect more likely reflects ordering artifacts than pure depletion, so it stands as a cautionary lead rather than settled fact.�ans��src�١Danziger, Levav & Avnaim-Pesso,《Extraneous factors in judicial decisions》,Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences,2011 (DOI: 10.1073/pnas.1018033108)ٟDanziger, Levav & Avnaim-Pesso, 'Extraneous factors in judicial decisions', Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences, 2011, DOI: 10.1073/pnas.1018033108��id�psy_26_015�body���直答:长期应激把发育中的海马塑造成了更小的结构,受虐越严重缩减越明显。机理:反复虐待使HPA轴持续激活,过高的糖皮质激素抑制齿状回的神经新生并促使树突退缩,这些过程恰好落在海马快速发育的窗口里,损伤便以剂量依赖方式写进解剖结构;Teicher等2012年报告,受虐者海马的CA3、齿状回与下托体积随童年暴露严重度递增而系统性缩小。�=Chronic stress shapes the developing hippocampus into a smaller structure, and the heavier the maltreatment the greater the shrinkage. Repeated abuse keeps the HPA axis activated, and excess glucocorticoids suppress neurogenesis in the dentate gyrus while driving dendritic retraction; because these processes fall inside the hippocampus's rapid-growth window, the damage gets written into anatomy dose-dependently. Teicher and colleagues reported in 2012 that CA3, dentate gyrus, and subicular volumes decline systematically with escalating severity of childhood exposure.�ans��src���Teicher、Anderson与Polcari论文《Childhood maltreatment is associated with reduced volume in the hippocampal subfields CA3, dentate gyrus, and subiculum》,PNAS 2012(麦克莱恩医院/哈佛医学院)��Teicher MH, Anderson CM & Polcari A, 'Childhood maltreatment is associated with reduced volume in the hippocampal subfields CA3, dentate gyrus, and subiculum', PNAS, 2012 (McLean Hospital / Harvard Medical School)��id�psy_26_018�body���直答:早期效应量很可能被系统性高估,真实效应即使存在也远小于最初报告。机理:Hagger团队协调二十多个实验室、两千余名被试,用统一的经典自控任务范式做预注册重复,结果效应接近零,置信区间排除了文献中的典型大小;小样本、分析灵活性与发表偏倚被视为高估来源。动机与信念等调节因素尚存争议,但把自控力当作会耗尽的单一燃料池,已经缺乏稳健的证据支持。�XEarly effect sizes were likely inflated systematically, and any real effect is far smaller than first reported. Hagger's team coordinated over twenty laboratories and more than two thousand participants in a preregistered repetition of a unified classic self-control paradigm; the effect landed near zero, with confidence intervals excluding typical published magnitudes. Small samples, analytic flexibility, and publication bias are blamed for the inflation. Moderators like motivation and belief remain debated, yet treating willpower as one depletable fuel tank no longer rests on robust evidence.�ans��src�ـHagger等论文《A Multilab Preregistered Replication of the Ego-Depletion Effect》,Perspectives on Psychological Science 2016فHagger MS et al., 'A Multilab Preregistered Replication of the Ego-Depletion Effect', Perspectives on Psychological Science, 2016��id�32d95040f229�body���质量比时长更关键：被动刷短视频与亲子共同看、边看边聊、随后现实里延伸游戏，效果完全不同。后者保留互动与迁移，更接近学习而非消磨。��Quality matters more than hours: passive short videos differ greatly from watching together, talking about it and extending into real play. The latter keeps interaction and transfer, closer to learning than killing time.�ans��src��;林崇德 主编,《发展心理学》人民教育出版社�CLin Chongde ed., Developmental Psychology, People's Education Press��id�c0d58dc550ab�body���婴儿能追踪音节同现的频率：经常出现在一起的音节更可能被听成一个词，从而在无分隔的自然语音中切分出词边界。这种统计学习在语言、视觉甚至音乐中普遍存在，是早期认知的通用机制。�Infants track transitional probabilities between syllables: pairs that co-occur often are heard as one word, letting them segment speech without boundaries. This statistical learning appears in language, vision and music—a general early-cognition mechanism.�ans��src��`Richard Gerrig Philip Zimbardo,《心理学与生活》第19版中译,人民邮电出版社,2016�hR. J. Gerrig and P. G. Zimbardo, Psychology and Life, 19th ed., Chinese ed., Posts & Telecom Press, 2016��id�000e030931df�body���丝绸之路连接中国与中亚、欧洲，中国输出丝绸、瓷器和茶叶，换回毛皮、香料、宝石和马匹。它不只是商品通道，也促成了宗教、技术与艺术的传播。骆驼商队是这条路上最主要的运输方式。�The Silk Road linked China with Central Asia and Europe; China exported silk, porcelain, and tea in return for furs, spices, gems, and horses. It was not only a trade route but also a channel for religion, technology, and art. Camel caravans were the main means of transport along it.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�027c5772e5ac�body�ٓ位于港口、河流或交通要道、又能聚集人才与生意的城市更容易繁荣。位置、资源和人聚在一起，经济就活跃。ٜCities at ports, rivers, or crossroads that also gather talent and business tend to thrive. Location, resources, and people together fuel an active economy.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�02918646dbe9�body�ل总和生育率估算一名女性一生平均生育的子女数；人口长期稳定的更替水平约为每名女性2.1个孩子。ٛThe total fertility rate estimates the average children a woman would have in her life; the replacement level for stable population is about 2.1 per woman.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�0352902a788b�body�ٷ因为大英帝国的扩张、美国的崛起和全球贸易让英语成了通用语；科学、网络与航空也用它沟通。会英语便于跨国读书、做生意和交朋友。��Britain's expansion, America's rise and global trade made English a lingua franca; science, the internet and aviation use it too. English eases studying, business and friendship across borders.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�03bced7d0f3d�body�ٽ共情是理解并分享他人情绪与处境的能力，分为认知共情（明白对方想法）和情感共情（感受对方情绪）。它是道德发展与亲社会行为的基础。��Empathy is the ability to understand and share another’s feelings—cognitive empathy (grasping their thoughts) and emotional empathy (feeling with them). It underpins morality and prosocial behavior.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0648f9e35df7�body���心理韧性指个体在逆境、创伤或压力中恢复并适应的能力，并非天生固定，而可通过社会支持、认知训练和稳定环境培养。它是积极心理学关注的核心。��Psychological resilience is the ability to recover and adapt after adversity, trauma, or stress. It is not fixed at birth but can be built through social support, cognitive training, and stable environments—a focus of positive psychology.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�071ec02b8691�body��文艺复兴重新推崇古典学问与人本精神，鼓励人们观察和质疑自然，为后来的科学革命铺垫了思想土壤。印刷术使书籍普及，知识传播加速。它对教育、艺术与探索精神的重视，间接推动了近代科学的发展。�>The Renaissance revived classical learning and humanist spirit, encouraging observation and questioning of nature, preparing the intellectual ground for the later Scientific Revolution. Printing spread books and accelerated knowledge. Its emphasis on education, art, and exploration indirectly advanced modern science.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�08f627e7df5c�body�ِ人口普查清点一个国家有多少人、住在哪里、做什么，是政府规划学校、医院和交通等公共服务的基础数据。ٖA census counts how many people there are, where they live, and what they do, providing the basic data for planning schools, hospitals, and transport.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�090ebaa535aa�body���人口金字塔是一种用背靠背条形图按年龄和性别展示人口分布的图形，横轴为人数、纵轴为年龄组。它的形状能直观反映一个国家是年轻型、成年型还是老年型社会。��A population pyramid is a back-to-back bar chart showing a population’s distribution by age and sex, with numbers on the horizontal axis and age groups on the vertical axis. Its shape reveals whether a society is young, mature, or aging.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�09147b0464fa�body���尽管“看不见的手”高效配置资源，但垄断、外部性、公共物品与信息不对称会使市场失灵，需要政府介入。认识到失灵边界，才能既尊重市场也善用干预。�Although the “invisible hand” allocates efficiently, monopoly, externalities, public goods, and information asymmetry cause market failure needing government intervention. Recognizing where failure begins lets us respect markets yet use intervention wisely.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�0b6dc392d477�body���贫困线是官方划定的最低生活费用标准，收入低于它即被视为贫困。绝对标准看能否满足基本温饱，相对标准通常按收入中位数的比例设定。它用于识别救助对象与监测减贫。�The poverty line is an official minimum living-cost threshold; income below it is considered poverty. An absolute standard checks basic subsistence; a relative one is usually set as a share of median income. It identifies aid recipients and monitors poverty reduction.�ans��src��C世界银行 (2020), 《贫困与共享繁荣 2020》, 世界银行�5World Bank (2020), Poverty and Shared Prosperity 2020��id�0ca0c2c3a914�body��K亚洲、非洲、北美洲、南美洲、南极洲、欧洲、大洋洲。�UThey are Asia, Africa, North America, South America, Antarctica, Europe, and Oceania.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0e10d7e6261e�body�٪七天周制源自古巴比伦，与月相周期（约28天分四段）和宗教传统有关，后被多文明沿用。它并非自然节律，而是人造时间单位。��The seven-day week came from Babylon, tied to lunar phases (about 28 days in four) and religious tradition, later adopted by many civilizations. It is not a natural rhythm but a human-made time unit.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�1072414054fa�body�ه人口增长指一个地区的人数随时间变多，当出生的人多于去世的人、或迁入的人多于迁出时就会发生。�|Population growth means more people in an area over time, occurring when births exceed deaths or arrivals exceed departures.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�1268866b5ab3�body���通货膨胀是整体物价水平持续上升、货币购买力下降。主因包括需求过热、成本推动（如能源涨价）与货币超发。温和通胀常见，恶性通胀则破坏经济秩序。�
Inflation is a sustained rise in the general price level and a fall in money's purchasing power. Main causes include overheated demand, cost-push shocks (like energy price rises), and money overissue. Mild inflation is common; hyperinflation destroys economic order.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�139602201f44�body��普通法遵循“先例约束”原则，上级法院的判决对下级法院同类案件有拘束力，使法律随案件积累而演进。这增强了可预期性，也让法官在造法上扮演重要角色。成文法修改慢时，判例可灵活填补空白。�Common law follows “stare decisis”: higher-court decisions bind lower courts in similar cases, so law evolves through accumulated rulings. This enhances predictability and gives judges a law-making role. When statutes change slowly, precedents flexibly fill gaps.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�1534d4c14d94�body��人类学是研究人类及其文化、社会、生物演化的综合学科，常分为文化人类学、体质人类学和考古学等分支。它强调通过田野调查理解不同人群的多样生活方式。人类学帮助人们以更包容的视角看待文化差异。�@Anthropology is the holistic study of humans, their cultures, societies, and biological evolution, often divided into cultural, biological, and archaeological branches. It emphasizes fieldwork to understand the diverse ways of life of different peoples. Anthropology fosters a more inclusive view of cultural difference.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�179dfd17b983�body��1920年代在西部电气公司的实验发现，工人产量不仅受工时与报酬影响，更受关注、群体氛围等社会心理因素驱动，即“霍桑效应”。它开创了关注人而非仅效率的管理视角。行为科学由此进入组织研究。�%Experiments in the 1920s at Western Electric found workers' output was driven not just by hours and pay but by attention and group atmosphere—the “Hawthorne effect.” It opened a management view focused on people, not just efficiency. Behavioral science thus entered organization studies.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�18f9b7d81880�body���世界宗教指在多个地区拥有大量信众、具跨民族传播力的几大宗教，通常指基督教、伊斯兰教、印度教、佛教和犹太教等。它们塑造了全球文化与伦理图景。ٺWorld religions are those with large, cross-ethnic followings across regions—typically Christianity, Islam, Hinduism, Buddhism, and Judaism. They have shaped global culture and ethics.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1ba2b18ff932�body�٥政治生态学研究环境问题的政治与经济根源，强调资源争夺、权力关系如何塑造生态退化与气候脆弱性，而不只是自然过程。ټPolitical ecology studies the political-economic roots of environmental problems, emphasizing how power and resource struggles shape degradation and climate vulnerability, not just nature.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1c0ae150b73c�body���言论自由是公民表达意见而不受政府事前审查的权利，被许多国家宪法和国际公约所保障。多数国家也规定边界，如禁止煽动暴力、诽谤和仇恨言论，以平衡个人自由与他人权利。�Freedom of expression is the right to voice opinions without prior government censorship, protected by many constitutions and human-rights treaties. Most states set limits—such as against incitement to violence, libel, or hate speech—to balance liberties with others’ rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�1c8f1bb92464�body���新闻价值是事件被媒体选为报道的吸引力标准，如时效性、冲突、显著性、接近性与人情味。它解释为何每天无数事只少数上头条。不同媒体对同一标准的权重不同。�News value is the attractiveness standard by which media pick events to report—timeliness, conflict, prominence, proximity, human interest. It explains why of countless daily events only few make headlines. Different outlets weight these criteria differently.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�1ca704d21285�body�٢个体理性地使用共享资源（如大气、渔场）会过度消耗、损害全体。气候变化正是全球公地悲剧，需集体约束与配额安排。٭Rational individuals over-exploit shared resources (atmosphere, fisheries), harming all—a tragedy of the commons; climate change needs collective limits and quota regimes.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�222f66feb876�body�ٟ算法社会指日常决策——如新闻推送、贷款审批、招聘筛选——越来越多由算法自动完成，技术逻辑深度嵌入社会运行。٫An algorithmic society is one where daily decisions—news feeds, loan approvals, hiring screens—are increasingly automated, with technical logic woven into social life.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�23bfacdea6d6�body���借词是一种语言从另一种语言吸收来的现成词汇，如汉语的“咖啡”（源自阿拉伯语）、“雷达”（源自英语 radar）。借词反映文化交流与接触历史。��A loanword is a word borrowed ready-made from another language, such as Mandarin “kāfēi” (coffee, from Arabic) or “léidá” (radar, from English). Loanwords reveal cultural contact and exchange.�ans��src��,民族语（Ethnologue, SIL International）�Ethnologue (SIL International)��id�2461253dca8d�body���汉字是表意文字，一个字代表一个意思或语素，历史上从图画与象形演变而来。它不随语音改变拼写，所以不同方言、不同读音的人能读同一套字。��Chinese characters are logographs—each stands for a meaning or morpheme, evolved from pictures and pictographs. They don't change spelling with pronunciation, so people with different dialects can read the same writing.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�25724333de75�body���关税是政府对进口商品征收的税，目的是增加财政收入或保护本国产业。表面上由进口商在边境缴纳，但成本往往通过更高价格转嫁给本国消费者。��A tariff is a tax a government levies on imported goods, used to raise revenue or protect domestic industries. Although importers pay it at the border, the cost is usually passed to domestic consumers through higher prices.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�2c8924818fcd�body�ٷ汉语方言语音差异大，但共用表意汉字系统，书面可互通；历代“书同文”与通用语推广维系了文字统一。这利于跨方言交流与国家整合。�Chinese dialects differ greatly in sound but share an ideographic script that is mutually readable in writing; centuries of “unified script” and standard-language promotion kept writing unified. This aids cross-dialect communication and national integration.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�2ec679e75b9c�body���不满八周岁为无民事行为能力人，其充值原则上无效可退；八周岁以上限制民事行为能力人，超出年龄智力的消费需监护人追认，否则可主张返还。实践中需举证。��Children under 8 lack civil capacity, so their top-ups are void and refundable; those 8+ are limited, and spending beyond their age and intellect needs guardian ratification or can be reclaimed. Proof is needed in practice.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2fc6c5c5ee73�body�ف人口老龄化指老年人口比重上升、整体年龄变大的过程，主要由生育率下降和寿命延长共同推动。هPopulation aging is the rising share of older people and a graying population, driven mainly by falling fertility and longer lifespans.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�320cc040445b�body�ٙ春节是家人团聚的核心节日，返乡表达的是对血缘家庭的重视与年度重置。大规模春运是这一文化惯性的人口体现。ٵSpring Festival is the core reunion holiday; returning home expresses the value placed on the family and an annual reset. The huge travel rush is this cultural inertia made visible.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�324a7d49afe5�body��&民法调整平等主体之间的财产和人身关系，如合同与婚姻；刑法规定哪些行为构成犯罪并施加刑罚，以维护社会秩序。民事案件通常由受害方起诉，刑事案件多由国家机关追诉。两者的目的、程序和举证责任都有明显不同。�dCivil law governs property and personal relations among equal parties, such as contracts and marriage; criminal law defines acts as crimes and imposes punishment to protect public order. Civil cases are usually brought by the injured party, while criminal cases are prosecuted by the state. Their purposes, procedures, and burdens of proof differ markedly.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�358ec153ad7a�body���供需定律指在其他条件不变时，价格上升需求量减少、供给量增加；价格下降则反之。二者交点决定市场均衡价与量。它是经济学理解价格形成的起点。�The law of supply and demand says that, other things equal, a higher price reduces quantity demanded and raises quantity supplied, and vice versa. Their intersection sets the market equilibrium price and quantity. It is the starting point for understanding price formation.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�38be7114acb7�body�ٙ一起行动会让人感到“我们是一伙的”，大脑也会释放让人愉快的化学物质。集体仪式强化归属，孤独感随之降低。٠Acting together makes people feel 'we are one group', and the brain releases feel-good chemicals. Collective ritual strengthens belonging and lowers loneliness.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3b63eca0e132�body���贸易顺差指出口大于进口，逆差则相反。顺差意味对外净卖出、积累外汇；逆差则需用资本流入或储备弥补。长期大额逆差可能暴露竞争力问题。�A trade surplus means exports exceed imports; a deficit is the reverse. A surplus means net selling abroad and accumulating foreign exchange; a deficit must be financed by capital inflows or reserves. Persistent large deficits may signal competitiveness problems.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3be9c76d6a79�body���普雷斯顿在 1975 年发现，一个国家越富裕，其国民平均寿命通常越长，但曲线「越往高处越平缓」——从穷到富寿命提升很快，富国之间差距却很小。这说明经济发展初期对健康收益最大。�Preston found in 1975 that richer countries tend to have longer life expectancy, but the curve flattens at the top—gains are large moving out of poverty yet small among wealthy nations. It shows economic development yields the biggest health payoff early on.�ans��src��7Preston，《收入与死亡率关系的变迁》(1975)�DPreston, 'The Changing Relation between Income and Mortality' (1975)��id�3c174c2e4c8c�body��o由多国政府或团体组成、处理共同议题（如卫生、贸易）的常设机构，例如联合国。�^A standing body of states or groups tackling shared issues like health or trade, e.g., the UN.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�3c70c58e5109�body���买方市场是供过于求、买家占优势、价格偏软的市场；卖方市场则供不应求、卖家占优、价格看涨。它是供需力量对比的直观体现。房地产旺季常呈卖方市场。�A buyer's market is one with excess supply where buyers hold the advantage and prices soften; a seller's market has excess demand where sellers dominate and prices rise. It reflects the balance of supply and demand. Hot real-estate seasons are often seller's markets.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�3c76cb21122a�body���批判性思维是有意识地分析、评估证据与论证而非被动接受结论的思维方式，强调逻辑、质疑与区分事实与观点。它是通识教育与终身学习的核心能力。��Critical thinking is the disciplined analysis and evaluation of evidence and arguments rather than passively accepting conclusions, emphasizing logic, questioning, and separating fact from opinion. It is central to liberal education and lifelong learning.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�40f8fe408d74�body�ٖ人们存钱是为了以后用，比如应对生病、上学等意外开销，也为了将来买更贵的东西。就像松鼠囤坚果过冬一样。ٜPeople save to spend later, to cover unexpected costs like illness or school, and to afford bigger purchases. It is like a squirrel storing nuts for winter.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�43c30189542b�body�٥改革开放后，政策鼓励勤劳致富、允许一部分人先富起来，口号把“发财”从忌讳变成正面目标，释放了创业与劳动的活力。��After reform and opening, policy encouraged getting rich by hard work and let some prosper first; the slogan turned making money from taboo into a positive goal, unlocking entrepreneurship and effort.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�472950dfe123�body�ٍ银行只需保留部分存款作为准备金，将剩余贷出，贷款又会被存入银行，从而通过存贷循环放大货币供给。ٗBanks keep only a fraction of deposits as reserves and lend the rest; those loans are redeposited, expanding the money supply through the credit cycle.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�477f4dd0f4e9�body��“看不见的手”是亚当·斯密提出的概念，指个人在追求自身利益时，通过市场交换无意间促进了社会整体福利。价格信号引导资源流向最需要的地方。它说明自由市场能在没有中央指令的情况下实现有效配置。�FThe “invisible hand” is a concept from Adam Smith, meaning that individuals pursuing their own interest unintentionally promote overall social welfare through market exchange. Price signals guide resources to where they are most needed. It shows that free markets can achieve efficient allocation without central commands.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�49c04fcac2f3�body�ٮ婚礼在印度等地不仅是两家人结合，也是整个家族与社区的大事；盛大仪式显示家族面子、巩固亲友网络，并履行宗教与传统义务。��In India and nearby lands a wedding joins not just two people but whole families and communities; grand rites show family honor, cement kinship networks and fulfill religious and traditional duties.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�49eba19b2caa�body���文化是一个群体共享的价值观、信仰、习俗、语言和物质产物，通过社会化代代相传。它塑造人们的行为方式，使不同社会呈现出独特的生活方式。��Culture is the shared values, beliefs, customs, language, and material products of a group, transmitted across generations through socialization. It shapes people’s behavior and gives different societies their distinct ways of life.�ans��src��c泰勒《原始文化》（Tylor, Primitive Culture, 1871）；联合国教科文组织（UNESCO）�4Edward Tylor, “Primitive Culture” (1871); UNESCO��id�4a2f39a7381a�body�ٯ当一个国家或地区65岁及以上人口占比达到7%即为老龄化社会（联合国标准），达到14%为深度老龄化。它带来劳动力减少与养老压力。ْBy UN standard, a society is aging when those 65+ reach 7% of population, and deeply aging at 14%. It brings shrinking labor and pension pressure.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�4b37a752d1d8�body���时区是为统一计时把地球按经度划分的区段，理论上每15°相差一小时。多数国家采用整小时区，也有半小时或45分钟的特例（如印度、尼泊尔）。��Time zones divide the Earth by longitude so clocks stay consistent—in theory one hour per 15°. Most countries use whole-hour zones, but some use half- or 45-minute offsets (e.g., India, Nepal).�ans��src��?美国中央情报局《世界概况》（CIA World Factbook）�CIA World Factbook��id�4b95ed22b127�body�٥抽样误差来自仅调查部分总体且随机波动；非抽样误差来自无应答、问卷设计与测量偏差，后者常比前者更难控制且更隐蔽。٬Sampling error comes from surveying a subset with random variation; non-sampling error from nonresponse, design, and measurement bias—often harder to control and subtler.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�4e39cc1fd86d�body��中产阶级通常指收入、教育和职业处于社会中间层次的人群，如专业技术人员、管理人员和中小企业主。它常被视为社会稳定与消费的重要支撑。中产阶级的规模与活力被认为关系到社会的健康运行。�)The middle class generally refers to people in the intermediate tier of income, education, and occupation, such as professionals, managers, and small business owners. It is often seen as a pillar of social stability and consumption. Its size and vitality are considered vital to a healthy society.�ans��src��SPeter Blau & Otis Dudley Duncan,《The American Occupational Structure》Wiley,1967�MP. M. Blau and O. D. Duncan, The American Occupational Structure, Wiley, 1967��id�4e9326176b38�body���宪法是国家最根本的法律，规定国家结构、权力分配和公民基本权利，具有最高效力。其他法律不得与它相冲突。它相当于一个国家的“根本游戏规则”。��A constitution is a nation's fundamental law, setting out state structure, the distribution of power, and basic citizen rights, with supreme authority. No other law may conflict with it. It is a country's “basic rulebook.”�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�4ed0f54d6943�body�ٜ这一习俗混合了西方传统：蜡烛象征生命之光，吹灭并许愿寓意祈福。它已成为跨文化的轻松庆祝仪式，无强制意义。ٽThe custom blends Western tradition: candles symbolize the light of life, and blowing them out with a wish means blessing. It is now a cross-cultural lighthearted ritual with no compulsion.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�4fc059e7ba8e�body�ٟ全球供应链是一件产品从原料、零件到组装、销售分散在多国完成，各环节靠贸易与物流连接，以降低成本和贴近市场。٣A global supply chain spreads a product's raw materials, parts, assembly, and sales across countries, linked by trade and logistics to cut costs and reach markets.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�50bb6dc8d540�body��博弈论用数学模型研究多个相互依赖的决策者在策略互动中的选择与结果，比如竞争、谈判和合作。它不只用于经济学，也用于政治、生物与计算机等领域。核心思想是：你的收益取决于别人怎么选。�$Game theory uses mathematical models to study how interdependent decision-makers choose and what results follow, in competition, negotiation, and cooperation. It is used not only in economics but also politics, biology, and computing. Its core idea: your payoff depends on what others choose.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5187044ec03b�body���英格兰银行成立于1694年，最初为政府战争筹款而设，后来逐步承担发钞、管理国债和稳定金融的职能。它是世界上最早具备现代中央银行特征的机构，许多国家央行都以其为范本。�Founded in 1694 to fund government war borrowing, the Bank of England gradually took on issuing notes, managing debt, and stabilizing finance. It was among the first institutions with modern central-bank features, and many countries modeled their own central banks on it.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�523ff521d0ea�body�ٖ数字鸿沟指不同群体在接触互联网、使用数字设备和获取数字技能上的差距，常按收入、地区、年龄和性别分布。٢The digital divide is the gap between groups in accessing the internet, using devices, and gaining digital skills, often split by income, region, age, and gender.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�54f8248232ba�body��`契约是双方自愿达成的具法律约束力的协议，通常需要约、承诺与对价。�mA contract is a voluntary, legally binding agreement, typically needing offer, acceptance, and consideration.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5a7b09f6e17a�body�ٷ全球治理指国家、国际组织、企业与非政府主体为应对跨国问题（气候、疫情、网络）而协调规则与行动的过程，并不依赖单一世界政府。��Global governance is the coordination of rules and actions by states, international organizations, firms, and NGOs to address transnational issues (climate, pandemics, cyberspace)—without a single world government.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�5b0ee45ac563�body�ٔNGO 是不以营利为目的、独立于政府的民间组织，常从事扶贫、环保、人权与救灾等工作，依靠捐赠或会费运转。١An NGO is a non-profit, non-governmental civil group often working on poverty, environment, human rights, and disaster relief, funded by donations or membership.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5c8d9e49f427�body�٫科技政策影响公众、企业、研究者与政府等多方，利益相关者通过咨询、听证与游说参与，以求在风险与收益间达成可接受方案。٣Tech policy affects publics, firms, researchers, and states; stakeholders engage via consultation, hearings, and lobbying to balance risks and benefits acceptably.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5d21b5def136�body���总和生育率指一名女性按当前生育水平度过一生平均会生育的孩子数。通常2.1左右才能维持人口不增不减。低于这一水平，长期人口就会趋于萎缩。��The total fertility rate is the average number of children a woman would bear over her life at current rates. About 2.1 is needed to keep population stable. Below that, population tends to shrink in the long run.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�5d4d39e5fe11�body���19世纪普鲁士建立分年级、按课程表和统一教材运作的国民学校，强调纪律、读写算与爱国忠诚。这种模式后被多国效仿，奠定了现代公立学校体系。其标准化也常被批评压抑个性。�*In the 19th century Prussia built graded public schools run by timetable and uniform textbooks, stressing discipline, the three Rs, and patriotic loyalty. Many countries later copied it, founding the modern public-school system. Its standardization is also criticized for suppressing individuality.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�5dbc52e30477�body�ٮ通货膨胀是指一段时间内整体物价水平持续上涨，导致货币购买力下降的现象。通常用消费者价格指数（CPI）的年度变化率来衡量。��Inflation refers to a sustained rise in the general price level over time, which reduces the purchasing power of money. It is usually measured by the annual percentage change in the Consumer Price Index (CPI).�ans��src��W国际货币基金组织（IMF）《国际金融统计》；曼昆《经济学原理》�rInternational Monetary Fund (IMF), “International Financial Statistics”; Mankiw, “Principles of Economics”��id�5e48f80b95d8�body���媒介素养是受众理解、分析、评价并创造媒体信息的能力。它包括识别偏见、核实事实与反思传播意图。在信息过载时代，媒介素养是公民的基本生存技能。��Media literacy is the ability to access, analyze, evaluate, and create media messages. It includes recognizing bias, verifying facts, and reflecting on communicative intent. In an age of information overload, media literacy is a basic civic skill.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6073ea4247c3�body�ٟ一起欢呼或叹气会放大情绪，也制造“我们支持同一队”的归属感。共同关注的事成了社交的纽带，孤独感被热闹冲淡。٬Cheering or groaning together amplifies emotion and builds 'we root for the same team' belonging. A shared focus becomes a social bond, thinning loneliness with excitement.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�609e289a14f2�body���识字率指能读写简单句子的人口占适龄人口的比例，常用来衡量基础教育水平。近百年全球识字率大幅提升，但地区间仍有差距。提高识字率是减贫与发展的重要前提。�The literacy rate is the share of the population able to read and write a simple sentence, often used to gauge basic education. Global literacy rose sharply over the last century, though gaps remain between regions. Raising it is key to poverty reduction and development.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�640eaf653f00�body���法律面前人人平等指所有人在法律适用上不受身份、财富或权力的特殊优待或歧视，是法治与基本人权的核心原则。它要求同样的情形得到同样的处理。��Equality before the law means no one is granted special favor or discriminated against by status, wealth, or power—a core principle of the rule of law and human rights. Like cases must be treated alike.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�659b9af21d09�body��人口爆炸指20世纪某些地区死亡率快速下降而出生率仍高，导致人口在短期内急剧增长的状况。它曾引发对资源与粮食的忧虑，如“马尔萨斯恐慌”。随着教育普及与城市化，许多国家随后自然回落。�BPopulation explosion describes a situation, especially in the 20th century, where death rates fell fast while birth rates stayed high, causing sharp short-term growth. It sparked fears about resources and food, such as “Malthusian panic.” As education and urbanization spread, many countries later fell back naturally.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�65d26ffc75e0�body�ٮ平台治理指对电商、社交、出行等数字平台在规则、内容、竞争和数据上的管理与监督，涉及平台、用户、政府与社会的多方责任。��Platform governance is the management and oversight of digital platforms (e-commerce, social, ride-hailing) on rules, content, competition, and data, involving platform, users, government, and society.�ans��src�٢Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor,《What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy》,Annual Review of Sociology,2020 (DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857)٠Steven Vallas & Juliet B. Schor, 'What Do Platforms Do? Understanding the Gig Economy', Annual Review of Sociology, 2020, DOI: 10.1146/annurev-soc-121919-054857��id�66df17c73afb�body���行为经济学结合心理学研究人们在真实决策中如何偏离“完全理性”假设，例如受偏见、情绪和社会因素影响。它补充了传统经济学对理性人模型的不足。��Behavioral economics combines psychology with economics to study how people deviate from the “fully rational” assumption in real decisions—e.g., under bias, emotion, and social influence. It complements the traditional rational-agent model.�ans��src��6丹尼尔·卡尼曼《思考，快与慢》（2011）�5Daniel Kahneman, “Thinking, Fast and Slow” (2011)��id�67e8136fa94f�body��!三角贸易是16到19世纪跨大西洋的贸易循环：欧洲把工业品运到非洲，非洲奴隶被运往美洲，美洲的糖、棉花、烟草再运回欧洲。它给欧洲带来巨额财富，却建立在奴役与苦难之上。这是历史上规模最大的强迫迁移之一。�mThe triangular trade was a transatlantic cycle from the 16th to 19th centuries: Europe shipped manufactured goods to Africa, enslaved Africans were carried to the Americas, and American sugar, cotton, and tobacco returned to Europe. It generated vast wealth for Europe but rested on enslavement and suffering, and was among the largest forced migrations in history.�ans��src��KEltis & Richardson，《跨大西洋奴隶贸易地图集》(2010)；UNESCO�KEltis & Richardson, 'Atlas of the Transatlantic Slave Trade' (2010); UNESCO��id�68656487a002�body�ه只问一个人意见太片面。调查随机抽取足够多的人，能让结果更接近整体真实想法，误差也可被估计。فAsking one person is too narrow. Surveys randomly sample enough people to approximate the whole population, with estimable error.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�68a2599cf4cb�body���贝壳曾被许多早期社会当作货币，是因为它稀有、不易腐烂、便于携带和计数。在海贝稀缺的内陆地区，它成了人们认可的交易媒介。随着金属铸币出现，贝壳货币才逐渐退出流通。�Shells served as money in many early societies because they were rare, durable, portable, and easy to count. In inland areas where sea shells were scarce, they became a widely accepted medium of exchange. They gradually disappeared from circulation once metal coins emerged.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�68c254c10ebf�body�ٜ数据权属讨论谁对个人数据、平台数据与公共数据拥有控制、收益和许可的权利，是数字时代新型财产权争议的核心。ٱData ownership asks who holds control, benefit, and permission rights over personal, platform, and public data—a core dispute over new property-like rights in the digital age.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�6927e8e7335f�body�٨这句寒暄源自温饱时代对温饱的关切，如今已成不带实际询问的礼貌开场，类似西方的“你好”。它体现以食为媒的亲切文化。ٸThis greeting arose from a time when food security mattered; today it is a polite opener with no real inquiry, like “hello” in the West. It shows a food-centered warmth in culture.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�6a7b0228fe90�body�ل声调区别词义，如“妈麻马骂”发音相近但意思不同，读错会误解。汉语靠声调承载部分语义信息。��Tones distinguish meaning: “ma” with four tones means mother, hemp, horse, scold—similar sounds, different senses. Mispronouncing a tone causes misunderstanding; tones carry part of the semantics.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6aab7c80111d�body�٨因为人类靠群体生存，被群体接纳才安全。在意评价能帮我们遵守规则、维持关系，所以“在乎名声”是进化出来的生存本能。ٰHumans survived in groups, and acceptance meant safety. Caring about judgment helps us follow rules and keep ties, so 'caring about reputation' is an evolved survival instinct.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6b90d4730d4a�body�ٺ大运河把南方的粮食（尤其是稻米）经水路运到北方政治中心（如长安、洛阳、北京），也运送盐和物资。它是一条国家命脉式的运输干线。��The Grand Canal moved southern grain (especially rice) by water to northern political centers (e.g., Chang'an, Luoyang, Beijing) and carried salt and goods. It was a lifeline transport artery for the state.�ans��src��?联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《中国大运河》�-UNESCO World Heritage Centre, The Grand Canal��id�6ba86489e7e7�body��u文化规范是一个群体约定俗成的行为准则，包括习俗、禁忌与法律，引导成员如何行动。�gCultural norms are shared rules of behavior—customs, taboos, laws—that guide how group members act.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�6d5737333e75�body��古代市集是固定时间地点聚集买卖、讨价还价的场所，和超市一样都是人们获取商品的中介节点。不同在于市集多靠口碑与当面交易，而超市依赖标准化标价与供应链。基本功能都是连接生产者和消费者。�eAncient markets were places where people gathered at set times and spots to haggle and trade, serving like supermarkets as intermediary nodes for obtaining goods. The difference is that markets relied on reputation and face-to-face dealing, while supermarkets depend on standardized pricing and supply chains. Both basically connect producers and consumers.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�6ebbbb9dae0e�body���公投是由全体合格选民直接就某项重大议题投票决定的形式，如独立、修宪或加入国际组织。它能直接体现民意，但也可能使复杂问题被简化为二元选择。��A referendum lets all eligible voters directly decide a major issue—independence, constitutional change, or treaty membership. It expresses popular will directly but can oversimplify complex questions into binary choices.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�6f147f02f477�body�٪终身学习指离开学校后持续获取知识与技能，以适应职业变化与技术迭代。在AI与自动化时代，单一学历难以覆盖整个职业生涯。ٴLifelong learning means continuously gaining knowledge and skills after school to adapt to job change and tech churn. In the AI age, a single degree rarely covers an entire career.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�75be48e37a50�body�ٮ石器时代是人类主要使用石器的最早历史阶段，按技术分为旧石器、中石器和新石器三个阶段，跨越数百万年，直至金属冶炼出现。ٻThe Stone Age is the earliest period when humans mainly used stone tools, divided into Paleolithic, Mesolithic, and Neolithic stages spanning millions of years until metalworking emerged.�ans��src��:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937�:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937��id�765ad69a2392�body�ٙ通用语是不同母语群体间用于交流的共有语言（如历史上的阿拉伯语、今日的英语），常随贸易与霸权兴衰而更替。ٔA lingua franca is a shared language for communication across mother tongues (Arabic historically, English today), shifting with trade and hegemony.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�7bf3bdd95fa3�body�ٙ平台用算法根据用户点击与停留推送相似内容，形成“信息茧房”。它提升黏度却也收窄视野，让人难见不同观点。١Platforms push similar content by your clicks and dwell time, forming a “filter bubble.” It boosts engagement but narrows the view and hides differing views.�ans��src��FEli Pariser《信息茧房:互联网正在隐藏什么》,Penguin,2011�YEli Pariser, The Filter Bubble: What the Internet Is Hiding from You, Penguin Press, 2011��id�838def6d0ef7�body���语言是人类储存和传递文化的主要载体，也塑造人们认识世界的方式。萨丕尔-沃尔夫假说认为语言结构可能影响思维。不同语言承载着独特的世界观与历史记忆。�Language is the main vehicle for storing and transmitting culture, and it also shapes how people perceive the world. The Sapir-Whorf hypothesis suggests language structure may influence thought. Different languages carry unique worldviews and historical memory.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�83d338b4cda8�body���储蓄是指收入中未用于当期消费而被保留下来的部分，可以存入银行、购买资产或持有现金。储蓄为投资和未来消费提供资金来源。适度的储蓄有助于个人应对风险，也支撑宏观投资。�␀Saving is the part of income not spent on current consumption and set aside, whether in banks, assets, or cash. It provides funds for investment and future consumption. Moderate saving helps individuals cope with risk and supports macroeconomic investment.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�84696b20be29�body�٠16–18世纪欧洲政策以积累金银、限制进口、扶持出口与殖民地贸易为特征，视贸易为零和博弈，后被自由贸易理论批评。ٞMercantilism (16th–18th c.) favored accumulating gold, restricting imports, and protecting exports as zero-sum trade, later criticized by free-trade theory.�ans��src��>亚当·斯密《国富论》（The Wealth of Nations, 1776）�.Adam Smith, “The Wealth of Nations” (1776)��id�88cf0373692a�body�ٙ大数据（如手机信令、社交记录、交易流水）能实时、大尺度地观察人口流动、舆论与行为，补充传统问卷的不足。٦Big data—cell signals, social logs, transaction records—lets researchers observe mobility, opinion, and behavior in real time and at scale, complementing surveys.�ans��src��R世界银行(World Bank)《World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives》�@World Bank, World Development Report 2021: Data for Better Lives��id�89467a605ca7�body�ٟ因为冷藏船和飞机把水果快速运到各地，贸易规则让跨境买卖更方便。你冬天吃到的芒果，可能来自几千公里外的果园。٥Reefer ships and planes move fruit fast, and trade rules ease cross-border buying. The mango you eat in winter may come from an orchard thousands of kilometers away.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�8a14805f0871�body���可持续发展目标（SDGs）是联合国2015年通过的17项全球议程，涵盖消除贫困、清洁能源、气候行动等，设定了到2030年的发展蓝图，供各国共同推进。ٳThe Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) are 17 global targets adopted by the UN in 2015—ending poverty, clean energy, climate action—forming a 2030 roadmap for all countries.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8a227ec47c94�body�ِ国际移民指人跨越国界、在另一国停留一段时间以上的移动，按原因可分为劳务、家庭团聚、求学与避难等。يInternational migration is crossing a border to stay in another country for a period, by reason of work, family reunion, study, or asylum.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�8a79e3fd5ba7�body���信用货币（法定货币）本身没有内在价值，其购买力来自政府法令和公众信任。现代纸币和账户里的数字都属于信用货币。它依靠国家信用而非黄金背书来流通。��Fiat money has no intrinsic value; its purchasing power comes from government decree and public trust. Modern banknotes and digital account balances are fiat money. It circulates on the credit of the state rather than a gold backing.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8bbbbaf0f5c8�body�ٽ最低工资是政府依法规定雇主必须支付的最低时薪或月薪，旨在保障劳动者基本生活。支持者认为它能减贫，反对者担忧可能减少低技能岗位。ٶA minimum wage is the legally set lowest pay employers may offer, meant to secure workers’ basic living. Supporters cite poverty reduction; critics worry it may cut low-skill jobs.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8f2ed11eb531�body��囚徒困境是两个被捕同伙各自选择是否供出对方：若都沉默，两人轻判；若都招供，两人重判；但单独招供者最划算。结果两人往往都招供，得到比合作更差的结果。它说明个人理性可能导致集体不理性。�^The prisoner's dilemma: two arrested partners each choose whether to betray the other. If both stay silent they get light sentences; if both confess they get heavy ones; but the one who confesses alone fares best. They usually both confess, ending worse than if they had cooperated. It shows individual rationality can yield collective irrationality.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�8f55f8037bfa�body��Q支撑城市运转的系统，包括供水、电网、道路、排水与通信。�\It is the systems keeping cities running: water, power, roads, drainage, and communications.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�917b57506e59�body���法律是由国家制定或认可、并以国家强制力保证实施的行为规范总和。它规定权利与义务，用以调整社会关系、维护秩序。不同法系（如大陆法系与普通法系）在渊源和适用上各有特点。�Law is the set of rules created or recognized by the state and enforced through state coercion. It defines rights and duties to regulate social relations and maintain order. Different legal families, such as civil and common law, differ in sources and application.�ans��src��,H.L.A. 哈特《法律的概念》（1961）�,H.L.A. Hart, “The Concept of Law” (1961)��id�91ae7d2f8e07�body�ي调查全体人口成本高、耗时长，抽样通过研究有代表性的小部分来推断整体，既省钱又能得到可信结论。ٖSurveying everyone is costly and slow; sampling studies a representative subset to infer the whole—saving money while yielding credible conclusions.�ans��src��[UN DESA,《Principles and Recommendations for Population and Housing Censuses Rev.3》,2017�:UN DESA, Census Principles and Recommendations Rev.3, 2017��id�96168af0e187�body�ٓ国际组织是由多个国家政府（或成员）依条约成立的常设机构，如联合国、世界卫生组织，用来协调跨国事务。ُAn international organization is a permanent body established by treaty among states—like the UN or WHO—to coordinate cross-border affairs.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�97948959bacf�body�ٽ麦加是伊斯兰教发源地，有禁寺和克尔白，先知穆罕默德在此传教。每位有能力的穆斯林一生应朝觐一次，使麦加成为全球穆斯林的精神焦点。ٽMecca is Islam's birthplace, home to the Grand Mosque and the Kaaba where the Prophet preached. Every able Muslim should pilgrimage once, making Mecca the faith's spiritual focus worldwide.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�9977972d04fa�body���选举是公民以投票方式定期选择公职人员的程序，是代议制民主的核心机制。它通过和平、可预期的方式实现权力更替与问责。公平选举要求普遍、平等与秘密投票。�An election is a procedure where citizens periodically choose officeholders by vote, the core mechanism of representative democracy. It enables peaceful, predictable power turnover and accountability. Fair elections require universality, equality, and the secret ballot.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�9af2ac0f76c3�body���证据是用于证明案件事实的材料或信息，如书证、物证、证人证言和电子数据等。法律对证据的收集、采信有严格规则，以保障裁判的公正。没有充分证据，很多主张难以在法律上成立。�-Evidence is the material or information used to prove facts in a case, such as documents, physical objects, witness testimony, and electronic data. Law strictly regulates how evidence is collected and admitted to ensure fair adjudication. Without sufficient evidence, many claims cannot stand legally.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�9d7e81653d83�body���大河流域需要统一治水与调粮，战乱让百姓渴望安定，儒家也强调“天下归一”。统一便于修渠、平准物价、抵御外患，逐渐成为强大的政治文化传统。�River civilizations needed unified flood control and grain distribution; wars made people crave stability, and Confucianism stressed 'all-under-heaven as one'. Unity eased canal-building, price stabilization and defense, becoming a strong political tradition.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�a0952eb4fab3�body���检察官代表国家追究犯罪、维护公益，负责提起公诉。律师则受当事人委托，为其辩护或代理以维护其合法权益。两者在诉讼中相互对抗又共同保障程序公正。��A prosecutor represents the state to pursue crime and public interest by filing charges. A lawyer is hired by a party to defend or represent them and protect their legal rights. They oppose each other in trial yet together safeguard procedural fairness.�ans��src��<Garner 主编，《布莱克法律词典》(第11版，2019)�7Garner (ed.), 'Black's Law Dictionary' (11th ed., 2019)��id�a33910eec93b�body���世界上最早的纸币是中国北宋时期在四川地区发行的“交子”。由于铁钱笨重不便贸易，商人在11世纪初发明了可兑换的金属货币票据，后来由官府正式发行。交子的出现比欧洲早了约600年。�`The world's earliest paper money was the “jiaozi” issued in Sichuan during China's Northern Song dynasty. Because iron coins were heavy and awkward for trade, merchants in the early 11th century invented exchangeable notes backed by metal currency, later formally issued by the government. Jiaozi predated European paper money by roughly 600 years.�ans��src��P韩启德总主编《十万个为什么》(第六版),少年儿童出版社,2013ٗHan Qide chief ed., Ten Thousand Whys, 6th edition, Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�a5ecfb52ab40�body�ٮ非正式制度指不成文的习惯、规范与信任网络（如熟人信用），在正式法律薄弱处替代或补充治理，深刻影响经济绩效与合约执行。ٶInformal institutions are unwritten norms, habits, and trust networks (e.g., kinship credit) that substitute or supplement governance where law is weak, shaping economic performance.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�a68507d630df�body�ِ义务教育保证每个适龄儿童都能免费上学，掌握读写和基础知识，既帮助个人发展，也让整个社会更有能力。١Compulsory education ensures every child can attend school free of charge to learn literacy and basics, helping both personal development and society's capacity.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a688282b1c81�body�٥数字经济指以数字知识和信息为关键生产要素、以信息网络为载体的经济活动，包括电商、数字金融、平台服务和数据产业。��The digital economy refers to economic activity built on digital data and information as key factors of production and networks as infrastructure—including e-commerce, fintech, platforms, and data industries.�ans��src��WManuel Castells,《The Rise of the Network Society》Blackwell,1996 初版;2000 第2版�SM. Castells, The Rise of the Network Society, Blackwell, 1st ed. 1996, 2nd ed. 2000��id�a69e5bfb405a�body�٥奖牌证书把“你很棒”这件事变成看得见、可展示的符号，满足成就感，也向别人发出能力与努力的信号，激励人继续参与。ٴMedals and certificates turn 'you did well' into a visible, shareable symbol, satisfying achievement and signaling ability and effort to others, motivating continued participation.�ans��src��bFrank, R. (1985), 《选择正确的池塘：人类行为与地位追求》, 牛津大学出版社�kFrank, R. (1985), Choosing the Right Pond: Human Behavior and the Quest for Status, Oxford University Press��id�a86c63817942�body�ٙ人权是每个人仅仅因为是人就应当享有的基本权利，比如生命、自由和平等对待，不因国籍、性别或身份而被剥夺。ٯHuman rights are basic rights every person has simply by being human, such as life, liberty, and equal treatment, which cannot be taken away by nationality, gender, or status.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�a941741bb729�body���社会群体是两人及以上、彼此认同并持续互动的一群人，如家庭、班级、球队。它与只是碰巧同处的“聚合体”（如电梯里的乘客）不同，群体内部有共同规范与身份。��A social group is two or more people who identify with one another and interact regularly—family, class, team. Unlike a mere aggregate (elevator passengers), a group has shared norms and identity.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�aa204a4e7ccc�body���犯罪率是一定时间、一定人口中发生犯罪案件的数量，常表示为每十万人中的发案数。它受统计口径、报案率与执法力度影响，跨地区比较须谨慎。��The crime rate is the number of offenses in a period per population, often per 100,000 people. It is shaped by definitions, reporting rates, and policing, so cross-region comparison needs care.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�abeb0604bbe8�body��1950年代标准化集装箱普及后，货物可整箱吊装、跨运输方式无缝转运，装卸时间从数天缩短到几小时。这大幅降低了海运成本，推动了全球供应链与产业分工。如今绝大部分国际贸易货物都靠集装箱运输。�FAfter standardized containers spread in the 1950s, cargo could be lifted as whole boxes and transferred seamlessly across transport modes, cutting loading time from days to hours. This sharply lowered shipping costs and fueled global supply chains and the division of labor. Today most international trade moves in containers.�ans��src���Crowley,《The Box: How the Shipping Container Made the World Smaller and the World Economy Bigger by Marc Levinson Princeton, NJ: Princeton University Press, 2006》,World Trade Review,2008 (DOI: 10.1017/s1474745608003856)��Crowley, 'The Box: How the Shipping Container Made the World Smaller and the World Economy Bigger by Marc Levinson Princeton, NJ: Princeton University Press, 2006', World Trade Review, 2008, DOI: 10.1017/s1474745608003856��id�ac2267c93de1�body��贫民窟是城市中住房简陋、基础设施匮乏、人口密集的低收入聚居区，常出现在快速城市化而住房供给不足的地方。居民多从事非正式工作，缺乏稳定产权。改善贫民窟是全球城市发展的重要议题。�*A slum is a low-income settlement in a city with crude housing, poor infrastructure, and high density, often appearing where rapid urbanization outpaces housing supply. Residents usually do informal work and lack secure property rights. Upgrading slums is a major issue in global urban development.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ace8a47b6e07�body���银行是依法接受存款、发放贷款并提供支付结算等服务的金融机构。它通过吸收储蓄并把资金贷给借款人，连接资金盈余方与短缺方。银行体系的安全对整个经济稳定十分重要。�A bank is a financial institution legally taking deposits, making loans, and providing payment services. By gathering savings and lending to borrowers, it connects those with surplus funds to those who need them. The safety of the banking system is crucial to overall economic stability.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�afad016aefbc�body���性别角色是特定社会文化对“男性”“女性”应有的行为、气质和分工的期待，如“男主外、女主内”。它随时代和地域变化，并非由生理决定。��Gender roles are a culture’s expectations about how men and women should behave, feel, and divide labor—such as “men earn, women care.” They vary across time and place and are not fixed by biology.�ans��src�� 联合国妇女署（UN Women）�UN Women��id�b10da7748177�body��T节日强化群体认同、传递价值，并通过集体仪式缓解日常紧张。�_Festivals reinforce identity, transmit values, and relieve daily tension through shared ritual.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b358c26d81a2�body�ٱ同侪压力指个体因渴望被同伴接纳而顺从群体态度或行为的现象，在青少年中尤为明显。它既能促使人向善，也可能诱导冒险或从众。��Peer pressure is the push to conform to a group’s attitudes or behaviors to gain acceptance, especially strong in adolescence. It can encourage good conduct or prompt risky, conformist behavior.�ans��src��kAsch（1955）《Scientific American》从众研究；Asch（1951）群体压力与判断修正实验报告٘Asch (1955), Scientific American, Opinions and social pressure; Asch (1951), Effects of group pressure upon the modification and distortion of judgments��id�b3ece0e61365�body�٨只关注“幸存”样本而忽略已退出者会得出偏误结论，如仅研究现存企业而忽视倒闭者，会高估成功率。它提醒注意缺失数据。ٓFocusing only on “survivors” and ignoring dropouts biases conclusions—e.g., studying only living firms overstates success; mind missing data.�ans��src��lGraham,《Daily briefing: Mentors, beware survivorship bias》,Nature,2021 (DOI: 10.1038/d41586-021-02647-8)�jGraham, 'Daily briefing: Mentors, beware survivorship bias', Nature, 2021, DOI: 10.1038/d41586-021-02647-8��id�b430e0b04c73�body��人口学是研究人口规模、结构、分布及其变化规律的科学，核心是出生、死亡和迁移三大过程。它用生育率、死亡率和迁移率等指标描述人口动态。人口数据对城市规划、教育医疗和经济发展都十分重要。�PDemography is the science of population size, structure, distribution, and change, centered on the three processes of birth, death, and migration. It uses indicators like fertility, mortality, and migration rates to describe population dynamics. Population data matter for urban planning, health and education, and economic development.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�b569baa858cf�body��u分权指把决策和财政权力从中央下放到地方或基层政府，使更接近民众、回应本地需求。ُDecentralization shifts decision and fiscal power from central to local or grassroots government, bringing it closer to people and local needs.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�b5fdd279423e�body�ي城市化是越来越多人从农村搬到城市居住、城市规模不断扩大的过程，伴随着工厂、学校和交通的发展。ٝUrbanization is the process of more people moving from villages to cities and cities growing, alongside the development of factories, schools, and transport.�ans��src��QJohn Weeks,《Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues》Cengage 多版�ZJ. R. Weeks, Population: An Introduction to Concepts and Issues, Cengage, various editions��id�b687b9ccec09�body���病毒式传播指信息借助社交网络被大量用户快速转发、呈指数级扩散的现象。它依赖内容本身的情绪共鸣和可分享性。一条短视频可能在几小时内触达数百万用户。��Viral spread describes information rapidly forwarded by many users through social networks, growing exponentially. It relies on the content's emotional resonance and shareability. A short video can reach millions within hours.�ans��src��-中国科学院（网络谣言传播研究）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (research on online rumor propagation)��id�b930aa894248�body���《大宪章》是英格兰贵族迫使国王签署的文件，写明「王权也须服从法律」、不能随意抓人征税。它确立了「法律高于统治者」的雏形，后来成为宪政与法治传统的重要源头。�Magna Carta was a document English nobles forced the king to sign, stating that even royal power must obey the law and cannot arrest or tax at will. It planted the seed that rulers are bound by law, later a key source of constitutional and rule-of-law tradition.�ans��src��%大英图书馆；《大宪章》1215�!British Library; Magna Carta 1215��id�b9baa41b9f5e�body���失业指有劳动能力且积极找工作的人暂时没有工作的状态，失业率是其占总劳动力的比例。摩擦性、结构与周期性失业成因不同。适度失业被视为经济调整的正常摩擦。�Unemployment is the state of able, actively job-seeking people temporarily without work; the unemployment rate is their share of the labor force. Frictional, structural, and cyclical unemployment differ in cause. Some unemployment is seen as normal adjustment friction.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c01b242db902�body���在中世纪，胡椒、丁香等香料用于保存食物、调味和医药，欧洲本地无法生产，只能从亚洲长途进口。香料利润极高，直接推动了欧洲航海探险和新航路的开辟。它也是早期全球化的重要动力。�NIn the Middle Ages, spices like pepper and clove were used to preserve food, flavor dishes, and treat illness, but Europe could not produce them and had to import them from Asia over long distances. Their huge profits directly drove European maritime exploration and new sea routes. They were also a key engine of early globalization.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c177277922f8�body���假新闻指故意编造、以误导公众为目的的虚假信息，常伪装成正规新闻报道。它不同于无心的事实差错，核心在“蓄意欺骗”。识别假新闻需要核查来源与交叉验证。�Fake news refers to deliberately fabricated information intended to mislead the public, often disguised as legitimate news reporting. Unlike unintentional factual errors, its essence is deliberate deception. Identifying it requires checking sources and cross-verification.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�c2239b21e2c5�body���事实核查是媒体或独立机构对照原始证据，验证公开说法真伪的做法，常给出“真实/误导/虚假”评级。它是对抗谣言与假新闻的关键机制。许多平台已内嵌核查标签。��Fact-checking is when media or independent groups verify public claims against original evidence, often rating them true/misleading/false. It is a key mechanism against rumor and fake news. Many platforms now embed check labels.�ans��src�٩Kumar,《Fact-Checking Methodology and its Transparency: What Indian Fact-Checking Websites Have to Say?》,Journalism Practice,2024 (DOI: 10.1080/17512786.2022.2098520)٧Kumar, 'Fact-Checking Methodology and its Transparency: What Indian Fact-Checking Websites Have to Say?', Journalism Practice, 2024, DOI: 10.1080/17512786.2022.2098520��id�c2ce2863a4d6�body�ٮ多数决（如单选区相对多数）按得票最多者胜，易形成两党；比例代表按得票比例分配席位，更能反映多元诉求，但政党可能较多。��Majority rule (e.g., single-seat plurality) lets the top vote-getter win, tending toward two parties; proportional representation allocates seats by vote share, better reflecting diversity but often yielding many parties.�ans��src��PRein Taagepera & Matthew Shugart,《Seats and Votes》Yale University Press,1989�LR. Taagepera and M. S. Shugart, Seats and Votes, Yale University Press, 1989��id�c60e6914471d�body��社会学是研究社会结构、社会关系和社会行为的一门学科，关注个人如何在群体中互动以及社会如何运行。它探讨家庭、教育、阶层、文化等主题。奥古斯特·孔德等人被视为社会学的早期奠基者。�"Sociology is the study of social structures, relationships, and behavior, focusing on how individuals interact in groups and how society operates. It examines topics like family, education, class, and culture. Thinkers such as Auguste Comte are regarded as early founders of the discipline.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�c6520ef3da4f�body���关税是政府对进出口商品征收的税，通常在边境口岸收取。它可以增加财政收入，也被用来保护本国产业免受外来竞争。过高的关税会推高物价并可能引发贸易摩擦。��A tariff is a tax a government levies on imported or exported goods, usually collected at the border. It can raise revenue and also protect domestic industries from foreign competition. Excessive tariffs raise prices and can trigger trade disputes.�ans��src��tN. Gregory Mankiw,《Principles of Economics》第8版,Cengage,2017;中译《经济学原理》北京大学出版社�bN. G. Mankiw, Principles of Economics, 8th ed., Cengage, 2017; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�cd91ffbba8b6�body���家庭是基于婚姻、血缘或收养形成的基本社会单位，承担生育、抚养、经济合作与情感支持功能。现代家庭形态日益多元，如单亲、同居与丁克。它是社会结构的细胞。�The family is the basic social unit formed by marriage, blood, or adoption, undertaking reproduction, care, economic cooperation, and emotional support. Modern family forms are increasingly diverse—single-parent, cohabiting, childfree. It is the cell of social structure.�ans��src��9Becker, G. (1981), 《家庭论》, 哈佛大学出版社�EBecker, G. (1981), A Treatise on the Family, Harvard University Press��id�cdc98bb2a96d�body�ٜ红色波长最长、最醒目且历史上与“停止”关联；绿色代表通行，黄灯作过渡警示。三色约定俗成成为全球通用信号。٘Red has the longest wavelength and historic link to “stop”; green means go, yellow warns of transition. The three colors became a global convention.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�ce84ec76c5df�body���它把国家与读书人绑定：皇帝用考试换取精英的忠诚，读书人用功名换取地位，减少了地方豪强世袭。低成本的人才选拔加上文化认同，使其长期稳定。��It tied the state to scholars: the ruler bought elites' loyalty with degrees, and scholars gained status through study, weakening hereditary local strongmen. Cheap talent selection plus shared culture made it durable.�ans��src��@费孝通,《乡土中国》北京大学出版社,2012 等版本�RFei Xiaotong, From the Soil, multiple editions incl. Peking University Press, 2012��id�d0871d7a44e2�body��科举是隋唐到清末通过考试选拔官员的制度，主要考儒家经典、诗赋与策论，强调读写与治国理政知识。它让平民可凭才学入仕，打破了世家垄断。其公平竞争理念影响深远，甚至启发了现代文官考试。�GThe imperial examination, from the Sui–Tang through the Qing, selected officials by testing Confucian classics, poetry, and policy essays, emphasizing literacy and governance knowledge. It let commoners enter office by merit, breaking aristocratic monopoly. Its ideal of fair competition influenced later civil-service exams.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press��id�d107edfe2907�body��f约一万年前，人类由采集狩猎转向定居农耕，为城市与文明奠定了粮食基础。�tAbout 10,000 years ago humans shifted from foraging to farming, providing the food base for cities and civilization.�ans��src��:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937�:V. Gordon Childe, What Happened in History, Gollancz, 1937��id�d10f96c3d103�body���丝绸之路是连接欧亚的陆海贸易网络，除丝绸外还交换香料、技术与思想，使沿线绿洲与港口城市因中转贸易而繁荣，并改变了物资与文化的分布格局。ټThe Silk Road linked Eurasia by land and sea, carrying silk, spices, tech, and ideas; transit cities along oasis and port routes prospered, reshaping the distribution of goods and culture.�ans��src��]联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网》�\UNESCO World Heritage Centre, Silk Roads: the Routes Network of Chang'an–Tianshan Corridor��id�d48855d89300�body���非政府组织是不以营利为目的、独立于政府的民间机构，如红十字会、无国界医生。它们在人道救援、环保和人权领域填补政府与市场之间的空白。��A non-governmental organization (NGO) is a non-profit, non-state body like the Red Cross or Doctors Without Borders. They fill gaps between government and market in aid, environment, and human rights.�ans��src��]Anthony Giddens,《Sociology》Polity Press 多版;中译《社会学》北京大学出版社�ZA. Giddens, Sociology, Polity Press, various editions; Chinese ed. Peking University Press